window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":601,"title":"Chapter 601: Chapter 600 - Realm Expansion!","paragraphs":["Hello.","It is your trusted Shadow Guard Night once more.","This is the 36th Journal Entry in the new Volume I’ve started since the day the Infinite Realm was established.","It has been an extremely busy period of time, with many beings moving around this wondrous Realm as they mostly harvested its abundant resources that did not seem to be ending.","Delegations were sent from numerous Lands that used to be Worlds, beings of different Races meeting as they began to work together towards a common goal. I was always present and protecting Queen Adelaide during these meetings, her delight as she handled any matters that would be helpful to the Esteemed Person being extremely visible every time.","During this busy time period, the Esteemed Person abruptly passed down the word that the biggest enemy was defeated. Just like that.","He didn’t need an army with him or millions in order to come out victorious in such an ordeal, and this knowledge caused many of us within this Realm to feel a burning desire to get stronger- just so that this Esteemed Person would not leave us all behind!","We wanted to participate in the battles, you know? Be of some help as we received so many benefits that we never thought possible, you know?","Yet not too long thereafter, on what should have been a period of relaxation and resting...a change began to occur.","RUMBLE!","Ahh, it’s actually just happened once more as I am writing this. Over the past few days, a tremor would pass throughout the Infinite Realm every now and then. Sometimes it came in a few minute intervals, sometimes just a few every hour. We didn’t know what these tremors represented at first, but every time a tremor finished the extremely perceptive beings could notice that the atmospheric essence had risen once again.","This was an easy thing if you had been following the Esteemed Person for a while and was there was the Worlds ascended to higher ranks before ultimately forming into a Realm, and I noticed it right away as a shocking truth was confirmed right after as the changes became more noticeable and word passed down from the culprit in question!","It seemed that every time this tremor occurred, it signified that yet another World was joining the expansive Infinite Realm, that another few billion creatures had joined us once again!","It was such a shocking thing as we expected the Esteemed Person to rest for even a little, but it seemed like he could not sit still as every few minutes, another World was fused into this grand Realm filled with wonders.","RUMBLE!","Multiple worlds have already been fused as I am writing this Journal Entry, the task we have at hand to continue reaching out to the newly joining worlds and establish communications and governance only continuing to increase as many beings would have to be mobilized.","But this entire unbelievable and shocking issue of the Esteemed Person actively moving as he combined numerous worlds into this Realm made many of us who could think realize that something big was coming.","He would not be moving like this unless another enemy we do not even know about had risen, or maybe the Esteemed Person just enjoyed achieving ridiculously higher realms of power that he didn’t wish to stop.","But either way, I was already preparing my mind to withstand any shock that the Esteemed Person wanted to send towards us next. Me being even surprised at the fact that a new world was being fused into this realm every few minutes was a loss on my mission, but I am now vowing with all my strength to never be shocked at the things this being did in the future.","I would wholly expect unbelievable and shocking things to continue to occur, and I will succeed in never having my jaw drop at the next unbelievable event.","Until then, there is an entire Realm to explore and numerous races to meet. I’ll update next time on the progress of my mission, whenever the time comes that the Esteemed Person chooses to break all common sense again.","---","RUMBLE!","Yet another world seamlessly fused into the Infinite Realm as Noah used the feature of {World Integration}. He had stopped counting the hundreds of billions after a certain point as many beings found their worlds suddenly changed, his focus working overtime in the Infinite Realm as they stabilized any newly appearing fused lands and spoke to their people.","The billions of Vampyres that were spread out all over the Dark Expanse were those at the forefront of wanting to take on this task, trying to be of some help to their Progenitor as they moved diligently to make sure everything continued smoothly!","But just like this, Noah was able to seamlessly integrate many worlds as he first teleported across the Dark Expanse where he only had to let beings like the Grand Mage Edrusim know what he was doing as they only nodded in a stupor, already sending him messages of when their own Worlds being integrated into this wondrous Realm that only a few higher of ups of the Dark Expanse knew about.","They were at the forefront of it as Old Man Inuit had told them the being who had so easily taken care of Aldrich and the billions of Celestials that nobody could find at this moment was the 9th Infernal Lord, a being that was moving for the peace of the Novus Galaxy!","All those with the tiniest bit of intelligence wanted to attach themselves to this being as Noah was able to bring in multiple powerful Prime Worlds in this manner.","Days passed like this as his main body integrated new worlds while his two clones continued cultivating multiple universal laws at once, the areas where these two clones stood turning into shockingly overabundant fields of essence as the mana of numerous laws freely swirled around.","RUMBLE!","His origin shook at this moment as he detected yet another change, reaching another stupidly grand milestone in a short span of time as one of his clones briefly opened his eyes to observe the changes in the stat panel.","[Noah Osmont][Title(s): Infernal Lord(Variant), Grand Controller(Fate)]","[Bloodline(s): Vampyre Progenitor]","[Aether Particles(s) : 5,526,932]","[Karma Line(s) : 502,492]","[Fate Line(s) : 10,000,000]","[Chaos Particle(s) : 5,192,265]","[Origin Core(s) : Light-1, Dark-1, Fire-8, Water-8, Earth-3, Air-3]","[Domain(s) : Aether, Karma, Fate, Chaos, Light, Dark, Space, Time, Fire, Water, Earth, Air]","[Vitality: STAR FORGER]","[Focus: - ]","[Strength: STAR FORGER]","[Law(s) : Aether- 55%, Karma-5%,Fate-100%,Chaos-51%, Light-8%, Dark-8%, Space-28%, Time-12%, Fire-83%, Water-83%, Earth-38%, Air-38%]","[Authority(s) : Aether Lord, Fate Lord, Chaos Lord, Flame Lord, Water Lord]","Beautiful numbers that were enough to make a grown man cry were displayed in front of him, the shocking speed of progress he had made in just a matter of days being visualized for the first time!","Multiple laws now littered his stat panel as he managed to break the 50% mark in the Law of Chaos, gaining yet another Authority aside from Aether that was just handed to him. Even more shocking was the rate of progress for the four laws that had amazing synergy- it was Fire, Water, Earth, and Air!","The synergy of cultivating these four laws at the same time allowed for him to simply speed run their advancements, the four Origin Cores of these laws spinning at such a rapid rate as they devoured all the essence they came across.","Yet as Noah stared at the new information on the laws of Karma, Aether, Light, Dark, Space, and Time...he couldn’t help but bring a smile to his face while thinking of the future!","The Novus Galaxy had a grand plan aside from Noah completing his Infinite Mana trait, and it was a plan that Aldrich had helped to initiate as he sent out a signal to the chaotic Universe! Whatever this signal would bring to them...Noah had to be ready for it as it would determine the success or failure of the plan that his own Galaxy had concocted, and whether it faced another cycle of destruction and rebirth because of it!","It was a shocking and cruel plan when considering the lives of the creatures within this wide Novus Galaxy...yet Noah could not help but think back to the grand goal that the entity overseeing the Novus Galaxy had discussed with him back then, his face becoming firm as he chose to continue advancing his strength and make sure nothing went wrong."]},{"number":602,"title":"Chapter 602: Chapter 601 - A Party Sets Off","paragraphs":["A brilliance that was reminiscent of gorgeous stars was continuously shining from an enormous Rift that stood at a central position of a Galaxy. This Rift towered over 100 miles in size, being something so ridiculously large that it could be seen from great distances away.","This rift was commonly known as the Universal Rift, a unique tool that the inhabitants of the Galaxy that just recently received a weak signal utilized!","Monitoring the signals coming through this rift was the job of the Watchers, a powerful group of beings chosen to tirelessly release their auras as they learned to communicate with this radiant Rift that allowed for them to reach the point they were at today.","The uses of the Universal Rift were many, and it made it possible for this Galaxy to stand strong over an unknown number of years as its inhabitants used this Universal Rift to explore the Chaotic Void of their Universe.","The first beings to utilize and test this Universal Rift realized that it had the capabilities to smoothly allow for the exploration of their Universe by allowing whoever stepped into it a smooth passage across the Chaotic Void!","A unique energy would surround the beings that passed through it, making them appear outside of the Galaxy as this unique essence given by the Universal Rift would surround them for an entire month before it disappeared.","This meant that one did not have to be a Grand Controller to be able to leave their Galaxy, where anyone bold enough to explore could do so!","Over the numerous years, the inhabitants of this Galaxy had done just that. Numerous explorations occurred as they rose to new heights and gained strength of colossal proportions, multiple Controllers and other powerful beings rising over the years.","More often than not, Grand Controllers were favored as they could traverse the Chaotic Void with ease, each party that was setting off for an exploration almost always leaving with one or two beings at the level of a Grand Controller.","But in this Galaxy, Controllers were not even the beings that were at the peak of power! Given the title of Law Masters, Controllers were actually just a powerful force that resided in this Galaxy and focused on the comprehension of Universal Laws. There was an even more terrifying force that was led by powerful beings that were directly chosen by this Galaxy and granted fearsome power to wield.","These were the beings that were granted Traits, beings that were known as Blessed!","The Blessed were powerful beings either born with a Trait or awaking to it in their prime, beings such as them becoming more and more prominent over the years as their Galaxy garnered more and more strength from their explorations.","It was like a feedback loop of elevating to higher levels of strength, where the inhabitants of the Galaxy went out to explore the unknown Universe and brought back spectacular treasures which enhanced the power of their Galaxy, this unique realm that had a Universal Rift within it continuing to rise over the eons as it now stood at an unshakable level of strength!","On this day though, another Exploration was about to occur as an advanced party was being sent to check out a weak Signal that Watchers had noticed being attracted to the Universal Rift. It was a Signal that was weaker than all the others they had come across, so the higher ups had simply given the task of checking out exactly what this signal was first.","Sometimes it was the signal of a Galaxy filled with treasures and wonders, other times it was a signal released by powerful entities seeking to devour unsuspecting beings for fun, or it could be an unknown treasure simply floating around the Chaotic Void of this vast Universe!","The Signal that was received recently would be checked out by a powerful group of Law Masters and Blessed, which consisted of multiple Controllers and beings with powerful Traits. Even though it was simply a scouting mission, all precautions were taken as the beings about to pass through this Universal Rift knew of dangers they could come across the Chaotic Void.","Near the Universal Rift, multiple beings adorned in regal attire walked across the golden floors below as they entered into an expansive chariot, this chariot having a shimmering starry blue barrier covering it as the animals that would be pulling it were fearsome creatures letting off an aura similar to that of a normal Controller.","This was known as an Imperial Vessel that was pulled by creatures commonly seen outside of Galaxies, creatures known as Void Beasts that could traverse through the Chaotic Void with ease!","These Void Beasts had wide dark wings swirling with runic circles as their bodies could very similarly be compared to a Gryphon, but their eyes oozed the power of Space and Chaos as they looked forward coldly, the reigns attaching them to the grand chariot making them shockingly seem like docile creatures.","Multiple figures entered this Imperial Vessel as a single stone-faced man sat at the forefront of this spectacular chariot, holding the reins as his essence of a Grand Controller fully tamed the Void Beasts that began releasing a powerful essence of Space and Chaos which caused the chariot to take to the skies.","RUMBLE!","The many Watchers and beings carefully observing and noting the changes of the Universal Rift gave their permission as the chariot pulled by Void Beasts flew forward, going into the Rift as they soundlessly disappeared!","On this day, a shimmering blue chariot pulled by Void Beasts entered a Universal Rift as they went on to search for a signal. Within this chariot known as an Imperial Vessel, three Law Masters and three Blessed took this exploration mission that would bring about unintended consequences.","This marked the first time that the Galaxy known as the Nexus Galaxy, a terrifyingly powerful realm that had survived eons and collected powerful beings of stupendous strength- it marked the first time that the forces of the Nexus Galaxy set off as they would come in contact with a being that would soon bring to fruition a spectacular Trait!"]},{"number":603,"title":"Chapter 603: Chapter 602 - Into the Nebula Realm!","paragraphs":["On another side of the Chaotic Void, a singular being in the Novus Galaxy continued to advance forward as multiple milestones were achieved.","The first milestone was the continued upgrade of his subordinates, the Harbingers of Sin and other powerful beings overseeing the Novus Galaxy actually being granted entrance past the golden barrier of the Central Realm!","Using the ability of Pocket Realm, Noah used it as a simple transfer portal as his subordinates came into the depths of the Central Realm with ease, their minds being shaken once more as they sensed an abundant atmospheric essence that was even greater than the Infinite Realm that was still expanding even now.","Noah had brought his subordinates over to the mystical clearing that had numerous Inheritance Crystals which contained the techniques of comprehending universal laws, and he gave them the option of choosing what law they wanted to follow!","Unlike him, none of them could afford to focus their attention on multiple laws, with his subordinates choosing the law that fit them best as they also embarked on their path to become future Controllers.","Kazuhiko’s eyes shone when he glanced towards the Crystal containing the techniques of the Law of Chaos, looking at the dark glint as he rushed towards it right away. To him, he would finally be achieving his dream of releasing dark rays of chaotic light from his blade once he became proficient in the law of chaos!","Athena had only come into the Central Realm briefly as she sought to learn more of the truth of this realm that many Celestials fought for, being one of the last few remaining Celestials who had even been able to enter past the golden barrier. She remained on the path of the Law of Fate as her resolve became even stronger when looking at the level of strength her Junior Brother displayed, knowing that she had to work that much harder.","Others like the Kraken were humble as they remained comprehending the normal laws of Fire, Air, Earth, and Water. One particular Emperor Penguin was even bolder and more arrogant than the rest as he chose to study both the law of Time and Space, making it his goal to increase his spatial abilities and combining it with time to be even more deadly!","\"RAA! RAA!\"","Excitement was abound in the hearts of Noah’s subordinates as they learned these techniques as well as the treasures of the Central Realm. Things like Luminescent Rainbow Dews that could upgrade one into the World Rank were free and many, with other treasures of similar potency or even stronger being able to be found in these deep areas of the realm.","Their goals of rapidly increasing in strength to catch up to Noah seemed to be possible at this moment as the next few days were spent with them making rapid progress!","The second milestone was the bringing another Skill Tree into the Star Forging Realm, Noah getting ready for whatever was coming as best as he could, and he chose the goal of bringing at least one more skill tree into the Nebula Realm before whoever received the released Signal came.","The skill trees he chose for this task were the Fate’s Guardian skill trees! He chose Fate’s Guardian naturally because the law of Fate was currently one of the only laws he had at 100%, and the skill tree would benefit greatly from its backing.","Over the past few days, the product of this skill tree at the Star Forging Realm had been produced as it added even more to his abilities, their skills seeming subpar at this point compared to Terror of Cthulhu skill tree currently at the Nebula Realm.","He gained another pair of skills that passively increased his comprehension of the law of Fate, as well as a skill termed Celestial King that was very similar to what Aldrich had used in the past battle!","But this skill tree was just one of the major things in Noah’s mind, because he was currently focused on absorbing the Nebula Realm cores that he had obtained from the defeat of Aldrich.","He had chosen not to convert the Origin of Aldrich into skill points in order to obtain these cores, as the strength and resiliency of his level would matter just as much as the perks being given by becoming a Controller as he advanced to further stages!","From the stage of a Star Forger, one would have to destroy their very Origin that was in the shape of a star as they later used the shattered dust of this star to try and form a Nebula, an Origin that was so strong that it would contain multiple miniature small stars.","As Noah absorbed more and more Nebula Realm Cores, his Origin had continued vibrating at a high speed as it even caused the artificially formed Origin Cores of laws to bounce in excitement.","Within Noah’s body, there existed not just his main Origin Core, but also the Fire, Water, Air, Earth, Light, and Dark Origin Cores!","He was shockingly walking around with multiple cores within his body, and his main one was about to dissolve into dust as it served as a base to build even more miniature stars in the future!","RUMBLE!","His main body was situated in a beautiful scenery of green as enormously tall ancient trees surrounded him, his position currently being in the depths of the Central Realm past the golden barrier as an overabundance of essence surrounded him.","Much of this essence was currently swirling towards him rapidly as he had already started the process of entering into the realm of a Nebula!","His Origin had been vibrating at a high frequency as a pained expression continued to deepen on his face, the process of essentially shattering one’s own core before reforming into something grander being extremely dangerous.","CRACK! CRACK!","Lines of cracks spread throughout the Origin Core as Noah felt the other origins representing multiple laws rotate even faster, bringing a sense of stability as in the next millisecond...his main Origin shattered!","RUMBLE!","It felt as his Origin had been completely ground into dust, leaving behind a cloudy mass that began to circulate rapidly. This cloudy mass was the initial formation of a Nebula, and it needed enormous reserves of essence as it was circulating faster and faster while trying to birth multiple stars within.","Yet it turned out that at this time, the nearest sources of essence was the unique energy that the Fire, Water, Earth, Air, Light, and Dark Origin Cores that had been even more actively rotating and releasing essence as this multicolored assortment of energies rushed forward to build the stars within this Nebula!","The unique essence of Universal Laws themselves! Going towards building a single being’s Nebula!","Such a thing was unheard of, and it would be the beginning of a shocking set of events as far from the Novus Galaxy where Noah was trying to condense his first stars, an entity that was freely floating in the Chaotic Void of the expansive Universe multiple light-years away opened his eyes the moment that Noah began establishing a new Core that was being built with the essence of Universal Laws themselves.","RUMBLE!","\"After countless eons...\"","WAA!","The body of the entity took a seated position as this moment as a shocking event played out light years away!"]},{"number":604,"title":"Chapter 604: Chapter 603 - Too Many Eons!","paragraphs":["The Entity floating amidst the Chaotic Void that would shred the defenses of any being that did not have a unique treasure or the essence of a Grand Controller had gotten to a seated position, his stature simply too enormous to even comment on how large it was, there being no suitable point of comparison in the current space he presided!","\"Truly too many eons for such a being to rise again...hmm\"","The Entity waves his hands as in front of it, a page that shone with the most gorgeous color of gold appeared.","This page had an archaic language written on it, the Entity reading the words of the page with a somber expression!","\"A being with an Origin molded from the Universal Laws themselves...a being with multiple unique powers that will cause even the most powerful Void Beasts to tremble...Ah, why isn’t there more information!\"","RUMBLE!","The Entity grumbled with unhappiness as he waved his hands and caused the golden page to disappear, his gaze glancing around the chaotic void as he opened his mouth and began sucking in the surrounding void as if it was malleable, the Chaotic Void that could rip many beings apart actually being devoured by him rapidly as he patted his stomach thereafter and released a burp!","\"Alright, guess I will continue searching for the remaining pages of this trash Book of Ruination. Such a pain...\"","His body began moving through the Chaotic Void once more as this Entity continued forward while releasing shocking words.","\"Too many eons have passed...too many...\"","RUMBLE!","\"If I just had more pages...maybe I would be able to locate you...Bah!\"","OOOM!","This entity shockingly had the page of a treasure called the Book of Ruination, a treasure so extremely high that it should not even be talked about at this stage of the story!","This creature had been able to sense a change because it held a page from this book, noticing the advent of a being that had a core molded by the essence of the Universal Laws themselves!","Unbeknownst to many, this being moved!","---","Back in the Central Realm, a wondrous scene was occurring as amidst a forming nebula, the colors of red, blue, grey, green, white, and darkness that represented the numerous Law Origin Cores within Noah’s body were freely flowing into the establishing nebula, the stars sprouting up having a spectacular array of colors as they shone with magnificence!","Within the spinning Nebula, colorful round stars had begun forming as one could count their numbers in tens!","This was an extremely shocking thing as those familiar with the process of stepping from the Star Forging Realm and into the Nebula Realm would know that normally, one would form a few stars within their new Nebula, with the norm being around 3 stars or geniuses forming close to 10 the moment they established their Nebula.","Yet Noah...! Noah had tens of stars forming within his Nebula during his first time condensing it, the starry nebula rotating heavily as if it was carrying enormous weight, the essence of numerous Universal Laws surging into it endlessly!","RUMBLE!","All the surrounding essence particles were also being sucked in rapidly as the many ancient trees around Noah lost their l.u.s.ter, even their essence being devoured as his Nebula took every source of essence that it could find.","BZZZ!","Its heavy rotations slowly got faster as this Nebula spun while absorbing even more energy, numerous small stars shimmering with color being seen within as a resplendent ray of multicolored light shot forth from Noah at this moment and pierced the skies of the Central Realm!","WAAA!","It was a magisterial sight of wonder that attracted the attention of the nearby Protectors and Infernals as they looked towards this sight with confounded shock.","Noah opened his eyes at this moment as he felt the rotating Nebula that drew in a ridiculous amount of energy at every rotation- energy from the Law Origin Cores, energy from his own body, and even atmospheric energy, all he could say as he felt this rotation was a feeling of unbound and wild strength!","This Nebula had a myriad of colors as it looked extremely beautiful, where one could actually get lost in it if they observed it long enough. The feeling of strength that this Nebula brought to him...was simply too much.","He felt like he could step out into the starry space as he threw out a fist towards a world...and this world would shatter!","He felt as if he could throw a punch in the skies and it would crack!","It was such a joyful feeling of strength as each of the cells within his body felt drunk by the unique essence floating through them, the 6 Origin Cores of Fire, Water, Earth, Air, Light, and Dark rotating even faster than when he was actively cultivating using their techniques...as if they were receiving an enormous pull from the Nebula they surrounded.","It was a shocking and much-welcomed development where even Noah did not understand the complete meaning of it!","[It seems a change has occurred with your very Origin, the essence of the Universal Laws becoming more closely entwined than they should be...]","He heard the voice of his own Realm System as he tried to sense the enormous changes within himself as well as his strength, but even he could not fully fathom it.","He released a breath as even his breath unconsciously released a colorful burst of mana, as if he was simply too full at this moment in time!","\"How different is it from the breakthroughs of other Nebula Rank beings you’ve observed?\"","Noah voiced out a question not towards his own Realm System, but towards the entity known as the Novus Galaxy as he received a reply soon after, the pain from hearing this voice being much dimmer after all this time.","[Completely different from what I have observed before. There should be a special property with your Nebula as it looks to be made of the unique essence of universal laws. I will see if it is possible to decipher it.]","RUMBLE!","Essence freely flowed from Noah in droves as he nodded, moving his body as explored this ridiculous feeling of strength while moving on to his next goal.","Shockingly, more than 50 Stars had formed within his Nebula at the time that he established it.","Fifty. F.u.c.k.i.n.g. Stars.","If the knowledgeable creatures of this expansive Universe heard this, they would tumble from their seats as they lost all hope in the meaning of what genius was!"]},{"number":605,"title":"Chapter 605: Chapter 604 - The Requirements are Met!","paragraphs":["As his main body ascended to new heights of power and ridiculous new possibilities he did not even fully know about yet, one of his clones was currently exploring the Letalis Expanse.","This was the same Letalis Expanse that was mysterious to him before as he moved while observing the positions of the Ancient Terror and the Terror of the Void that had gone back to their posts as commanded the day that Aldrich was defeated.","He could also sense the wild power of the Terror of Aether that had sulkingly returned back to its post after whatever the Novus Galaxy told it, but Noah could still feel boundless anger from the heart of the Cthulhu as it still was not convinced of why they invited doom over to themselves!","Even now as Noah thought about what the Novus Galaxy had told him, he had slight apprehension as it involved the lives of simply too many, but his apprehension was overshadowed by the possibilities that the Novus Galaxy spoke about as he resolved himself and continued forward.","He had been going around the Letalis Expanse the past few days as he connected more and more worlds from this Expanse while exploring the race of Ancients that he did not get the chance to interact with before.","Many of these Ancients actually stemmed from the Ancient Terror that stood at the level of a Controller, one of the three Terrors currently residing and watching the boundaries of the Novus Galaxy that were thinnest in this Expanse.","When one looked at a Galaxy, they could not just look at it as a circle with many things contained inside of it, but something that existed within its own space as it only had one side that could be seen as a door.","Using this analogy, the entirety of the Letalis Expanse could be considered as a door, the area that if one wanted to enter the Galaxy, it would have to be through here!","This was why the Three Terrors at the level of Controllers were stationed to monitor the boundary around the Letalis Expanse for the past thousands of years, and still the reason why they were there until now.","The rest of the Letalis Expanse had vibrant Prime Worlds that held the unique race of Ancients, with Noah coming across beings nearly the same as the ones he came across before when he used [Summon the Ancients] from the Blood Lord skill tree!","The Ancients living in the Letalis Expanse were very closely tied with the Terrors, their race being similar to the Infernals that had recently returned into the Central Realm as they also had the task to act as protectors.","The Vampyre Progenitor had originated from them, and this was why Noah believed that the [Blood Lord] skill tree that came with the bloodline of the Vampyre Progenitor would lead to the abilities of the Ancient Terror when he made it into the Nebula Rank, very similar to how [Amorphous Space Beast] led to the abilities of the Terror of Aether!","Thus, he continued traversing the Letalis Expanse as he connected more of its worlds, the passing days allowing for the count of the Worlds integrating into the Infinite Realm to increase more and more rapidly.","RUMBLE!","At this moment, he had just finished the integration of another world when he felt a rumbling within his own Origin, his connection to the Infinite Realm communicating something to him as he stopped to pay attention.","[The time is nearing.]","OOOOM","His main body in the Central Realm heard the voice of the Novus Galaxy as he was still studying his newly built Nebula, the last World Integrated into the Infinite Realm causing some type of reaction as Noah could sense the entire Realm was overflowing with essence.","With the addition of this world, the goal of completing the Trait of Infinite Mana was actually nearing!","\"You mentioned that you would know when the conditions are met?\"","[Yes, the base requirement was for your Origin and Soul to be strong enough to withstand the last step, as well as your Realm being expanded into at least a Large Realm.]","The conditions were for him to achieve the Nebula Rank, which granted him a ridiculously strong Origin that was even more stupendous than even the Novus Galaxy expected with the unique formation where the essence of Universal Laws was now flowing within it, as well as his Realm being expanded multiple times as hundreds of Worlds were now integrated with it!","[All the hard parts are finished, and your Origin should be strong enough at this point to withstand the last step- which is establishing a connection...with the Novus Galaxy itself.]","RUMBLE!","To bring to fruition the Trait of Infinite Mana, he didn’t need to spend months and years connecting and integrating every single World in the Novus Galaxy into his Realm, all he had to do was grow strong enough where he could withstand a connection with an entity at a much higher stage than him, and he would effectively share a connection with everything it was connected to!","[This will only be possible using your Infinite Realm as the intermediary for the connection, with it really being a three-way connection where I shall be connected to your Realm, and you are connected to it.]","Yes! Even though Noah had stepped into the Nebula Realm, the task of successfully forming a connection with an entire Galaxy was much too grand to even be thought about! But they could use other means to force a connection, and therein lay the use of the Infinite Realm!","\"Good. Let us get started.\"","Noah’s eyes shone with l.u.s.ter as he floated to the skies and went even deeper into the depths of the central realm. His face was calm as his heart beat soundly, not an ounce of nervousness appearing on his expression as he exuded strength and confidence.","This was the same being that was only a Rank F hunter a few months ago!","This was the same man that had been fighting with goblins in [Goblin King’s Abode], the same man that was tussling with lowly Demon Lords in the Frozen Lands of the Beast World!","Yet now, he stood at the precipice of something grand as he set out to do something that others could not even imagine!"]},{"number":606,"title":"Chapter 606: Chapter 605 - Trait: Infinite Mana I","paragraphs":["The wings of change were rapidly blowing as many beings were taken into a grand new era.","The dynamics of the Light and Dark Expanse had changed greatly just over the span of the last few days, the name of the Overseer known as Noah Osmont beginning to spread around the two Expanses as he went around integrating worlds into his Realm.","Many beings came to know that a wondrous Realm called the Infinite Realm existed, and that this being that had quite literally wiped Celestials off the face of the Galaxy was the one controlling this Realm!","In just a matter of days as many worlds were integrated from the Expanses, the dynamics of power shifted greatly as many realized the strength they carried could not even be held in comparison.","Yet even before the beings could absorb this change as they learned to adapt to this starting of a new Era, Noah was changing things once again as his main body appeared in front of a huge blue door!","This door was near the position where his home world used to be, and it was also the door that led into the Infinite Realm.","Noah’s hands rested upon this shimmering blue door as he utilized a feature of the Infinite Realm that would make possible what he wanted to do!","<strong>[Realm Gateway] :: A shimmering blue archaic door of light is all that remains of the Infinite Realm to the outside universe as it exists in its own spatial space. This Gateway can be shifted under the will of the Infinite Realm Master, as well as set restrictions for the beings allowed in or out.</strong>","RUMBLE!","His mana rushed into it as the gateway shone with l.u.s.ter, disappearing along with him as he transported it towards the Central Realm.","This blue door was the only official entrance of the Infinite Realm that was located in its own spatial space, and this space could be easily accessed by the Novus Galaxy when Noah brought its gateway into another Realm!","He reappeared at the depth of the area past the golden barrier as he moved forward, creating for a spectacular scene as the Protectors and Infernals all around the area turned their heads upwards to observe a shocking scene.","They observed a single being with his hand placed on an archaic blue door, and this being was flying through the skies as he dragged this archaic blue door with him!","It was a majestic sight to come across as Noah continued going deeper into the Central Realm, his surroundings gradually changing as more and more vegetation came to be, even the numbers of Protectors reducing as it was becoming quieter and quieter.","He continued forward while dragging the archaic blue door behind him, following the guidance of the Novus Galaxy as he came upon a small grove of thick ancient trees in a circular formation.","The Ancient Trees seemed to be surrounding something, their leaves wriggling and shifting as Noah neared and created an opening.","Noah patted the door that he was dragging as it became smaller in size, entering through the area where the ancient trees created an entrance as he appeared in what could be considered an entirely different space.","His eyes shone as within the encirclement of the ancient grove of trees where no outside light could penetrate, it shimmered brightly as colorful particles of elements were abundantly floating around. Essence of all colors freely overflowed in a gorgeous array of green, red, blue, white, and gold as they danced around a single black core!","This core was unlike anything that Noah had come across before, observing it being completely still as it made no movements at all since he appeared! It had a glossy obsidian black color that actually reflected Noah’s own devilishly handsome face, showing his figure and the outline of the shimmering archaic blue door he dragged with him.","Shockingly, as he came across what should be the core of an entire galaxy, there weren’t some brilliantly rotating miles long core that was at the deepest depths of a hard to get location- it was simply an obsidian core staying entirely still in the middle of an ancient grove of trees!","The only thing different was the fact that there was an extremely dense amount of universal law essences in this area, where Noah could feel all the particles of different laws visibly move even in liquid form the nearer they were to the obsidian dark core.","[At the end of it all, everything returns to simplicity. Galaxies have a tremendous amount of power, but they also have grand restrictions that make them extremely vulnerable.]","RUMBLE!","[If an enemy had somehow managed to break through the boundaries of the Letalis Expanse, and then the golden barrier was breached, and then all my Protectors failed to stop their advance...they would be able to pry open the trees around me and do as they wish.]","The words of the Novus Galaxy revealed more and more information as Noah let the blue archaic door representing the entrance of his realm float alongside the river of universal law essences around this mystical obsidian black core, his hands instinctively reaching towards it as it looked very enticing!","[Careful, even a small touch or mistake can cause the deaths of trillions. The cores of Galaxies are some of the most fragile things in existence, which is a ridiculous paradox when considering what they are able to do.]","His hands pulled back as he adopted a serious expression and contained his wonder inside of him.","\"What do I need to do?\"","[At this point, focus on your connection with the Infinite Realm. The singular connection that you share with it. During this whole process, you will need to focus on the stability of this connection the most as I open up a channel between myself and your Realm.]","RUMBLE!","[I will share a connection with your Realm and not you directly, but just this action will be enough to fully bring the Trait of Infinite Mana into a reality as I will have met all conditions to grant it at that stage.]","Yes! Traits had requirements that had to be fulfilled if they were crazy powerful, and the requirement of the ridiculous Trait of Infinite Mana was for one to really have a source where they could use as much mana as they wished without ever having to worry!","The Universe would be forced to acknowledge and grant this trait when a being who would actually share a connection with an entire galaxy appeared, as no matter what he did in his lifetime- he truly would never be able to run out of energy! Thus, Infinite Mana would be fully bright into fruition!"]},{"number":607,"title":"Chapter 607: Chapter 606 - Trait: Infinite Mana II","paragraphs":["In the ancient grove where the essence of universal laws was freely flowing around an obsidian core, Noah took a deep breath as he sat down while closing his eyes, his entire mind focusing on his Infinite Realm as he even utilized [Skill Creation] to make two new skills to support his thoughts and make sure that everything went smoothly.","After spending 30 Skill Points in total, the skills [Ultra Speed Computing] and [Parallel Though Enhancement Support] came to be as his mind was further enhanced, grasping all the minute details that would have made any being’s head hurt!","RUMBLE!","The moment that he was able to fully focus on the connection he shared with his Infinite Realm, a change finally occurred as the obsidian core that represented the core of an entire Galaxy shone with a distinct light, a black line released from it as it latched onto the archaic blue door that represented the entrance of this realm.","This black line briefly stopped on the surface of the blue door before it pierced through instantly, entering into a different spatial area as a shocking sight occurred in the Infinite Realm on this day.","Many beings within the realm were able to observe it with their eyes just briefly, and from the stories played out in the future, some said they saw a flash of a dark line that shot from the skies and pierced deep into the Infinite Realm!","This was actually what happened, this thin black line being the connection that the Novus Galaxy was forming as it found the core of Noah’s Infinite Realm as it smashed into it with a purpose!","RUMBLE!","[Connection initiating.]","Noah heard the words of his System that had now begun resonating with the cold voice of the Novus Galaxy, the voices ringing out in conjunction within his mind as he focused all his mental faculties on keeping his connection with the Infinite Realm.","Within the Realm itself though, great changes were occurring as the back like that had appeared and disappeared briefly had begun causing great changes, the establishing of a connection between a Galaxy and a Realm creating for a wondrous exchange of essence as the atmospheric levels of mana in the Infinite Realm began rising crazily once again.","In the Infinite Realm, the Harbingers had exasperated expressions as they truly did not even know what was happening now!","So many shocking events after shocking events continued to occur that they thought they were ready for anything, but they were proven wrong at every turn.","At this moment, the inhabitants of the Infinite Realm felt strong waves of essence vibrating and permeating throughout as it went yet another grand change.","[No errors have occurred. Beginning Synchronization.]","RUMBLE!","In the ancient groove of the Central Realm where the obsidian core of the Novus Galaxy existed, Noah heard this voice again as his brow began sweating, feeling the connection he shared with his Realm rapidly expanding!","The line of connection that could be observed by him in a cylindrical manner was expanding more and more, ballooning to greater sizes as a connection was formed between his Infinite Realm and the Novus Galaxy.","RIIING!","The black light that represented the connection shooting forth from the Novus Galaxy seemed like a tout string that had found an anchor on both sides, vibrating rapidly as the atmospheric essence of the Infinite Realm began to rise ever so greater!","[Synchronization successful.]","[Connection established. Beginning the process of granting a Trait.]","RUMBLE!","When Noah thought the process would slow down or even pause briefly as he sensed the enormous cylindrical line within his mind that actually still continued to expand even after the connection between his Realm and the Novus Galaxy continued- the process sped up even faster as the Novus Galaxy initiated the culmination of the Trait right away, Noah unconsciously raising his head to the skies as he felt a burning sensation with his very Origin!","This sensation was actually a branding, a ritual where a certain trait was being attached to his very Origin and Soul, a process of a Trait being granted to him!","This would be the first Trait that the Novus Galaxy granted to any creature, and this entity had chosen to do this purposefully so because the being granted the first Trait was special- being granted their abilities in the most optimum and powerful form.","For the past thousands of years since its last cycles of destruction, not a single trait had been granted to any creatures in the Novus Galaxy as most only fumbled through the levels of power and dabbled into laws. Yet today, the first being to have a trait would be born in the Novus Galaxy as it gained its first Blessed!","[Trait culmination and harmony confirmed.]","RUMBLE!","Noah felt the branding on his soul heat up as he felt a sense of tremendous calm and accomplishment, feeling ’something’ appearing within him that wasn’t fully there before, this ’something’ granting him an enormous sense of freedom and power!","[A New Trait has been born.]","OOOOM!","A magisterial sight played out around Noah at this moment as his body subconsciously lifted off the ground, the color blue dominantly spreading out from him as his body shone brightly!","CRACK!","As this mana was senselessly leaking from his body, the surrounding earth below him cracked at the pressure as the soil became ground to dust, an awe-inspiring presence shooting forth from him as crackles of blue energy coiled around his body.","This was mana! Pure and una.d.u.l.terated mana!","Mana that he could choose to do whatever he wanted with as at this point, no matter what realm of power he achieved- he would never ever have to worry about his reserves of energy!","It did not matter if he stayed at the Nebula Rank or somehow crossed ten ranks above it, for as long as he lived he would always have what his trait foretold- Infinite Mana!","RUMBLE!","His eyes opened at this moment as resplendent and gorgeous arcs of blue light permeated out from them, his form at this moment looking extremely ethereal as there was such an overabundance of mana that it was leaking from his eyes as they took on a form of shining blue lights with arcs of mana occasionally flashing out.","OOOOOOH!","He released a primal below that shook the skies and earth as he announced the arrival of something grand, the arrival of a Trait that would comfortably stand above many Traits in this unexplored universe.","He was announcing the arrival of Infinite Mana!"]},{"number":608,"title":"Chapter 608: Chapter 607 - What are your traits?","paragraphs":["As Noah completed a new trait in the Novus Galaxy, a grand chariot was being pulled across the chaotic void of the Universe by two fierce Void Beasts.","This chariot caused for a mystical sight to play out as these ferocious beasts seamlessly trudged along the chaotic void and carried along with them the inhabitants that were coming from the Nexus Galaxy.","The bodies of these Void Beasts released a mystical aura of chaos and space, this chaotic void actually making them feel as if they were home as they happily moved forward while directed by the essence of a Grand Controller!","Inside this carriage, two Law Masters aside from the Grand Controller and three Blessed were sitting in contemplation or talking with each other.","At this time, one of the Law Masters, a being that comprehended the law of fire in its entirety- glanced towards the three Blessed as an envious light flashed through his eyes. He couldn’t help but ask out carefully as the colorful essence of fire danced around him.","\"So...what are you guys’ Traits?\"","The question was a simple one, but it caused for a weird atmosphere to develop inside of the magnificent Imperial Vessel as it dealt with the unique powers of the beings they were working with!","But the Blessed at the very forefront smiled as he spoke out mildly, his extremely white hair and frosty appearance adding on to a mysterious air about him.","\"My Trait is [Ice Man]. I can utilize the element of ice even better than a controller of the law of water to the point that I’m capable of turning my entire body into a pure form of ice as no physical attacks can even reach me.\"","RUMBLE!","The envy in the eyes of the fire Law Master only increased as he heard these powerful words, his eyes going towards the other two Blessed that also had smiling expressions as if they knew of their high status!","The man at the forefront continued as they pointed towards the other two Blessed beside him.","\"This one has the trait that is called [Supernova], where each one of her strikes always releases the explosive force of a dying star.\"","The Blessed holding the Trait of [Ice Man] pointed to a curvaceous woman beside him as another shocking trait was revealed, with the voice of the frosty Blessed continuing to ring out!","\"Lastly, my friend here has the trait called [Ability Mimic] that effectively allows him to mimic and display the abilities of his opponents.\"","Every single word that left the Blessed’s mouth on what trait he and his two partners held had only caused the envy of the Fire Law Controllers eyes to increase, only the eyes of the other Controllers trying to remain without a change as the majestic chariot continued to traverse the chaotic void.","The Grand Controller that was at the forefront of the chariot and releasing his essence to steer the Void Beasts listened to this conversation as he only smiled, speaking out towards the five others inside the chariot at this moment.","\"With this signal that we are exploring, we don’t really know what we might come across. So your Traits and our masteries in the Universal Laws will work together nicely to defend against anything that we come across.\"","His voice was magnetic as it held a sense of power that only Grand Controllers that fully comprehended a Supreme Law could feel!","The others nodded at the words of the Grand Controller as even the three Blessed took on serious looks. This was because even they could not simply look down upon a being that had mastered a Supreme Law, and this being steering the Imperial Vessel had comprehended the Supreme Law of Chaos!","\"We were lucky so far to not have come across too many powerful Void Beasts, where all of the ones that appeared I could easily take care of. But keep your minds sharp as anything can happen!\"","The eyes of the Grand Controller were vigilant as the aura of chaos spread out from him calmly, sensing the many happenings of the Chaotic Void around him as he used his unique essence of a Grand Controller to continue steering the two Void Beasts pulling the Imperial Vessel forward.","\"What if we are unlucky and the signal was a powerful entity?\"","At this point, the frosty Blessed posed a question as the Grand Controller laughed warily.","\"Haha, we can only try to run at that point. Only a few parties have been unlucky enough to come across dangerous entities that cared enough to act against them, and we never heard from them again.\"","His expression was portraying calm, but he knew there was a level of danger with the task they were undertaking where anything could go wrong!","\"Anyways, I assume that you three should have been given some life-saving Talismans from the Imperials, yes?\"","The Grand Controller said this to the three Blessed as they scratched their heads with smiles.","\"The life-saving measures are only enough to survive against an extremely powerful Grand Controller’s or a Beginner Assimilator’s attacks for a short period of time as we try to make an escape.\"","The frosty Blessed holding the Trait of [Ice Man] said this as he shook his head, a somber atmosphere occupying the inside of the majestic chariot.","\"We shall see. Normally a signal reaching the Universal Rift should not be something too dangerous or too meaningless.\"","The Grand Controller voiced his words as the Imperial Vessel continued traversing across the chaotic void with even more speed, only a streak of light being visible in the utter darkness of the terrifying void.","These beings from the Nexus Galaxy were heading towards a singular location. The location where a Grand Controller of Fate had actually shattered a portion of the boundary of his own galaxy and released the signal that reached them!","As these beings traversed towards the source of this signal, towards the Novus Galaxy, one would wonder exactly what they planned to do once they found it!"]},{"number":609,"title":"Chapter 609: Chapter 608 - Why stop at one?!","paragraphs":["In the Novus Galaxy, Noah was floating in the skies of the Central Realm as his body took in the feeling of strength and power that his newly granted Trait gave him.","The Trait of Infinite Mana didn’t reinforce his body or grant him strength in any visible way, but it gave him the feeling of power that made him think he could do anything he wanted!","This was a unique feeling the very few beings could come across, and Noah was feeling it because of the fact that from now on until whatever stage he reached in his journey, he would always have Infinite Mana!","[With the success of granting this Trait, you have fully taken the mantle of the Champion off this galaxy.]","RUMBLE!","The voice of the entity that controlled the Novus Galaxy rang out in his mind as Noah sensed the connection that was now added to his Infinite Realm.","He shared a connection with the Infinite Realm, and now the Infinite Realm shared a connection with the Novus Galaxy itself!","He could continuously observe new changes continue to occur as every second passed in the Infinite Realm, and all of these changes could be attributed to the singular black line that represented the connection that this realm now shared.","[The lives of the trillions in this galaxy. Those you know, and those that you do not know. They are now all intertwined with your future actions and mine.]","[Whether we succeed or undergo another cycle of destruction and rebirth will depend on our actions from here on.","As Noah heard these heavy words, he shook his head as he completely wiped away any feelings of weakness or uncertainty from his mind. His thoughts became calm and he affirmed to himself that he would succeed!","He glanced at the blinking Stat Panel in front of his eyes as new changes displayed themselves, but he focused on a single row that displayed new information.","He saw that a new section had appeared which displayed his Trait of Infinite Mana!","[Noah Osmont][Title(s): Infernal Lord(Variant), Grand Controller(Fate)]","[Trait(s) : Infinite Mana]","[Bloodline(s): Vampyre Progenitor]","....","He simply stared at the top of the stat panel as he focused on the newly appearing section with shining eyes. If one was perceptive enough, they would be able to notice the way that the stat panel was structured held its own meaning.","When one looked at the section that displayed the titles, it showed [Title(s)] that put an ’S’ in the parentheses which indicated that one could start with one title and gain many, thus having the singular and plural form of the word displayed on the Stat Panel!","The same applied to the section listing [Bloodline(s)] as at this moment, in the section that displayed Noah’s Infinite Mana Trait, one could also see the singular word Trait with the parentheses of ’s’ attached to them!","This shocking hidden clue actually showed that in the future there was a possibility not just for one Trait, but multiple!","RUMBLE!!!","Noah’s eyes became even firmer as he stared at the word of Traits on the stat panel and thought about the words of the Novus Galaxy days ago when he confronted it and asked for the reason why she let Aldrich release a signal that would effectively endanger all of them. This memory was very vivid in his mind!","At that time, the words of the Novus Galaxy had shocked him!","[I have undergone multiple cycles of destruction and rebirth. I am tired of it, and I never want to experience that again. Thus when the change happened, I vowed to make a Champion that wouldn’t just stand above other beings, but a champion that would completely and unilaterally be able to smash all of them into nothingness.]","While talking through the 1st Infernal Lord, a cruel and wicked enchanting smile had appeared on what would be a normally blank face, the Novus Galaxy feeling very strongly about this issue!","[Infinite Mana as a Trait was only the first stage of this. It was a trait that granted the Champion all the mana for them to do whatever they wanted, and it was such a shocking trait that it could raise one to be a future powerful entity in this unexplored Universe.]","At that time when Noah heard these words, his heart was shaken as he realized that the plans of the Novus galaxy did not just finish at one trait!","[Since one trait can give you such a power, why not another? Why not a third? Why not a fourth? What if...what if we continue along this path as we create something that will be able to trample on any being that ever thought about standing in our way. Why stop here?]","RUMBLE!","The words of the Novus Galaxy were extremely cold and dominating when she talked about this, as Noah sensed a variety of emotions in them that were surging with confidence and arrogance!","But the more he heard them, the more that his heart beat even faster as those same thoughts began to occupy his mind.","If a single trait that required so many conditions just to be bought to fruition would be able to create a future entity that would be powerful enough to stand among the ranks of the unknown entities of the unexplored universe, what if you simply had another trait just as powerful as it?","What if he had three or four?! This shocking thought occupied his mind as it seemed to be the only thing he could see, but of course, there were rules that restricted such things to be brought to fruition! As the universal laws would have it...a being could only have a single trait!","That is why only Galaxies could grant Traits to their inhabitants, and the Traits were branded into their very origin and soul. It was because of this problem, because of this universal restriction, that the Novus Galaxy let a signal be released into the outside universe.","The Novus Galaxy had actually invited unknown forces that would hopefully be from another galaxy in order to just bypass just this single restriction!","She had a grand plan that involved bypassing the restriction of the galaxy only being able to grant a single trait to a being residing within! She had thrown out the bait of the signal to whatever galaxy caught it as she planned to do something terrifying to whatever force they sent in order to achieve her goals.","[If I cannot grant you another Trait because of such stupid restrictions, then I will simply have another Galaxy do it for you...]","[For the goal of creating an unbeatable Champion...for the sake of gaining strength to withstand all the terrifying unknowns waiting for us...this will succeed!]","RUMBLE!","A terrifying plan! A scheming Novus Galaxy! Just what exactly would come out of all this?!"]},{"number":610,"title":"Chapter 610: Chapter 609 - Peace","paragraphs":["As Noah completed the terrifying Trait of Infinite Mana, the beings connected to him simply experienced the huge changes of the Infinite Realm that continued to get denser and denser atmospheric essence as it further strengthened their resolve to get stronger.","In the core area of the Infinite Realm where the central continent of the Spiritual World used to be, an arrogant penguin had his beak raised high as he faced thousands of beasts, beings that the penguin considered his brothers and sisters!","The area they were currently in was filled with the universal essence of space as it was very conducive to cultivating the Law of Space, and the Emperor Penguin was currently acting as the teacher as he faced the crowd of beasts.","This arrogant Penguin was floating at the forefront as one could see that in order to fit into the role of a teacher more, this penguin had adorned a nice fitting white suit that shone with great contrast to his sleek black feathers, the appearance of a bow tie being even more prominent as it gave the Emperor Penguin an appearance that would make many beings stop on their tracks!","\"RAA!\"","He released a bellow that relayed his intentions to the many beasts, each of them activating [Disciple of Space] as they tried to comprehend this law around them, some of them beginning to display their skills as they bowed to the Emperor Penguin and sought guidance.","It was a carefree and peaceful scene of these beings only striving their best to get stronger, because even though the Overseer of the Infinite Realm had not relayed them any information that made them feel any sense of danger, many of them were still striving to improve their strength as they saw the continued changes of the Infinite Realm every day!","Noah had not yet told anyone else about the events that occurred at the boundary of the Novus Galaxy and the Signal sent out, or that a force could be making its way towards here at this moment. He knew that his subordinates would grow to be extremely powerful in time as they used the resources of the Infinite Realm and the Novus Galaxy, but they were currently nowhere near being ready to face beings that could traverse the Chaotic Void.","He knew the knowledge that because the Novus Galaxy had finally granted him the first Trait of this Galaxy, it could now begin to awaken Traits on those that met the qualifications or those who were destined for them as many beings would gain even greater forms of power in the coming future!","But the battle to come, Noah would most likely be fighting it alone, only supported by the fearsome Terrors that held the titles of Controllers. Thus, his subordinates had no idea of what was coming, but they still instinctively continued to train with even more vigor.","Aside from the Emperor Penguin who was working to improve the strength of the high ranking beasts of the Infinite Realm, there were also Barbatos, Athena, Elena, and many others that were doing just the same!","In one region of the Infinite Realm that was filled with the essence of Chaos, Barbatos was sitting on a throne of bones releasing a distinct black hue that continuously strengthened thousands of high ranking Undead of a powerful Legion that she herself was creating, this legion being reinforced by the power of Chaos as she chose to comprehend this law.","Her gaze was distant as her fingers unconsciously released essence, her thoughts rotating around a single being as she felt the continuing changes of the Infinite Realm and sighed!","\"Ah, Little Fish...\"","She thought of a single man who seemed to be elevating himself to greater and greater heights each day, her resolve of getting stronger only increasing as she sought to go towards the same level of power as this being! To just be able to stand alongside him while raising her head high!","Barbatos was not the only one with these emotions as in another location, Athena was actually facing the three remaining Mythical Beasts of the Beast World, some of the Demon Lords from the Demon World, and various other beings all over the Infinite Realm that sought to learn the law of Fate.","One could also see Old Man Inuit and Fritz by the side giving their own guidance, these old beings looking at their surroundings in shock and awe still as the fantastical sights continued to play around them.","Athena was currently following the routine where she aided those needing to see the techniques of Fate in the Infinite Realm for half of her day, using the other half of the day to traverse the Light and Dark Expanse with Old Man Inuit and Fritz as they continued to oversee the healing period for these two Expanses.","Her goal of seeking Order was still just as steadfast as she also had another reason to seek for strength at this time.","ROAR!","In another location of the Infinite Realm, one could observe a fearsome Draconic Fire Behemoth nearing 100 meters in size, the pet known as Draco having grown to the powerful peak of the World Rank as it sparred with Elena and hundreds of other Vampyres.","Scenes like these were abundant all over the Infinite Realm as many beings strengthened themselves while feeling a period of peace.","This sense of peace was enhanced even more when they looked at the nearly endless resources of the Infinite Realm!","Anytime they wished, they could walk to a nearby field that would be filled with wondrous medicinal herbs or fruits that were potent with essence, aiding them in regenerating their strength or even advancing through ranks as they enjoyed an atmosphere that very few could come across!","Even while feeling this peace, many of the top commanders under Noah were nearing the rank of Star Forgers as time passed while they also began traversing in the path of laws. Being in an environment where they could dedicate all of their time to training while keeping calm hearts, it was actually the perfect recipe to create powerful soldiers that would grow their strength at terrifying speeds.","Even if they would be nowhere near as close as Noah when it came to their breakthroughs and even with comprehending laws, it would not take them hundreds of years like their predecessors for them to achieve high levels of strength!","Just a few years would be enough to produce multiple experts, and Noah even expected to have multiple Controllers in around 10 years or less as he thought about his subordinates and all the opportunities they had access to!","But for all of this to come to fruition, he had to make sure that the plan of the Novus Galaxy was carried out seamlessly, that whatever they invited would be taken care of with no problems as he would then continue on this grand journey!"]},{"number":611,"title":"Chapter 611: Chapter 610 - [Controller](Fire, Water)","paragraphs":["As Noah repeated the words of Novus Galaxy in his mind over and over again, he was staring at the description of his Trait while continuing to sense the confounding sense of power from his Origin that had birthed a Nebula.","<strong>[Infinite Mana] (Unranked) :: Its uses are pure and simple, granting exactly what the trait says. The holder of this Trait can cast as many abilities as he wants for however long he wants, with mana never being an issue for them. It is currently unranked as there is very limited knowledge of where it might stand amongst the numerous Traits in the outside galaxies.</strong>","Noah glanced at the details of the Trait as he smiled, knowing that on this day, he could full well look down upon all others when it comes to the reserves of mana as he can confidently ask- Mana depletion? What’s that?","His smile was wide as he glanced at the description of this trait with vigor, only being taken out of this trance when he felt his Origin begin to vibrate with power!","He sent his awareness in as he found the now over 50 stars in his Nebula floating in a mystical formation, each of these stars contributing to granting him stupid levels of attack and defensive power.","If beings in the Star Forging Realm were powerful because they had a star supporting them in their Origin, one would only have to think a little to understand the realm of power where a being at the Nebula Rank had multiple stars that were doing just the same!","This created for a vast gulf for beings in the Nebula Rank, where one could have tens of stars while others only had two or three- the former being able to trample on the one holding fewer stars with ease!","But currently, the reason that Noah’s origin was shaking was because extremely pure streams of essence continued to come from the law Origin Cores surrounding his Nebula, but the current flow of universal essence was even stronger from two particular Origin Cores- the Fire and Water Origin Cores.","This was because the comprehension of these two laws...were about to hit 100%!","RUMBLE!","Tremors spread out because of the majestic energy as the size of the red and blue cores were the second largest after Noah’s Nebula, where they were glowing even brighter than the Light and Dark Origin cores that were a level higher in terms of laws.","Their rotation only increased as the seconds passed, and Noah felt their vibrations reach a breaking point as the two Origin Cores came to halt instantly...thereafter exploding into a shower of colors as they were both ground into dust!","Similar to how his Nebula formed, the Origin Cores of Fire and Water had dissolved into milky red and blue particles as they actually formed the base of a Nebula, extremely small red and blue stars beginning to erupt from these Nebulae as Noah felt an even more intense rush of universal essence washing over his own Origin.","This was an extremely interesting sight to come across as in the vast Galaxies, Nebulae were huge cl.u.s.ters of gas and dust in space that come about from the supernova of a dying star, and they are also the regions where new stars begin to form as they were actually termed the Nursery of Stars!","Seeing the Origins of two laws forming into a Nebula at this moment represented a grand future that showed the path of these laws was only just beginning.","The two newly appearing Nebulae that represented the comprehension of law of Fire and Water vibrated with essence as they began to float around Noah’s main Nebula in a circular motion, following the same path as the four other Origin Cores of Air, Earth, Light, and Dark that were all still singular circular origin cores!","But the essence they released towards Noah’s Origin was ten times what the other cored released, Noah feeling this awe-inspiring sense of strength as he looked at his Stat Panel.","[Noah Osmont][Title(s): Infernal Lord(Variant), Grand Controller(Fate), Controller(Fire, Water)]","[Bloodline(s): Vampyre Progenitor]","[Aether Particles(s) : 6,294,563]","[Karma Line(s) : 924,249]","[Fate Line(s) : 10,000,000]","[Chaos Particle(s) : 6,624,983]","[Origin Core(s) : Light-2, Dark-2, Fire-10, Water-10, Earth-4, Air-4]","[Domain(s) : Aether, Karma, Fate, Chaos, Light, Dark, Space, Time, Fire, Water, Earth, Air]","[Vitality: NEBULA]","[Focus: - ]","[Strength: NEBULA]","[Law(s) : Aether- 62%, Karma-9%,Fate-100%,Chaos-66%, Light-21%, Dark-21%, Space-38%, Time-27%, Fire-100%, Water-100%, Earth-38%, Air-38%]","[Authority(s) : Aether Lord, Fate Lord, Chaos Lord, Flame Lord, Water Lord]","Shockingly, he had just seamlessly advanced forward as he became a Controller in another two universal laws, where he now stood at the level where he had complete comprehension of 3 laws!","He focused his attention towards the two newly appearing titles of Controller.","<strong>[Controller](Fire) :: A title granted to those with complete comprehension of the law of Fire. All fire-related skills will exhibit their power at the level of a Controller regardless of their rank, the user beginning to embark on truly understanding the essence of Fire. The essence of a Fire Controller allows them to be immune to any fire-based attacks of those at lower stages of the Law of Fire.</strong>","<strong>[Controller](Water) :: A title granted to those with complete comprehension of the law of Water. All water-related skills will exhibit their power at the level of a Controller regardless of their rank, the user beginning to embark on truly understanding the essence of Water. The essence of a Water Controller allows them to be immune to any water-based attacks of those at lower stages of the Law of Water.</strong>","Nearly identical descriptions with the only changes being whether it was fire or water were displayed in his eyes, Noah gaining two more Laws that granted him the title of a Controller as he could actually claim Immunity to any beings with less advancement in the two laws!","Another even more ecstatic thing was the fact that being a Controller of the laws of Fire and Water allowed one to display the immense power of such a level on all possible cast skills of the user.","This made Noah’s eyes shine with l.u.s.ter as he imagined a shocking sight of him defeating powerful enemies with skills of the lowest tier!","\"Haha!\"","He gave a boisterous laugh as he was not the least beast fearful of whatever was coming, his main body letting his clones continue their advancement in the laws and proficiencies of a particular skill tree that would soon enter into the ranks of Nebula as he went off towards the Letalis Expanse.","His 100% comprehension in the law of Fate told him that whatever was coming would be upon them in just a day or two, thus he went towards the only location that any Outsiders could enter- and that was the Letalis Expanse where three Terrors were stationed!"]},{"number":612,"title":"Chapter 612: Chapter 611 - I Want Their Origins!","paragraphs":["The vast Letalis Expanse was eerily quiet at this time, the progeny of the Ancient Terror living within sensing the winds of change as they knew something was coming!","These were the only creatures of the Novus Galaxy to sense anything amiss, with only a few others in the Light and Dark Expanse being able to notice something. Some of these beings included Old Man Inuit and Fritz, who had some proficiency in the laws of Karma and Fate as they recently felt a sense of foreboding that came and passed infrequently!","Old Man Inuit had asked Noah about this just to be sure, and Noah had told him that it was not anything for them to worry about, not revealing the shocking truths behind what was to soon happen.","Since they were not strong enough at this moment, Noah wanted to let the beings of the Novus Galaxy continue to expand their skills and increase their power, as they could fight all they wanted in the future!","As long as he and the Novus Galaxy succeeded in their scheme the next few days, it would set up for a grand future where wars for the beings of the Novus Galaxy to join would only be an inevitability. When this time came and they were sufficiently strong enough, he would let them freely fight as much as they wanted.","At this moment though, his figure appeared in an unstable location in the Letalis Expanse where one could feel a dreadful amount of Aether dancing around, Noah actually coming to the location where the Cthulhu was normally stationed as he prepared to intercept whoever came.","RUMBLE!","The Cthulhu felt his presence as its star-sized red eyes opened slightly, only turning into slits before they closed fully thereafter as if it did not even want to glance towards Noah!","Noah smiled at this as he saw the majesty of the Terror of Aether while also understanding its emotions. Made for the purpose of protecting the Novus Galaxy, yet its Master continued to conduct unexplainable things over and over again until now, an unknown force was coming towards them because of it.","Even after listening to the Novus Galaxy, the Cthulhu still kept to its belief that they did not need to provoke the hornets’ nest, and they could have continued peacefully while slowly amassing their strength to only protect themselves if they needed to! This was why the Cthulhu did not look favorably towards Noah, even with the knowledge that he was this Galaxy’s chosen Champion!","There was a stark silence in the dreadful space filled with Aether as Noah looked like a grain of sand in the starry space when next to the star sized Cthulhu.","\"...\"","\"Can you not go patrol somewhere else?\"","The Cthulhu’s words were unruly as even while knowing full well that it was speaking to the Galaxy’s Champion, it showed its distaste as its numerous tentacles wriggled dangerously. Noah let out a light laugh at the words of this being he adopted the power of through the Terror of Aether Skill Tree, replying as his eyes stared at the blank space all around them until they landed on the boundary of the Novus Galaxy far away.","\"I wanted to be next to someone I admired. Your abilities got me where I am today.\"","\"Hmph.\"","The red star sized eyes of the Cthulhu opened as they showed the immense power within, its rumbling voice sounding out again.","\"Another one of me is not nearly enough to stop whatever you all invited towards us.\"","\"I am not just another one of you, though.\"","Noah replied quickly as he looked into the huge eyes of the Terror of Aether that took up the surrounding hundreds of miles, his voice continuing to ring out.","\"The first Trait holder in the Novus Galaxy, the first natural Grand Controller, the first to hold multiple completed universal law comprehensions...\"","RUMBLE!","Noah listed out his achievements as the eyes of the Cthulhu shone with a red light, listening silently before they turned towards the starry space above them!","\"Even with all that, even if you win...her plan is simply...\"","The red light in the eyes of Cthulhu intensified as it thought of the apparent plan that Noah was told not too long ago. This plan of the Novus Galaxy was truly a terrifying one, with many hidden things that were not revealed even until now.","They very closely dealt with whatever Outsiders came searching for the signal they sent out, and it was actually tied even closer to Traits!","To understand exactly what was in store, one must grasp what a Trait actually meant.","The origin of Traits stemmed from a Galaxy towards its inhabitants, where a single being would only ever hold a single Trait throughout their lives. Yet the Novus Galaxy wanted a Champion who held multiple Traits, a being that could look down upon any enemies that came with extreme strength.","Noah recalled the words of the Novus Galaxy as he floated near the baleful area of Aether next to the Cthulhu.","[To do this, to even have the possibility of making this plan possible, I will need the origins of the powerful beings that are hopefully from another Galaxy. If they are powerful entities from the Chaotic Void, it would be a failure as we would have to try again, given that we survive that entity of course.]","RUMBLE!","The terrifying plan of the Novus Galaxy was revealed at that point as one could feel a maddened hunger for power and survival, a hunger of a being that had undergone multiple cycles of destruction and rebirth! This hunger was caused by the fact that this entity did not want to go through it again!","Such a plan bordered on the extreme, and it was the reason why Cthulhu disagreed with it! Yes...Noah actually found himself looking forward to it as he thought of the many unknown possibilities.","They were simply too many wondrous things in this Galaxy, and in the larger unexplored Universe that he had yet to step out to. As he accomplished his trait of Infinite Mana, his eyes were looking towards even grander horizons that he had yet to even see as he wondered just what else was out there!","As for whatever the released signal would call towards them? Well, he was getting ready for this as well as even at this moment his clones were working hard to push another Skill Tree into the rank of Nebula. But in the coming battle, all he wanted to do was freely go rampant as he utilized his Trait to the fullest! He wanted to spam whatever enemy acting against them to death! He wanted to do many things as he sought to see the limit of where he could reach with the power he held.","\"I really think it will all be fine.\"","Calm words rang out in the space filled with Aether as the eyes of the Cthulhu locked towards Noah’s extremely small figure, the eyes trying to see behind this being that the Cthulhu had sensed multiple times when he was just a fledgling!","Cthulhu stared at this creature as he saw a devilishly handsome and confident smile appear on his face, a smile that actually caused the powerful Cthulhu to feel an unknown sense of pressure!"]},{"number":613,"title":"Chapter 613: Chapter 612 - Outsiders! I","paragraphs":["The man and Cthulhu observed the stars littering the Letalis Expanse as their awareness spread out to cover the boundaries of this Expanse and thus the mystical Novus Galaxy, continuing to monitor everything as they waited patiently.","At the same time, less than a light year away from the Novus Galaxy, an Imperial Vessel from the Nexus Galaxy was rapidly nearing their positions as it contained within it three Law Masters and three Blessed!","The powerful Grand Controller steering the Void Beasts forward had a careful look as the Imperial Vessel tore through the chaotic void, knowing that they were rapidly nearing the location where their Universal Rift had felt the signal.","The body of this Grand Controller undulated with power as one could feel particles of chaos seamlessly floating around him, a profound feeling being felt from him as those knowledgeable would know that this being was not simply at the stage of a Grand Controller!","He had already begun embarking on the path above that, a path that the Blessed moving with him in this Imperial Vessel had mentioned before- the path of an Assimilator!","Yet even the two Law Masters beside him and the three Blessed did not fully grasp this yet as they went forward, where they were now nearing the location of the signal.","RUMBLE!","The essence of the Grand Controller erupted out as he began slowing the speed of the Void Beasts, their Imperial Vessel that was shooting forth at the speed of light slowing down the extreme blackness of the chaotic void registered around them.","The six beings had looks of care as they each spread out their awareness while moving forward, choosing the route of extreme care as they did not know exactly what they would come across! Their bodies bubbled with power as they apprehensively prepared for anything, the Grand Controller keeping his energy ready to go at any time in case they were intruding upon a powerful Entity’s space!","\"...\"","The Imperial Vessel slowly moved forward as they came just a few miles away from the signal, the eyes of the Grand Controller opening wide as his body began to tremble, joy appearing on his face as he voiced out with great vigor.","\"It’s...another Galaxy! Haha, we’ve actually found another galaxy!\"","RUMBLE!","\"What!\"","\"This!\"","Ecstatic joy was on the faces of the other 5 beings from the Nexus Galaxy as their awareness went forth, noticing the imperceptible spatial boundary that would never be noticed by a passing being unless they were an extremely powerful entity of if they knew of the location in advance.","\"Judging by the undulations and power of the boundary...it actually seems to only be a Millenium Galaxy, with a range of maybe 10,000-20,000 years! This...\"","The face of the Grand Controller was becoming more and more ecstatic as he thought about what their finding truly meant!","The beings of the Nexus Galaxy were great explorers of the unknown Universe through the use of the Universal Rift, and the powerful force controlling everything in the Nexus Galaxy made it their goal to locate and explore new Galaxies! They had been fairly successful over the years and grown to the height they were currently at, but coming across a Galaxy such as this one which was termed a Millenium Galaxy was extremely rare.","This was because Galaxies were extremely hard to perceive when they had just undergone a cycle of destruction and reformation, where many Galaxies could only be located with ease after they had reached 50,000 years or more.","But at this point, a Galaxy might have powerful Inhabitants that would give even the forces of the Nexus Galaxy a headache to take care of. But when it came to Millenium Galaxies that had not reached the 50,000 years timestamp...this was the type of finding favored the most!","The three Blessed in the mystical chariot felt their hearts pounding as the significance sunk in, one of them hesitantly speaking out.","\"We...can report it right away and be swiftly promoted among the ranks of Imperials...\"","His voice shook many out of their stupor as they turned to him, the face of the Grand Controller squinting as he looked back. He spoke a second later as a weird atmosphere overtook the Imperial Vessel.","\"We can. But...if we enter and explore it for ourselves, can you imagine the possibilities of other rewards that might be waiting for us? The inhabitants of this Millenium Galaxy should have at most achieved Controllers and a few Blessed, maybe a few Grand Controllers at most. It is such a rare finding that we...\"","He left the last words unspoken as the faces of the other 2 Law Masters and three Blessed shone with light, thinking back to the resources that the Imperials controlled in the Nexus Galaxy, and imagining these same types of resources simply waiting for them in this Millenium Galaxy in front of them!","\"In the case we do explore and find that one of the treasures that the Imperial Adjudicator seeks happens to be in this Galaxy...can you imagine the rewards if we personally present it?\"","The voice of the Grand Controller rang out again as it seemed extremely sweet and layered with honey, making the rest of the party looking forward with shining eyes.","Their minds seemed to be made up as they looked at each other and nodded, neither of them choosing to send word back right away that they had reached the target of the signal released, and that it was actually a new galaxy still in its beginning stages that they had not come across before!","The three Blessed holding the Traits of [Ice Man], [Supernova], and [Ability Mimicry] looked at each other with looks of resolve as they nodded towards the three Law Masters led by the Grand Controller.","\"Let’s do it!\"","RUMBLE!","Imperceptible waves of fate spread out as these six beings made their decision, a decision that would put in motion a shocking set of events!"]},{"number":614,"title":"Chapter 614: Chapter 613 - Outsiders! II","paragraphs":["The Novus Galaxy was in an extremely peaceful era where many of the creatures in the Light and Dark Expanse were forging new lives as they recovered from the terror of constant war with the disappearance of the Celestials.","Not many knew the truth that the leader of this organization had actually exterminated this enormous force himself, and they lived in blissful ignorance as they continued on with their lives! Even at this moment as for the first time in the history of this Novus Galaxy when Outsiders were about to enter, only a few creatures in this Galaxy knew or felt it!","RUMBLE!","In the Letalis Expanse where the boundary of the Novus Galaxy could be seen, an Imperial Vessel could be seen squeezing through the miles long boundary with ease as it was covered by a unique energy.","This energy stemmed from a single being- the one at the forefront who was a Grand Controller of Chaos, and actually had the essence required to freely travel through the Chaotic Void as well as easily pass through the boundaries of galaxies, or even shatter or portion of such boundaries if they wished!","But the Grand Controller was moving with caution this time as they were undertaking a fairly dangerous task of entering another Galaxy. The problem at this moment lay in the unknowns, where even though they knew that this Galaxy should only be a Millenium Galaxy with at most a few Controllers, they still had to move carefully to make sure nothing went wrong.","SAAA!","The mystical chariot that was the Imperial Vessel passed through the boundary as it appeared in the Novus Galaxy for the first time, the three Law Masters and Blessed within the chariot stepping out and floating alongside it as the Void Beasts breathed in the new atmosphere with vigor!","\"This...\"","The eyes of the Outsiders from the Nexus Galaxy shone with l.u.s.trous light as they sensed the surrounding space, their awareness confirming with them the truth of this galaxy as they affirmed it really was less than fifty thousand years old!","They knew this because this was not the only outside Galaxy they were stepping in aside from their Nexus Galaxy. They had been sent on missions before that required them to step into fearsome galaxies of close stature to their own, and a few that were at lower levels.","But during all this time, they always explored Galaxies where their predecessors were there before them! This new Galaxy they stepped in...they saw that they were actually the first as they sensed the peaceful nature and movement of essence!","RUMBLE!","At this point, essence rumbled out from the body of the Grand Controller, the unique essence of chaos permeating out as his voice resounded.","\"Continue to be careful and do not celebrate yet. This Galaxy must have its own protectors, and as all Galaxies sense foreign objects and beings entering them, they will be sending their protectors over to us at any moment.\"","OOOM!","His words carried immense weight as the others nodded and their bodies began permeating with power, the Fire Law Master and the Space Law Master beside the Grand Controller actually lighting up as their bodies released powerful Authorities to surround the Imperial Vessel in a defensive manner!","They had to do this because as mentioned before, a Galaxy could always sense foreign beings that did not belong to it, causing any outside forces entering any galaxy to be sensed right away as if it contained powerful enough Protectors, these Outsiders could be defeated and thrown out with ease!","\"I am confident after entering this galaxy that they have a few Controllers or powerful Blessed, and at most, two or three Grand Controllers. We will test whatever is sent our way first before we decide to act.\"","The eyes of the Grand Controller were shining with greed as they stared at the foreign space around them, all he could feel from it being its young age as his heart looked forward to the treasures of this Galaxy!","RUMBLE!","Before his voice could even settle in the ears of others, they felt a strong aura propel towards them rapidly as the first thing they could see were its extremely large star-sized eyes.","WAA!","This strong aura rushed towards them as they could feel intense emotions of anger from its eyes, its enormous size stopping hundreds of miles away from them as the red eyes locked onto their party atop the Imperial Vessel.","The Cthulhu had made an appearance as the six beings looked at it carefully, their eyes not changing as they simply floated and kept their energy ready to go without moving!","This was because they were waiting...they were waiting to see just how many protectors this Galaxy could afford to send towards them!","RUMBLE!","A second later, another two auras appeared, their sizes just as large as they were in the thousands of miles. The Ancient Terror and the Terror of the Void appeared with cold looks as they also stared at the outsiders from a distance of a few hundred miles away.","It was an extremely tense situation as the Outsiders from the Nexus Galaxy waited a few seconds longer, the frosty Blessed who held the Trait of [Ice Man] not being able to hold himself back as an ecstatic expression actually appeared on his face!","\"Haha, this is all? It looks like this venture will be extremely worthwhile!\"","Shocking words were heard from the Outsiders by the three Terrors as they were filled with immense disdain. This was because the Outsiders could sense the auras of Grand Controllers on the three Protectors, with this aura being strongest around the Cthulhu that wriggled with baleful tentacles filled with Aether.","Even the face of the Grand Controller of Chaos was filled with light as he waited a few seconds longer before confirming they had really struck it rich to be entering a Galaxy that had so few Protectors!","\"Outsiders, you are not welcomed here!\"","RUMBLE!","The voice of the Terror of Aether rang out as it was filled with anger and unwillingness, the thing it did not want the most to happen actually taking place at this moment! But the Outsiders he spoke paid him no need as the frosty Blessed laughed while stepping forward, the authorities of the two Law Masters still actively surrounding the force of six Outsiders.","\"Boorish creature, has nobody ever told you size is not everything?\"","The words of the Blessed were filled with confidence as even while sensing that the creature in front of him was a Grand Controller of the Law of Aether, he stepped forward fearlessly and spoke down towards it!","OOOM!","A unique feeling of power released from this Blessed as he freely activated his Trait, [Ice Man].","SHAA!","For the surrounding thousands of miles, the starry space instantly became a realm of ice as the being that was the cause of it all flung his arms out with a wide smile and spoke.","\"A galaxy in its infancy just waiting for us to explore...ahh!\"","RUMBLE!","An enormous area of complete white permeated for thousands of miles in the Letalis Expanse near the barrier of the Novus Galaxy, six outsiders appearing as they disdainfully looked down at the natives sent to stand on their way!"]},{"number":615,"title":"Chapter 615: Chapter 614 - [Fireball]!","paragraphs":["Going back a few seconds, Noah had been talking with a not so pleased Terror of Aether when they felt the abrupt change in the barrier they were observing as well as the appearance of 6 new auras of power.","Three of them felt familiar to Noah, as they each had a hint of law where Noah knew it was two Controllers and a single Grand Controller that also seemed to have a unique aura included with him! The other three were even more unique as the aura Noah felt from them was unlike anything he had come across before!","RUMBLE!","The enormous body of the Cthulhu began to move the moment the auras appeared, leaving behind wrathful words that showed its thoughts at this moment.","\"The result of the actions you condone has come, let us hope it is not the doom for us all!\"","Noah gave a light smile at the strong words of the Cthulhu, sensing the other two Terrors far away from them also converged towards six newly appearing signatures as he also made his way.","\"A galaxy in its infancy just waiting for us to explore...ahh!\"","He appeared just in time as the Outsider at the forefront had an ecstatic look on his face while observing Cthulhu and the other two Terrors, Noah’s body finally become visible in their eyes as they also looked towards him, his appearance actually making them look even happier as it apparently furthered their belief that this galaxy was nothing much!","Noah’s eyes shone as he looked towards the Grand Controller letting out an aura of Chaos, as well as the other two Law Masters released auras of Fire and Space. These beings he could sense the auras of and understand, but the other three gave him a unique feeling of strength that he could attribute one thing- Traits!","He glanced at the being at the forefront who had wavy frosted hair as his body released extremely cold elements that turned the surrounding miles into a frozen space. He observed this unique being using his power, realizing that this being was utilizing a trait while his body only gave off the essence of someone at the Nebula Rank, but no law masteries whatsoever!","Yet this being was able to cause the surrounding thousands of miles to be filled with cold elemental particles that actually reduced the movements of Controllers and even slowed them down.","This was a being with a Trait, this was a Blessed!","Noah’s small figure stepped forward amidst all of this as the three Terrors had their essence ready to erupt at any moment, his eyes shimmering with strength as he appeared fully in front of the six Outsiders.","The Outsiders squinted their eyes as they actually could not observe any sense of danger from Noah’s small body, their confidence levels only rising as they confirmed these beings in front of them really were the only Protectors that this Galaxy could send out!","\"It seems like our journey will be extremely rewarding this time around.\"","The other two Blessed holding the traits of [Supernova] and [Ability Mimic] spoke to each other with smiles as they were actually protected by the Authorities that two Law Masters released as well as the field of frozen ice that the strongest Blessed laid out, not treating Noah as anything much!","Noah did not mind this as he simply wanted to open up a new chapter and fully start the terrifying plan that the Novus Galaxy had concocted, and he wanted to start off this new stage in the most spectacular way possible.","He did not want to exchange any words or play games with these Outsiders, he only wanted to start off his new path in one way! He wanted to do so in the same way when he first awakened...and it was with a single skill!","After becoming a Controller of the Law of Fire, Noah had carefully read the description that said how any rank of skills could display power at the level of Controller, and he had many ideas when he saw this!","The first thought that came to his mind was his first skill, the skill that actually started his path as an Awakened until he reached the position he did today.","It was a skill with an extremely fast casting time because of it being the lowest ranked skill- it was the Rank F+ Fireball!","His hand stretched out in front of him towards the unbothered Outsiders that had only begun releasing their energy more rampantly, preparing to see what the native of this Galaxy would throw before they fully committed to doing as they wished.","It would be an utter surprise for them when they heard a simple word!","\"[Fireball].\"",".....","BRRRRRRRR!","Like the sound of a gatling gun, tens of balls of fire bloomed out from Noah as events had to be described in a manner as if time was slowed down!","When describing the ’balls of fire’ being released from him, it did not really capture what they were fully because their sheer size was simply too enormous! These so called Fireballs were actually tens of miles large, where each one was larger than Noah’s current human form by thousands of times!","They were not really fire balls, but genuine scorching suns that were nearing the size of stars! The heat they released as they were utilized by a controller caused undulations in the surrounding space as they threatened to melt anything in sight, and it was these genuine suns that were shooting out in the tens just from Noah casting [Fireball] once.","It was a skill maxed in proficiency as Noah even added to it 5 Skill Points, this simple beginner skill at this moment actually being able to shoot out multiple scorching suns at a speed unbefitting of their sheer size and stature!","\"...\"","OOOM!","The Blessed with the [Ice Man] trait had his eyes dilate as he discovered hundreds of miles long suns rushing towards them at ridiculous speeds, his body glowing in a powerful blue light as he screamed out while wiping away the unbothered expression.","\"Ice Age!\"","RUMBLE!","He was not alone as the face of the Fire Law Master hardened, his body also stepping forward as he actually utilized |Intent| using his power as a Controller.","|Protect|!","BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","Sun after sun smashed towards them in a shower of searing heat and molten flames, each explosion causing the frosty Blessed to tremble as the Ice Age he was spreading out was rapidly eaten up!","BOOM!","Yet another sun smashed and exploded as a hazy red barrier formed from the Intent of the Fire Law Master stopped it, their faces finally becoming serious as they stared at this being in front of them.","Waves of heat washed over to them as the hand of the Blessed with the [Ice Man] trait was trembling, the eyes of the Fire Law Master cold as he stared at this being that was apparently just like him!","Even the Grand Controller nodded with a careful expression as it seemed this was in the bounds that he expected this Galaxy to send out, beginning to send messages to the other 5 Outsiders at this moment, but his words would get drowned out soon after!","\"They seem to have some skills, but this should be an easy fight. Reinforce each other’s streng-\"","RUMBLE!","His words were cut short as they consecutively heard the same words for the skill that had just made their expression serious, the words of the Grand Controller veering off as they looked towards the Protectors of this Galaxy with wide eyes.","\"[Fireball]. [Fireball]. [Fireball].[Fireball]. [Fireball]. [Fireball]. [Fireball]...\"","BRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRR!!!","Time seemed to be moving extremely slow as near Noah, the Terrors tumbled away!","Space seemed to fold from the searing heat!","A color of red overtook the starry space!","A shocking and majestic sight erupted as tens of suns began to appear in front of Noah.","On the other side, the Grand Controller of Chaos had an incredulous face as his powerful essence finally moved and swept out as he sensed this overpowering appearance of an ability used too many times, an Authority of Chaos emerging out as it held a hint of something else- it was the aura of someone that was a Beginner Assimilator!","But even this Assimilator had a gaze full of shock as he stared at the appearance of hundreds of suns that covered the entirety of their sights from all around them, each of these suns carrying with them a power of a peak Fire Controller as they thundered towards them at speeds not matching their miles long sizes!","It was shocking!","It was ridiculous!","It was the spamming of a low rank skill that had an extremely fast casting speed while carrying the immense prowess of a Controller!","It was the rank F [Fireball], and it opened up yet another stage in Noah’s life!"]},{"number":616,"title":"Chapter 616: Chapter 615 - Assimilator!","paragraphs":["Have you ever come across tens of exploding suns?","Deep in the center of these explosions as well, each of the scorching heat of these suns actually being directed at you as they seemed to endlessly rush forward? It was a terrifying sight to say the least!","BOOOM!","The Grand Controller of Chaos was taking the central position of defending as he was backed on his right by the Fire Law Master and on his left by the Blessed with the [Ice Man] Trait.","Their gazes were finally serious as the essence of the Grand Controller of Chaos expertly moved to create a thick black barrier, this barrier being covered by freezing ice in front and a layer of a flaming barrier in the back as the three beings worked together to withstand a barrage of exploding suns!","BOOM! BOOM!","The suns seemed nearly endless as the face of the Grand Controller became extremely serious, his voice ringing out to the others as they made their moves.","\"Sajar, Johnny Boy, you’re with me in taking on this small being. He should be the strongest protector in this Galaxy, yet seems to not understand the concept of preserving one’s mana with such reckless attacks.\"","His words were careful as they were directed to the Fire Law Masters in his party and the Blessed holding the [Ice Man] Trait. All the meanwhile, he slowly analyzed the situation before them while the barriers they erected were able to stop the barrage of suns that continued to explode with searing heat in front of them!","\"You three, take on the oversized creatures behind him, and don’t hesitate to use your life-saving Talismans in case something unexpected happens, I will rush in to resolve anything else.\"","He then spoke towards the two other Blessed beings and Space Law Master as the one holding the Trait of [Ability Mimic] nodded with vigor.","The words of the Grand Controller were filled with strength as he breathed in after finishing his commands, the other 5 Outsiders nodding in understanding as they saw the unique power bubbling on his body!","This was a power that they did not expect this Grand Controller to have, a power that showed he had actually already embarked on the path of an Assimilator!","This made their resolve even stronger as in the next moment, two words filled with intent left the mouth of the Grand Controller of Chaos.","|Chaotic Dispersal|","RUMBLE!","A star shaking might erupted out with these words, the intent of a Beginner Assimilator rushing towards the endless suns as it carried with it a unique authority, this essence wiping away all the coming suns as if they didn’t exist in the first place!","This intent continued forward until it found the source of the enormous balls of fire, only being stopped as it clashed with another intent that Noah released!","BZZZT!","An impasse came to be as the two sides were able to see each other once more, the Outsiders seeing the figure of Noah calmly observing them as a distinct smile was visible on his face, apparently very pleased at the way his opening attack had gone.","The Grand Controller of Chaos locked onto Noah’s figure as the party he was with followed his words!","The Space Law Master became a white streak of light as he shot towards the Terror of the Void, the one holding the Trait of [Supernova] going to match Cthulhu, and the one with the [Ability Mimic] Trait actually locking eyes with Noah first as her body shone with an Incandescent light before she went over to match the Ancient Terror.","Others might not have known, but the incandescent light on the Outsider’s body when she locked eyes with Noah was her actually using her trait as she became able to mimic the terrifying skill he had used, the Outsider wanting them to have a taste of their own medicine when she went to match the Ancient Terror!","This left the Grand Controller of Chaos, the Blessed holding the [Ice Man] trait called Johnny Boy, and the Fire Law Controller to face Noah himself, these beings moving carefully as they did not want any mistakes after finding such an opportune galaxy.","\"You don’t seem to have even embarked on the path past a Controller yet, Native. Why don’t we have a talk where I might even show you the way?\"","The voice of the Grand Controller who could also be called a Beginner Assimilator rang out towards Noah, the unique essence he used to completely wipe away tens of scorching suns being extremely potent as his right hand pointed forward!","The other two Outsiders backed away from him as one moved with their Authority and the other released terrifying coldness, this Beginner Assimilator continuing to talk as his aura only shot up higher.","\"You see, after completely comprehending a Universal Law and becoming a Controller, one must then Assimilate their law comprehension where the ultimate goal...\"","OOOOM!","His hand released a milky black aura as Noah could see it was an extremely potent essence of Chaos, and it seemed to be moving in conjunction with the Beginner Assimilator’s intentions as it wrapped around his body before he completely disappeared in a flash of chaotic light!","\"...is becoming one with the very Universal laws themselves.\"","The Beginner Assimilator actually appeared instantly behind Noah, his fist covered with this extremely potent chaotic essence as it smashed into Noah before he could even react!","BOOM!","The light of chaos overflowed as a blow was dealt by the Outsiders for the first time, even the eyes of the Terrors looking towards Noah’s figure that had been shot forward like a cannonball towards the other two Outsiders.","WAA!","Halfway through before Noah even reached the Law Master of Fire and Johnny Boy that were already preparing their attacks, his body came to a stop as a tinge of golden light began to cover him, his face shining in the dark space as one could actually see an expression of joy on his face!","This was because he had affirmed the path forward that he knew of after becoming a Controller, and he had felt the strength of this stage as the strike that had smashed into him from this Grand Controller that had begun Assimilating his comprehensions was enough to injure him!","But that was all- just enough to injure him as the two Outsiders behind him could observe his back that was a gory mess of blood rapidly healing as good as new, the distinct gold light that represented fate beginning to fully release from him.","His eyes were full of joy as he stared at the Beginner Assimilator as if he had found a rare treasure, his mind already seeing the path of laws laid out in front of him.","First, you comprehend the laws, and then you become one with them!","Assimilate them!","This was the stage above a Controller, this was the stage where beings sought to become intertwined with the Universal Laws as they freely used them to do their bidding!"]},{"number":617,"title":"Chapter 617: Chapter 616 - Three Versus One!","paragraphs":["As Noah faced a Beginner Assimilator with palpating levels of chaos surrounding his body as well as a Blessed and a Fire Law Master, the Terrors were facing their own enemies as the three Outsiders went to match them!","The Blessed holding the Trait of [Supernova] fearlessly went towards the terrifying Cthulhu that wriggled with Aether as her hands were covered by a red glow. The Cthulhu saw this figure with his star sized eyes as he cast a skill instantly, calling forth numerous stars to materialize and rush towards this Outsider as he utilized [Star Caller].","BOOOM!","The Blessed saw the newly appearing stars as she met the forefront one with her fist, a fearsome explosion occurring as the star was shattered into pieces, her body weaving through the rubble as her fist smashed into all the other coming stars while she advanced towards the Cthulhu!","This was the being holding the trait of [Supernova], a being that released the power of a dying star with every strike she landed! Her body shone with the l.u.s.ter of the essence of someone at the Nebula Realm as tens of stars swirled within her Origin.","The Cthulhu’s red eyes focused on this being as he cast yet another ability and caused baleful Aether to envelope the surroundings, the battle fully underway in this location as in another two spots, the other Two Terrors were facing their own enemies!","The Space Law Master was weaving through the layers of space as he began releasing attacks on the Terror of the Void, this powerful terror also being proficient in this space as a fearsome battle began.","The other battle worthy of note was the one where the Blessed holding the [Ability Mimic] trait was facing the silent Ancient Terror, a smile apparent on her face as prior to this, she had used her ability to mimic the terrifying skill that the small human that was being surrounded by three Outsiders cast, and she wanted to use this same skill as she showed them a taste of their own medicine!","The Blessed threw out her hands as she cast the fearsome skill- [Fireball]!","Rumble~","\"...\"","Small fluctuations of power were released as a few fireballs a few inches in diameter flew towards the Ancient Terror, their power diminishing before they could even reach the Terror as they disappeared simply because of the sheer pressure this being released.","The Blessed that knew for sure she had mimicked the ability of that being correctly looked forward incredulously at this scene!","The lesson of abilities being utilized very differently depending on the user was learned on this day as the same skill that allowed scorching suns to erupt out from the hands of one being were only small balls of fire in the hands of another!","The Ancient Terror ignored this embarrassing moment as from it, a Blood World bloomed that completely encased it and the Blessed with it, nobody else being able to know what was happening within this Blood World.","OOOM!","With these three battles occurring in their own spaces, we can now look back to the stage where a Beginner Assimilator, a Fire Law Controller, and an icy Blessed were in a triangular formation as they blocked off all sides and rushed towards Noah.","The most danger could be felt from the body of the Assimilator, as the essence of chaos could actually rip apart the defenses of a Grand Controller that Noah always had surrounding his body, the abilities of the Fire Law Master and the Blessed called Johnny Boy being much lesser worries!","As their three figures rushed towards him, Noah gave a light smile as he also cast [Blood World], an enormous veil of blood erupting with him at the very center as it threatened to cover the three Outsiders in the surrounding space.","Their bodies shone with their own unique power as they protected themselves from what they assumed was an area of attack ability, but this Blood World did not harm them one bit as it simply passed through them and continued expanding, covering the area of tens of miles around them as only the three of them and Noah were within this Blood World!","They found at this moment that they could not sense the outside world, nor could they communicate with others as well- this ability fully creating an isolated space where nothing could go in or out! The gaze of the Beginner Assimilator was passive as he nodded towards the other two Outsiders, the battle fully beginning as dazzling skills flew out.","From the hands of Johnny Boy, pulsing Frost Orbs that held enough power to threaten any Controller were released as he utilized the [Ice Man] Trait, the area he occupied becoming fully covered in white as he threw out long distance attacks!","The two Law Masters continued to rush towards Noah as they wanted close combat to pin their enemy down, especially the Assimilator that could easily injure Noah’s body with the essence of chaos fluidly moving through him.","It seemed like it was bound to be a long and difficult battle as these powerful Outsiders faced the native Protectors of the Novus Galaxy, but would it really be like this? The answer was no! And it was a shocking no as a smile bloomed from Noah in the next moment, the aura of two more beings that looked just like him appearing in the veiled Blood World!","RUMBLE!","\"What!\"","\"|Defend|\"","\"Ice Fortress!\"","The three outsiders reacted in their own ways as one of Noah’s clones appeared above Johnny Boy as cast [Madness Hegemony], the surrounding space changing to that of baleful Aether as terrifying Portals of Terror began to bloom around the Blessed holding the [Ice Man] Trait.","Another clone appeared in front of the Fire Law Master as he did not cast any flashy abilities, but actually something simple from the abilities of the Absolute Sin. From the Sin of Gluttony, Noah tested out the usefulness of [Devouring] as a black circle went on to wrap around this Controller!","The ability of Devouring allowed him to devour his enemies and even their memories, with the mana requirement varying from who exactly he was trying to devour. If a being he was targeting did not have the prowess to break through the black circle that represented [Devouring], then with his Infinite Mana...Noah should be able to devour that being in their entirety as their defenses were slowly ground down!","This ability would only work on someone on the same level as him or weaker as they would not be able to escape the black circle that represented [Devouring], so Noah simply tried it as one of the Outsiders became completely encased in the light of Gluttony.","\"Sajar!\"","The Grand Controller saw this insidious skill where his companion did not seem to be breaking out of as his body tried to change directions, but Noah’s main body stood in his way at this time as a few words left his mouth.","\"[Incandescent Emperor].\"","RUMBLE!","A new skill was cast from Noah for the first time as a brilliant golden glow erupted from him and blinded the Assimilator for a brief moment, an ability from the newest skill tree that had just stepped into the Nebula Rank through the hard work of his clones just minutes ago being utilized as Noah single-handedly took on three beings at the Nebula Realm- one an Assimilator, one a Controller, and the other a Blessed being!"]},{"number":618,"title":"Chapter 618: Chapter 617 - I Cant Take Any Damage!","paragraphs":["Right before his two clones had appeared and blindsided the Outsiders, they had finished maxing the proficiency of the [Fate’s Guardian] skill tree as Noah also met all the other requirements to upgrade it to the rank of Nebula!","Unlike the Nebula Rank Terror of Aether Skill Tree, only 5 new skills were laid out in front of his eyes.","<strong>...>>>NEBULA [Incandescent Ruler- Fate’s Guardian] :: [Incandescent Emperor](5/5), [Holy Fire](5/5), [Fate’s Guardian](5/5), [Aura of Redemption](5/5), [Sword of Judgment](5/5)</strong>","<strong>[Incandescent Emperor](5/5) :: The stature of the Incandescent Ruler is adorned as the user adopt a regal armament. While active, Incandescent Emperor grants +1000% to Damage, Attack Speed, Cast Speed, Law Resistances, Defence, as well as +50% Decreased Damage Taken from all sources. </strong>","<strong>[Holy Fire](5/5) Golden raging fires of Fate thunder down towards the user’s enemies as they scorch everything with righteous terror, with the greatest burning damage dealt to their enemies’ souls.</strong>","<strong>[Fate’s Guardian](5/5) :: The fate lines representing other creatures the user is connected to can be observed as their futures can be guided to the most optimum path.</strong>","<strong>[Aura of Redemption](5/5) :: A circular aura that surrounds the user and grants them constant health regeneration where any damage dealt can be healed instantly for as long as the ability is kept active. </strong>","<strong>[Sword of Judgment](5/5) :: A unique sword capable of tearing apart space itself is called upon to be wielded only by the user. The Sword of Judgment deals 0 Physical Damage in exchange for dealing a tremendous amount of Soul Damage.</strong>","Skills with grand names befitting the rank of the skill tree appeared, and each of them fought the others for supremacy! Noah particularly liked Incandescent Emperor and Sword of Judgment, Holy Fire coming in close third as they all pertained to him being able to deal crazy amounts of damage to his enemies.","This was why he had cast [Incandescent Emperor] as he faced the Beginner Assimilator in front of him, a golden light erupting out as his human form gained the mantle of a regal Emperor!","Royal robes shimmering with golden lights dr.a.p.ed over him, and one could see a distinct golden crown fall upon his head as it sat and shone with complete arrogance while releasing a light of domination. His devilishly handsome face was even further extenuated as his human form looked like the shiniest golden crowned being one could ever come across.","But this form that hugged his body shape granted him +1000% in Damage, Attack Speed, Cast Speed, Law Resistances, Defense, and even a +50% Decreased Damage Taken from all his enemies!","The Beginner Assimilator in front of him noticed how Noah’s aura had become greatly sharper, a dangerous edge that even he was threatened by coming to light. The eyes of the Assimilator turned serious as the liquid chaos essence around him began bubbling, beginning to wrap around his body as a black armor formed around him.","He glanced towards the frosty Blessed, Johnny Boy, who was currently releasing extremely cold waves of essence to keep at bay dreadful Portals of Terror, as well as the Fire Law Master that actually had not been able to escape from the terrifying black light of [Devouring] yet! The Assimilator glanced at all this as he prepared to go toe to toe with this unexpected enemy while saving his comrades! But would he really get the chance?","In the Blood World that nobody could see inside of, one of Noah’s clones was floating above Johnny Boy who released dreadfully cold ice essence, this Outsider shouting out powerful words soon after.","\"Pure Ice Form!\"","RUMBLE!","Blasts of cold erupted out as Noah was able to see this being change fully into a white-blue creature, even his light skin tone disappearing as he became a man of ice!","The cold eyes of this Outsider locked onto Noah as he waved his hands and released the barrier of cold light that was stopping the destructive elements of the Portals of Terror, the attacks actually going towards Johnny Boy as they reached him and...nothing happened!","\"Ignorant Native, I have taken a pure form of ice that even a Water Law Controller cannot obtain. It is something only possible from my Trait, and you cannot deal any physical damage to me!\"","The Blessed shockingly revealed his ability and what it could do with ease, Noah looking towards him quizzically as he took in the said words and nodded, opening his hand out as he called out a skill.","[Sword of Judgment].","SHIIING!","A ray of golden light fell down as a gorgeous looking serrated golden blade of light appeared in the clone’s hands.","One of the skills from the newly advanced Nebula skill tree was cast as Noah listened to the words that this pure ice form this being had taken prevented all physical damage, so he chose a skill that dealt 0 physical damage and an enormous amount of Soul Damage, grasping the golden blade of light as he slashed down towards the icy Blessed!","SAAA!","The golden blade left waves of light behind it as it swung, and the target, Johnny Boy, did not even move as he stared arrogantly at the coming blade. He was extremely confident in his Trait, as he had been able to stand to powerful Controllers in the past the moment he took on his Pure Ice Form.","He wanted to show the native in front of him that his body could not even be hurt as he would lay out terrifying attacks thereafter!","But this was where he would be terribly mistaken.","\"Dodge you fool!\"","The words of the powerfully shining Assimilator rang out as his figure streaked towards Noah’s golden armored body, his eyes locking on to the non-descript golden blade carried by Noah’s clone as this Outsider was more in tune with laws and could sense the terrifying damage that could be dealt by the sword!","These words shook Johnny Boy out of his stupor as he immediately sensed something wrong, his hand waving as he wanted to pull out his life-saving Talisman right away just in case.","But it was too late!","WOOSH!","Like a mere streak of light, the Sword of Judgment passed through his body from top to bottom seamlessly.","\"...\"","CRACK!","A terrifying sound occurred thereafter instantly, the blue light shining brilliantly in the eyes of this frosty Blessed died out, his Origin having undertaken enormous Soul Damage with zero protections as even his Rank at the Nebula did not save him!","\"Johnny Boy!\"","The Assimilator looked forward with brazen shock at this unexpected scene as he could not even believe his eyes!","At this time waves of fate spread out from the spot of the Blessed’s death as Noah’s clone saw the statue of the ice man in front of him beginning to crack, a unique energy from the surroundings actually gathering on the body of the Blessed he had so easily taken down as a shocking sight played out.","This unique energy wrapping around the dead Blessed was actually from the Novus Galaxy itself, this energy going on to preserve the dead Origin of this Outsider for the future grand plan of this Galaxy!","Noah’s clone observed as the body of the Outsider actually folded in on itself, being crumpled together as it came to form a singular black mass that remained stationary in the hidden Blood World.","At this time, Noah felt a change in his Stat Panel as he opened in to observe his Skill Points shooting up by a few hundred, his eyes shining with light as he was finally able to defeat a separate existence to grant him an enormous number of skill points! This being at the Nebula Rank and holding a Trait had gifted him with hundreds of Skill Points just a few minutes into this battle!","The gaze of the clone that just took down this powerful but stupid Blessed now turned towards the shocked Assimilator as he went to assist his main body, terrifying words leaving his mouth as he did so.","\"That’s one.\"","...!","The words were calm and nonexpressive, making one think what was just done was as easy as anything could be!"]},{"number":619,"title":"Chapter 619: Chapter 618 - My Specialty is Actually Spamming","paragraphs":["Shockingly, a Blessed had fallen in a matter of minutes since the battle began!","Only the Assimilator observed this horrendous situation as his body began to burn with an extremely black color, the aura of chaos permeating through as powerful black chaos shadows began to rise around the Assimilator.","These chaos shadows shone with a dark l.u.s.ter as each of them held the power of a Controller, the gaze of the Assimilator cold as he went all out!","Meanwhile, in the area where Noah’s clone had trapped the Fire Law Master, the black circle that represented the ability of [Devouring] opened, the sight inside making the eyes of the Assimilator even colder!","Inside the opening aura of Gluttony, the husk of a being could be seen as all essence and life force was drained out, the eyes of this Nebula Rank Fire Controller losing their light a second later as Noah had actually defeated this being with a single skill that just drained him out entirely.","A unique essence from the surrounding space went on to wrap around the husk of a being as it folded in itself, forming a second black mass that represented the Origin of this being from another Galaxy!","Noah also watched his stat panel that showed the number of skill points rising rapidly, both of his clones having finished their opponents the moment they appeared as at this moment, his three bodies went towards surrounding the singular remaining enemy in the hidden Blood World.","The Grand Controller of Chaos was looking towards the spots where his companions had died, only an eerie black mass remaining in these positions as it created for a terrifying atmosphere!","He had thought they found a young galaxy with weak Protectors and chose to enter and take most of the riches for themselves, choosing to not even send word back to the Watchers assigned to him for this mission. Now, an unexplainable enemy had appeared as he lost a Blessed and a Controller.","He breathed out as his body thrummed with power, reminding himself that he had already embarked on the path of strength after a Controller, and this being in front of him showed no indication of it. All he could see was that somehow, he was proficient in multiple laws, where he might even be a Controller in each of them as well!","\"It was a mistake to enter and antagonize you like this. Do you think we can let bygones be bygones?\"","More and more chaotic dark shadows that held the auras of Controllers appeared around the Assimilator as he said these careful words, going for possible diplomacy before he went all out against this mysterious enemy.","Noah only smiled at these words as his three bodies surrounded all sides of the Outsider, replying thereafter with a calm tone.","\"Outsider, similar to how you have the unique power of an Assimilator or how your friends have their Traits, I have my own unique power you know.\"","His words seemed to be resonating with the surrounding space as the Assimilator continued to prepare, the numerous chaotic shadows floating protectively around him as an unbound aura of chaos threatened to spill out at any moment with the command of this Assimilator!","|Protect|, |Defend|, |Strengthen|, |Fluid Teamwork|, |Enhanced Chaos|","RUMBLE!","Numerous |Intents| were used by the Outsider as the summoned chaotic shadows around him became more and more solid, the aura of Chaos palpable as these shadowy figures screeched towards Noah’s three bodies!","\"My power lies in mana, where my specialty is actually just spamming.\"","Noah’s eyes honed in on the powerful chaotic figures that numbered over ten, each of them glowing with the aura of a Peak Controller as in the middle of them, an Assimilator was tightly protected!","The Outsider was taking all precautions after seeing the deaths of his two companions, where he now used an ability that summoned more than 10 figures with the power of Controllers as he planned to carry out a long and prolonged battle with Noah.","...or so he expected.","But Noah planned to do something entirely different, where he wanted to fully use his Trait of Infinite Mana as it deserved to be used...with constant and repetitive spamming of powerful skills that required enormous amounts of mana to be used!","RUMBLE!","The surrounding space had begun to tremble as it felt a premonition of what was to come, the face of the Assimilator turning colder as he bellowed out while commanding his summoned creatures to rush forward!","[Madness Hegemony].","Noah’s main body called forth a skill that changed the surrounding space and caused it to be filled with numerous Portals of Terrors, streaks of Aether Rays appearing as they began to shoot towards the many chaotic figures and the Assimilator.","[Holy Fire].","WAAA!","One of his clones called out as from the space above, illuminant golden flames that burned the surrounding space itself began to appear as they rained down with a merciful light that threatened to burn everything it touched!","[Fireball].","BRRRRRRR!","His other clone called out the name of the Rank F+ skill as Noah condensed the balls of star sized suns into just a few meters, increasing their explosive force as they thundered forth towards the protected Assimilator like rapid bullets.","BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","The rays of Aether, Portals of Terror, scorching golden flames, and terribly explosive fireballs all smashed into the protected Assimilator as the chaotic figures he summoned took the brunt of the damage, but he survived with no problems as he prepared to retaliate at this moment, expecting his opponent to have used up a lot of his energy as he used this gap to finally deal some damage! But as he prepared to move out, he heard the same words repeat again!","[Madness Hegemony]. [Holy Fire]. [Fireball]. [Madness Hegemony] [Holy Fire]. [Fireball]...","Reinforced by the powerful skill of [Incandescent Emperor] which granted +1000% to many things, but the two qualities of Attack Speed and Cast Speed that were also reinforced by 1000% made a terrifying scene where all of these cast skills were being cast and rushing forth at a nightmarish speed that would cause one to tremble in fear.","RUUUMBLE!","Space itself shook from the ridiculous amount of mana being used as layers after layers of Portals of Terror, Aether Rays, golden flames, and destructive small suns all began to appear en masse around a singular Assimilator!","[Madness Hegemony]. [Holy Fire]. [Fireball]. [Madness Hegemony] [Holy Fire]. [Fireball]...","This Assimilator’s eyes opened wildly in shock as he couldn’t help but ask in his mind-","’How do you have the mana for all this?!’","But his question would never be answered as the barrage of colorful and destructive abilities rained down thunderously.","At this point, Noah was not even doing any work, but he was simply calling out skill names as he spammed over and over again!","It was against an enemy that had embarked on a path even higher than a Controller, but with barely a small rank above him, would that be enough to withstand against endless abilities swarming on all sides?","The answer was a dreadful no as a particular Outsider had already begun sweating as his summoned chaos soldiers began to be wiped away by the horrendous damage as all these endless attacks targeted him!","BRRRRR!","On this day, Noah learned the joys of repetitively using powerful skills with no consequences as a true spammer was born!"]},{"number":620,"title":"Chapter 620: Chapter 619 - Lets wrap it up","paragraphs":["BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","A constant flood of destructive skills rained down endlessly towards a singular Assimilator, the many chaos guards he summoned being wiped away in a matter of seconds as the flood of skills continued.","Terrifyingly scorching fireballs with the potency of suns, destructive Portals of Terror and Aether Rays, scorching Holy Fire that even scorched the surrounding space!","All of these horrendous abilities rained down endlessly as Noah spammed his many skills with ease and without stopping!","He had Infinite Mana, so there was nothing stopping him from being able to overwhelm someone much stronger than he was through these methods.","So what if this Outsider was an Assimilator? What if he had begun assimilating the Supreme Law of Chaos to himself as his usage of this law was even greater than his fully comprehended Law of Fate? None of it mattered when he went ahead and did something that defied all reason!","\"OOOOOH!\"","The Assimilator roared out as he continued defending against the barrage of attacks, pulling his aura back entirely as one could see a circular liquid barrier of chaotic light protectively hugging his body. This barrier took the brunt of the damage from the destructive skills as he tried to move across the chaotic space!","His Chaos Lord Authority was closely wrapping around him as his body thrummed with power.","His figure tried shifting left and right constantly, but each area he appeared in either had scorching fireballs or he was chased by destructive rays of Aether that would bloom Portals of Terror whenever they smashed into his barrier!","It was a terrifying situation where any place he went to, shockingly dreadful abilities awaited on both sides as he could not escape.","\"Native!\"","RUMBLE!","His voice rang out with an enchanting chaotic light as within his hands, a dark halberd made of the essence of chaos appeared as he slashed away the incoming attacks, his brow visibly sweating while he tried to reach out to Noah.","\"It was our mistake, I have no problem admitting this! Let us talk!\"","BRRRRR!","Among the barrage of fireballs with the damage of actual suns, the Outsider tried to bring this battle to a stop as Noah’s three bodies acted as if they had not heard anything, skills continuing to be called out as they thundered down!","\"I am just an Assimilator in charge of an exploration party from the Nexus Galaxy, there are many like me!\"","BRRRR!","\"My life is not worth much, but I can connect you to the force of Imperials that rule the Nexus Galaxy and many more Galaxies, I can work with you!\"","The Assimilator continued to plead out as he unbelievably saw the attacks continuing to rain down, shock running through his mind as he wondered whether this being in front of him had endless energy.","One could not simply spam skills like this, they had to run out sooner or later!","But seeing how his words did not seem to have any effect, the Assimilator gritted his teeth while deflecting the numerous terrible skills, moving from pleading to threats.","\"If my party is wiped away without us sending word to the Watchers assigned to us, they will see this as an anomaly as a powerful force will be sent to this location!\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking threats were released as the Assimilator continued.","\"We are a disposable party, that’s why we were sent first to check out an unknown signal! But the next force will not be the same, it will have multiple Imperial Assimilators and even Beta Ranked Blessed that are nothing like the Alpha Blessed you defeated!\"","Information freely flowed from the Outsider that was cornered at this moment, even his rank as a Beginner Assimilator actually not being able to help him as he faced a being that constantly spammed powerful skills capable of injuring Controllers over and over again.","The Outsider talked of Alpha and Beta Ranked Blessed, introducing some of the distinctions between the different ranks of Traits that individuals could be lucky enough to obtain throughout their lifetimes!","But...Noah had already begun to obtain this knowledge from the Fire Law Master that he had cast [Devouring] on, his mind working overtime as he senselessly continued to spam his skills while learning more about the Galaxy these beings came from.","\"I...I can even send back a message that we just came across a powerful entity and lost a few of us, it doesn’t have to end like this!\"","The words of the Assimilator were getting more desperate as he shockingly found even with his rank a level higher, his chaos barrier was beginning to crack as the essence he could supply to it was actually running dry.","This being in front of him...was actually driving him to exhaustion!","But all of his words were ignored as he despairing heard an impassive voice ring out amidst the exploding suns and bursting portals of terror.","\"Let’s wrap this up, why don’t we?\"","RUMBLE!","The dreadful skills seemed to actually be rushing down even faster as both of Noah’s clones were now dr.a.p.ed in the armaments of the [Incandescent Emperor] ability, the +1000% cast and attack speed causing the flood of abilities to get even wilder as the defenses of the Assimilator began to crack!","|Faster Casting|, |Extreme Speed|, |Duplication|.","But this wasn’t all as Noah dreadfully added the Intents of his essence as a Controller, the speeds of the barrage of skills simply becoming insane as they even doubled with the last Intent!","\"No!\"","The Assimilator was unwilling as he did not expect to lose his life in a Millenium Galaxy, in such a young galaxy that should not have had such a terrifying figure!","As he glanced at this enemy that seemed to have endless energy to cast his skills over and over again, he realized that his strength did not lie in the essence of fate or fire that made him a genius Controller of two laws, but it was shockingly the trait that somehow allowed him to endlessly cast these horrible abilities so many times.","As this Outsider was faced with a spamming of abilities he wondered- just what Trait did this creature have to give him power like this?!","Just what was the rank of such a Trait that he could handle him and two others with ease?!","CRACK!","The answer would not be known by this being nor Noah for quite some time as the Chaos Barrier this Assimilator cast finally cracked, the flood of skills rushing towards his strong body as they began to ravage him apart.","\"They will come to this signal again...!\"","\"They will come!!!\"","RUMBLE!","His words were drowned out by the barrage of fire and aether as a being that had already embarked on the path past a Controller faced his end.","The cause of his death? Someone was spamming too much!"]},{"number":621,"title":"Chapter 621: Chapter 620 - Origins from another Galaxy!","paragraphs":["In the hidden Blood World where no eyes could pry in, Noah had actually defeated three Outsiders! One was an Assimilator, another a Fire law Controller, and lastly the Blessed who was called Johnny Boy.","His three bodies stopped the constant spamming of skills as they each held the ability of the [Incandescent Emperor] still active. This allowed for a regal aura to show on all his three bodies as they were adorned with a golden crown and royal golden robes that shone with majesty!","But his expression was impassive, where one could only observe a light smile as Noah simply watched the condensing of the black circular masses that represented the origins of these dead outsiders. These origins were the things that his Nexus Galaxy needed in order to carry out a terrifying plan.","The circular black masses remained stagnant as they floated in space held up by the unique essence of the Novus Galaxy itself. Noah did not even touch these Origins as he had already obtained the skill points he wanted from taking down separate existences, but no other loot like skill books or cores were given to him this time around!","All of these things were retained within the origins that were floating in space as they made up the core of the Origins of these Outsiders.","But one of the bigger rewards that he had obtained from these three outsiders was actually the memories of the one that he had devoured. These memories told him about a grand Galaxy! A Galaxy filled with trillions of beings, a galaxy that had its reaches spreading out across this unexplored Universe!","His heart beat slightly faster as he absorbed all of this new information and contemplated the future, and he then placed all of it aside for now as there were still three other Outsiders that the terrors were facing outside of the Blood World he had erected.","The Terror of Aether was facing the Blessed with the [Supernova] trait as this being utilized his essence at the nebula rank along with his trait to release explosive strikes that each held an extreme power of a supernova!","But just this was not enough to withstand The Terror of Aether who released an ability much similar to Madness Hegemony as the rounding space became filled with the baleful power of Aether as the Portals of Terror and chaotic rays of ether freely floated around. The state of this Blessed was pitiful as they were barely keeping up their defenses amidst the attacks of the Cthulhu.","The Blessed with the [Ability Mimicry] was in an even worse state as she had mimicked the ability known as [Fireball], hoping to use this fearsome skill to punish the natives of this galaxy. Yet to her dismay, all that this ability released from her hands was a few flimsy fireballs and not the humongous suns that Noah had released prior!","Her Trait was currently still on a cooldown after the first few minutes of using it, and so this meant they did not have as many viable and powerful abilities to use while facing the Ancient Terror! This meant that this Blessed was also on dire straits in this battle as nobody else could even observe her situation as she was wrapped in the Blood World of the Ancient Terror.","The only Outsider who seemed to still be standing head-on as the Space Law Master who was facing the Terror of the Void. His body was constantly shifting and moving across the space as his eyes looked to the battle of his other companion that was on the losing side. He was not even able to observe the states of battle for his other four companions as they were contained in isolated worlds!","His gaze looked hurried as he waited for the Assimilator that should have been contained in Noah’s Blood World to come out, and this was because he expected the powerful Grand Controller to have easily been able to defeat the singular native that he faced with Johnny Boy and the Fire Law Master.","Yet to his shock as a few minutes passed by, not a single being came out of the expansive Blood World as his worries only piled up!","RUMBLE!","This was only so until this moment, when this isolated world dissolved and they shockingly saw the scene within as a single being came out of it alive.","The appearance of Noah’s three bodies with the same exact regal armament of an Incandescent Emperor gave terror to the two outsiders that could see him as they were actually not able to observe the beginner Assimilator who should have been powerful enough to defeat this being with the support of their other two companions!","As they could already barely hang on to their own battles, this change made them despair!","The Terror of Aether used this chance when the Blessed with the [Supernova] Trait was distracted as he released and compiled multiple portals of terror, his tentacles flooding out and beginning to constrict the space around this Outsider, her fate actually being decided at this instant.","The other Blessed that was facing the Ancient Terror in her own Blood World also could not hang on at this time, not even knowing what was happening to her companions as her defeat also happened in the next few seconds! This only left the Space Law Master who had grown increasingly panicked as he shook his head in stupefaction and fear, his figure starting to turn into a streak of light as he tried to run towards the boundary of the Novus Galaxy!","The Terror of the Void released its own terrifying skills to stop this, but it did not even need to as Noah himself flashed above the space where this Outsider was running towards as he cast yet a simple spell.","[Fireball].","BRRRRRRR!","Scorching suns bloomed in front of Noah from the simple cast of a low-ranking skill as they shot forth like a barrage of bullets, these tens of miles-long suns going on to smash into the body of the worn-out controller as they were able to utterly obliterate his defenses!","OOOM!","The scene that had occurred multiple times before happened again, where yet another origin began to condense in the space of the Novus Galaxy as simultaneously, three more black masses formed.","These black masses of Origins represented the six Outsiders that had come to observe the signal received by the Universal Rift of the Nexus Galaxy, and these six Outsiders had all so easily and ridiculously been taken down in less than half an hour!","All that remained of these Outsiders were small circular black masses that represented the Origins of existences of another galaxy, as well as the Imperial Chariot being pulled along by two Void Beasts that remained stationary far in the distance.","[Now...we can begin.]","RUMBLE!","The nonchalant voice of the Novus Galaxy rang out at this moment as the unique energy that wrapped around the six origins shone with a bright black and white light at this instance, the plan that this terrifying entity had crafted starting to be carried out at this moment!"]},{"number":622,"title":"Chapter 622: Chapter 621 - What is making all of this possible?","paragraphs":["The Terrors watched on in silence as they saw the Outsiders called into the Novus Galaxy so easily defeated, their eyes locking towards Noah as he was the one to actually stand against half of them and come out unscathed in even less time than it took for them to defeat their enemies!","But Noah was not paying attention to these gazes, his eyes being focused on the Origins of the Outsiders that came from a place called the Nexus Galaxy.","These Origins had begun to shine with light as they moved close to each other, Noah watching closely as the essence of the Novus Galaxy itself wrapped around them and caused them to spin in a circular motion around each other!","What was happening now might not have any meaning to anybody else watching, but it held a great meaning to Noah as he recalled the plan of the Novus Galaxy to raise a dominating champion that would utterly obliterate any enemies they came across.","The first step was the completion of the Infinite Mana Trait, with the next step being to directly begin the culmination of another Trait that would also take time to come to fruition.","In order to do this, the essence of another Galaxy was required! This was because a Galaxy was the only thing capable of granting Traits, and it could only grant these traits once to the inhabitants residing within it.","A single being could only ever receive one Trait, which meant that if Noah wanted another Trait, he had to be considered a native of another Galaxy!","He could not just barge into another Galaxy like the 6 defeated Outsiders had done, as that would only cause that Galaxy to notice their existence that was different from the natives as the Protectors of that Galaxy would all swarm towards this Outsider to eliminate them.","So the only solution meant that a being had to be considered a native, and this was the plan that the Novus Galaxy devised and needed the Origins of beings of another galaxy for!","As Noah watched the 6 spinning orbs that represented the Origins of the beings from the Nexus Galaxy, the cold voice rang out again.","[The first step in culminating another powerful Trait is for me to carry out a procedure that will send half of your Origin into another Galaxy, your Origin being covered by the potent aura of the natives of that galaxy as it completely evades the senses of the Galaxy Core, that entity treating you as if you were their own.]","Yes!","The plan was to use the Origins of the natives to mask his own, and somehow succeed in transferring himself into the Galaxy as he was recognized as a native!","[If successful, your transferred Origin will be able to find a vessel in that Galaxy that resonates with your soul as we force a fusion with their Origin and yours, with the most likely scenario being you finding a vessel that is near death.]","The shocking words of the Novus Galaxy continued as they showed a clearly laid out plan to send half of Noah’s Origin into another Galaxy, this process being able to happen undetected as his Origin found a vessel of a being to occupy, thereby being considered a native as he embarked on a journey to culminate his second trait in that Galaxy!","But...such a thing was far-fetched and should not be possible!","Being capable of somehow using the Origins of the natives of that galaxy to mask Noah’s, somehow sending his Origin to traverse the chaotic void and be able to arrive into the new galaxy, and even the process of successfully finding a vessel that his Origin would occupy...all of these were impossible things to achieve as universal laws existed which prevented such a thing from ever becoming a reality.","Yet, the Novus Galaxy had done many things that defied universal laws, and this yet another impossibility it planned to overcome.","Noah’s eyes shone as he thought about this, seeing the six rapidly rotating Origins come close to each other as they began fusing together, a milky white color spreading out as a singular white and black mass was slowly forming.","He was thinking of what made it possible for the Novus Galaxy to continue doing things that defied Universal Laws, and it could all be attributed to the \"Change\" she mentioned previously, but never explained to him!","Somehow, this \"Change\" made it possible for her to culminate a being with a Trait such as Infinite Mana that completely went against natural laws, and now she was doing another impossible thing as she planned to transmigrate the Origin of this same being seamlessly into another Galaxy.","Noah could not help but ask as he watched the formation of the milky black and white core made of the 6 Origins of the Outsiders as he prepared himself.","\"What exactly is making this possible? How can you be able to undertake events to allow a successful transmigration into a vessel of another Galaxy with such confidence?\"","He asked how any of this was probable as the 6 Origins of Outsiders fused into one, a spectacularly shining milky mass being observed by the eyes of Terror and Noah in the starry space of the Novus Galaxy!","[Bring the Origin Embryo into the Central Realm, I will show the ’Change’ that makes all this possible.]","The voice of the Novus Galaxy rang out as the Terrors looked at each other, returning to their posts as Noah’s hands delicately reached out to the milky white mass called Origin Embryo. He carefully wrapped his essence around it as his figure disappeared from this location and teleported into the Central Realm!","Not just the Central Realm, but the location where a mystical grove of ancient trees resided, the obsidian core of the Novus Galaxy lay! He reappeared within this mystical location as the thick essence of universal laws surrounded him again, the Origin Embryo he arrived floating in the air between him and the obsidian core of the Novus Galaxy.","[It was a change that occurred when I underwent the last cycle of destruction and reformation, the reason why all of this is possible.]","The voice of the Novus Galaxy rang out as Noah shockingly saw the smooth obsidian core shine with a dark light as something with a terrifying aura came out of it!","This aura was terrifying because it made his very Origin tremble as his knees nearly buckled from the weight of the pressure released, the ’thing’ coming out of the obsidian core of the Novus Galaxy being this shocking!","[This is what made it all possible, something that I found with me the second my consciousness returned after the last destruction.]","An aura of colors erupted in the mystical ancient grove as Noah’s eyes trembled while observing the appearance of something so powerful it felt like his entire origin could be obliterated in a second!","The thing that made it possible for the Novus Galaxy to defy so many natural laws had appeared!"]},{"number":623,"title":"Chapter 623: Chapter 622 - Ruination Core!!!","paragraphs":["\"What is that...?\"","Noah asked with trembling words as he sensed this unknown feeling of pressure coming from the thing floating out of the obsidian core of the Novus Galaxy, being able to notice its shape being square as it seemed to be filled with multiple holes that led to nowhere!","A square item with countless holes, shining with a fearsome red and black light!","The milky liquid form of the universal laws had begun dancing wildly as they were attracted by this black box, beginning to flow towards it fearfully as they entered the holes of this box and never came out.","Noah felt his heart pounding as the voice of the Novus Galaxy rang out while slowly pulling this red and black square box back into its Obsidian Core.","[Ever since I regained consciousness, I have only known its name. It is something called a Ruination Core.]","RUMBLE!","Space shook at the mention of these two words as Noah repeated them in his mind, the shocking identity of the thing that caused an enormous change in this recent cycle of destruction and reformation of the Novus Galaxy being revealed!","It was this item that made it possible for the strict and inviolable natural laws to be twisted and bypassed in order to achieve the Trait that Noah currently held, and it was also this item that the Novus Galaxy had to use to make it possible for the grand undertaking of placing Noah’s Origin into another galaxy.","The intense pressure it released slowly receded as it was pulled back into the Obsidian Core of the Novus Galaxy, Noah finally being able to breathe again as his mind still swirled with questions!","What exactly was this item that made all this possible? Why had it appeared when the Novus Galaxy began a new cycle? How could its uses actually bypass natural laws as it made unbelievable things possible?","[Our lack of knowledge of this item is actually our greatest weakness, because it should hold an insurmountable importance, and yet we do not even know what it is. All I can currently do is exert my influence to utilize an insignificant portion of its power that has allowed me to do what I have done so far.]","[One of the things you will have to do as you explore this Universe is to gather knowledge and find out exactly what this is, and how we can better use it! But you must take extreme care as just from the little we can do with it...means that we will undoubtedly invite a disaster if others were to find out that we hold such a thing.]","RUMBLE!","Noah felt his heart shaking as he heard these words, nodding as he understood more of the mysteries of why and how the Novus Galaxy came to be where it was today, and yet as always he just felt like he was left with even more questions!","[This Ruination Core will be what will make it possible for your Origin that will be masked within this Origin Embryo that is in tune with that Nexus Galaxy to successfully traverse through the boundless chaotic void and arrive in that Galaxy safely to find a vessel.]","The main player that made many things possible was introduced, and even though Noah and even the Novus Galaxy did not understand fully what it was at this point, they still continued forward with their aims as Noah nodded with a serious expression!","\"You say my origin will be attracted to a vessel in the Nexus Galaxy...I wouldn’t find myself becoming a baby or something, right?\"","[No, your Origin will require a vessel that has lived for some years and had a wide and strong enough core to contain your Origin. It will most likely be an aged being, or a sickly being in their prime who has a weak core, or even a being that has been seriously injured and is about to face death. Your Origin will seek its fated counterpart in this galaxy as your complete comprehension in the Law of Fate will actually make it so that you will enter the most opportune vessel to start your rise in the Nexus Galaxy.]","Yes!","If all goes as planned, Noah would successfully be able to have a part of his Origin enter the Nexus Galaxy and transmigrate into a vessel of this powerful galaxy as he began on his quest for his second Trait!","[The moment you successfully find a vessel and awaken will also be the time that your second Trait will be granted to you, the entity overseeing that Nexus Galaxy unconsciously feeling its essence being used as before it will even notice, a Trait will begin to be culminated within you!]","The Ruination Core was making all of this possible! The transfer of this Origin Embryo, the implantation of Noah as a native of this galaxy, and even the initial unconscious use of this Galaxy’s essence to initiate the initial formation of Noah’s second trait.","[Similar to Infinite Mana, there will be conditions that you will have to fulfill in order to bring your second trait to fruition, where even if that Nexus Galaxy notices anything thereafter- as long as your trait initiated successfully, it has to help you bring it to fruition. As long as you fulfill the requirements of that Trait similar to Infinite Mana, it will be completed with no problems!]","The voice of the Novus Galaxy was filled with a wild hunger for power as Noah heard its words. His eyes shining with bright l.u.s.ter as he looked forward to such an event.","[While you traverse this new Nexus Galaxy and aim to complete your second trait while gathering knowledge and information, half of your remaining Origin over here will continue comprehending laws and getting stronger as we get ready for a bright future.]","The rough details of a grand future were laid out as Noah was reminded of what was required to achieve this plan, which was to separate his Origin in half as one would be feud to the Origin Embryo made from the six Outsiders to go towards the Nexus Galaxy, while the other half would remain in the Novus Galaxy as it healed and continued growing stronger!","But this action of separating his Origin...would be an extremely painful one as very few beings in the vast universe had ever even gone through something like this.","Yet he would have to endure it as he stepped onto a path for an unknown but grand future, so he steeled his resolve as he looked forward to the rotating Origin Embryo just waiting for him.","\"When do we start?\"","[Before splitting apart your Origin, we will have to deal with protecting ourselves first from the signal we released. As that Outsider mentioned, even stronger beings will be sent here to check out what went wrong, so we naturally have to disappear from this location first before we carry out our plans.]","The Novus Galaxy said these words simply as Noah smiled, recalling something unique that only he was currently able to do in the Novus Galaxy as the mention of relocating an entire galaxy was mentioned!","\"You couldn’t possibly mean the...\"","[Yes, the inconsequential and intuitive World Engine produced by the inhabitants of the Lost World. Well, with a few modifications and support from something that has made many improbable things possible up to this point.]","RUMBLE!","Waves of fate rolled out as events continued to steer towards an uncertain and terrifying future, a being and a Galaxy continuing a plot that would shake the unexplored Universe!"]},{"number":624,"title":"Chapter 624: Chapter 623 - Relocation","paragraphs":["Near a glimmering multicolored Universal Rift, a Watcher opened his eyes as they slowly dimmed with golden light.","This light was very much similar to one present in Noah’s eyes whenever he utilized the essence of Fate, the light in this being’s eyes being much more powerful and condensed!","This being opened his eyes as he muttered shocking words.","\"All six dead...? Could it be an unknown Entity, or something else?\"","The Watcher wondered out loud as he was already sending word to the correct departments and waiting for directions on how to move, where he was actually sending a message and waiting for word from a High Ranking Imperial!","The light of fate in his eyes flowed towards his brain as imperceptibly pieces of information began to flow into him.","\"No...not an unknown entity...\"","Information that he should have had no knowledge about was flowing into him as he ascertained exactly what happened just a few minutes ago! The knowledge that the party of beings under his watch had actually located the signal and spent some time around it before they lost their lives became clear to this Watcher, making him rule out the possibility of a powerful unknown entity as the other choices were extremely enticing to him!","He also sent word of this as he received a reply soon after, a voice entering his mind.","\"Watcher Gold Eye, we trust your judgment. They might have found a treasure and got greedy, thus resulting in their death. We will dispatch a force of multiple Alpha Blessed just like them and a few Beta Blessed accompanied by Assimilators.\"","RUMBLE!","The verdict was quickly passed down as the Imperials worked on efficiency and communication, getting to the core of the issue as they thoroughly prepared!","\"Actually just in case, I shall let one of the High Imperials holding a Delta level Trait accompany this force to make sure there are no mistakes.\"","The classifications of Traits were mentioned once again as a terrifying individual planned to be sent out, a being holding a rank of a High Imperial! But the more important ranks were those of Traits, which went from the lowest ranked Alpha to Beta, and the terrifying rank of Delta.","Past Delta, one would come across the fearsome ranks of Traits termed Epsilon and the legendary rank of Omega!","As far as many beings knew, an individual holding a Trait of Omega had not risen in the Nexus Galaxy or in the nearby doc.u.mented galaxies! But the issue of this signal that had caused the rapid vanishing of a party under a Watcher had made an Imperial issue an order for multiple Blessed at the ranks of Alpha and Beta, as well as a single Delta ranked High Imperial to accompany them.","\"Thank you for the support, Watcher. I will send the selected beings your way in a few minutes...\"","RUMBLE!","Waves of fate spread out as the Watcher smiled, the light of fate staying within his eyes as it seemed extremely dense!","One would be able to notice the faint glimmer of Fate Lines, but these golden lines seemed much thicker and much brighter than even Noah’s current Fate Lines as they held a unique power. It was the power of a being that was not just a beginner Assimilator, but a genuine Assimilator that had been fusing the Law of Fate to himself!","He prepared to receive and send off yet another party across the Universal Rift soon as the Imperials moved with efficiency in the background...","---","Back in the Novus Galaxy, Noah had pulled out the exquisite World Engine as it had begun to be disassembled and reassembled numerous times by the Obsidian Core of the Novus Galaxy in front of him, the resplendent color of powerful and ancient runic sigils swimming around freely!","Before they could start with the grand scheme, they had to ensure their safety as they relocated the Novus Galaxy from the location that released the Signal which reached the Nexus Galaxy.","The words of the Outsider rang out in Noah’s mind as he mentioned how they were just a disposable party sent to see if it was anything genuine. Normally, a party such as this would have reported their findings of another Galaxy right away, but the shockingly young age of the Novus Galaxy made them greedy!","The fact that they now perished meant that the signal would be investigated even more thoroughly, where higher ranks of Blessed and powerful Law Masters could be sent. Thus, Noah’s eyes watched with rapt attention as the World Engine was assembled together once more, this time as it shone with a black and blue light as the runic sigils all around it settled down.","[It would normally be an impossible thing to even imagine, but I have restructured the Engine to be able to spread its effects across the entire galaxy when activated near the core.]","The voice of the Novus Galaxy rang out as the newly formed Engine floated towards Noah.","[Even with that modification though, the impossibility would lie in the fact that no being is capable of supplying the energy required to carry out a teleportation of an entire Galaxy. Well, that is unless you had Infinite Mana.]","\"Haha!\"","Noah gave a light laugh at this as his hands landed on the newly modified Engine. It could not be termed a Realm Engine or even a Galaxy Engine as it was about to do something spectacular!","From the hands of the Atlanteans of the Lost World that first created the World Engine, to the Celestials destroying their World because of it, this same World Engine was now being used to change the fates of trillions! It was truly shocking to see how things were so intertwined and connected when one could observe the river of fate and understood its movements...","Noah yet again began violating common sense as mana leaked from his body endlessly and entered the modified Engine, a unique essence beginning to permeate from this item as it expanded outwards to start covering the entirety of the Novus Galaxy!"]},{"number":625,"title":"Chapter 625: Chapter 624 - Split your Origin!","paragraphs":["A Galaxy was extremely vast, even a Millenium Galaxy like the Novus Galaxy that was present less than 50,000 years was just as vast.","Yet at this moment, a unique essence had begun to spread out from the core of the Central Realm of the Novus Galaxy, this essence released by an Engine modified to allow for the displacement of an entire Galaxy into a different location being put to work!","From the hands of Noah, endless mana leaked out as he did not feel any strain from activating an item that would be able to affect an entire galaxy, his energy pouring in even faster as the rate that the unique essence released from the Engine actually increased.","It rapidly spread out from the area behind the golden barrier, going on to pass the Sanctum of the Central Realm where newly arriving beings would appear, and then began to permeate out of the Central Realm itself!","This unique essence was barely perceptible to the inhabitants of the Novus Galaxy, many of them just feeling something spreading over them as they would soon go about their days without knowing even what had happened.","Many of the creatures of the Novus Galaxy were in a stage of ignorance right now, where none of them even knew that a shocking battle had just taken place in the Letalis Expanse! It was a battle where they came in contact with beings Outside of this galaxy, but the vast majority of beings in the Novus Galaxy were not even thinking about such a concept at this time, and many normally would not in all their lifetimes!","The inhabitants of the Infinite Realm were the same, where Noah’s subordinates also did not know what Noah had just done or what shocking actions he was actually doing right now. Each of them continued to strive for greater levels of strength as they just had an intuition that something big was going on, and Noah was shouldering all of it himself.","Even these beings were also only able to notice the imperceptible essence being released from the modified Engine wash of them as it permeated through the Novus Galaxy, Noah’s mana continuing to sink into the Engine as the three expanses began to be covered throughout!","From the Letalis Expanse to the Dark and Light Expanse, this unique essence permeated throughout as it covered every nook and corner, every star and sun...everything was covered and protected by this unique energy as over an hour passed by!","RUMBLE!","In the ancient mystical grove of the Central Realm where Noah was near the Obsidian Core of the Novus Galaxy, his eyes opened as the Engine his hands were attached to sent him a feedback telling him that its essence had reached every corner of the Novus Galaxy, and he could initiate the final step at this moment.","His eyes shone powerfully as he gave the command, a wave of immense mana erupting from him as it acted like a chain reaction, the modified Engine in front of him releasing a white light that traveled even faster than the speed of light as it went to encompass the Novus Galaxy in an instant!","It was also this blast of energy that meant that at this moment, this expansive Galaxy had actually been shifted from its original position in this unexplored Universe.","If one were to be standing in the Chaotic Void and they could clearly observe the boundaries of the Novus Galaxy, they would have watched on at this moment as this expansive galaxy disappeared from this position, never to be seen again at this location of the Chaotic Void!","---","In an unknown location of the vast Universe, the Chaotic Void was filled with all sorts of wild destructive elements as they all came together chaotically yet peacefully at the same time.","This dance of destruction and peace was disturbed at this moment as the surrounding space trembled, the appearance of a warping galaxy changing the surrounding atmosphere as spatial essence ran rampant!","RUMBLE!","Waves after waves of tumultuous essence spread out as the calm only came a few minutes later, this unknown location of Chaotic Void gaining a galaxy on this day silently.","The location that had released a signal caught by the Imperials of the Nexus Galaxy...was now empty!","A successful relocation had occurred on this day a the Novus Galaxy was hidden in an unknown location, its beings not likely to be bothered by any Outsiders in the coming future.","In the Central Realm of the Novus Galaxy, Noah breathed out at the successful warping of an entire galaxy, not an ounce of exhaustion being felt from his origin after spending such enormous amounts of essence to do such a thing.","[Everything went successfully, and we can now proceed.]","The Novus Galaxy itself seemed to have no brakes as it continued to proceed forward, one event after another finishing as they just continued!","[At this point, all that is left is for you to split your Origin in half so we can fuse it into this Origin Embro. After that, it will just be your entrance into the Nexus Galaxy we have to worry about as the remaining half of your Origin here heals as you continue to increase your strength.]","Yes!","At this point, a much needed time had been given to Noah after this relocation, where after they carried out their scheme, he would have an enormous amount of time with no interruptions or enemies popping up every few days!","He would be able to enjoy the Infinite Realm as he farmed the powerful medicinal herbs and fruits as much as he wished, as he created Dungeons for the enhancement of his forces’ strength, crafting items and potions using the features of the Infinite Realm, and traverse through the multiple laws he had as he became a Controller in all of them and then proceeded forward to become an Assimilator!","To do this, he would need the techniques of Assimilating laws that a Galaxy like the Nexus Galaxy will have, as the enemies he defeated did not give him any skill books this time around since their Origins were used to make the palpating Origin Embryo.","Even the being he devoured was only a Controller, and did not even have the techniques needed for one to assimilate universal laws!","As he thought of all of this, Noah was very much looking forward to the coming future! But to start things off and make it possible, he had to first split his Origin and Soul as he underwent an extremely painful process.","He sat on the vibrant earth as he was surrounded by the milky rivers of universal law essence swirling around the core of the Novus Galaxy, casting [Aura of Redemption] to offset and heal the coming pain as he gave a command to his Origin!","It was akin to a being sending neural impulses from their brain to tell their limbs to move or for their mouth to open, but the impulses that Noah was sending were telling his very Origin to split in half!","RUMBLE!","His face grimaced with immense pain as the process began, his very Origin being split apart as in front of him, the Origin Embryo made from the Origins of six beings from the Nexus Galaxy floated close by, ready to fuse with whatever came out!","The scheme of a Galaxy continued as a powerful being was splitting apart his Origin to fuse it to an Embryo that would allow him to imperceptibly enter a grand Galaxy, a galaxy where he would be starting off with another Trait as the path of seeking immense strength to unilaterally smash any and all enemies continued!"]},{"number":626,"title":"Chapter 626: Chapter 625 - Embark towards the unknown!","paragraphs":["Pain could be felt on different scales, and it could be felt in many different forms!","Currently, Noah was undergoing the strongest type of pain- one that dealt with his very Origin.","\"...\"","He grit his teeth as he prevented any painful grunts from leaking out, his eyes changing to a shade of red as the process of splitting his Origin continued!","|Split|!","RUMBLE!","He exerted his power as a Controller as he used his intent to accelerate the process, the essence of fate wrapping around his Origin as it initiated the last step.","SPLAT!","Noah was forced to spit out a mouthful of blood as he felt something inside him break into two parts, the process continuing to mount the pain as he felt his chest splitting!","From his chest, one could see the protrusion of a swirling origin, looking very similar to a swirling nebula as it very quickly became a circle that shot towards the prepared Origin Embryo. The split Origin from Noah shot into this Embryo quickly as it entered and pierced it to its very center, remaining there peacefully as the essence of the Novus Galaxy wrapped around it vibrantly.","Noah himself was breathing out heavily as the cast [Aura of Redemption] healed his body and soul, feeling himself getting much better but also having a sense of unknown weakness as half of him had been taken away!","He felt this bubbling consciousness flicker in and out inside the Origin Embryo as a black and red light was shining from the obsidian core of the Novus Galaxy as it undoubtedly used the power of the mysterious Ruination Core to fuse Noah’s origin into this Embryo and have it ready to be sent forth towards a new Galaxy.","RUMBLE!","Waves of essence erupted out at this moment as the Origin Embryo shone brightly, Noah feeling his other half of consciousness vibrantly come to life as he found his other half to only feel himself as a round ball- as a simple origin!","[It was successful.]","The words of the Novus Galaxy rang out as Noah’s main body looked at the Origin Embryo floating in front of him, his hands reaching out as he grasped onto it delicately and felt his consciousness within.","\"It is ready to be sent out? The Nexus Galaxy will not even notice as this origin enters?\"","[No. Through whatever power this Ruination Core holds, I am confident in being able to allow passage of this Origin Embro into the Nexus Galaxy until it finds a vessel and awakens a Trait. Everything will be left up to you thereafter.]","Noah nodded as he adopted a serious look, pushing the Origin Embryo towards the Novus Galaxy as he spoke out with conviction.","\"Let’s do it!\"","OOOOM!","The colors of black and red shone even brighter as the Novus Galaxy used the immense and unknown power of the mysterious item known as a Ruination Core to make improbable things possible, this time all of this power focused onto this Origin as a few realities were placed into it!","One was for it to be able to traverse the Chaotic Void of the Universe and reach the Nexus Galaxy, another was to be undetected by this very Galaxy itself as it found a vessel to enter and initiate the process of awakening a Trait right away by forcing the use of this Galaxy’s essence the moment Noah awakened.","Unimaginably hard conditions that would have never been possible under any circ.u.mstances were being forced to occur by the power of this unknown Ruination Core as the Origin Embryo containing half of Noah’s shot out from the ancient grove swirling with universal laws and began going towards the boundary of the Novus Galaxy!","It shot past the layers of the Central Realm at speeds faster than light as it then pierced across the Letalis Expanse, seamlessly passing through the boundary of the Novus Galaxy as it already entered the Chaotic Void.","It then...continued!","Seamlessly, easily, and without any issues- it crossed across the Chaotic Void that would normally need the essence of a Grand Controller to move around in ease, or the use of a unique treasure like the Universal Rift of the Nexus Galaxy that covered those passing through it with a unique essence which allowed them to easily traverse the chaotic void.","Noah felt this Origin Embryo shoot forth across the chaotic void as his eyes glowed with expectation, looking forward to what was to come as his tired body sat down in the ancient grove where the core of the Novus Galaxy lay.","The milky colorful rivers of universal essence that flowed around the core of this galaxy moved in tandem as he breathed out, finally coming to terms with the fact that in the coming weeks and months, he would most likely have all the time in the Novus Galaxy to do whatever he wished.","There would be no enemies he had to face, no threat pointing down towards them that would destroy everything...just a period of peace where he could explosively grow his strength as he learned more about this unknown Universe and the galaxies present within it, as he learned more about the systems of power and strength while he became ever stronger!","He had to work on his own rank as he continued forging Stars to expand his Nebula, as he had not even reached the peak of this realm before he spilled into the next one. He had many laws to comprehend to completion before he began to assimilate them, many skills and skill trees that he could create and combine...there were a great deal of things he now wanted to do! But most of all, he wanted to relax and watch what would happen to this Origin Embryo that was now traversing through the Chaotic Void as it went towards a singular location.","An unknown number of light-years away, this Origin Embryo went towards a new Galaxy as it sought to find a vessel to reside in that would allow Noah to transmigrate into a brand new being!"]},{"number":627,"title":"Chapter 627: Chapter 626 - You see, I actually wasnt that OP before I","paragraphs":["The river of time waited for no one as it moved along, the workings of fate continuing as they should as events perpetuated one after another across the unknown Universe.","In the expansive Nexus Galaxy where a certain Origin Embryo was heading towards, a certain event was occurring as it was obscured from the eyes of many.","A dashing young man was talking to a shadowy figure in front of him.","\"How many new participants rose this round?\"","\"We have gathered information on 443 unaccounted new Blessed that have signed up and are moving across Imperial Citadel, Master Andrews.\"","The shadowy figure brimming with power replied as the young man called Andrews nodded, his gaze turning cold as he sent out shocking words.","\"The Blessed Imperial Selection this year is much different compared to previous ones, where the Imperial Adjudicator is actually allowing the Imperial Princess to join. We cannot have too many rugrats filling in the count and surrounding the only daughter of the Imperial Adjudicator if something dangerous were to happen in this selection.\"","\"You mean...?\"","The shadow figure asked hesitatingly as he foresaw the extreme measure his Young Master wanted to take for the being that was normally hidden behind layers of protection and guards who would actually be participating in the yearly Blessed Imperial Selection that allowed one to become a high Imperial!","\"Yes, thin out the coming participants. We shall act as the first layer of the Trial to thin out unworthy beings. Get rid of the ones with trash Traits that are even thinking of dirtying the presence of the Imperial Adjudicator’s daughter.\"","RUMBLE!","A command was given out as the shadowy figure only paused for a second and then nodded, disappearing thereafter as he sent out word to the others and went to undertake the task they were given!","In his mind though, he was shaking his head disappointedly at the commands of the young master that also chose to participate in this Blessed Imperial Selection because of the news that the Imperial Princess would be participating.","His young master was going out of his way to harm others just because he didn’t want what he considered weak beings with trash traits to be around the Princess when the Selection Trials were underway, when the Imperial Princess herself most likely did not even know his young master or even spare a thought about him before!","But since he came from a prominent family in the Imperial Citadel, he could command guards at the Peak of the Nebula Realm or even low-tier Controllers! The shadowy figure sighed again as he weaved across the brightly lit areas of the Imperial Citadel, a paper appearing in his hands as he checked off and crossed multiple names based on their Traits.","The Imperial Citadel earned its name as it was at the very center of power of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm, this ’citadel’ alone being larger than most continents or even high ranking Realms.","In one of the parts of this city, multiple shadowy figures followed the commands of their Young Master as they tracked down the newly appearing Blessed who planned to join the Blessed Imperial Selection trials, taking out the ones with weak Traits as they would not even be able to make it to the starting point of this yearly Trial!","\"What...!\"","\"Why?!\"","Pained cries silently rang out silently in the night as some fell down as they were walking across the sparkling streets, others not opening their eyes from their meditation, and some being stopped in the middle of their meals!","This shocking event continued in the shadows of the Imperial Citadel as one of the shadowy figures looked at one last name that was crossed out on the list and matched it to the being he was tailing currently.","[Alexander- Auxiliary Trait, Alpha Rank.]","The lowest rank of a Trait, and one that wasn’t offensive or defensive at that! The shadowy figure sighed as he tailed this unsuspecting being, and the moment he passed through a near Alley, a gravitational force suddenly pulled him towards this dark alley as the shadowy figure finished his given mission for the night!","His bloody hand that pierced through this shocked Blessed’s body was pulled out as he saw the light gradually disappearing from their eyes, the figure disappearing in a conflagration of shadows as he moved.","Such was life! Such was the fate of those weak, as their lives could be altered on the whims of someone slightly stronger than them!","But the river of fate worked in mysterious ways as at this same time, an Origin Embryo that had been streaking across the Chaotic Void for days had finally reached its destination, piercing through the boundaries of the Nexus Galaxy without a hitch as it silently and grandly entered.","This Origin Embro continued streaking silently across the vast space of the Nexus Galaxy, ignoring the many Realms and worlds spread around it as it searched, before waves of golden light covered it as it came to a stop and then began shooting towards a specific direction!","It was towards a certain Brightgold Monarchy Realm that was publicly known as the largest Realm in the Nexus Galaxy, the Realm where the ruling force of Imperials that had consolidated power throughout the Nexus Galaxy resided!","This imperceptible streak of light thundered forth silently as a unique power wrapped around it, where even the Nexus Galaxy itself could not feel anything out of sorts at this moment.","It easily pierced through the barrier of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm as it continued forward, seemingly set towards a specific direction as it passed numerous continents in this expansive realm and went towards the Central one.","The Origin Embryo actually continued towards the Imperial Citadel that was bustling with activity and power, the largest area of this Brightgold Monarchy Realm as well as the area where powerful Imperials resided!","It only stopped momentarily above this continental Citadel before it zoomed towards a certain section of it, an area currently clouded in the darkness of the night as it appeared in an alleyway where a being was rapidly nearing death.","The Origin Embryo stopped above this being that had been dealt a deathly blow not too long ago by a shadow figure, a golden wave of fate erupting out silently before the Origin Embryo drilled towards the dying being!","RUMBLE!","As if his body had received an enormous shock, the figure began convulsing vigorously as the dying light of his Origin was rapidly revived while fusing with something else, this process being completed in a split second as the figure became completely still thereafter.","\"...\"","OOOOM","A golden light appeared to cover the figure at this moment as it floated a few meters towards the sky, this golden light permeating throughout the body as it healed all injuries before carefuly bringing it towards the ground again...but this time it was standing on its own two feet!","\"Ahhhh...\"","A deep breath was taken by the rejuvenated figure as his eyes opened, streaks of blue and gold-colored lights coursing within these eyes as he looked at his arms while his face was that full of wonder.","\"Hmm, Alexander?\"","The words were more of a confirmation than a question as imperceptible changes continued to occur in the body of the being that was marked for death, someone else taking over this being’s identity as silently, Noah had arrived in the Nexus Galaxy without any issues!"]},{"number":628,"title":"Chapter 628: Chapter 627 - You see, I actually wasnt that OP before II","paragraphs":["In the Central Realm of the Novus Galaxy, Noah had a wide smile as he talked with the obsidian core in front of him.","\"I’ve successfully found a vessel in the Nexus Galaxy.\"","RUMBLE!","The surrounding space shook at this proclamation as it affirmed the success of something that should have been impossible, yet it was a reality as Noah was waking up in another Galaxy as someone else!","[This Ruination Core continues to exceed all expectations as the Nexus Galaxy itself was not able to notice anything. Even now, its very essence is being used to awaken your second Trait.]","The Novus Galaxy replied with a tone that wasn’t as cold as usual, where one could even notice a tinge of happiness within it!","\"My second Trait, huh?\"","Noah felt his excitement stirring as he recalled his discussions of the second Trait with the Novus Galaxy. It was fairly cryptic thus were, with the only thing he understood being the fact that it would be a trait going towards the goal of making a Champion that was simply unbeatable. For this to be done, one might think that a Trait had to be an extremely powerful Offensive or Defensive Trait, but often enough it was actually an Auxiliary Trait that took center stage!","His Infinite Mana was not an offensive or defensive Trait, but an Auxiliary one that supported him in such a major way that he could easily beat other Blessed with it.","Of course, he did not know if the Infinite Mana Trait was considered one of the highest tiered Traits, but he believed so! When looking at the ranks of Alpha, Beta, Delta, Epsilon, and Omega...Noah would say his Trait belonged to Omega!","But he had no confirmation of this as they had not collected enough information about Traits, so he would hold off on the judgment for now as waited to see what his second Trait would be.","[Your second Trait...well, you will see it soon enough. It should be another Auxiliary Trait that will allow you to completely dominate those pointing their sword at you when it brought to completion. Even at the first stage of its awakening, it should be on par with some of the most powerful Traits existing in the Nexus Galaxy.]","The voice of the Novus Galaxy resounded out once again as Noah nodded, closing his eyes as he focused on seeing his new self-awakening in the Nexus Galaxy!","---","In the dark alley where a being should have just faced death, a figure that released fearsome blue and golden lights in his eyes looked towards his surroundings as he breathed in.","A name was rolling off his tongue over and over again as he was seemingly getting used to it, his eyes somewhat hazy as he absorbed numerous flows of information!","\"Alexander...a Blessed on his way to participate in the Blessed Imperial Selection, but met the unfortunate fate of suddenly being killed out of the blue.\"","The voice that held a tinge of pride and arrogance threw this being off as he closed his eyes briefly, sorting the abundant amount of information when at this moment, he felt the influx of a unique essence wrapping around his origin!","This essence was coming from the surroundings nearby, being the essence of the Galaxy itself as it went on to awaken a Trait in Alexander!","This was something extremely new and foreign as this being already had a Trait before, but the moment he faced his death this Trait was taken from him, only for his figure to be rejuvenated a millisecond later as he was now awakening another Trait.","Alexander closed his eyes tightly as he felt his head pounding, the essence of Galaxy swirling around his brain as it focused here for his Trait! The essence only converged faster and faster as it rose in density until finally, Alexander opened his eyes again as they shone with white light!","New knowledge flowed into his mind as he felt the appearance of a Trait, and the identity of this Trait making his eyes shake because of the sheer ridiculousness that just its name represented!","\"She wouldn’t be this crazy right?\"","Noah, or more aptly named at this moment, Alexander, shook his head in a stupor as he looked at the second Trait he had in this lifetime.","[Alexander King][Title(s):HIDDEN]","[Trait(s): HIDDEN, Protagonist]","[Bloodline(s): HIDDEN]","[Origin Core(s) : HIDDEN]","[Domain(s) : HIDDEN]","[Vitality: STAR FORGER]","[Focus: HIDDEN]","[Strength: STAR FORGER]","[Law(s) : HIDDEN]","[Authority(s) : HIDDEN]","\"...no f.u.c.k.i.n.g way.\"","A completely new stat panel that had much of its contents hidden as if one was looking at a redacted doc.u.ment appeared in front of Alexander’s eyes, causing him to release expletives as he glanced at it! Much of the information was hidden because in this new galaxy, even though the one known as Noah retained half of his Origin which granted him access to the powers and laws that he had cultivated so far, they had to be hidden from the eyes of the Nexus Galaxy itself!","At this moment, this galaxy would just begin to notice as a large consumption of essence that awakened this Trait should have been noticed by it, but when it glanced towards Noah, all it would find was a peculiarity that awakened another Trait and not be able to find anything else about him! This was because unlike the Novus Galaxy, the Nexus Galaxy did not have something like the Ruination Core, and the impossible things and abilities that the Novus Galaxy carried out were not something this galaxy could do.","But all of this was not the most shocking information that took Noah’s attention, with another thing that appeared in a pristine white color appearing that shook him to his core!","The most shocking information was the second Trait, a Trait that had the ridiculous name of [Protagonist]!","[Protagonist]!","What did this term represent? It represented a leading character or a central figure in an event or story, it represented the being that everything revolved around.","Noah was shaking his head in stupefaction because shockingly, the Novus Galaxy had chosen such a term for the second Trait, which had tremendous implications for what exactly would be contained in this Trait and what type of support it would give!","He could not wait any further as he zoomed in on the Trait of Protagonist, wanting to see exactly what shocking thing he had just gained this time around!"]},{"number":629,"title":"Chapter 629: Chapter 628 - You see, I actually wasnt that OP before III","paragraphs":["[Protagonist] :: You are the protagonist. To live up to such a title, abilities worthy of creating a true Protagonist are granted. As it is a culminated Trait, it has different stages that each have their own abilities. Currently Unlocked Ability(s) : Eyes of Truth, Photographic Memory, Memorable Visage, Blind Luck. Locked Abilities: Plot Armor, Chosen Extras, Deus Ex Machina, Chosen One, Save Point, @#%#%@$. To increase the stage of the Trait and bring it to complete fruition, you must play the central and decisive role in the Nexus Galaxy.","\"...\"","Alexander stared at the blue screen in front of his eyes with sheer and pure shock as he did not even know where to begin!","’This...this is just ridiculous...’","His thoughts were swirling around his mind as his other body that was light years away looked towards the obsidian core that represented the Novus Galaxy in shock as this information was transmitted to him.","\"This trait...\"","[If you want someone unbeatable, you have to naturally think outside the box. This Trait is the realization of a far-fetched possibility, if you could really culminate it to completion, the tools available to you will ensure that you will keep your life even while facing the most powerful enemies.]","RUMBLE!","A shocking truth was released as the madness of this Novus Galaxy continued to go to even greater heights, a Trait of stupid proportions being culminated in Noah’s new identity in the Nexus Galaxy!","What Offensive Trait? What Defensive Trait? Could those compare to a Trait that was actually called Protagonist?!","Noah shook his head as he reeled in his shock, focusing on the feedback of information that his new identity, Alexander, was receiving.","He first focused on the stage of abilities that were currently unlocked with just the newly awakened version of this Trait, beginning with the extravagant sounding Eyes of Truth.","[Eyes of Truth] :: Glance upon the many things in the vast galaxies as their secrets are laid bare to your eyes.","[Photographic Memory] :: Forgetting things? What’s that?","[Memorable Visage] :: As the protagonist, you begin to take the central role wherever you go, your visage being remembered by all who lay eyes upon you as you automatically give out a favorable impression, as well as garner prominent attention from your enemies.","[Blind Luck] :: Fortunate things just seem to happen to you out of nowhere. You could just be walking across the street and find a million dollars by the roadside.","\"...\"","Descriptions that seemed to be overly simple and taunting were laid out in front of him as he did not even know where to begin!","Blind Luck, Memorable Visage, and Photographic Memory were ridiculous, but they were understandable.","It was [Eyes of Truth] that Noah was looking most closely at as he tried to understand it!","He wasted no time as his thoughts went towards this skill, using Eyes of Truth on himself.","DING~","A soft sound rang out through his mind as numerous words appeared on a text box in front of him. It wasn’t the usual blue panel boxes that he could see because of his Realm System, but a red textbook that shone with gold words as if it wanted to be known it was distinct from anything else!","[Alexander King] :: A Blessed born in the Brightgold Monarchy Realm located in the Nexus Galaxy. [Life History][Strengths][Weakness][Ability(s)][Trait(s)][Habits]...","His eyes opened wide as he read on more and more, shockingly finding out that almost every piece of information about him was listed on this red and gold box panel that popped up after using [Eyes of Truth] once!","His life history, his strengths and weaknesses, his abilities, even his habits! Everything was laid bare in front of his eyes as they shook, his question going towards the usability of this terrifying Eyes of Truth as he wondered-","’This is what will pop up if I use it on anyone?!’","His eyes rose in alarm as he thought about this fearsome ability from the Protagonist Trait, as this single ability alone had such shocking implications that he could not even begin to list them all out!","If it really showed him the contents of the red and gold panel when he used it on anyone, then all the secrets about that person- their entire life- would all be accessible for him to read and do what he wished with such dense information!","This was...too shocking!","He thought he was strong before.","He thought he was maybe somewhat overpowered to be able to do the things that he had been doing.","But now with such a second Trait called Protagonist and the ridiculous abilities that came with it...","THUMP!","He felt the beat of his heart as he finally turned his face upwards and looked around him in the new world, nay the new Realm he was in.","His expression was that of amazement and absurdity as he stared at the skill while beginning to look around him. He was located in a dark alleyway between two enormous buildings, but if one stepped out from this alleyway they would step into a bustling world full of activity!","The more shocking thing was that as Noah looked around him, the Eye of Truth unconsciously activated as his eyes shone with an enticing red light, the information of everything around him going towards his mind.","[Rickter Auction House] : An establishment in the Imperial Citadel of the Brightgold Monarchy...","[Red Lantern Tavern] : An establishment in the Imperial Citadel of the Brightgold Monarchy...","Information of everything around him was clearly displayed in front of his eyes as he stumbled out of the darkness and towards the light. He went towards the brightly lit street in the cover of night as everything shone with resplendent light, his eyes beginning to look over the beings nonchalantly moving through the streets!","[Donny Sharpton] :: A citizen of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm located in the Nexus Galaxy. [Life History][Strengths][Weakness][Ability(s)][Trait(s)][Habits]...","[Rachel Zang] : A hidden operative of the Imperials tasked with covertly maintaining the order of the Imperial Citadel. [Life History][Strengths][Weakness][Ability(s)][Trait(s)][Habits]...","[Simon]...[Jake]...","Numerous names and everything about them rose in front of Noah’s eyes as he shook his head in wonder, officially beginning to look at the new galaxy he found himself in as he also explored a shocking new trait. It displayed the Traits of everyone he looked at, their strengths and weaknesses...everything!","It was genuinely a balance-shattering trait of ridiculous proportions, where even the abilities unlocked at the first stage were this powerful. There were still unlocked abilities that had just as shocking names, and all of this was waiting for Noah to start moving towards as he made his first steps in the Nexus Galaxy!"]},{"number":630,"title":"Chapter 630: Chapter 629 - The Imperial Citadel of Brightgold Monarchy","paragraphs":["Noah condensed the knowledge he had amassed so far about himself and his surroundings as he walked happily through the streets of the Imperial Citadel.","The streets he was walking on dripped with the aura of extravagance and richness as the very road he was stepping on...was made of gold!","Spectacular lights permeated through the streets he was in as they made the cover of the night seem like day, the unique style of buildings being something you would call modern because of their aesthetics, but they also looked medieval because of their ancient and old air!","One thing they all had in common was that almost every single building shone with colors that weren’t too distinct in the night, but Noah could make out they were white and gold.","It was a genuine Citadel filled with unique architecture that shone with white and gold, the people around walking through it varying in power as he had truly seen too many. The shocking thing was that the lowest ranking beings he came across were actually at the EPIC rank.","Not a single being ranked B, A, or S in his own terms walked the streets, where even the weakest beings were EPIC rank!","Those at the Saint Rank were abundant, those standing at the Void Realm being many, and he even came across multiple World Rank experts that were nonchalantly walking and talking or going into certain buildings.","Star Forgers were among the rarity, with him not coming across a Nebula Realm being just from the few minutes of walking.","All of these beings he came across had differing powers, with some carrying hints of Law Masters, others having the unique aura of a Blessed, and some having neither. But Noah could not stop looking around in amazement as all these beings that were passing around him and going on about their night...he could see everything about them with the Eyes of Truth!","Their abilities, weaknesses, life history...everything was shockingly privy to him because of his Trait.","He had focused the Trait on himself once more as he had pulled up the red and gold panel that had his information, going over the last few events listed in the Life History of Alexander King as he came to know exactly what had occurred right before he transmigrated.","[Alexander King] (Life History) :: ... 03/18/XXXX- Was walking across the streets of the Imperial Citadel as he prepared for the yearly Blessed Imperial Selection when a gravitational force pulled him into a dark alleyway and he was dealt a heavy injury by a peak Nebula Rank Shadow Imperial under the command of the Young Master of the Light Dawn Household.","Shockingly, Alexander had been targeted and killed by a Nebula Rank expert, and a peak one at that!","Noah had yet to affirm how many stars one would have to forge in their Nebula to be considered the peak of the Nebula Rank, yet a guard of just one of the powerful households in the Imperial Citadel had taken this rank!","Of course, as they were identified only with their rank, it meant they did not have the title of a Controller or Blessed as those heights were still rare to achieve for nobodies. But the reality remained as Noah found himself in a grand new Realm of a shockingly powerful Galaxy that had lived for many years.","Beings here did not just have a thousand or two thousand years to rise up through ranks, they could have had thousands and tens of thousands of years depending on their talent to grow stronger before their lives ran out. This made way for a Realm such as this Brightgold Monarchy Realm in this Nexus Galaxy to have many beings that Noah would consider experts moving around!","Alexander himself was only at the Star Forging Realm as he registered his name on the list of hundreds to be participating in the yearly Blessed Imperial Selection that allowed citizens of the Brightgold Monarchy to distinguish themselves and have the chance to join the ranks of High Imperials- beings that directly worked for the Imperials to explore the expansive universe!","Yet before he could even put his foot in the door, his life was taken.","But from it, Noah came to be as he found his Vessel and awakened another Trait of his own in this body. And at this moment, whether it was by the workings of fate or not...the goal of this Alexander was very much in line with Noah’s!","He had to explore this Brightgold Monarchy Realm as he understood the Imperials that controlled not just this, but the entire Nexus Galaxy as he fulfilled the requirements of culminating his second Trait.","The requirements listed for him to become a central figure in the Nexus Galaxy, for him to truly live up to the name of the Trait before he could ascend through its stages or complete it.","This Trial that was known as the Blessed Imperial Selection which the owner of this old body was killed for...Noah would participate in it as he made his grand entrance into the Nexus Galaxy while understanding the forces working within!","He walked through the Imperial Citadel of this Brightgold Monarchy as he used the [Eye of Truth] on anything that walked, being able to absorb so much information that even the very natives of this Citadel would soon be behind him in terms of knowledge of it.","When he added another ability of the Protagonist Trait, the [Photographic Memory]...everything just clicked into place too damn perfectly.","He saw that even though it was deep into the night and would soon even change into dawn in this Imperial Citadel, the movements of beings within it were just as vibrant. A wide smile overtook his face as he breathed all of this in while his feet took him towards the location where Alexander inadvertently had not been able to arrive at before.","---","As Alexander took his first steps in the Nexus Galaxy, Noah was in the Novus Galaxy with a wild and dominating look in his eyes as he stared at the panel in front of him.","[Noah Osmont][Title(s): Infernal Lord(Variant), Grand Controller(Fate), Controller(Fire, Water)]","[Trait(s) : Infinite Mana, Protagonist(Incomplete)]","[Bloodline(s): Vampyre Progenitor]","[Aether Particles(s) : 6,725,982]","[Karma Line(s) : 1,924,356]","[Fate Line(s) : 10,000,000]","[Chaos Particle(s) : 6,252,654]","[Origin Core(s) : Light-2, Dark-2, Fire-10, Water-10, Earth-5, Air-5]","[Domain(s) : Aether, Karma, Fate,Chaos, Light, Dark, Space, Time, Fire, Water, Earth, Air]","[Vitality: NEBULA]","[Focus: ∞ ]","[Strength: NEBULA]","[Law(s) : Aether- 67%, Karma-19%,Fate-100%,Chaos-62%, Light-25%, Dark-25%, Space-44%, Time-36%, Fire-100%, Water-100%, Earth-44%, Air-44%]","[Authority(s) : Aether Lord, Fate Lord, Chaos Lord, Flame Lord, Water Lord]","In the panel that showed his Traits that were not hidden or redacted like Alexander’s, spectacular things showed as most of all, he observed the singular addition of the Protagonist Trait!","His eyes shone as the same sparkling red light that appeared when Alexander used this new Trait was recreated in Noah in this galaxy that was light years away!"]},{"number":631,"title":"Chapter 631: Chapter 630 - Shocking Revelations!","paragraphs":["Traits were things that were ingrained in the very Origins of beings, with a being only being able to carry a single Trait throughout their lifetimes as a Galaxy had to bless them with it, and one could only ever be a native of one galaxy.","Yet, Noah had violated this rule through the use of a terrifying item he did not yet understand, and he had now succeeded in transmigrating half of his Origin onto the body of a being in another galaxy as he awakened a new Trait there as well!","This meant that within his Origin, two Traits were inscribed! In the body of Alexander, he could utilize Infinite Mana, and in the body of Noah, he could utilize the Protagonist Trait! Both of his bodies had access to both of these Traits as they all shared the same shocking origin.","This brought us to the current moment where Noah’s eyes were shining brightly as he looked at the details of the Protagonist Trait, especially the ridiculous [Eyes of Truth] that simply did too much as he sent his thoughts towards the Novus Galaxy.","\"This Trait is as ridiculous if not more compared to the first, but its uses are simply...\"","He shook his head as he spoke, letting out shocking words as he wanted to use this Trait in this Galaxy at this moment!","\"Let me see the [Ruination Core] once again. With the abilities of Protagonist, I should be able to glean exactly what it is.\"","RUMBLE!","[Such was the possibility I anticipated. We know too little of this unexplored Universe, a Trait such as this will allow us to gain information at extreme speeds that nobody can even imagine.]","The voice of the Novus Galaxy rang out blandly as the obsidian core of this galaxy opened up once again, the red and black square cube that shone with a terrifying aura being released again as Noah controlled his body to not tremble and opened his eyes towards it, using [Eyes of Truth] on this terrifying object!","OOOM!","Sparks of red and gold light erupted out as it felt like an inviolable truth was violated, Noah feeling a searing pain in his eyes as one turned bloody and ruptured, but a red and gold panel still appeared in front of him as it showed a set of shocking words.","<strong>[Ruination Core] :: A tool of extreme power that more often than not invites destruction to its user. Capable of interfering with the Universal Laws themselves, it is a tool of Ruination that has multiple counterparts spread out across the Dark Universe. A special constitution is required to wield tools of Ruination. When all the tools of Ruination are gathered, the Dark Universe will #$%[email protected]$^$%^##$%#^#%...</strong>","THUMP!","A shocking set of information could be read in front of him as his ruptured eye healed, blood leaking from him as even with the use of the newly gained Trait, he was still only able to glean a fraction of information from this terrifying item!","One of the biggest gains he got from it was that this Universe he had simply been calling the unexplored universe was actually known as...the Dark Universe!","Another was that this single Ruination Core...was actually not alone.","The information indicated that it had counterparts, making it seem like other Ruination Cores existed out there in the vast Dark Universe.","[This...]","Noah had relayed the information to the Novus Galaxy as this new reality came before them, an air of seriousness permeating throughout as a single sentence had placed them in this state. It was the sentence that mentioned tools of Ruination such as the Ruination Core more often than not led their users towards destruction!","The Novus Galaxy had been actively using it, and it had even made possible many things that they never could have even imagined before. It even brought the new Trait that made it possible for Noah to know the identity of this item, and yet the truth told by the [Eyes of Truth] remained the same.","[We have stumbled across something much too grand and powerful at this time. You need to continue growing ever stronger and faster as we try to understand these mysteries even more while gathering information with your new Trait. When it advances to another stage or once it comes to completion, we should be able to discern all there is to know about these...Ruination Tools.]","THUMP!","Noah closed his eyes as he could still feel his beating heart, nodding as his mindset calmed down and he explored this Protagonist Trait even more! There are still the unlocked abilities of [Blind Luck] and [Memorable Visage] he had to explore, but his counterpart would be collecting more than enough information for this as he took his steps in the Imperial Citadel!","---","Deep in the Brightgold Monarchy Realm where the bastion of Imperials resided, Alexander had walked through the streets of this Citadel as he gathered more information of its people and culture, as well as observe the ridiculous levels of strength from these beings that had lived in a galaxy for hundreds of thousands of years.","At this moment, dawn had broken as the rays of golden light glistened down from the star that was hanging far above the skies of this mystical Realm, and Noah had come towards a huge fortress that had powerful auras in the hundreds moving around!","The fortress glimmered with gold and white, its structures rising arrogantly to the skies as Noah could not wait to replicate them in his own Infinite Realm.","But at this moment, he had arrived in front of this fortress for the same reason that many other Blessed were also going towards it at this time- for the yearly Blessed Imperial Selection!","It was a selection that held multiple Trials to decide which renowned and powerful Blessed would be joining the ranks of High Imperials, the ranks of beings that were the true heroes of the Nexus Galaxy. It was these beings who gained the chance to freely use the Universal Rift as they explored the Dark Universe, while also holding the title of High Imperials who had access to a variety of resources and techniques to forge powerful Blessed and Law Masters.","Such was the fortress that Noah arrived at, the location which was receiving all the incoming Blessed participating in this yearly Trial, the Imperial Thunderdome!"]},{"number":632,"title":"Chapter 632: Chapter 631 - EPSILON!","paragraphs":["Noah went towards the entrance of the Imperial Thunderdome where a robust woman that had a figure more built than many men stood with a clipboard and pen.","She was noting the names of the Blessed coming in as she crossed their names out on the sheet placed on the clipboard as they entered into the Imperial Thunderdome thereafter, her gaze filled with power and seriousness as not a single being acted out of order!","Noah went towards this woman as she raised her eyes towards him, looking over him up and down as she asked passively.","\"Name?\"","\"Alexander King.\"","She located his name far down in the sheet as she crossed it out, her eyes landing on the Trait listed next to this being as she developed a quizzical expression!","\"You have an Auxiliary Trait such as this and you are taking the Imperial Selection?\"","Her words were actually not insulting and more of caution as it was rare for someone with such a Trait to join this Trial, her eyes focusing on the Trait listed next to Alexander’s name that read- [Analyzer]!","\"I will tell you now that the Trial is extremely tough, and this year even more so as it will not just be ending in our Imperial Citadel.\"","She cautioned the being in front of her as she only saw Alexander smiling, a smile of calm and confidence as he replied,","\"Thank you for the warning, but I am confident in my abilities.\"","With these words, the robust woman nodded with a passive face as she let him through, allowing Noah to enter the doors of the Imperial Thunderdome! He walked in to observe the expansive space of this building that looked like an extremely huge auditorium while his eyes glanced at the stat panel that listed all the information of the robust woman outside.","He had been keeping [Eyes of Truth] active on all beings he came across as he gathered a ridiculous amount of information, this time learning that the woman checking off names in front of this Imperial Thunderdome was a Controller in the Law of Earth. He read over her life history and abilities as he continued gathering information while going further into the Imperial Thunderdome where hundreds of beings were gathered around.","Some of them were in groups, others being alone with passive looks as they all waited for the ceremony that would start this Blessed Imperial Selection to begin.","\"That’s...\"","\"No way...\"","Gasps and surprises could be heard throughout a few minutes after Noah’s entrance as at this moment, the figure of a veiled woman appeared while surrounded by two shockingly gorgeous women beside her.","These two women seemed to be acting more as Guardsmaids as they moved forward with dangerous smiling expressions, parting the crowds of people that moved away from them naturally as they came to stand not too far away from Noah and also waited.","\"That is...the daughter of the Imperial Adjudicator?!\"","\"You...don’t speak so loudly!\"","RUMBLE!","Whispers and hushes rang throughout as those that did not know finally knew the secret that in this yearly Selection, the Imperial Adjudicator had actually allowed his daughter to join the trials in the Blessed Imperial Selection to officially gain the title of High Imperial!","This was actually a puzzle in the eyes of many, as the Imperial Adjudicator was what could be considered the highest position among the Imperials, and this applied to the Imperial Princess as well. She had a special position where nobody in the entire Nexus Galaxy would dare to even offend her, and even those at the rank of High Imperials would not so much as have the courage to talk to her.","So when they saw she was participating in the Blessed Imperial Selection, they only saw it as an esteemed young person being bored and wanting to explore, thus coming here with her Guardsmaids just to enjoy the Trials!","If she so wanted, she could have simply asked her father, the Imperial Adjudicator, to release a decree that granted her the official title of a High Imperial. But she chose the round about way as she appeared in this year’s Blessed Imperial Selection. The veil on this person’s head glimmered with a mysterious essence where even if a being sent their aura forward to check, they would still not be able to observe what the face lying behind it actually looked like.","Noah’s eyes were passive as he also turned his eyes towards these new shining entrants, his curiosity peaked as they were actually connected to the high powers of this galaxy.","His eyes had been passive from just looking at them, but when he used the [Eyes of Truth] on the figures of ridiculously gorgeous Guardsmaids and the veiled Imperial Princess, his eyes nearly popped out of their eye sockets from what he found!","He was shocked from looking at the Guardsmaids as he found out that from the ranks of Alpha, Beta, Delta, Epsilon, and Omega-the two of them actually had Delta Ranked Traits!","In the entire past day he had spent walking around this Imperial Citadel of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm of the Nexus Galaxy, he had yet to come across beings with Delta Ranked Traits, and two of them were here acting as Guardsmaids for this being called the Imperial Princess.","Yet what was even more shocking was the rank of the Trait that the Imperial Princess herself held. It was a whole f.u.c.k.i.n.g EPSILON Rank Trait, and a truly shocking one at that!","<strong>[Anna Lexalius Dannicus] : A unique being residing in the Brightgold Monarchy of the Nexus Galaxy. [Life History][Strengths][Weakness][Ability(s)][Trait(s)][Habits]...</strong>","The history and all the information there was about this being displayed itself in front of Noah’s eyes as they shook, coming in contact with one of the beings who would be a major player in the Nexus Galaxy for the coming future.","Veiled where nobody could see her face and surrounded by two Delta Ranked Blessed, the Imperial Princess Anna Lexalius Dannicus had appeared!"]},{"number":633,"title":"Chapter 633: Chapter 632 - SuChapter a trash Trait!","paragraphs":["\"Alright alright settle down!\"","OOOM!","A voice traveled out to cover the entirety of the Imperial Thunderdome as a man with a shocking aura appeared in the skies. One could see glistening white wings spreading out from his back as his chiseled jaw and devilishly handsome face attracted the attention of many.","This being looked around the Imperial Thunderdome as he gave a slight nod over to the direction of the Imperial Princess before continuing to speak out.","\"There are a few hundred of you here for the Blessed Imperial Selection this year, a number slightly higher than the previous years but it shows your drive and strength since the Trials this year are even harder!\"","RUMBLE!","\"I am the Trial Master presiding over the selection this year, you can call me Master Zeke!\"","The man grandly announced his identity as Noah moved his shocked eyes over from the Imperial Princess to him. The [Eyes of Truth] told him everything about this man as he also had a shocking identity, being someone that was a Delta Ranked Blessed and also someone that held the rank of Black Hole!","<strong>[Zeke Aureus] :: A birdman of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm of the Nexus Galaxy. [Life History][Strengths][Weakness][Ability(s)][Trait(s)][Habits]...</strong>","The information of the humanoid man with expansive white wings was made clear as Noah came across the level above Nebula for the first time. Above the rank of Nebula and after one had built a sufficient amount of stars, they would form a Black Hole that devoured their entire Nebula as they held a shocking level of power and defenses!","Do you know what a Black Hole is?","It is a region of spacetime where gravity was so strong that no particles of light could escape from it!","This Realm of power termed as Black Hole was one where if such an expert wanted you dead, you would just have to lie waiting to die, as you could never escape from their grasp! It was rumored that those in the realm of Black Hole could easily become controllers of the Laws of Space and Time, being able to manipulate gravity so freely as they lived up to the name of their Rank.","Such a being was presiding as the Trial Master for this year’s Blessed Imperial Selection, and many wondered if it was because the Imperial Princess was participating this time around.","Master Zeke waved his hands as on the opposite side of the Imperial Thunderdome, a barrier of white light seemed to peel off as it revealed a pulsating dark rift that shone with malice.","\"The First Trial this time around will take place in this Carnage Realm. You all must know about such realms, right? Your task will be to simply survive in this Realm for a day as we assess the usefulness of your Traits. Only those coming out of the Carnage Realm alive will proceed to the next stage.\"","Many had surprised expressions and even a tinge of fear as the First Trial of this year’s selection was revealed, the use of a Carnage Realm being one of the requirements shocking many of them. The trial beginning like this showed them it was bound to be extremely tough!","\"The abilities of a Blessed vary, and you can use any means necessary to survive, even working with others. You should also pay attention to this...\"","Master Zeke said this with a glint in his eyes as he waved his hands and caused the appearance of numerous talismans to land in front of the Blessed participants.","\"These are Spatial Talisman that will directly send you out of the Carnage Realm the moment you crush them, and it will also mean automatic failure of the Trial. After 24 hours, they will naturally send you back here. Now, be ready!\"","RUMBLE!","Rapid movements began to occur as the Blessed around Noah began shuffling around, the Spatial Talismans being taken by all as those already in groups were feeling much safer after the words of Master Zeke as others that were alone began looking for other people to group up with.","A group of three Blessed came towards Noah as they saw him standing in the middle of the sea of people with a calm and confident expression.","\"Hey, you wanna join in with us for this Trial? The name is Mark. We have two Offensive Blessed and a Defensive Blessed on our team. What about you? You can join us and complete our team if you are a Defensive Blessed as well.\"","One of them at the forefront reached out his hand in a welcoming gesture as Noah returned in and spoke with a smiling expression.","\"Alexander, an Auxiliary Blessed with the Analyzer Trait.\"","\"...\"","The hand that was reaching out to him stopped in midair as the man pulled back, the other two beside him seemingly losing their patience as they began to pull the one known as Mark from the forefront away.","\"Bah, you always have bad luck with people...nearly grouping us with someone that has such a trash Trait...\"","Shockingly hurtful words were released as the three moved away from Noah like a plague, others hearing these words as they glanced towards him with ridicule and pity while focusing on finding other partners if they didn’t have any!","Noah laughed inside as he revealed the old Trait that this body used to have, his eyes reading the information freely available to him from the Eyes of Truth as he stared at the dark Rift that led to this Carnage Realm where the Trial would take place.","<strong>[Rift of the Aether Carnage Realm] :: A rift that leads to a destroyed Realm where Aether freely permeates. The Safe Zones are located...The Danger Zones are located...</strong>","Information that told everything he needed to know about this dangerous Realm that made many Blessed fearful was displayed in his eyes as he made himself familiar with everything while waiting, his mind still on the shocking details of the Imperial Princess standing calmly with her Guardsmaids by the side as he occasionally switched over to her panel to read her details over again.","As he remained alone while Blessed constantly moved and shuffled around, he continued to use the [Eyes of Truth] on all the Blessed around him as he garnered more information on Traits and understood many of the beings in here at deeper levels than even their closest friends.","While spreading his attention around, his eyes landed on a particular being that was surrounded by 2 other Blessed, a frosty look on his face as he had an arrogant and pompous expression of someone important!","Noah saw the eyes of this being trying their best to not look towards the direction of the shocking Imperial Princess as the information on him was revealed in his eyes, making his brows raise up as he found interesting information.","’Ho, so you were the perpetrator of the murder of poor Alexander before I came?’","Noah was looking at the [Life History] of the Young Master that had given out the command for multiple Blessed that planned to join this Selection to be killed, citing a stupid excuse of taking out the weak that pointlessly caused multiple Blessed to silently lose their lives in the past day.","<strong>[Andrews Manuli Dawn] The Young Master of the Light Dawn Household of the Imperial Citadel.[Life History][Strengths][Weakness][Ability(s)][Trait(s)][Habits]...</strong>","From the Life History of this being, he learned of many despicable things he had done throughout his time as the events that occurred yesterday became clear in Noah’s eyes, a cold light coursing through them as he had already made a judgment about this being!","’Alright. You aimed to kill me, so I will naturally avenge the body of this being that I have taken over.’","His eyes shone with light as he marked a being for death on his first day of arrival in the Nexus Galaxy!","\"Alright, enter and good luck to you all!\"","At this time, Master Zeke spoke out with a loud voice as his white wings flapped majestically behind him, the hundreds of Blessed beginning to enter the Rift that led to the Carnage Realm as Noah also made his way over!"]},{"number":634,"title":"Chapter 634: Chapter 633 - A Fateful Meeting in the Aether Carnage Realm","paragraphs":["The Aether Carnage Realm was a unique Realm that had faced destruction in the past but had not been destroyed fully. It then thrived on the elements of destruction as it took on the qualities to become a Carnage Realm!","This particular Carnage Realm had the elements of Aether permeated throughout from its destruction, and was thus filled with extremely dangerous and baleful Aether swimming around freely all across it.","One could come across areas of floating earth and stones all across this Realm, but much of its space was occupied with clouds and tendrils of Aether that would shred apart an unsuspecting being if they were caught in it. Even more terrifying, Aether Storms occurred frequently in random areas, and were the major causes of death for anyone exploring an Aether Carnage Realm as they would be surrounded and ground down by Aether in a matter of seconds!","Yet, Carnage Realms were also preferred by powerful Law Masters as they had an abundant essence of whatever element they were named after, a being that was trying to comprehend the Law of Aether being very comfortable in a place like the Aether Carnage Realm.","Still, it was a Realm that was extremely hard to navigate in, and it was why it was used as the first Trial for this year’s Blessed Imperial Selection!","That was the reality for most people, but a single being was freely walking across the Aether Carnage Realm as if it was his home!","Noah had shining eyes as he looked at the areas around him, the tendrils of Aether occasionally striking down like lightning making any nearby Trial Participants scurry as they tried to find a safe location that was not permeating with too much Aether while preventing themselves from ever having the bad luck of coming across an Aether Storm.","Yet for Noah that had [Eyes of Truth] that told him everything about this Realm...he held no worries as it even felt like home!","He knew the extremely dangerous zones as well as the safe zones, and even what signs he should watch for in case an Aether Storm was about to form in a certain area. He was more familiar with this Aether Carnage Realm than even beings that had explored it once or twice over, and this only made possible because of his Trait.","He was continuing to compound the abundant knowledge he was coming across while thinking of the beings he came across that he could consider important, the shocking Imperial Princess holding an Epsilon Ranked Trait being one of them, and the killer of the body he was currently moving in being the other!","As he saw fewer and fewer people around him, he disappeared into a cloudy area of Aether as the dangerous tendrils only washed over his body briefly before they became calm, his proficiency that was over 50% in the Law of Aether still existing in his Origin as this much would not harm him.","He moved across the dangerous tendrils of Aether of this Carnage Realm as he chose to continue collecting and assimilating the vast amounts of information before making any major moves. Even in the case of the Young Master that killed Alexander, he wanted to collect more information on the Household he was a part of and how they were connected to the Imperials.","He had to move carefully and not just focus on the small fries in front of him, because there were many experts on this Nexus Galaxy!","Just from his first day here, he had met numerous Star Forgers just like the realm of his current body and multiple beings at the Nebula Realm, not to mention the terrifying expert at the rank of Black Hole.","He chose the route of care as he closed his eyes while surrounded by tendrils of Aether, even using this time to absorb and cultivate them as he waited for the 24 hours to pass before he successfully cleared this Trial.","Using this time, he was gradually building up the Origin Cores of Water, Fire, Air, Earth, Light, and Dark as well as the Lines and Particles of other laws that were returning towards him at crazy speeds.","His Origin was already proficient in all of these laws, and he just had to use the essence around him to recreate them in this body as he expected it to only take him a matter of days before he was fully back to the same power that his body in the Novus Galaxy held!","---","At the same time, three figures were moving across the Aether Carnage Realm peacefully as it seemed they were on a stroll, the central figure being veiled in a regal while cloth while the two Guardsmaids beside her were looking around carefully while clutching their weapons!","\"Will you two relax? I finally got permission to leave that stuffy castle filled with old monsters to enjoy myself, but you two aren’t making it easy.\"","The veiled figure, the Imperial Princess, said with a sonorous voice that would drain the energy from the legs of weak men as the two women beside her shook their heads simultaneously.","\"We’re sorry Imperial Princess, but aside from the Carnage Realm being dangerous, we don’t know what intentions these weak Blessed participating in this Trial might have towards you and we have to be on guard.\"","Protective words filled with conviction rang out from the two Guardsmaids, one of them sporting a head full of dark hair tied up in a ponytail, another having a similar style with the color of green.","\"Mmm, that’s your worry? It seems like anyone we come across simply bows with trembling bodies or they scurry away in fear. And do you all think any of them can actually harm me?\"","The Imperial Princess remained with a sonorous playful tone as she talked to the uptight maids, reminding them how anybody they came across actually shook in their boots as they knew the identity of the Imperial Princess, and nobody could brave to even be within a few meters of this only daughter of the Imperial Adjudicator as they traversed far away from them!","The last sentence to come out of the mouth of the Imperial Princess might have also seemed arrogant and domineering, but when the maids heard it- it was like they had received a reminder as their hands lifted from their weapons and became slightly less worried. This was because they knew her words that none of them could actually harm her were a fact, and it was because even the two of them at the peak of Nebula Realm and holding fearsome Delta Ranked Traits could never even get near the Imperial Princess in strength!","\"Come on, I don’t know when that old man is going to get paranoid again and force me back into that castle. Let’s enjoy this freedom while we still can.\"","The two Guardsmaids looked at each other as they shook their heads wyrily, understanding the heart of this fearsome Imperial Princess that had never come out like this before in her life. They continued floating across the deadly Aether Carnage Realm as the two of them moved to protect the Imperial Princess anytime tendrils of Aether rushed towards them, the hours passing by within this Realm.","They had come across multiple parties and beings during this time, each of them simply nodding towards them with respect as they scurried off quickly thereafter. This action drew a light of disappointment from the veiled Imperial Princess as she continued moving forward.","Things had continued to play out this way until half an hour later as they passed through a region of particularly wild clouds of Aether, they came across a figure that was peacefully floating in the skies while surrounded by tendrils of Aether!","The baleful Aether seemed to actually be attracted towards him as he seemed to be cultivating, and the presence of the three women alerted him as he opened his eyes and stared towards them.","The three of them were still floating on the same path they had been going on as they expected another panicked reaction and a bow, but their figures simultaneously came to a halt when they actually observed this being to not even have a change of expression, simply closing their eyes once more as they returned to their cultivation!","\"...\"","The two Guardsmaids had annoyed looks as they felt that this being had not shown the proper respect to the Imperial Princess, while the veiled Princess herself had an interested light flashing across her eyes as she came across a being that didn’t scurry away from her the moment they realized who she was, and this one did not even seem to care!"]},{"number":635,"title":"Chapter 635: Chapter 634 - A Ridiculous Show of Power","paragraphs":["The party of three Blessed that contained an Imperial Princess and her Guardsmaids came to a stop as they stared at a single being that was cultivating peacefully while surrounded by tendrils of Aether.","The maids had looked of annoyance as they already moved their essence to begin moving away, choosing not to even bother with such a being as they could already sense fluctuations at the Star Forging Realm. Such a being did not even enter their eyes, and they chose to spare his worthless life for the disrespect he showed the Imperial Princess today!","But as they began moving on the path they were on, they had to come to a halt again as they realized the Imperial Princess herself had remained where she was, and had even begun floating towards this figure that had briefly opened his eyes and then ignored them!","\"Ah, Princess...\"","One of the Guardsmaids complained as they both followed, the veiled Imperial Princess floating towards this being that had drawn slight interest from her as she came to be a few meters from him.","The being opened his eyes once more as the three women noticed the ridiculous level of calm within them, with the words coming out of this being’s mouth shocking them thereafter!","\"Can I help you?\"","RUMBLE!","The annoyance in the maid’s eyes changed to anger as their aura terrifyingly erupted out, one of them speaking out as her oppressive aura crashed towards Noah.","\"Is that how you speak to Nobility? To someone as Esteemed as the Imperial Princess? I will give you one chance to redeem yourself!\"","Even though her aura was wildly flying out, she still gave the being in front of them a way out for the actions that these maids thought to be disrespectful!","\"Raya.\"","OOOM!","The name of the maid was uttered once from the veiled Imperial Princess, her voice having a tinge of coldness as the peak Nebula Rank being shuddered and dropped to her knees in the skies filled with Aether.","The other maid did the same as they heard the cold tone, their voices ringing out simultaneously!","\"Please forgive us!\"","\"...\"","The Guardsmaids heard a tone that rarely came out of the mouth of the Imperial Princess as they knew that they had erred, immediately dropping to their knees as the veiled being looked towards Noah and spoke.","\"I apologize for my maids, we don’t normally come across beings with such...a carefree demeanor such as you and they did not know how to act.\"","The Imperial Princess spoke her first words towards Noah as his eyes landed on this being, his thoughts unknown as he replied with a smile.","\"It’s fine.\"","His reply was simple as it drew the interest of the Imperial Princess even more, where she realized even after this being knew her identity, they remained unimpressed! Were they simply fake and putting on airs, or was there something interesting with this being?","She glanced towards him as she found a young man that did not look any older than 25, dark hair freely flowing on his head as he had a fairly average face that seemed to have a hint of unbound confidence!","\"You’re a Blessed that also cultivates a Supreme Law? It’s rare to come across such a talent.\"","She spoke as she tried to probe this person as he was the first one to rouse any interest among the beings she met the day of her freedom.","\"Yes, and I would love to continue talking about this any other time, but I have to advise the Imperial Princess and her Guards to move from here at this time, as a terribly powerful Aether Storm is about to form in this region.\"","The words out of Noah’s mouth drew more annoyance from the kneeling Guardsmaids that had still not lifted their heads up, seeing his natural tone of talking the Esteemed Princess like any normal person distasteful as they also laughed away at his words.","Who was he trying to fool? One of the main dangers of this Carnage Realm were the powerful Aether Storms that unlucky beings could come across, and they were dangerous because one could never foresee them before they formed!","Yet this Star Forging Blessed was claiming that one would be forming in this region even before any signs for it were picked up by even them?","\"Oh?\"","The Imperial Princess raised a brow in her veiled face, looking around the tendrils of Aether around them that did not seem too destructive at this moment as even she was doubtful!","\"Yes, you all still have a few seconds before it hits.\"","Noah continued with a calm expression and passive words as the Imperial Princess turned towards him.","\"Then shouldn’t you be moving away from here? I’m sure it will be deadly to someone at the Star Forging Realm, even if you cultivate the Law of Aether.\"","He looked towards her with a mysterious light as he replied,","\"I naturally have my ways, Princess.\"","RUMBLE!","The moment his words finished, a shocking storm of Aether began to rage out of nowhere, the Guardsmaids looking around them in shock as their bodies lit up with essence to protect themselves, the initial blast of the Aether storm knocking them away from the Imperial Princess!","They looked towards the distasteful being with shock as they saw him to somehow still be in the same position as before, the Imperial Princess also still standing a few meters away from him as they actually seemed to be at the center of the Aether Storm!","’He was actually correct? This...’","The Guardsmaids and the Princess were filled with shock as they looked towards Noah, who seemed to be oscillating with the baleful waves of Aether being produced by the rapidly strengthening Aether Storm as he remained in the same place.","\"Princess!\"","The two guards used their boundless strength to push back towards the Imperial Princess at this juncture, but the force of the Aether Storm was just growing stronger as it pushed them further back, none of its destructive energies being able to pierce through their essence but it could still prevent them from moving forward!","\"You two know I’ll be fine, I’ll meet up again with you soon.\"","They heard the nonchalant voice of the Imperial Princess as the Aether Storm became even stronger, being something that would even threaten a Nebula Rank being if they were not careful!","For comparison, it was like receiving Noah’s or the Terror of Aether’s [Madness Hegemony] that released powerful strikes of Aether constantly in the form of a forceful storm.","But in the middle of this raging Aether storm, Noah was still sitting peacefully without any worries, as he also held the skill of Terror of Aether, something like this not being able to harm him in the slightest!","But the more shocking thing was the Imperial Princess in front of him that was looking at him with greater interest at this time, the veil and even the white regal cloth draping over her not even shaking in the slightest in the middle of this raging Aether Storm.","Even Noah’s own body had to undulate up and down as he wavered through the Aether Storm, his body absorbing much of the Aether as the rest could not harm him. But this being in front of him seemed to not even be affected the rough pressure of the terrible storm they were in the center of, much less any of the terrible Aether swarming towards her!","Noah observed as baleful tendrils of Aether rushed towards her en masse, but every time they were within just a few inches of her they disappeared silently as even the clothes and veil she wore did not even shake!","His eyes shone as he looked at this scene and remembered the Trait of this being he had seen with the [Eyes of Truth], the EPSILON ranked Trait that made this being at the peak of Nebula Rank to stand in the middle of an Aether Storm without even being pushed aside by a millimeter from the position she chose to float in.","<strong>[Anna Lexalius Dannicus](Trait) : Vector Controller(EPSILON)- A Trait that allows the user to control the magnitude and direction of something within the scope of their understanding. </strong>","A distinct light could be seen covering the Imperial Princess who held a Trait of ridiculous proportions, a meeting between her and the being holding the Traits of [Protagonist] and [Infinite Mana] taking place amidst a raging Aether Storm!"]},{"number":636,"title":"Chapter 636: Chapter 635 - Who is that?","paragraphs":["Was it through the effects of [Blind Luck] and [Memorable Visage] or simply coincidence that Noah met the person with the fierce personage of the Imperial Princess?","This was the same personage that was the daughter of the Imperial Adjudicator, the being standing at the forefront of the Imperials who controlled the entirety of the Nexus Galaxy and the many reaches it had across the Dark Universe!","This Imperial Princess with a much too ridiculous trait was floating in front of Noah as an interested light passed through her veiled eyes, her Trait making it so that the powerful tendrils of Aether could not even touch the clothes on her.","When one looked at her Trait of Vector Controller, they had to understand that Vector was a term that referred to the position, velocity, and force of something. A being that could control Vector could effectively control those same three qualities!","This Imperial Princess was currently making it so that the tendrils of Aether could not even reach her as they were displaced elsewhere, and even if she allowed for them to reach her, she could change the speed they came towards her to be at a turtle’s pace or she could simply control the force of the tendrils of Aether to be nothing more than a feather landing on her clothes!","Such was an ability of a Vector Controller, and this was a very simplified description of it when one thought about all the possibilities she had when it came to her Trait.","Worthy of being an EPSILON ranked Trait, worthy of an Imperial Princess of the force controlling the Nexus Galaxy!","\"You are interesting. What Trait do you have, if you don’t mind me asking?\"","She said these sonorous words as the Aether Storm raged around them, Noah only smiling as he breathed in the surrounding Aether while replying.","\"A simple Auxiliary Trait called Analyzer that lets me be very knowledgeable of my surroundings.\"","His words caused a doubtful expression to appear on the veiled Princess, but she nodded impassively as she looked around the raging storm around them towards a certain location that had begun shining with a dense orange hue. She smiled towards this as she knew her Guardsmaids were going overboard, the two of them utilizing their Traits as they were trying to forcefully tear apart the Aether Storm she was in the center of!","KAAA!","The fearsome sound of a phoenix erupted out as a blazing golden shape of a phoenix flashed outside of the Aether Storm, much of it being torn apart as one of the Nebula Rank guards holding a DELTA ranked Trait streaked through the torn Aether to return towards them.","<strong>[Raya Von Saun](Trait) :: Golden Phoenix(DELTA)- The user can call upon the power of the Ancient Halcyon Phoenix to aid them.</strong>","Noah recalled the Trait of this maid he had seen from the [Eyes of Truth] as from another side, an even more shocking power ripped apart the Aether Storm still trying to rage around them.","RUMBLE!","Noah observed as the very tendrils of Aether themselves burst into colorful blue lights as a cylindrical path was created, the other maid that was clad in a shocking blue aura of flames also making her way over as they reduced the force of the Aether Storm by a significant amount, its raging force beginning to die down around them.","<strong>[Maya Von Saun](Trait) :: Essence Burst(DELTA)- The user can convert all elemental energies into a burst of destructive energies under her control.</strong>","Two sisters, each with their own shocking DELTA ranked Traits, reappeared grandly around the Imperial Princess as they apologized.","\"We are sorry for leaving your side, your Highness!\"","They said these words as they continued using their Traits to forcefully erupt the Aether Storm around them, even though they could see that the Imperial Princess was not even the least affected!","On one side, the image of a terrifying Ancient Halcyon Phoenix opened its beak as the purple Aether was washed away with a blazing gold, the other side having the Aether burst into dispersing blue essence as another Trait was utilized.","Thereafter, the eyes of these Guardsmaids honed in towards the singular being standing near the Imperial Princess who seemed to have an amazed look while looking at their colorful skills!","\"Hmph.\"","The Guardsmaids came back protectively around the veiled Imperial Princess as the Aether Storm around them was fully and forcefully dispersed by their fearsome power, the event having even called over other Blessed as they felt the fearsome power of Traits they never came across before.","The few that were nearby and came were greeted with the sight of the veiled Imperial Princess talking to a figure sat in a meditative position in the skies, the auras of the two Guardsmaids that drew them in being just as bright as ever!","But it wasn’t the shocking levels of energy that made their eyes nearly pop out of their sockets, but it was the scene of the Imperial Princess talking to the Blessed floating in the skies that shook them!","\"That is...\"","\"Who is that?! How dare he...\"","Many could not help but voice out their opinions as in the next second, a powerful aura of a Blessed came over as he also saw this scene, his face turning incredibly dark and sour.","Young Master Andrews had entered the scene while accompanied by two other Blessed beside him, his gaze nearly spitting flames as he saw the inviolable Imperial Princess actually having her presence sullied by someone else!","\"Who...is that?\"","He gritted his teeth as he said this to the two Blessed behind him, this Young Master of the Light Dawn Household of the Imperial City not even being able to recognize one of the beings he had called for the death of the night prior as he wanted to prevent cases like this where a rugrat was staining the presence of the Imperial Princess to ever occur.","\"Err...we don’t know yet, Young Master. I’m sending the image of his face over to our information network, we should get a name briefly.\"","One of the Blessed beside him spoke with sweat dripping down his back as he worked fast, where he came out with a name and shocking information a second later!","\"He...he’s actually one of the targets that should have been taken out last night by the Covert Guards, an ALPHA ranked Blessed with an Auxilliary Trait...\"","CRACK!","The very air around them cracked as a few beings turned to look their way, noticing the palpating essence around Young Master Andrews as his power threatened to rage and spill out at any moment.","The being he aspired to even be close to, the esteemed personage that even the highest of Nobility ever saw...a being with a trash ALPHA ranked Auxiliary Trait was actually so nonchalantly standing next to her?!"]},{"number":637,"title":"Chapter 637: Chapter 636 - That kid has a death wish!","paragraphs":["The two Blessed close to Young Master Andrews saw the palpating rage in his eyes as they sighed in their hearts while looking over at the scene of the veiled Imperial Princess talking with a nobody. They shook their heads as they thought in their minds,","’This kid really has a death wish!’","To be so nonchalantly talking with someone like the Imperial Princess, the two Blessed already said their prayers for this being as they tried to assuage the anger of the Young Master they moved with!","\"We will gather more information about him as we ask the Covert Guard that should have taken his life what happened, Young Master...\"","The Young Master’s rage only continued to grow higher as he looked at the scene of the calm expression on the face of the Blessed as he talked to the Imperial Princess, numerous thoughts and commands coming from him as he began to utilize his position to find out all there was to know about this kid with a death wish- the Blessed known as Alexander King!","Meanwhile, Noah sighed as he looked around them at the peering gazes of many beings as he came out of his meditative position and spoke.","\"It seems like you’re bringing me trouble, your Imperialness.\"","A metaphorical vein seemed to pop in one of the Guardsmaids as she spoke in annoyance.","\"It’s Your Highness, Your Highness.\"","Maya gave Noah the proper term as he nodded with a smile towards them while starting to move away to spend the remaining few hours of the Trial in peace, the sonorous voice of the veiled Princess ringing out still.","\"What is your name?\"","The voice was filled with interest as the Imperial Princess realized the situation where this being was seen with her with the eyes of many Blessed who might each have their own intentions and interpretations about it, but he actually did not seem to be bothered by it at all!","\"King, Alexander King.\"","RUMBLE!","Noah left behind the tendrils of Aether as he stepped away from this meeting, the Imperial Princess repeating this name in her mouth with interest as she laughed and also began moving away with her maids that looked towards Noah with careful eyes!","His figure disappeared among the clouds of Aether as the other Blessed also moved away, Young Master Andrews giving the direction that Noah had left in a hard look as his aura focused on the direction of the Imperial Princess with a palpating heart.","If even he did not have the courage to go up to her, nobody else should even think of sullying her presence, especially not a trash Blessed!","He sent a telepathic message to the beings he could control outside the Aether Carnage Realm as he schemed.","\"Get ready a Blessed geared towards silent assassinations that cannot be tracked. Have them ready to intercept the trash known as Alexander King the moment that we finish the first Trial!\"","His words were sharp as he chose to do everything silently, as he did not know exactly why the Imperial Princess was talking to that being, but he did not want to be tied to that being’s death in any way if the Imperial Princess happened to hear about it.","Thus, he released a command as a Blessed proficient in assassination was prepared for Alexander!","---","The hours passed in the Aether Carnage Realm and many Blessed continued to be teleported out as their essence ran dry, only those with uniquely powerful Traits or those that had dipped into comprehending laws being able to withstand the deadly environments of this realm.","The Blessed had their own Yearly Imperial Selections, and so did Law Masters in their own regions. But if there existed Blessed who held a powerful Trait and also had the profession of a Law Master, these were the true peak powerhouses as they had many strengths reinforcing their power!","The first Trial of this year’s Blessed Imperial Selection took out the Blessed that did not have Traits to grant them enough stamina to hold on in dangerous environments, or those who could not react to the unpredictability in the ever-changing and random environments of the Aether Carnage Realm.","Of the few hundred that entered, less than half had managed to stay until the very end and not break the Spatial Talismans!","RUMBLE!","Noah felt the Spatial Talisman he had on him break naturally after the 24 hours, his figure being sent out of the Aether Carnage Realm as he reappeared in the Imperial Thunderdome.","\"Haha, we made it!\"","\"Brother, didn’t I tell you I could do it?!\"","Shouts of joy were erupting out from all around as around 200 Blessed were left in the Imperial Thunderdome, those that had been teleported out of the Aether Carnage Realm before the 24 hours already having been escorted outside.","In front of each of these slightly over 200 Blessed, new talismans appeared in front of them as they signified a status of beings that passed the first stage of this Selection.","\"Good, good! Quite a decent amount of you remain after that!\"","The vibrant voice of the winged Master Zeke erupted out as everyone put their attention to this being in the skies, taking the glowing Talismans in front of them as they listened.","\"You all must be exhausted after 24 hours of constant danger, so you get a day’s rest before the last portion of this year’s Blessed Imperial Selection. But be warned...if you thought this Carnage Realm was too hard and you struggled too much, you will undoubtedly fail the other half of this Selection.\"","OOOM!","The reverberations made the faces of many serious as soon after, the voice changed to a boisterous one.","\"Alright, go and celebrate for now and be sure to come back here tomorrow at this exact time!\"","\"Yeah!\"","\"Drinks!\"","Shouts of joy erupted out again as the Blessed moved about, Noah giving a light smile as he moved out to the exit of the Imperial Thunderdome as he planned to gather more information in the next 24 hours about the Imperial Citadel and the Brightgold Monarchy it was in, as well as continue to read over the details of the powerful Imperial Princess.","Not too far from him, the party of the Imperial Princess and two Guardsmaids glanced towards his direction briefly, especially the powerful maids that gave him an inquisitive look. But they weren’t the only ones as in another direction, the eyes of the Young Master Andrews were cold and devoid of emotion, a message coming to his mind as he was told the unfinished job of taking out trash Blessed would be completed today!"]},{"number":638,"title":"Chapter 638: Chapter 637","paragraphs":["Chapter 637: 637","Noah continued to think about the information of the shocking Traits of the one known as Imperial Princess as well as her guards as he moved out of the Imperial Thunderdome and went to explore the wide Imperial Citadel that was as large as multiple continents in his own Infinite Realm .","He wanted to establish himself and gain more strength before he associated himself with such terrifyingly powerful figures, but he would take things as they came because such figures showing even a slight interest in him was good, their background really being too grand!","As he left behind many of the cheering Blessed that passed the Imperial Selection, he delved back into the heart of the Imperial Citadel as he observed this fascinating city and its people more .","A majority of the beings he came across were humans, with those that weren’t being similar to Master Zeke as they were simply humans with animalistic features . Of course, much of what made him excited was the food of a Realm in an entirely new Galaxy, so he was ready to go into a specially large restaurant to enjoy himself first .","His eyes were reading the information of a restaurant that his [Eyes of Truth] said was among the very best establishments in this expansive Imperial Citadel, and he was already taking steps towards this place when suddenly . . . he felt a powerful essence pass through him!","’Hmm?’","In front of his eyes, the people that were just passing around him or even the restaurant in front of him had all but disappeared as he found his sight looking around an area filled with clouds!","\"Hmph, making me move just for a mere Star Forging Blessed with an Alpha Trait? This Andrews is really becoming spoiled . \"","A cold voice rang out from all around as Noah saw his surroundings seemed to all be endless areas of rapidly roiling cloud, realizing he was in a different spatial space through the use of a skill or Trait!","But . . . he did not need to guess as the [Eyes of Truth] were telling him everything about it at this moment .","His face adopted a solemn expression as he seemed to ’fearfully’ look around, the cold voice ringing out again .","\"You can say your prayers now, little guy . You are in my [Cloud World]! It is my Trait that allows me to seamlessly transport myself and other targets into a separate space as everything that happens within never ever gets a chance to leave . \"","\"Ahhh, why did you have to offend someone as spiteful as that young master...\"","The voice seemed to mourn for Noah as it came from all sides, this being that was proficient in assassination because of his Trait collecting his powerful Nebula Rank essence as he prepared to deal a deadly blow to the ’weak’ Blessed that showed a panicked face amidst the roiling [Cloud World]!","\"Ayyy...\"","A pained sigh seemed to ring out as the being sent out a strike, but his eyes bulged when he watched the Blessed in the middle of the roiling clouds suddenly disappear, his chest feeling extremely cold and painful thereafter as from his hidden location deep in the clouds, the figure of Noah reappeared!","\" . . . Blergh!\"","A mouthful of blood was spat out from the Nebula Ranked Blessed as he felt his eyes were deceiving him, but the strike of Aether Ray that had passed through his very heart and Origin seemed to say otherwise as the youth behind him came closer, putting his hands on his body as a calm voice rang out .","\"Richard Mazin, 269 years old, commonly known as the Swift Cloud Assassin with the interesting Trait of [Cloud World] . \"","...!","Alarm showed on the body of the Swift Cloud Assassin as he heard his hidden name and correct age uttered from the mouth of this being as he felt his essence move slower as his life began to leave his body .","\"You . . . how...!\"","GUH!","Another mouthful of blood was spat out as Noah waved his hand to destabilize the space around them, the roiling clouds nearly coming to halt as he continued speaking .","\"You [Cloud World] is nearly unbreakable once you bring someone in the same realm like you or lower, and it is why you have been able to have an impressive assassination streak of 1,839 since you began working for the Light Dawn Household of the Brightgold Monarchy, wow . \"","His voice seemed to have a tinge of praise as he talked, the Swift Cloud Assassin only becoming colder and colder as his feet slumped to the ground, his mind in turmoil as this being in front of him spoke of things that nobody should know!","’Just what exactly is this fiend?! What did that stupid young master send me to kill!’","Regret was welling up in the heart of the Swift Cloud Assassin as none of his questions were answered, not even knowing how it came to be that he was dying as Noah’s voice continued .","\"[Cloud World] is definitely unique as it hides your aura and body among the clouds with your enemies never being able to know where you are, being able to strike them until they are dead . Alas, you ran into me where my eyes told me exactly where you were...\"","\"Ahh...!\"","Noah kept his hand on this being as he mocked in the same manner of pained unwillingness that this assassin had shown when he brought him into this [Cloud World], and he then began to release tendrils of Aether onto this body as the shocked look never left the assassin’s face since he had just died too easily and shockingly!","The [Eyes of Truth] had told Noah exactly what the [Cloud World] around him was, and even where its master was hidden as everything thereafter was history! He simply teleported behind him as an Aether Ray released to shatter the being’s origin, and he now lay dead .","\"I wanted to return to Nebula Rank soon too, didn’t think someone would deliver themselves to me on a platter . \"","Noah spoke calmly in the [Cloud World] that was in stasis even after its Master died, this spatial area being something that would dissolve within 5 minutes after being cast, but this time was extended even further as Noah had destabilized the space and actually began supplying essence to keep the [Cloud World] active longer!","He watched calmly as the assassin died, a red light passing over the dead body as he also read the memories of the being and then watched vibrant Nebula Rank cores appearing in front of him as this Blessed only left these cores behind . Noah smiled as he grabbed these cores and began absorbing them, the Realm of this body that had been in the Star Forging Realm beginning to shoot up as the essence within these cores dissolved rapidly .","The Law Origins that he had already begun to recreate since the past daw also churned and spun as Noah filled his Origin to the brim before soon exploding it again into a Nebula, the essence of the universal laws repeating the same thing they did as in the Novus Galaxy as Noah regained much of his power in this new Galaxy at this time!"]},{"number":639,"title":"Chapter 639: Chapter 638","paragraphs":["Chapter 638: 638","In the soon to be dissolved [Cloud World], Noah, or more aptly Alexander- was forging a Nebula within his origin as the essence of universal laws went on to help him do it!","The cores of the Nebula Rank assassin that delivered himself to him continued to be consumed as fuel, more and more stars being formed within the Nebula . The experts at this rank were particularly numerous, as the requirement to proceed into the next realm was particularly high, and it actually varied among different beings .","It was a known truth that after one had cultivated more than 1000 stars within their Nebula, they could make a breakthrough into the Realm of Black Hole if they were talented enough! The talk of talent was mentioned because some beings achieved more than 1000 stars and still remained in the Nebula Rank for all their lives, death claiming them after a few thousand years .","When it came to those that forcefully tried to form their Black Hole with insufficient stars forged, the creation of such a force would actually devour them from inside out as their very lives were snuffed from existence .","To be successful with forming a genuine Black Hole within your Origin, it was said that the more stars one forged, the better . The upper limit of a thousand is what many beings aimed for, but very few were ever able to do this and achieve the realm of Black Hole!","Noah was making it his goal for both his bodies in the two Galaxies to amass and forge more stars within his Nebulae, testing exactly what upper limit of stars he himself could reach before he could seamlessly rank up to the Realm of Black Hole . As he did this, something unique was happening far away in the Novus Galaxy...","---","As the first being to be given a Trait had appeared in the Novus Galaxy, others could now appear as well!","Across the vast stars in the Novus Galaxy, those lucky enough would be able to awaken a Trait if fate had it, the rank of such a Trait completely random as for the first time in a while, the entity that was the Novus Galaxy let things run their course without using the Ruination Core to interfere or bend Universal Laws .","This was more of a cautionary move after having understood a little of the identity of this Ruination Tool because of Noah’s Trait, the danger of this item they still did not fully understand presenting itself to them in a clear fashion as they proceeded carefully!","The essence of the Galaxy had thus been randomly been granting Traits to those lucky enough, but the Novus Galaxy could of course choose to focus a significant portion of its essence in certain areas as it affected the rates of Traits being born there with a lot more frequency .","This is where we come into the Infinite Realm, where the essence of the Galaxy was chosen to be gathered in this wondrous Realm and multiple Blessed had been awakened with every passing day!","Those worthy of note as of right now were two key figures, one of them being much more boastful about it than the other as Noah was looking at the Traits of two beings among his people that awakened, and they were fairly high ranked Traits at that .","[Emperor Penguin](Trait) :: Gigantomachia(DELTA)- The user of this Trait is capable of expanding their form into a gargantuan size as their Strength, Focus, Vitality, and all cast abilities are strengthened by more than ten times . An essence focused on the essence of indestructibility begins to form around the user the more that the Trait is employed .","RAA! RAA! RAA!","The Emperor Penguin was bellowing out loudly in a region of the Infinite Realm as he toward more than 100 meters in size, being larger than even most Behemoths as his trait did not just grant him this massive size . The strengthening of all of his attribute values and skills by more than 10 effectively multiplied his strength by that much as this Infinite Realm Beast was going wild while sparring with others to show off his newly awakened power .","\"Haha, come! Come!\"","ZOOM!","The figure of the arrogant penguin shot around the sparring area where the Draconic Fire Behemoth, Kazuhiko, Kraken, and many others were knocked back at the fearsome power he showed, the pride of this penguin having just shot up to another level with the advent of his Trait .","But he wasn’t the only one worthy of note with a powerful Trait, as the Inquisitor herself, Athena, had also gained a DELTA ranked Trait!","[Athena Cross](Trait) :: Extinction Flames(DELTA)- The user of this Trait is capable of shooting out extremely scorching flames that have the corrosion attribute, capable of reducing those that cannot defend themselves into nothingness .","\"Yaa!\"","The Inquisitor let out a fierce yell as she stood to stop the barrage of the rampaging Emperor penguin, her hundreds of thousands of Fate Lines shimmering around her body as she flipped her palm forward, dark purple flames blazing out!","WAA!","The Emperor Penguin felt an immense threat from these [Extinction Flames] as his flipper smashed forward with dense spatial essence, shockingly finding it eaten up rapidly as he was pushed back and smashed towards the ground .","BOOM!","A crater formed as the beak of the arrogant Emperor Penguin looked up with blazing eyes, his [Sin of Pride] activating as his body shone with a golden luster, marking Athena as his only enemy as he erupted out again!","Athena herself breathed out while feeling the power of her Trait, actually lessening the factor of corrosion as she did not want to seriously hurt her sparring partners .","But these dark purple flames blazed around her as she adopted a shocking image of a conflagration of flames, going forward to meet the 100 meter golden shining Penguin as shocks reverberated through the immediate surroundings!","Noah was in the skies of the Infinite Realm observing this with a smile, knowing that powerful monsters of their own stature were slowly rising in the Novus Galaxy, which would make the coming months and years extremely interesting as he got himself acclimated to the Nexus Galaxy and learned of the larger Dark Universe .","As he looked at his people sparring and continuing to ascend in strength, he wondered who would become Blessed next, and for what shocking Traits they would receive as their strength ceaselessly rose ever so higher!","Would someone like that terrifying Imperial Princess with an EPSILON ranked Trait ever arise from his Galaxy?","These thoughts and more swirled in Noah’s mind as his attention was taken back to Alexander, his other version that had finished ascending to the Nebula Rank as a [Cloud World] dissipated around him ."]},{"number":640,"title":"Chapter 640: Chapter 639","paragraphs":["Chapter 639: 639","In the Imperial Citadel, the figure of Alexander reappeared just as seamlessly as it had disappeared from the gold-lined streets, the powerful Blessed geared for assassination disappearing entirely along with his [Cloud World] .","He had a bright smile on his face as he sensed his vibrant power at the Nebula Realm, continuing to move towards the restaurant in front of him as if nothing had happened, wanting to spend the rest of his time before the start of the next stage enjoying the delicacies of this new Galaxy!","The body of Alexander had minimal currency, but the assassin that had thrown himself at him held an abundance of this Realm’s currency on him as Noah splurged all this wealth on vibrant dishes that held enough essence to cause them to release an aroma and brilliance that would make the mouths of any being water .","Was it due to [Blind Luck] or something else that the assassin had so perfectly landed on his lap to grant me the cores he needed to quickly jump to the Nebula Realm and even the resources for him to enjoy limitless delicacies? He did not know or care, but he simply enjoyed himself!","---","The hours passed as many went about their day, those successfully passing the first stage of the Selection celebrating the entire day and night before they began to walk back into the Imperial Thunderdome on the next day .","Young Master Andrews had spent his day even more lavishly as he came back with eyes that seemed somewhat sunken, where one would know he must have spent a great amount of time in his nightly activities as even his spirit looked spent!","The Young Master seemed to be venting his frustrations because of the prior day’s events, and the fact that he could only stare at afar from the being he truly admired and sought to be in the company of .","He had a forlorn look as he glanced at the party of the Imperial Princess and her two maids, but his eyes nearly bulged out when he caught on that not too far away, the figure of the trash Blessed that should be dead the night prior was right there!","’What the fuck?!’","His mind fuming, the Young Master had begun to send numerous transmission messages to question why a simple assassination mission had not been completed as his second-rate villainy continued, and Master Zeke came out at this time .","\"Alright, everyone is here . \"","OOM","His voice took the attention of everyone in this section of the Imperial Thunderdome as he continued .","\"The last stage of the Trial will require us to step into a Teleportation Portal towards a region outside of the Imperial Citadel of our glorious Brightgold Monarchy Realm . . . we shall be heading towards the Devouring Hells Rift . \"","...!!!","Alarm rose in the eyes of many as they heard this, a twinkle passing in the eyes of Noah and a few others as they heard of this name .","\"Pass through this portal as we head there!\"","Master Zeke pointed towards a pre-prepared portal as the figures of Blessed entered into it, Noah also following along as after passing through it, they found themselves in the middle of an expansive mountain!","Abundant greenery and essence were around them as his eyes turned towards the opposite direction, being able to observe the boundaries of the enormous Imperial Citadel far off in the distance .","The single portal teleportation had taken the 200 odd group all the way out of the Imperial Citadel, bringing them to another location in the Brightgold Monarchy Realm as each of them followed the flying Master Zeke from the mountain as he went towards a certain direction .","\"We have a single rift in this Realm that leads into the Devouring Hells Realm, a realm located in an unknown spatial area somewhere in our Galaxy . This is the Realm where we keep vile prisoners as well as . . . beings from other Galaxies!\"","...!","Even the eyes of those knowledgeable were pensive as they heard this, the group flying with Master Zeke as they approached an enormous red Rift floating in the skies that was heavily protected by multiple Nebula Rank beings and a single expert at the realm of Black Hole .","\"Before being granted the titles of High Imperials and the benefits that come with it, your task will be to bring back the heads of five Prisoners as you learn exactly what power you will be coming across if ever you get to venture out of this Galaxy . \"","OOOM!","Waves of essence freely permeated as the Blessed faced this enormous red Rift, seeing another set of Spatial Talismans appearing in front of them as they worked the same as the ones before, where this time they could crush them to be teleported out the moment they brought back the heads of 5 prisoners!","\"The strongest of beings in the Devouring Hells are at the Nebula Realm, where any enemies higher than that have to be directly killed since they can easily break out of any devices tethering them to a Realm . The most dangerous ones that you will come across are Fiends, sneaky and terrible beings with immense physical prowess that can bring death to you in a second . \"","They received warnings from Master Zeke as the Prisoners in the Devouring Hells Realm were beings that were tethered and could not leave the Realm, but they were freely spread out across it as it was a Realm filled with chaos and terror!","Such was their last stage of the Blessed Imperial Selection, such was the place they had to find and defeat 5 Prisoners in order to join the ranks of High Imperials!","\"Enter!\"","WAA!","Essence erupted out as the over 200 Blessed rushed off with power, valiantly flying towards the red Rift as they committed themselves and their lives to completing this trial successfully .","Noah did the same as his aura felt the cold look that he was receiving from Young Master Andrews behind him, a light smile on his face as he ignored this arrogant young master for the time being and looked forward to seeing this prison of a realm, as well as the creatures from other Galaxies that Imperials locked in this place .","The party of the Imperial Princess and her maids was the last to enter as Master Zeke looked towards them with a smiling expression while shaking his head, the last stage of the Blessed Imperial Selection being underway!"]},{"number":641,"title":"Chapter 641: Chapter 640","paragraphs":["Chapter 640: 640","The tens of Blessed appeared in the skies of a brand new space, entering the Devouring Hells Realm through the rift near the Imperial Citadel as they looked at the new space around them .","Everything was colored by an orange hue as the stench of the dead permeated throughout, making many beings scrunch their faces as they each shot into separate directions .","Others still worked in parties for the matter of safety, while some moved alone as they sought to defeat 5 prisoners before too much time passed in this Realm .","This was because with every passing second, their lives were in more danger as the prisoners tethered but still moving freely within would notice them!","When Noah appeared in the new Realm, he read all the information he could with [Eyes of Truth] as he also began moving out, curious about the beings outside this Galaxy called Fiends .","The skies held a tint of the orange hue, but the earth below him was scorched red as it reminded him of the Infernal Realm, the wide expanse of barren and lifeless mountains making for a desolate scene as he freely spread his aura out without any worries .","He did not have to search for long as in just a few minutes, he sensed a fiery aura moving below him as he saw a Blessed wreathed in a brown-green earthen glow facing a humanoid being with hooves for legs, enormous sickled arms hanging on each side, and tout bat wings behind their back as their entries bodies were the vibrant color of red .","ROAR!","This monstrous creature released a sound blast as it attacked, the Blessed’s green light being shattered the moment the fist of this being landed as it could not handle the pure physical strength .","The Blessed panicked at this show of power as he hastily pulled out his spatial talisman, activating it as he disappeared in a shower of light!","The monstrous creature, or more aptly called a Fiend, then turned towards the other nearest aura as its eyes locked towards Noah in the skies, its tout wings flapping as it shot towards him like a bullet train .","BOOM!","As this creature barreled towards him, Noah marveled at the numerous information popping up in front his eyes as he learned of the beings called Fiends .","[Rak Ragaz] :: A Fiend from the Burning Domain Galaxy . [Life History] [Strengths] [Weakness] [Ability(s)] [Trait(s)][Habits] . . .","He read over the details of this being rapidly as he found out that even while being at the Nebula Rank, it was not proficient in any laws as it relied solely on pure strength!","SHAA!","He moved aside as he evaded a scorching fist that would have shattered the defenses of a normal Nebula rank being . This was one of the unique features of Fiends- they were beings that had stupendous ranks and pure power at the expense of not being proficient in laws .","But they made up for this huge disadvantage with their rapid progress in ranks, where even this single Fiend in front of Noah had already forged hundreds of stars, and his pure strength and defenses alone could easily match a normal Controller .","But as with everything . . . they had their weaknesses! And Noah knew exactly where the weakness of this bulky defensive being lay as the moment he evaded the fist he shot out multiple Aether rays that aimed toward the back of this being where his wings erupted out .","ROAR!","It released a painful bellow at the unexpected attack, swiping its fist behind him as Noah had already teleported in front of it, making sure there was nobody nearby watching a golden light shined out, [Sword of Judgment] being cast as the other way to very easily defeat something which had high defensive and offensive power . . . was to simply wound its soul!","BOOM!","Noah made quick work of the Fiend as he utilized his Traits and skills to take it out with ease, smiling as he felt an abundant amount of cores entering his Expansive Space unique to the body in this Galaxy . He took out one of the cores as he continued moving across the orange-tinted skies of the Devouring Hells Realm, forging more stars within his Nebula as he moved .","Aside from the cores, he confirmed with his own eyes as the number of Skill Points jumped up by a few hundred, these beings known as Fiends being considered separate existences as they were from a galaxy other than the Nexus Galaxy that he was currently a member of .","He did not even need to use his Origin Conversion skill as this being gave him the full Skill Points, and he continued to save and stack up these skill points as he planned to use [Skill Creation] for a dominating skill in the future!","He was very happy to have come into this Realm, because they effectively provided him with a place where he could farm the cores of beings at the Nebula Rank and skill points as he very quickly continued forging the numerous stars within his Origin!","---","It did not need to be described in countless words and fill multiple pages, but Noah continued traversing the Devouring Hells Realm as he made quick work of the Fiends he now knew too much about, collecting large amounts of Nebula rank cores as he absorbed some while moving, the number of Stars within his Nebula already passing 150!","One must know that the rank of Nebula was a stage-defining one, with many beings remaining in this realm throughout their lifetimes and never being able to reach Black Hole . It was a realm that many beings spent years in as they forged numerous stars within their Nebula, until they were confident enough to reduce all of it in the goal of forming a black hole .","Yet at this moment, Noah was getting multiple Nebula Rank Cores as he smoothly absorbed their essence that others worked hard to build for tens and hundreds of years, and he simply forged new stars as easy as it could be, forging in a matter of minutes what it took others years to do in this last stage of the Trial!","This same Trial that was disqualifying many Blessed as they could not withstand the destructive power of the Fiends was being passed with ease when it came to him as he actually used the time to further increase his strength .","In another location not too far away from Noah, another being was making even quicker work of the Fiends as the Imperial Princess holding a shocking EPSILON ranked Trait watched the oncoming fist of a Fiend twice her size cover the entirety of her sigh, and she replied by raising her index finger .","Just her single finger!","BOOM!","The Fiend towering over four meters in size felt an oppressive repulsive force, the instant he neared the finger of the Imperial Princess- an inexplicable field had appeared as it uttered pushed it back while disorganizing the essence in its body .","The Fiend looked towards its enormous fist that actually had its muscles and bones trembling with a confused look as it then looked toward the small finger that had stopped it, wondering if it was seeing things!","But at the same time, the outraised finger of the Imperial Princess made a beckoning gesture as a dense gravitational force suddenly pulled the Fiend forward, finding its body rapidly being pulled towards the Princess as her finger moved towards it like a blade .","SHIING!","An eerie sound erupted out as the head of the powerful Nebula Rank Fiend flew, its eyes still confused as the light faded away from its eyes, still not knowing how it fully died!","\"Hmm . \"","A thoughtful look appeared on the terrifying being in question as she looked at her hand that was spotless, still shaking it a little as she looked towards her maids .","\"These are the Fiends from the Burning Domain Galaxy that we are currently at war with? They don’t seem that tough . \"","Anna turned her head while saying these shocking words, the maids beside her shaking their heads without any answers as their thoughts ran wild .","’They’re plenty powerful, you know? It’s just that you’re a monster!’","Even the two of them would have to put in some work to take them down while using their Traits, but the Imperial Princess made things look extremely easy!","\"Oh, did my public presence cause anything interesting to happen?\"","She asked this as the maids Maya and Raya nodded, recalling various information on the reactions of the Noble Households .","\"Well, most just have the opinion of you playing around as they continue their gossip behind closed doors, with nothing substantial happening . The only thing to have happened that might be connected to you was the actions of an insignificant young master...\" . Raya said this as she pushed her glasses up, an illusory screen appearing in front of her as she moved data around .","\"Oh?\"","The veiled Imperial Princess focused on Raya with a hidden smile as the maid continued .","\"The Nobles continue to underestimate our reach thinking we do not know what they do, so we easily collected the information that Andrews of the Light Dawn Household had utilized his influence to set a prominent Nebula Realm Assassin to kill the . . . being you previously talked to in the first Trial . \"","Raya did not even know how to properly refer to Alexander, so she simply called him that ’being’ as she saw the veil of the princess move from her laughter!","\"Haha, they tried to kill a being overflowing with confidence even in a place like the Carnage Realm? Wasn’t he safe and sound as he entered this same Devouring Hells we are in a few hours ago?\" Anna’s melodious voice resounded out as it contained a chilling magnetism .","The two maids nodded as they recalled multiple documents, also mentioning the actions taken a few days prior when innocent Blessed faced death from this same being over a ridiculous ideal that also had to do with her .","\"Truly vile and useless . \"","Cold words passed from her as an interested light also streaked through the eyes of the Imperial Princess as she thought of the being that had apparently escaped death twice, her aura spreading out as she closed her eyes and put in some effort to use her Trait .","\"What does that fool Andrews look like?\"","She said this with closed eyes as Raya transmitted an image of the low-tier villain to the Imperial Princess, receiving a nod thereafter as the body of the Princess began to vibrate at high speeds .","\"Got it, I’ll be right back . \"","BOOM!","Without another word, space shattered in the area she was in as her body turned into a streak that moved even faster than it could be seen, and who knew how many times faster than the speed of light!","The Imperial Princess put in some effort as she made a grand move in the Devouring Hells Realm, leaving behind disbelieving maids that quickly tried to follow . . .","\" . . . \" Raya had her lips curve into a surprise ’O’ as she didn’t expect the Imperial Princess to move herself and leave them behind again, hearing a frustrated sigh from Maya as the two sisters erupted with power trying to catch up!"]},{"number":642,"title":"Chapter 642: Chapter 641","paragraphs":["Chapter 641: 641","VOOM!","In the Devouring Hells Realm, over tens of Blessed had given up or been killed from the terrifying power of the prisoners known as Fiends .","At this moment, Young Master Andrews was still fuming as he moved with two lackeys in the skies of the Devouring Hells Realm, thinking of the forces he would put together to fully and without mistakes take care of a single trash Blessed .","WAA!","Yet at the next moment, light flashed in front of the eyes of him and his lackeys as they were shocked to find the figure of the esteemed Imperial Princess appearing in front of them, the veil covering her as still as always as she pointed her fingers towards the two Nebula Rank Blessed beside Andrews .","One must know that this Imperial Princess had used insane speeds to traverse the large Devouring Hells Realm over the past few minutes as she came across multiple Blessed and Prisoners, and she had managed to locate the face of Andrews as she located him in no time, her fingers pointing emotionlessly to the two lackeys by his side!","CRUNCH!","A horrid gravitational force seemed to wrap around these two beings, and only these two beings as even the nearby stupefied Andrews was not affected . This gravitational force that was called upon by the use of the EPSILON ranked [Vector Controller] seemed to ignore the ranks and power of these beings as it squeezed them from all sides, their bodies folding in on themselves as they became a mass of round flesh and bones in an instant before dropping down to the red earth!","\" . . . \"","Andrews had his mouth agape as his heart pounded in terror, being close to the person he so dearly wished to be near so many times but never had the courage to do so, and yet this same person was emitting great killing intent towards him at this moment! The shock of what just happened registered in his mind as he stammered back .","\"Princess...\"","VOOM!","Before he could even utter another word, he felt his body being overtaken by a tremendous force as he was unwillingly pulled towards a certain direction, the figure of the Imperial Princess silently disappearing along with him!","---","Far off in another area of the Devouring Hells Realm, Noah had just severed the origin of another Fiend through the use of [Sword of Judgment], this skill that dealt pure soul damage being extremely deadly to beings not even traversing laws as they opted for extreme physical strength and a high rank .","He was about to continue searching for more as he was actually very happy with his progress, having taken down over 12 Fiends so far as he always had a core in hand to continue building up his Nebula!","He had gained over 200 Stars at this point, surpassing his other body in the Novus Galaxy as the stars mystically rotating in his Nebula were numbering over 300 . Aside from this Blessed Imperial Selection granting him an identity of an Imperial, he was also being taken to these amazing realms where he simply farmed cores while getting stronger .","He was about to continue this laid back adventure of taking down powerful Nebula Rank combatants while speedily advancing through the long and arduous Nebula Realm when suddenly, his defenses shot up instinctively as he felt a terrifying aura sweeping towards him at a ridiculous speed!","VOOM!","Two beings appeared in front of him before the sound could even register, his eyes observing space creaking and folding from the path they just took as he watched with surprise eyes the appearance of a terrifying Imperial Princess as well as . . . the being he had already made numerous plans for- Andrews!","The young master had his eyes shaking as he looked around him, Noah being astounded by the sheer speed that was multiple times above his own as he remembered the horrendous Trait of this being .","\"I heard this insignificant trash had actually called for your death and the death of multiple others . This violates the values of the powerful Households of the Imperial Citadel, so I will be using my authority as a Royal of the Dannicus Household to bring him and everyone involved to justice . \"","A shockingly cold voice released from Anna Lexalius Dannicus as even Noah was surprised, his mind having already conjured up numerous ways to deal with the problem of this Young Master and the influence he could have continued to use as he tried to kill him in the near future .","He expected for this Young Master to continue sending Nebula Rank beings towards him in the future as he planned to use that as a method of farming until he neared the Rank of Black Hole, where he would then look for the methods to break through as he gathered more information with his identity as a High Imperial!","Yet now, this terrifying Imperial Princess had gone straight ahead with a brute method as she used her strength and authority to bring the culprit right in front of him, and before he could even say anything else, he felt her oppressive power being activated again as she pointed towards the young master . Noah’s eyes shone with a red luster as [Eyes of Truth] were kept active to understand everything occurring in front of him .","BRRR!","Rapid and terrifying vibrations began to emit from the body of the Nebula Rank being as before he could use his Trait nor any of his power, his whole body seemed to be trembling as Noah watched in slow motion as the skin of this young master began to expand and burst like a bubble, his muscles and bones following thereafter as he understood somewhat what this Princess carrying an EPSILON ranked Trait was doing!","[Vibration Emission] :: One of the methods of manipulating vectors that the holder of the [Vector Controller] Trait can utilize . The user can generate vibrations or cause particles to vibrate as they wish, bringing about many means of destruction when the methods are used against someone else . Through increasing the vibration rate of subatomic vectors, the user can induce many effects not limited to but including Internal Rupture, Disintegration, Burst, Sonic Boom Generation, Molecular Oscillation . . . To counterattack Vibration Emission, one must have the capabilities to heal at a faster rate than the damage caused, or have a powerful enough constitution to withstand it . . .","Eyes of Truth told him that the spectacular Trait of Vector Controller was being used to produce vibration emissions within the body of Andrews as his very own subatomic vectors were induced to vibrate at greater and greater frequencies until . . . he burst!","POOF!","A shower of gory blood erupted out as an invisible circle wrapped around it, Noah only watching in silence as this puddle of blood was then released from this circle as it fell towards the red earth .","The Nebula Rank defenses of this being could not stop the oppressive power of [Vector Controller], nor did his Trait that did not even need to be mentioned . He just simply died .","Just like this, the low tier villain young master that used underhanded means and murder with the justification of his infatuation with an Imperial Princess . . . was actually brutally killed by the very being herself as the veiled powerhouse continued to glance towards Noah, not even giving the blood falling to the red earth a look as her voice rang out again, this time none of the coldness apparent in it!","\"Well with that over, I’m very curious how you managed to escape death twice, and even more interested to understand your demeanor towards me so far . \"","\" . . . \"","The voice had changed to the sonorous tone of an interested young girl that had found a toy to play with as Noah felt cold sweat metaphorically dripping from his back, realizing he had to quickly amass new abilities and grow his power if he was so quickly coming face to face with terrifying creatures such as this . . ."]},{"number":643,"title":"Chapter 643: Chapter 642","paragraphs":["Chapter 642: 642","In the skies of the Devouring Hells Realm, Noah stared at the veiled Imperial Princess as numerous thoughts crossed his mind . He was thinking about the terrifying ability that her Trait possessed, as well as what he would have done if it was directed towards him!","When it came to her using [Vector Controller] to cause a being’s very own subatomic particles to vibrate at greater frequencies until they burst and became puddles of blood, he looked over the counterattacks mentioned by the Eyes of Truth as he thought about using the ability of [Aura of Redemption] that granted him constant healing, and all he had to do was make sure his rate of healing exceeded the rate at which his very cells imploded .","Many possibilities of what he could do floated through his mind as the main point still stood- the power of this EPSILON ranked Trait was terrifying!","\"I didn’t die because they simply underestimated me . As for how I act towards you...\"","He replied to her question as a light smile hung over his face .","\" . . . well, it’s more so due to my Trait, [Analyzer], that lets me know information about the things and people around me . \"","The Imperial Princess’s veil shifted to the right quizzically at Noah’s words, her sonorous voice ringing out again with interest as if she did not just pulverize a genuine Nebula Realm being into a bloody mess .","\"Your Trait made you look upon the daughter of the Imperial Adjudicator of the Nexus Galaxy and not care about her status as you acted completely different from everyone else?\"","It was more of a conformational statement than a question, but Noah replied with a nod as he sensed two fierce auras that should have been this being’s maids rushing over here rapidly!","\"Yes, my Trait told me that you wish me no harm, and that you were actually saddened at the fact that nobody could truthfully talk to you because of your high stature . \"","RUMBLE!","At these words, Noah felt the extreme coldness of this Imperial Princess return as her next words were filled with power .","\"Your Trait peeks into my thoughts?\"","Her veil shone with luster as she said this, Noah raising his hands up as he replied to her quickly while cursing his [Memorable Visage] ability and making sure [Blind Luck] was still active and working .","\"No, I just get a glimpse of information about emotions and people’s intentions towards me . \"","\" . . . \" The Imperial Princess folded her hands in the skies as she seemed to be in thought, her bountifully blessed chest protruding even more as Noah remained calm .","A few seconds passed as a tense atmosphere permeated, the auras of the two powerful maids being seen by the naked eye as they rapidly made their way over with frustrated expressions . As they arrived, the tense atmosphere faded away as they heard the sweet voice of the Imperial Princess ring out with words that nearly made their jaws drop .","\"Interesting . Alright, since you’re the only person in my generation capable of talking to me with a straight face, you shall henceforth be my friend!\"","The veiled Anna Lexalius Dannicus said these words as more of a proclamation than even a question, her gaze locking towards the being in front of her as his next words would be extremely crucial .","Noah gave a light smile as he reached his hand out, his actions signifying his agreement as the nearing shocked Maids looked on to see slight hesitation in the figure of the Imperial Princess before he white-gloved hand reached out and grasped onto the outstretched hand!","\"Alexander . It’s nice to meet you, Imperial Princess . \"","\" . . . Anna of the Dannicus Household that rules the Nexus Galaxy . I look forward to the surprises you’re still hiding from me, friend . \"","Two beings that had only officially met twice in their lives shook hands on this day under the watchful eyes of two maids, this single hand shake being the beginning of a shocking set of events that would embroil multiple powers of the Dark Universe in chaos!","---","The hours passed by as powerful Blessed with unique Traits completed the task of defeating 5 Fiends and bringing their heads back, successfully completing the last stage of the Blessed Imperial Selection .","In this last part of the trial, slightly over half of those that entered were successful, and many were shocked to find out that a prominent Young Master of a powerful household of the Imperial Citadel had somehow faced his death in the Devouring Hells Realm!","Another shocking event that made many Nobles observe closely was the scene where the party of the Imperial Princess and her Guardsmaids could actually be observed to be moving with an unknown Blessed, those that had seen this same scene just 2 days prior spreading this information as soon enough, the identity of the being known as Alexander King began to be talked about .","At this point in time, many were just wondering exactly why this being was hanging around the Imperial Princess, and what authority he had to do so!","\"Haha! I welcome the new champions! I welcome you all to the ranks of High Imperials!\"","OOOOH!","A bellow could be heard from Master Zeke as he counted the heads of the Fiends brought forward by all the successful Blessed, and he then waved his hands towards the 100 odd Blessed that passed this year’s Blessed Imperial Selection, the wave of his hands causing the appearance of a green-gold emblem to appear in front of their eyes .","\"This is the Imperial Emblem that grants you an identity as a High Imperial, a sacred identity which comes with important duties!\"","The humanoid birdman spoke as his white majestic wings moved in the skies, all the Blessed that successfully passed the Trial being teleported back to the area in front of the shimmering red rift that led to the Devouring Hells Realm between multiple mountain peaks as they now grasped on to their Imperial Emblems .","\"There isn’t going to be some grand celebration or anything like that to welcome you all as you take on the mantle of High Imperials, but there is going to be a commandment that I will repeat- and it is this commandment you all must etch inside your hearts and follow . \"","RUMBLE!","\"As High Imperials, it is your job to put your life on the line to protect our Nexus Galaxy, the task of exploring the Dark Universe being something that comes second!\"","The strong voice of Master Zeke reverberated throughout the mystical mountainous region as the red rift leading to the Devouring Hells Realm shone menacingly behind him .","\"Of course, to usher in the new ranks of High Imperials also means abundant rewards to foster your strength . You will find many resources in the Imperial Emblem that also acts as your identity once you bind it by blood . The second reward will be something granted to every High Imperial . . . the access to the first two floors of the Imperial Library!\"","...!","The eyes of many beings shone as they heard these words, others not being able to contain themselves as they bellowed out their happiness at arriving in this new stage .","\"For the Nexus Galaxy!\"","\"For the Imperials!\"","OOOOOH!","Vibrant waves of power released outward as around 100 new High Imperials were added to the ranks of Imperials on this day, Noah implementing himself in the organization ruling the Nexus Galaxy as he was one step closer to completing his goals in this new Galaxy .","The path to completing his second Trait as he stayed true to its name of Protagonist, the goal of taking a central role in the fate of this new Galaxy . . . began now!"]},{"number":644,"title":"Chapter 644: Chapter 643","paragraphs":["Chapter 643: 643","As Noah fully assimilated himself in the Imperial Citadel of the Nexus Galaxy, the party being led by a DELTA-ranked Blessed and multiple Law Masters to check the disappearance of an exploration party finally traversed across the Chaotic Void and reached the location of the signal after a few days had passed .","As many Imperial Vessels floated in the Void, stern faces and confusion were all that could be seen as the powerful DELTA ranked Blessed at the realm of Black Hole spread his essence throughout, but affirmed what everyone was seeing with a grim face- it was the fact that there was nothing in the area that released the Signal!","This meant that the advance party of Imperials were most likely taken down by a moving Entity, which led to the assertion that they were just unlucky enough to have run across a powerful dweller of the void that had a horrible temperament .","\"Head back!\"","The lead DELTA ranked Blessed who was in the realm of Black Hole said these words as the many Imperial Vessels began to turn back, his gaze staying at the location of the Void where the signal came a bit longer as he noticed a peculiarity that he did not know how to explain .","The Chaotic Void around where the signal should have been . . . was particularly unstable as if a huge change had occurred here recently to make it so . But no conclusions could be drawn from it as the second party sent to check the Signal which was released from the Novus Galaxy turned around!","This incident would be attributed to the wrath of a fearsome entity, and that would be enough to successfully close this chapter as information about this signal would all be archived away in the near future .","---","In the grand Nexus Galaxy, a wide array of Realms and Worlds peacefully stayed within .","All of these Realms and Words were in a period of peace and conquest as they were unified under the rule of the Imperials residing in the Brightgold Monarchy Realm .","This realm had the name ’Brightgold Monarchy’ because it was founded by a being known as Golden Monarch Brightgold!","Though currently, the ones ruling the Central lands of this Realm and residing in the Imperial Citadel were the Nobles of the Dannicus Household, with the one known as the Imperial Adjudicator at the lead .","The Dannicus Household ruled with an iron fist as much of the success of the Nexus Galaxy could attributed on a whole to this powerful family, the prosperity many beings were seeing today coming from their conquests and actions .","This household was also the one to call themselves Imperials, with different ranks of this name given out to different beings depending on their power!","At the lowest rank, you had the Nobles who could freely claim the singular Imperial Title .","Above it, you had those who could traverse the stars and Galaxies, the High Imperials!","After High Imperials, you had the esteemed Imperial Lords who managed different regions of the Nexus Galaxy, and above them you had the Imperial Rulers that controlled the forces sent through the Universal Rift as well as command posts on other Galaxies .","Standing above all these Imperials was the singular Imperial Adjudicator himself, the Golden Conquer that resided in the Imperial Citadel!","In the Imperial Citadel that served as a command station for many of the things happening around the Nexus Galaxy, one would almost always hear about the most famous establishment aside from the unique Imperial Thunderdomes- it was the location where many beings sought knowledge, the Imperial Library .","This Imperial Library was open to very few beings, and it was restricted only to those holding the title of Imperials!","The first and second floors of this vast Imperial Library could be accessed by High Imperials, with the lowest rank of Imperials only being able to access the first floor .","Only Imperial Lords could access the mysterious Third Floor, and only Imperial Rulers had access to the Fourth Floor!","At this moment, the Imperial Library was receiving an influx of new beings all at once as slightly over 100 new High Imperials were crowned on this day, many of them rushing towards the Imperial Library after they ascertained their treasures in the Imperial Emblems .","This was because in the Imperial Library, aside from the vast knowledge about the Nexus Galaxy and the forces surrounding it, one could also find powerful Inheritances of Universal Laws and even techniques left behind by the powerful combatants of the past Era!","The truly smart Blessed knew to also try their hand in mastering Laws, with the true elites being the Imperials who could utilize Traits as well as wield the power of the Universal Laws .","At this moment, Noah was standing in front of the ridiculously huge entrance of the Imperial Library, coming here with the same goal as the many others that had already rushed in .","\"Many beings can stumble to learn the universal laws simply based on their talent, but if they have the guidance of techniques, they will comprehend and assimilate laws at rapid speeds . \"","The voice of the melodious Imperial Princess rang out beside Noah as she was flanked on both sides by the powerful Maids, Maya and Raya .","This bored Princess that had found a single friend she could talk to in her generation made it so that the four of them came to this Imperial Library together, much of her veiled gaze on Noah as she tried to probe this being that somehow drew great interest from her!","Noah nodded at the words of the Princess as he looked at the two maids who were still staring at him suspiciously, as if they were trying to find whatever means he had hiddenly used to capture the attention of their esteemed Princess .","He looked towards the Princess as he spoke .","\"I know the Imperial Library holds vast knowledge and techniques, but which floor might the truly powerful law techniques be held at?\"","The eyes of the Imperial Princess twinkled as she replied while taking steps towards the Imperial Library .","\"On the first floor, you have the techniques of the normal Universal Laws with millions of books containing knowledge of the Nexus Galaxy . On the second floor, you will find the techniques of the Supreme Laws and knowledge of other galaxies, and it is only until the Third Floor that you come across techniques for Ultimate Laws . \"","...!"]},{"number":645,"title":"Chapter 645: Chapter 644","paragraphs":["Chapter 644: 644","Ultimate Laws!","Laws that even his own galaxy did not have the techniques to cultivate, but this Nexus Galaxy that had lived for countless eons held it!","Noah listened to the words of the Imperial Princess as he nearly sighed, repeating the fact that Ultimate Laws were located in the Third Floor, and his title as a High Imperial at this moment only allowed him to access up to the second floor .","The Imperial Princes noticed his forlorn expression as he stared up the Imperial Library, her voice ringing out in a surprised manner .","\"You’re already trying to jump to Ultimate Laws? You have access to the floors that hold the techniques of all other laws up to Supreme, you should even find great techniques for your comprehension in the law of Aether there . \"","Noah nodded at her words as he seemed to be thinking of something else .","\"Well you see, I always wanted to learn an Ultimate Law since I am such a genius in lower-tier laws . Now that I’m here, I can’t help but feel like it is within my reach but still so far away . \"","\"Haha!\"","A slight laugh escaped from the Imperial Princess as she shook her head while staring at the man who seemed to have missed out on a huge treasure right in front of his eyes, his words speaking about himself like some kind of a genius that could easily comprehend laws . The maids Maya and Raya looked towards him with slight contempt as they thought he was showing off again .","’Hmph, wanting to embark on an Ultimate Law when you haven’t even mastered normal or supreme ones? He’s definitely a boaster!’","’It won’t be so easy for you to show off in front of the Princess . A genius in laws? Ha!’","The thoughts of the two sisters were in sync as they looked at each other, shocking words coming out of the mouth of the Imperial Princess soon after .","\"Well if you are so curious about Ultimate Laws and are the genius you say you are, I can grant access to the Third Floor for you just once . \"","...!","Noah’s eyes opened wide as he looked towards the veiled figure that he could distinctly feel was smiling with an expression of challenge . It seemed she was curious to see if he was just talking big about wanting to learn Ultimate Laws, and she would even use her status to grant him access so could see exactly what he was made of!","If things were really like that...","\"I’ll owe you a favor if you can make something like that happen, Princess . \"","His eyes twinkled as the veiled figure nodded, the two maids shaking their heads full of complaints as they knew not to speak out once their Princess had made her mind .","With out minding the gazes of the many beings around them, they ascended up the steps of the grand Imperial Library as its golden arched doors were wide open, a thin film of transparent white light being the only thing present!","Noah’s new Imperial Emblem shone as he neared and passed through the barrier into the First Floor of the Library with no problems, following the leading Imperial Princess and her maids forward as his eyes looked around him .","All around him, rows and rows of bookshelves could be seen as he could not even ascertain their numbers . Far off in the distance of this first floor, he could notice a glimmering blue portal surrounded by multiple Imperial Guards .","\"The Inheritances of normal Laws can be found once you go through that protected blue portal, the same thing being present on the upper floors . \"","Maya explained with a cold voice as instead of staying on the first floor, the four of them had begun taking the spiral stairway leading to the second floor . A similar scene as the first floor repeated as Noah saw the essence of space vibrantly permeating through this floor, its size somehow expanded to be even larger than the first floor as it nearly doubled in size even though it did not look like it from the outside .","This second floor should have been the last place he could access, where one would come across Supreme Laws! But he had the powerful Imperial Princess leading the way as her very presence caused murmurs to spread out in the quiet library, many people committing the figure of Noah who was accompanying her to their memory as they planned to find out who he was!","The four of them came upon the spiral stairway leading to the third floor as Noah saw it was protected by a single Blessed, this protector having a vibrant aura at the realm of Black Hole as he blocked the way towards the third floor where only Imperial Lords could access!","He saw the Imperial Princess that came ever so closer to him as his eyes shook, standing aside quickly as he bowed, but his aura also locked towards Noah at the same time .","\"Princess...\"","His gaze was questioning as he glanced towards Noah, the Imperial Princess waving her hands as a cold voice rang out from her .","\"Librarian Shaun . This is my guest, and will be allowed access just this once . \"","Her words came out cold and domineering, seeming more like a command to this expert at the Realm of Black Hole as Librarian Shaun nodded while bowing even deeper!","The barrier that only Imperial Lords could cross using their Emblems opened up in front of Noah at this time as he and the three women made their way to the third floor . Shocked gasps and envy could be seen in the eyes of many as they watched this scene, the information systems of many Nobles being put in play on this night as they all went to figure out the identity of the being taken to the 3rd Floor of the Imperial Library by the Princess .","Majestic and ancient were the only words to describe the third floor, being nearly empty as Noah could not sense a single soul on it!","It did not even have any guards stationed at the glimmering portals that shone with a pure green and oppressive dark luster, each of the two portals signifying a different Ultimate Law as they lay on opposing sides of the floor .","\"I don’t want to make my old man angry so I’ll only give you a chance for one or the other . Death or Life, what will it be?\"","The voice of the Imperial Princess rang out sonorously as her veiled figure turned towards Noah, nobody being able to see the expectant eyes under this veil that wondered what surprise this being would have in store for them!","If his words were just lies and he was just boasting in front of her this entire time, she would be very disappointed as she very quickly cut off her connection with this being .","But her eyes were expectant because . . . this person’s figure seemed to have an unbounded sense of confidence that simply could not be faked!","As the eyes of the maids and the Imperial Princess honed in on him, Noah turned his face towards the vibrant green and the intense dark portal that led to two different Ultimate Laws .","Life or Death . . . which would it be?!"]},{"number":646,"title":"Chapter 646: Chapter 645","paragraphs":["Chapter 645: 645","The choice was made in an instant as Noah thought about himself and his situation, choosing the Ultimate Law of Life right away!","When it came to defense or offense in this new Galaxy with filled monsters and the unexplored Dark Universe filled with even more terrifying entities, he would choose the option that would increase his defenses and grant more means of protection first before he did anything else .","Thus, his face turned to the right where a vibrant green portal law, the Imperial Princess smiling as she led the way there . She was really curious, was Alexander really the genius he said he was?","They passed the rows of ancient and tightly bound books as they soon came upon the unprotected portal, the Princess and her maids leading the way as they stepped into it right away with Noah following behind .","The scene in front of him changed instantly as he found himself in a unique spatial area, looking around him to see that even though they still seemed to be on the 3rd floor of the Imperial Library, they were in a separate space that still showed their surroundings in a transparent manner .","\"This is a different layer of space, but it is still within the third floor of the Library . It’s why the you can still observe the books outside of here, but what you want is right ahead...\"","The Imperial Princess and her maids looked toward the center of this circular spatial space they were in as Noah’s eyes also landed on a grand pedestal that was brimming with essence .","This pedestal looked extremely archaic and ancient, with green and brown runic markings swirling around it as Noah breathed in deeply to take in a refreshing air of . . . life!","He already felt his very muscles and bones rejuvenated as he just smelled the essence that this archaic pedestal released, and on top of this pedestal one could observe a floating green gem- this was the Inheritance that taught one how to cultivate in the Ultimate Law of Life .","Noah walked towards it alone as the maids Raya and Maya pulled the sleeves of the Imperial Princess, Maya whispering in her ears as they carefully watched the being in front of them .","\"Princess, what if you finally see he’s just a show-off and your father gets angry for bringing a nobody to a place only Imperial Lords are allowed in?\"","Maya tried to word the question as best as she could even though it still came out as an insult, the Princess laughing lightly as she didn’t seem bothered by it .","\"We’re already here, so we might as well just see how it turns out . \"","Thus, the three of them watched as a single young man went forward and touched the Inheritance holding techniques to traverse the Ultimate Law of Life, a bright green light shining out instantly thereafter!","RUMBLE!","Noah felt the flow of knowledge as he accepted this grand Inheritance, an inheritance that stood above laws like Fate or Chaos as it stood at a higher level . Numerous knowledge on the construction of skills through the use of mana entered his mind as they were classified into normal or part of an Absolute Skill, but his mind at this moment focused on the technique that taught one how to comprehend the Law of Life, on a technique that would have been similar to Disciple of Fire or Water, or Fate’s Disciple .","But this one did not have any of those names, and it was termed in its own way as Noah saw the words...{The Doctrine of Life}!","{The Doctrine of Life} :: Across the eons of time and space, there are few true wonders permeating throughout . This Doctrine is among the few wonders existing in the vicissitudes of time, one that teaches the user about a single thing- Life . With this technique, the user can begin comprehending the Ultimate Law of Life as a primeval tree buds from their very origin .","RUMBLE!","The shocking skill fully solidified in his mind as he put aside all the other skills that came with the inheritance, dropping to the floor as he took a seating position and looked to activate the skill right away!","This was because the moment the knowledge of it came to his mind, his very origin began to thrum with longing, a longing so deep that it overcame every other thought as it only told Noah to do one thing- start on the path of the Law of Life!","His mana nearly went into overdrive as he let it freely flow into the construction of {The Doctrine of Life}, activating the skill for the first time as a deep green hue began to emulate from his body . This green hue began to get brighter and brighter as the time passed, putting a stark contrast on the jaws of two maids that nearly dropped to the floor, as well as the veiled Imperial Princess that one could not see the expression of .","But shock had begun to enter their hearts as at this moment, they felt the appearance of a shockingly potent aura of Life emanating from the being seated in a lotus position in front of them, and this aura only became stronger and stronger as the seconds passed!","But this rapidly expanding green aura was the least fantastical thing, as the most resplendent sight was occurring within Noah’s very out Origin . At Noah’s very core, one could see a floating blue gold Nebula that was his Origin, and it was surrounded by two other Nebulae that represented the 100% comprehension of the laws of Fire and Water, as well as the vibrant Origin Cores of Earth, Air, Light, and Dark .","In the very middle of his Origin Nebula where over 300 Stars now peacefully made their rotations, one would be able to see at this moment the appearance and the budding of a seed!","A seed had appeared a second after Noah activated {The Doctrine of Life}, and the enormous influx of essence caused it to bloom a second later as Noah could now see a sprout that was gradually getting bigger until three branches came out, the unfolding of three leaves happening at this moment as the shocking aura of green he released shot through the fucking roof .","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":647,"title":"Chapter 647: Chapter 646","paragraphs":["Chapter 646: 646","Maya and Raya were watching with disbelief as the aura that was growing bigger and bigger from Alexander decided to go completely insane, forming into a column of green light as it thundered forth from the isolated space they were in and appeared outside on the 3rd Floor of the Imperial Library, and it then only became more powerful and oppressive as it shot above this floor and continued to go ever higher, the unique phenomenon overtaking the entirety of the Imperial Library!","On the second floor, the Imperial Guard at the realm of Black Hole felt this quaking aura above them as his face turned serious, the immensity of Ultimate Laws being one of the few things capable of making experts such as these serious .","This expert and many other beings in the Imperial Library turned their faces towards one direction as the vibrant column of green light only continued to get bigger, the gold-white Imperial Library becoming tinged green as it lit up brightly!","In the isolated space itself where Noah sat down peacefully, he observed the sprout that was budding from his Nebula as he saw his own mana flooding into it, but the essence of all the 6 Law Origins he also had with him were all flowing towards this sprout that signified his progress in the Law of Life thus far!","6 different law origins were bending to the Law of Life as they gave their own essence to make the sprout prosper, Noah noticing more branches appearing from the sprout with every second as it went from 3 leaves to 6, and then from 6 to 12 .","Everytime that a new leaf bloomed, it released with it a green light that permeated all across Noah’s body, his very cells drinking up the energy of this Ultimate Law as his body could not help but tremble in joy at the experience of it .","The trembling of his body only signified one thing- it wanted more!","And so Noah delivered as essence continued to flood towards {The Doctrine of Life}, his eyes observing the sprout that had begun spreading its roots throughout his origin bud with more and more leaves as it expanded in size .","Thick roots that shone with a unique power furled themselves all around the stars of his Nebula, creating for a shocking imagery as the more he kept {The Doctrine of Life} active, the more these roots spread out while the tree grew ever larger, its leaves becoming abundant!","When he reached 384 leaves on this resplendent tree, he felt the waves of green essence released from the budding tree more than double as the green light he released became even more intense, this green light essence that stemmed from the source of the Law of Life actually undergoing a form of positive feedback loop with the 6 Law Origins within his body as there was a cycling of energy that just caused a larger and larger reaction .","When the leaves came to be 1536 the party of Imperial Princess and her 2 maids had gaping mouths as from their point of view, they could observe the faint illusory image of an ancient primeval tree present on Alexander’s chest, this tree vibrantly shining with his every heart beat as it released an even grander luminescent light to the surroundings!","In Noah’s very own Nebula, he could also see the appearance of this mystical tree that was fully taking root in the middle of the swirling Nebula, vibrant green leaves that released lush essence which changed his body from inside out continuing to release nonsensically .","This essence of life itself was being drunk by his body so much that he even unconsciously released it outward, the three women standing a distance away breathing in deep breaths as the smell of something wondrous touched their noses!","THUMP!","The primeval tree beat in conjunction with his heart as he felt himself getting stronger with every beat, where he knew that purely from his physical strength alone, he was over 5 times stronger than just a few minutes ago .","But the more shocking thing was the essence of life itself that was so pleasurable that it made him want to scream out!","This was an Ultimate Lawa This was the Law of Life! Ah!","\"Small Success in an Ultimate Law...\"","Raya couldn’t help but mutter the shocking words, these three girls being witness to a being that embarked on an Ultimate Law and achieved a ’Small Success’ in it in a matter of minutes .","In the Nexus Galaxy and in the grander Dark Universe, the comprehension of laws was referred to in stages, where one would go from having nonexistent comprehension in a law to the stage of Small Success, and then step into Large Success before finally achieving Completion .","At this point as Raya mentioned Small Success, it was actually Noah hitting the 3% mark of the Ultimate Law of Life in a matter of minutes!","He would be considered at the stage of Small Success until he reached 49%, where stepping above half of a law’s comprehension and gaining an Authority meant that one was at the Large Success stage of this law!","THUMP!","With every beat of his heart, they saw the illusory tree on Alexander’s chest pulse out with energy, the disturbance in the Imperial Library only continuing as Maya reeled in her shock while glancing around them .","\"Princess, this . . . is causing too much of a commotion...\"","The shock and awe gradually calmed as they fully grasped what was happening, the Imperial Princess shaking her head in wonder as she observed the being that should have been seated on the floor begin to be raised up by the green essence in a show of grandeur, one last blast of green light erupting out grandiosely before his body was returned to the floor, the illusory green tree present on his chest also fading away slowly at this time .","OOOM","It was then that Alexander opened his eyes that shone with a bright hue, capturing the three girls’ eyes as they locked on to him with disbelief .","He looked around the fading green light around him as he actually shook his head in disappointment, his eyes staring at an invisible panel that showed his progression in the Law of Life had hit 5% before the initial burst of comprehension that came with all laws died down .","He shook his head in disappointment as he knew it would be arduous to raise this percentage from now on, but the three girls only looked at this scene with even more shock as his next words nearly made them want to strangle him!","\"Ah, it seems my talent in cultivating this Ultimate Law is only so-so, Your Highness . \"","RUMBLE!","\"You...\"","Maya had to reel in her words as in the figures of the three women, power nearly erupted out to strangle this arrogant being in front of them as numerous thoughts swirled through their minds .","’Your talent is so-so?’","’If your talent is so-so, then every one else’s talent is trash!’","\"Haha!\"","Clear and languid laughter broke out of the Imperial Princess as her gaze focused even more around Alexander, an unknown light coursing through her eyes as they looked up around them and tore through the layers of walls around the Imperial Library, her eyes coming to observe the figures of multiple beings that floated around the Imperial Library with careful expressions and bodies that shone with star shattering power .","\"You’ve brought me trouble, Alexander King . \"","Her sonorous voice rang out as Noah got to his feet and also felt the auras surrounding them, noticing the appearance of numerous experts at the realm of Black Hole carefully surrounding the Imperial Library, each of them releasing a pressure that made their very surroundings quake as all their eyes were focused on the isolated space located on the third floor they were in!","\"Now, what are we to do about this?\""]},{"number":648,"title":"Chapter 648: Chapter 647","paragraphs":["Chapter 647: 647","From the Imperial Library, a rumbling essence came out as Librarian Shaun- the one who had granted access to Alexander and watched as he went up to the third floor with the Imperial Princess, came out to meet the auras of multiple Black Hole Realm experts who were stationed in the Imperial Citadels .","\"Generals, it’s nothing major . Just the Imperial Princess and her people exploring universal laws . \" Librarian Shaun’s expression was awkward as he rubbed his temples while speaking out to them, his words making all of them having a change of expressions as one laughed jovially while coming closer .","\"The Princess is playing around again? And what do you mean exploring universal laws- that was someone gaining Small Success in an Ultimate Law!\"","A brute man with a ferocious scar running down diagonally across his face came forward with wild essence as he spoke .","\"General Zadan, I’m just as surprised as you are...\" Librarian Shaun had begun speaking with a light smile, but he had to stop half way as behind them, they sensed three powerful auras they were familiar with, as well as an extra aura that pulsed with extreme vibrancy and life!","Still fresh from the first cultivation session of {The Doctrine of Life}, Noah came out of the Imperial Library with the party of the Princess as he stared with shining eyes at the multiple experts in the Realm of Black Hole floating in the skies .","At their appearance though, these shockingly powerful beings had wide smiles on their faces as they bowed, each of them calling out respectfully to the Imperial Princess in front of them!","\"Princess...\"","\"Your Highness...\"","\"Little Anna!\" One particularly boisterous shout rang out from the expert with a huge scar running down his face, General Zadan floating closer to them as he looked at the veiled Princess up and down, and then gave a dangerous glare to Noah’s figure which still shone with a green luster .","\"Uncle Zadan . . . I’m not so little anymore...\" Noah nearly did a double take as he heard the voice of a shy girl come out of the terrifying veiled figure of the Imperial Princess, causing laughter to ring out among the groups of experts as many beings around the Imperial Library shockingly looked to the skies .","\"Haha, you will always be the little girl who gave a beating to a Nebula Realm expert when she was just 15 to me . Now, who is this being that is causing such a commotion, and what is he doing near my Anna . \"","RUMBLE!","The sharp aura of an expert at the Realm of Black Hole bubbled forth as Noah unconsciously felt the primeval tree stabilizing within his Nebula pulse, green energy bouncing off of him as he repelled nearly all of this pressure!","\"Uncle Zadan, stop it . . . he’s a friend of mine who is slightly good in comprehending laws, so I let him test himself with an Ultimate Law . \" The sonorous voice of the Imperial Princess rang out as the many experts around them shook their heads with disbelieving smiles .","’Slightly good in comprehending laws?’","’You let him try an Ultimate Law first?’","\"Hmm . . . still! He does not have an identity as an Imperial Lord! Little Anna, do you know how hard I worked to achieve that? Your father might ground you again for breaking more of his rules . \" General Zadan pulled back his aura as he said this to Anna, waving his hands towards the other 6 experts at the Realm of Black Hole as they each bowed towards the Princess as they began to fade away, but not before giving one last look at Noah as they burned his image into their memories!","\"Don’t worry Uncle, I’ll talk to daddy and explain everything . \" Anna seemed to have a mischievous smile behind her veil as the powerful scarred General Zadan nodded while shaking his head, turning his attention towards Noah as he spoke seriously .","\"You have great talent in the laws to be able to gain Small Success in the Law of Life on your first cultivation session . Life Law Masters are extremely rare, and you will be heavily sought after for your ability to [Endow] areas after you obtain your Authority . Come to the Sanctuary of the Watchers whenever you break into the Realm of Black Hole or gain more achievements in this law in order for you to take on the test to become an Imperial Lord . \"","The voice of the General was filled with power as Noah seriously nodded while voicing out .","\"I’ll be sure to do so when I am ready, General Zadan!\"","The General nodded at Noah’s words as he turned to Princess and completely changed his demeanor, patting her head as his body also began to fade away .","\"Try not to cause any more commotions, Little Anna . \" The voice was filled with love and care as he faded away .","\"Un . \" The veiled Imperial Princess nodded as she watched the expert disappear, still keeping her shy demeanor until the General left .","Noah breathed out silently as he saw the figures of powerful experts of the Realm of Black Hole come and go, but his breath had to come to a stop as he heard a telepathic message from the same disappearing General that was extremely cold and domineering!","\"No matter what genius you are, I better not hear about you touching a single hair on Little Anna’s body . \"","RUMBLE!","The voice was perceptible only to him as the auras of powerful experts all but disappeared, the sighs of the two maids being heard behind them as the Princess turned towards Noah and spoke with none of the shyness she showed to the powerful General she called Uncle .","\"Haaa, you’ve benefited a lot while nearly getting me in trouble, Alexander . \"","Noah heard this sonorous voice filled with power as he smiled and replied . \"I told you that I would owe you a favor, and I’ll be sure to honor it . \"","\"Mmm . I know you’re anxious to continue looking at the techniques you received from the Inheritance so I won’t keep you for long . I’ll be returning to the castle to make sure my old man doesn’t rescind my freedom again . \" The veiled Anna looked towards Maya and Raya as they each nodded while giving careful looks to Noah, the two of them having been surprised by him too many times in the past few days!","Anna placed her hands on the two maids as Noah could feel her mischievous eyes lock with his behind the veil, the area they were in beginning to vibrate rapidly as this Princess was about to take off along with her maids .","\"I’ll be sure to put such an interesting genius like you to use soon enough to reclaim that favor . Hold on to this and wait for my call~\"","BOOM!","Noah only heard a sonic boom as the three figures in front of him disappeared, his hand grabbing onto a glimmering green-gold medallion the princess had left behind before she streaked away .","Like this, the commotion that played out in the Imperial Library which caused multiple experts at the Realm of Black Hole to come check out resolved itself, leaving Noah some time to himself as he expectantly looked towards the abilities contained in the Inheritance of the Law of Life, as well as he himself checking out the Primeval tree that was taking root within his Nebula!"]},{"number":649,"title":"Chapter 649: Chapter 648","paragraphs":["Chapter 648: 648","On top of {The Doctrine of Life}, the Inheritance he received from the third floor of Imperial Library included numerous other skills that were being classified into a skill tree and an Absolute Skill in his stat panel.","His eyes shone with ever-increasing brilliance as he teleported away from the skies near the Imperial Library and appeared in the mountains where Master Zeke had led them through to go towards the Devouring Hells Rift, hiding his aura and body as he went down towards the thick trees abundant with greenery all around them.","\"Ahh...\" He couldn't help but release a comfortable breath as he came in contact with the abundant vegetation of the mountain he went down in, his newly gained essence of Life brimming as the grasses around him became greener and flowers bloomed not too far away!","He felt the vibrant life force around him as his eyes glanced at the other skills that came with the techniques of the Law of Life, starting with the Absolute Skill.","<strong><<Life's Apostle>> :: An absolute skill utilized by a being proficient in the Ultimate Law of Life. Abilities include [Life Essence Endowment], [Law Resonance and Enhancement] [Ultra Speed Regeneration],[Life Link], and [Origin Repair]. </strong>","A set of gorgeous abilities contained in an Absolute Skill laid out in front of his eyes as he went through their details with much enthusiasm. [Ultra Speed Regeneration] was fairly straight forward, granting the user the capability to rapidly heal and regenerate at the expense of Life Essence, with the effect only becoming more monstrous the more of the Law of Life one comprehended.","[Law Resonance and Enhancement] was another unique one that explained why the primeval tree within his Origin caused a reaction with the Origins of other laws, this ability actually showing the supremacy of an Ultimate Law!","<strong>[Law Resonance and Enhancement] :: An Ultimate Law stands above all those underneath it, where the being who cultivates it becomes able to traverse through all lesser laws with great speed. +500% to Universal Law Comprehension and Assimilation, +500% to the abilities and effectiveness of all lesser laws. (The skill is currently being enhanced by the [Life] ability under the [Primeval Tree of Old- Yggdrasil].) </strong>","A great boost, and one that simply made Noah even more terrifying as he saw the rate at which his Fire and Water spun increased even more, with the other Origins of Laws also increasing at a more rapid rate.","There was also the sentence in parenthesis that explained how the enormous boosts of the ability were coming from the Skill Tree that Noah had not viewed fully yet, but had simply dumped all the required skill points into as whatever effects it had were being fully given out even at this moment. But he would fully go over this new skill tree with the shocking name of [Primeval Tree of Old- Yggdrasil] later, as he would first focus on the abilities under the Absolute Skill.","Next up was the ability of [Origin Repair] that was even more straightforward as it gave a being comprehending the Law of Life the capability to repair Origins!","Such a thing was extremely rare, and Life Law Masters were a rare class that was much wanted in all factions. Noah thought about a certain Old Man in the Novus Galaxy as he looked at the descriptions of [Origin Repair], but his eyes moved to the last two abilities that just seemed to shine more than any others.","<strong>[Life Essence Endowment] :: The user can utilize their comprehension in the Law of Life to release endowment over a certain area, being able to cause the Revitalization and Enhancement of this area as all beings within it experience the vibrant essence of life. The ability can only be utilized over areas that the user has control of. An Endowed Area gains the boosts of +1000% Increased Atmospheric Essence, +500% Increased Universal Law Essence, +500% Increased Universal Laws Comprehension, and +100% Increased Life Force for all creatures residing in this area after a certain amount of time. (The skill is currently being enhanced by the [Life] ability under the [Primeval Tree of Old- Yggdrasil] Skill Tree.) </strong>","<strong>[Life Link] :: The user can connect their life essence with another being of a similar existence. Once linked, they are able to expand their individual strengths and draw them together in a union, allowing them to achieve untold power. (The skill is currently being enhanced by the [Life] ability under the [Primeval Tree of Old- Yggdrasil] Skill Tree.) </strong>","<strong>...!!!</strong>","Life Link was something unique that might have a use in the future, but [Life Essence Endowment] was the thing that made Noah's eyes tremble with power as he thought of the possibilities!","The Atmospheric Essence boost...the Universal Law Essence boost and comprehension...the increase in Life Force! It all showed boundless possibilities with far-reaching effects depending on how it was used...","But whatever possibilities he thought of in the Nexus Galaxy, he could not carry them out here as from the details of [Life Essence Endowment] that granted enormous boosts to an Endowed Area, he could only use this skill on an area that was considered under his control!","So he could not do anything in the Nexus Galaxy, but his other body in the Novus Galaxy...","---","In the Novus Galaxy, a star shaking green light just recently died down as his body in the Infinite Realm just finished cultivating using {The Doctrine of Life} and establishing his own Primeval Tree within his origin, feeling the abundant strength as he teleported above the Infinite Realm while thinking about the newly gained [Life Essence Endowment].","He could utilize this skill on a World or Realm he was connected to, but why stop there?!","His eyes were shining with a gold-green l.u.s.ter as an idea took root in his mind, sending a shocking message to the core of the Novus Galaxy thereafter.","\"With my connection to the Infinite Realm and the Realm's connection to you, can the Novus Galaxy be considered something under my control?\"","[In a sense. You want to try...?]","The core of the Novus Galaxy already knew of the abilities Noah had received from the <<Life's Apostle>> Absolute Skill, and saw the grandness and craziness in Noah wanting to try on something that was simply too massive!","Any other being that learned the techniques of the Law of Life and could utilize [Life Essence Endowment] would most likely be able to use this technique over a small specified area the size of a room, or at most a house as such a skill used enormous amounts of essence to put in practice.","Even General Zadan, the Black Hole expert who came when Noah caused the commotion in the Imperial Library- told him that he would be sought after for the ability to [Endow] area after he reached Authority in the law of Life, which meant that the span of an area that Life Law masters could endow must have been extremely minuscule, and was only at a decent level after they passed the 50% mark in the Law of Life that they could utilize the skill proficiently.","It was a skill that granted ridiculous boosts to the Endowed Area, and thus its cost was also naturally just as high! Yet Noah did not want to try out this skill over an area the size of a house or even a football field, or even a World or a Realm at that...","He wanted to cast [Life Essence Endowment] over an entire Galaxy!","...!!!","[It would normally be an impossible thing, but with Infinite Mana...what is to stop you?]","RUMBLE!","Raging waves of fate and chaos erupted out just from the daring thought of this, Noah's figure disappearing from the Infinite Realm as he teleported to the area in the Letalis Expanse that Aldrich had shattered some time ago.","His eyes couldn't hold in his excitement as golden-green lights vibrantly shone from them, his body being enveloped in the essence of a Grand Controller as he stepped into the boundary of the Novus Galaxy and went outside of it!","WAA!","His body felt the pervading darkness and terrifying might of the Chaotic Void for the first time as he stepped out, the essence of a Grand Controller protecting him with ease as he turned around to observe a barely discernible barrier of an entire Galaxy.","His hands lay on this barrier of the Novus Galaxy as he was about to do something wild, something that nobody else in the Dark Universe ever thought of doing, something that even the most powerful beings who delved into the law of Life could not do!","This was because multiple strict conditions were required to do it, and Noah met all of them! To be in control of the area he wanted to apply the shocking skill to? Check. To have the mana required to carry it out? Check. To cast a skill capable of affecting an entire Galaxy? Big f.u.c.k.i.n.g check!","He could do it, and so he did.","With his hands placed on the Boundary of the Novus Galaxy, he called out simply as a smile erupted on his face, a shockingly luminous light beginning to shine out in the Chaotic Void.","[Life Essence Endowment].","A single skill.","A burst of glimmering green light.","The rest...is history.","RUUUUUUUUUUMBLEEEEE!!!"]},{"number":650,"title":"Chapter 650: Chapter 649","paragraphs":["Chapter 649: 649","RUUUUUUUUUUMBLEEEEE!!!","In the Chaotic Void where the Novus Galaxy lay, intense vibrations were quaking out as an aura of immensity came to fruition .","It wasn’t an aura of a powerful being or an attack, but the pure aura of Mana that was just being used in obscene amounts!","With the successful activation of the [Life Essence Endowment] ability as all its conditions were met, a pure and blinding green light had begun to permeate from the boundary where Noah laid his hands as it began to spread out rapidly .","Inside his very Origin where a Primeval Tree had taken root, his Nebulae was trembling as the immense amount of mana coursed through it and into the Tree, and this Tree was shooting off the enormous amounts of Life Essence required to bring the [Life Essence Endowment] ability to full fruition over its target that was an entire Galaxy!","To make this possible, a ridiculous amount of Life Essence was required, and the Primeval Tree budding in Noah’s Nebula was only at the stage of 5% comprehension in the Law of Life, and had not grown to a stage where it could freely release such vast amounts of Life Essence in such a short period of time .","Yet it was being forced to do so as the Primeval Tree took the endless Mana from Noah’s Nebula and did something it normally would not do- it directly converted his mana into Life Essence as the ancient tree simply acted like a funnel, taking in one form of energy and converting it another!","Normally, one would have to absorb the essence of their surroundings, which was the essence of the universe, in order for this to be converted into the essence of a law as one gained more and more comprehension . One could even progress faster in a law if they were in a location dense with that law’s particles, similar to the Law Spaces present in Noah’s Infinite Realm .","This was why Noah could not simply use his endless mana and pump it into a particular law until it reached 100% comprehension, as that was not how one could traverse through the laws- the essence of the surrounding universe was required, and this was why they were called ’universal laws’!","Yet at this moment, the amount of essence required to carry out the [Life Essence Endowment] could simply not be absorbed enough from the surrounding space, and as the ancient tree simply had not grown enough to have the reserves of Life Essence to carry out the skill at this moment, it had to take the next available source of energy- which was Noah’s own mana as it endlessly pumped out Life Essence to bring to fruition the skill that met all of its requirements .","This caused for a shocking scene that should not have been possible, where as the ancient tree pulsed and released more and more essence, its branches became even thicker and more numerous as resplendent leaves grew, each one only making the release of Life Essence faster as in Noah’s stat panel- one could shockingly observe the percentage of mastery in the Law of Life rising at a visible rate every second!","5 . 5% . . . 6% . . . 6 . 5% . . .","The surrounding Chaotic Void quaked as the essence nearby rushed towards Noah and into the Primeval Tree, but it made a very low percentage as his mana went to provide more than 95% of what was required .","WAAA!","A magisterial occurrence was happening at this moment as the ecstatic light of Life fully erupted out with wild abandon, being fueled by endless mana as it went on to cover an entire Galaxy!","---","In a region unknown Light Years away, an Entity was floating near an extremely dangerous area in the Chaotic Void that held horrendous gravitational forces which would easily tear apart the defense of being multiple levels above the Nebula Rank .","This Entity was actually floating next to an enormous Black Hole as his gigantic figure seemed smaller than a grain of sand, a Black Hole so large that it was a few thousand Light Years in size!","To understand the sheer grandness of this, one must recall that 1 Light Year was 6 Trillion Miles . A small Galaxy could range at about a radius of a few thousand Light Years to tens of thousands of Light Years or even more, and there were actually numerous Black Holes within any Galaxy you came across .","This could be a lesson to some, but there were varying numbers and sizes of Black Holes in every galaxy, with many stellar black holes being very difficult to even detect . Yet this Black Hole that covered the sight of this entity neared the size of a few thousand light years! That was a few thousand light years times 6 Trillion just to understand this in terms of miles!","Such a sizable Black Hole would have been enough to release a shocking gravitational force that would have sucked in anything entering its fringes, yet a unique power seemed to exist that caused the terrifying effects of this Black Hole to only reach a few million miles away, its fearsome force actually not expanding thereafter! Only when one entered its peripheries would they feel its terrifying force . . .","Even this Entity with his extremely large stature was extremely minuscule in front of this Black Hole, yet his body and soul were not ruptured or destroyed by the terrifying forces being released from it as he entered its range .","He was ever so slowly using his essence to get closer into the Black Hole while also trying not to be completely absorbed and turned to dust by it, his gaze actually locked on to a glistening red page that seemed to be ignoring the horrendous forces of the Black Hole and was floating peacefully in its periphery .","The entity was risking his life as his face seemed extremely annoyed at the location that this shocking page, this page from the Book of Ruination- chose to hide at!","He had already been trying to go towards it for the past days, the current page he held leading him to this location as he got ready to obtain two pages from the Book of Ruination . Yet at this point, this shocking Entity had to come to a stop as he looked towards a certain region, his head turning back as he seemed to barely glimpse the instantaneous shine of a brilliant green light .","\"Hmm?\"","His interest was piqued as he had lived for many years in the Chaotic Void, and he knew what a light such as that blinking from such vast distances in the Chaotic Void meant .","\"Which fool is using such a large amount of mana right now?\"","The shocking question was more to himself as he wondered, the flash of light he observed being something that would only come about from a powerful entity utilizing a terrible skill which could be a final attack to release a force strong enough to obliterate a Galaxy without even going inside it to search for its vulnerable core!","\"Did one of those puny Galactic Rulers overstep their boundaries and anger an Entity capable of freely releasing their essence like this? Hmmm...\"","The Entity was curious about this light as he saw it fading away, where he knew that if he chose to follow it at this moment, he would be able to observe the shocking scene of its origin . But he was so close to another page from the Book of Ruination as he shook his head and spoke in a somber tone .","\"Oh well, no matter . Whatever galaxy rises and falls is of no consequence, being something that has happened countless times over the eons . What truly matters is strength, and the Tools of Ruination . . . that is strength!\"","RUMBLE!","His body shone with a unique luster as he proceeded forward, his eyes focused once more on the glimmering page floating innocently not too far from him .","The light that this Entity had observed was clear in his eyes because he was actually not too many Light Years away, where he was actually in a unique position of being able to follow the source of the light to its Origin .","It just so happened that other Entities like it also observed this light, but it was even more brief for them as they were a countless number of light years away, and even if they wanted to follow it to its source, they couldn’t!","But each of the Entities reacted in their own ways as they wondered- just which entity was so freely using such large amounts of mana that would cause for the light of whatever ability they used to flash countless Light Years away?","This would forever remain a question to them and in the future, some would even greatly regret that they had not done all they could to check the source of this light on this fateful day!"]},{"number":651,"title":"Chapter 651: Chapter 650","paragraphs":["Chapter 650: 650","Throughout the Novus Galaxy, waves of immense essence were spreading out wildly as they permeated through every planet and Realm, through every crevice and hole!","Waves of immense green light would wash over the expansive areas, as what followed thereafter was an abundant emergence of essence as the Atmospheric Essence, Universal Law Essence, Universal Laws Comprehension, and the Life Force for all creatures residing in the Novus Galaxy were all increased heavily .","In the Central Realm, the first Infernal Lord was overlooking the vast numbers of Infernals now freely moving around the Realm without any restriction, their essence of destruction having been reduced as they now tried to forge their own path .","Yet she felt the immense green wave wash over her as the surroundings erupted with essence of all different colors, feeling her Origin thrum with excitement as she felt abundant life force course through her!","\" . . . !\"","Even though she was a vessel that the Novus Galaxy could use to more easily express her will, she still wasn’t aware that Noah had begun doing something crazy which would cause this- so she was just as surprised as every other being in the Novus Galaxy .","Her eyes shook as she looked towards the vast Central Realm and saw this pervading green light filled with the aura of life washing over everything, the already abundant essence in the Central Realm bursting out melodiously as it approached dangerous levels where the particles nearly became solidified to be visible to the naked eye!","In the Infinite Realm, Barbatos was looking at her army of Undead she was raising as she now saw their bodies thrumming with the essence of Life, their bones becoming tougher than the strongest metals as they glanced towards her with glee .","She felt the abundant life force erupt within her as well as she observed the changes in the surroundings, receiving messages from numerous other Harbingers of Sin that this was occurring nearly everywhere!","Barbatos and all the other beings under Noah felt this enormous change as their minds only had a single culprit that could cause all of this, but it still did not prevent them from being overly shocked as the phenomenon this time was simply too enormous and large scale .","+1000% Increased Atmospheric Essence, +500% Increased Universal Law Essence, +500% Increased Universal Laws Comprehension, and +100% Increased Life Force for all creatures residing in the Novus Galaxy!","Such were the crazy boosts being applied throughout the Novus Galaxy, and the being conducting this skill in question was undergoing enormous changes himself as around him, abundant lines of fate wanted to rush towards him even though he had already met the 10 million max capacity, so the even wilder Chaos particles rushed towards him in hundreds of thousand as what he was currently doing at this moment was too significant and affected too many things .","THUMP!","As Noah felt the Primeval Tree within his Nebula pulse with even more strength and grow ever larger while budding even more branches and leaves, he saw that his comprehension in the Law of Chaos was shooting up faster with every second as he shockingly saw it would soon reach 100% in just a matter of seconds...","He had nearly 7 million Chaos Particles just a few minutes ago, yet he was now already past 9 million as he neared the complete comprehension of 100% of a Supreme Law, gaining more than 3 million Chaos Particles in just a few seconds as the effects of the [Life Essence Endowment] continued to permeate throughout the Novus Galaxy!","It was a maddening sight that would make all geniuses go green with envy as this was not all, the even more shocking thing was his progression in the Ultimate Law of Life that was even harder than a Supreme Law to traverse .","Within his vibrant Nebula, the roots of the Primeval Tree were stably spreading throughout the forged stars, its branches growing in numbers and size as the trunk only became thicker, its leaves shining with all sorts of colors as it was absorbing the essence in the surrounding, the essence of laws, and even more of Noah’s own mana .","As it cycled all of this essence to provide the Life Essence required to carry out the [Life Essence Endowment] skill over the span of an entire Galaxy, the percentage of the Law of Life was showing a rapid increase in Noah’s stat panel as it had already risen to 25%!","Let’s take a step back here and breathe a bit . . .","One might not realize it after watching Noah’s feats so many times, but comprehending laws was actually very hard!","It took a great deal of effort and time! This was especially so for an Ultimate Law, where powerful entities spent their entire lifetimes without being able to master it .","Yet Noah had comprehended 5% the first time he initiated its cultivation, and on the same day as he cast a skill that affected something as grand as an entire galaxy, the comprehension on his stat panel rose by 20%! He had ridiculously garnered over 25% in an Ultimate Law just a few hours after he began cultivating in it!","Where were those that called themselves geniuses? Where were those who thought they were talented?","They would pale in comparison to Noah as he stood in a realm of Genius that could not even be classified!","But this wasn’t all! The Ultimate Law of Life still had another ability contained in the Absolute Skill that dealt with other laws .","[Law Resonance and Enhancement] :: An Ultimate Law stands above all those underneath it, where the being who cultivates it becomes able to traverse through all lesser laws with great speed . +500% to Universal Law Comprehension and Assimilation, +500% to the abilities and effectiveness of all lesser laws . (The skill is currently being enhanced by the [Life] ability under the [Primeval Tree of Old- Yggdrasil] . )","This singular skill meant that as he neared 100% comprehension in the Law of Chaos because of the vast amounts of chaos his action of Endowing an entire Galaxy would bring, his other Laws were shooting up at extreme speeds as well!","Nothing as fast as the Law of Chaos, but as the Primeval Tree within Noah’s Nebula pulsed and drank more essence, the Nebulae of the Laws of Fire and Water forged even more stars within them as the Origin cores of Light, Dark, Earth, and Air spun and grew ever larger .","Aether particles rampantly entered as the layers of Space and the fabric of Time shook . . . every single law he cultivated being enhanced rapidly on this day as the [Life Essence Endowment] skill completed its effect!","As the luminous green light covering an entire Galaxy died down, the man responsible was shining with resplendent arrays of light in the Chaotic Void as he somehow managed to come out with the biggest boon than everyone else . . ."]},{"number":652,"title":"Chapter 652: Chapter 651","paragraphs":["Chapter 651: 651","THUMP!","Noah seemed to have fallen asleep for a long time, the skill he cast having forcefully made his consciousness shut down as he was waking up slowly while he felt abundant strength coursing through him .","Both his bodies had experienced something similar as his body floating in the Chaotic Void right outside of the Novus Galaxy was the one that shone with the most glimmering colors, his body as Alexander in the Nexus Galaxy using all possible covert abilities before he inexplicably passed out to make sure that his rapid comprehension of multiple laws wasn’t noticed by anyone else .","He didn’t know that because of his single cast of a skill that affected an entire Galaxy, a bright green light had shone for an instant as it acted like a beacon! Powerful beings that were termed Entities observed this light as they mistook him for someone on their stage because of the scale of this one skill he had cast!","The only saving grace was that either these Entities were too far away to even be able to track back this source of light, or the one that was near was simply too busy with their own goals . But ignorance was bliss as he continued on without any worries . . .","Both of his bodies from the two different Galaxies rose as Noah saw a shimmering ancient tree vibrantly sprinkling green essence into his Nebula and everything around him, his body feeling immensely heavy and tout with strength as he glanced at his stat panel .","[Noah Osmont][Title(s): Infernal Lord(Variant), Grand Controller(Fate),Grand Controller(Chaos), Controller(Fire, Water)]","[Trait(s) : Infinite Mana, Protagonist(Incomplete)]","[Bloodline(s): Vampyre Progenitor]","[Primeval Tree of Old- Yggdrasil: Young Tree Stage]","[Aether Particles(s) : 8,926,354]","[Karma Line(s) : 4,145,526]","[Fate Line(s) : 10,000,000]","[Chaos Particle(s) : 10,000,000]","[Origin Core(s) : Light-5, Dark-5, Fire-10, Water-10, Earth-8, Air-8]","[Domain(s) : Life, Aether, Karma, Fate, Chaos, Light, Dark, Space, Time, Fire, Water, Earth, Air]","[Vitality: NEBULA]","[Focus: ∞ ]","[Strength: NEBULA]","[Law(s) : Life-25%, Aether- 89%, Karma-41%,Fate-100%,Chaos-100%, Light-52%, Dark-52%, Space-61%, Time-57%, Fire-100%, Water-100%, Earth-85%, Air-85%]","[Authority(s) : Aether Lord, Fate Lord, Chaos Lord, Space Lord, Time Lord, Light Lord, Dark Lord, Flame Lord, Water Lord, Earth Lord, Air Lord]","He had cast a single that affected an entire galaxy as his mind was forced to take a nap, and he woke up to find out that he had become a Controller in another Supreme Law as he also gained the authority of multiple other laws!","’Ayy, I’m becoming too much of a genius!’ Taking a nap and waking up multiple times stronger, Noah could not help but let his thoughts run wild as he laughed .","His stat panel was vastly different with many laws being boosted simultaneously, his body sensing a unique aura as the essence of a Grand Controller of two laws swam freely around him .","Being a Controller in two normal Laws and a Grand Controller of two Supreme Laws was something he didn’t know if anyone else had done, but it boasted many questions when it came to using |Intent| to utilize the essence of these laws as a Controller .","As he continued forward in the future, would he simply be limited to |Intents| of two words or is he now able to utilize |Intent| with an even larger number of words? There were many things left for him to experiment on but he set his eyes below him where a shimmering Galaxy now lay, a strong essence of Life permeating throughout this Galaxy as it became the first to be [Endowed] in the long eons that passed!","This meant there were a great deal of things to watch out for, the boosts for the [Life Essence Endowment] skill being so enormous that Noah knew the growth for the creatures of this Galaxy would be simply monstrous as they lived in an area so extremely abundant in the essence of an Ultimate Law, as well as the boosts of Atmospheric Essence on top of denser Universal Laws Essence and Increased Comprehension .","\"Haaa...\"","He gave a content sigh in the Chaotic Void as he saw nothing had gone wrong, with many beings simply just beginning to acclimate to the wondrous changed environment they were in as Noah knew in any normal creatures were living in this Galaxy, that was soon about to change as nearly everyone would soon become ’awakened’!","With such an abundant Life Essence granted to them and the heavily enhanced essence of the Galaxy, even if a being did not want to- their bodies would naturally drink in the immense amounts of essence as they awakened to a new power .","[Not just that, with such an increased concentration of Life Force and Universal Law Essence, the essence of a Galaxy required to awaken Traits was elevated by a large factor, meaning that the Traits born in beings will be of high quality and even more abundant than other Galaxies . ]","The voice of the Novus Galaxy rang in his mind as the effects of Noah’s actions were still being studied, the wide ranging results they would provide being something he would continue to monitor and observe with the passage of time!","He continued to observe the vibrant essence and changes of the Novus Galaxy from the Chaotic Void as he looked at his stat panel again, this time wanting to observe the other side of the Inheritance of the Law of Life .","Naturally, it was the Skill Tree that was responsible for the ridiculous boosts that [Life Essence Endowment] had, the one under the name of [Primeval Tree of Old- Yggdrasil]!","[Primeval Tree of Old- Yggdrasil] :: A skill tree that includes a set of techniques meant only for a being that holds a growing Primeval Tree within their Origin . Abilities include [Life](5/5), [Yggdrasil](5/5), [Primeval Propitious Physique Forging ](5/5), [Ashes to Ashes](5/5) .","[Life](5/5) :: All abilities pertaining to the Law of Life are enhanced by ten times . (+5 Skill Point boost increased enhancement from two to ten)","[Yggdrasil](5/5) :: An ability that most beings cannot keep active for longer than a few minutes because of its immense mana requirements, but a worthy ability of a user of the Law of Life . Project your comprehension in the Law of Life outwards as you take on the form of an ancient tree lost in the vicissitudes of time . In this form, the user gains +3000% Physical and Soul Defense, +3000% to All Damage, +5000% Health and Mana Regeneration, +3000% Increased Area of Effect on all Abilities, +3000% Increased Attack Speed, +100% Universal Laws Resistance Penetration, +100% to all Universal Laws Resistance, +10% Vitality Returned Each Time an Enemy is hit by an Attack . All enemies struck by your branches gain the [Withered] status effect . All Allies struck by your branches gain the [Boosted Life Force] status effect . The user will also gain a Life Shield after every 10 minutes this ability is kept active . (The skill is currently being enhanced by the [Life] ability . )","\" . . \"","’This . . . I...’","Speechless .","For the first time in a while, Noah was genuinely speechless as he stared at horrendous percentages of a single skill that was being boosted ten times by another skill!"]},{"number":653,"title":"Chapter 653: Chapter 652","paragraphs":["Chapter 652: 652","Noah could not even finish looking at the remaining two skills as he stared dumbly at the one simply termed [Yggdrasil]!","Even he himself was out of words as he stared at the percentage of numbers that simply looked unreal in front of him, the skill called [Yggdrasil] being simply too monstrous .","The abilities were ridiculous to begin with, but the greatest root and the cause of the ridiculous numbers were the skill points that took the single skill that was called [Life] from just increasing the effectiveness of all abilities under the Law of Life from 2 to 10!","This was the reason why the boosts of something like [Life Essence Endowment] were at a crazy number like +1000% Increased Atmospheric Essence, +500% Increased Universal Law Essence, +500% Increased Universal Laws Comprehension, and +100% Increased Life Force for all creatures residing in this area after a certain amount of time . It was because originally, the numbers were respectively +100%, +50%, +50%, and +10% Increased Life Force of all creatures .","Yet even this original percentage increase was sought after in a Life Law Master, and if they utilized the [Life] ability without Noah’s skill points, they could even double the effectiveness . But Noah could ridiculously use the ability at 10 times effectiveness because of the unique features that he held!","This stayed true for the ability of [Yggdrasil], its crazy boosts in the thousands being explained this way .","He understood most of the percentages and the boosts they gave, but he was still unclear on the last portion of the skill that stated- [All enemies struck by your branches gain the [Withered] status effect . All Allies struck by your branches gain the [Boosted Life Force] status effect . The user will also gain a Life Shield after every 10 minutes this ability is kept active . ]","His eyes shone as he focused more on the three things mentioned .","[Withered] :: A status effect where the one affected will momentarily leak out their life essence as their bodies become withered .","[Booster Life Force] :: A status effect where the one affected will overflow with life force momentarily as injuries are healed at a rapid rate .","[Life Shield] :: A circular shield of Life essence that forms 10 minutes after [Yggdrasil] is activated . It can take in a set amount of damage before it can be broken . Those within the life shield experience constant healing and rejuvenation .","’Sheesh...’","Just the status effects given by the skill and the Life Shield were powerful by themselves, but they simply added on to the complete insane ability that was [Yggdrasil] .","He looked forward to the time he could use this as he expected a lot from it in battle!","His shock simmered down as his eyes went towards the remaining two skills, but even they did not hold back in their ridiculousness compared to the first .","[Primeval Propitious Physique Forging ](5/5) :: Those embarking on the Ultimate Law of Life cannot profane it by having such weak bodies . This ability allows the user to forge their body into the ancient Primeval Propitious Physique, which when cultivated to completion grants one an unfettered body that can freely traverse through Galaxies and the Chaotic Void, among many more possibilities . (+5 Skill Point boost grants 50% enhancement to the speed of forging) . (The skill is currently being enhanced by the [Life] ability, increasing enhancement to 500%)","[Ashes to Ashes](5/5) :: An ability that is incomplete, with its counterpart, [Dust to Dust], lying with the techniques under the Law of Death . This ability allows the user to remain alive for as long as a drop of their blood remains, being capable of complete health regeneration as long as mana is provided thereafter . When the user learns of the techniques under the Law of Death, the !#$%@#$ Skill, [Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust], shall be born . (The skill is currently being enhanced by the [Life] ability)","He carefully read over the two skills as he had a lot to look forward to when it came to [Ashes to Ashes], this skill having a grand name with unknown implications when he thought about its counterpart that he would obtain whenever he learned the Ultimate Law of Life . He would be able to utilize the star shaking name of [Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust] thereafter!","But the other skill made him even more excited as it was actually something he could utilize right now, the [Primeval Propitious Physique Forging] that allowed him to forge his body into the Primeval Propitious Physique .","To get the full benefits, he passed back through the boundary of the Novus Galaxy as he reappeared inside and left behind the Chaotic Void, sensing the abundant essence and Life Force that he was the cause of as he floated in the starry space .","In this starry space near the boundary of the Novus Galaxy and in the hidden mountains outside the Imperial Citadel of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm of the Nexus Galaxy, two of Noah’s bodies got in a seated lotus position as a single word was uttered .","[Primeval Propitious Physique Forging] .","RUMBLE!","Waves of essence erupted out as dense Life Force converged around him, this life force moving in mysterious ways as it came to form extremely colorful green runic circles that swirled around Noah’s body .","The green runic circles had ancient designs as they shone with luster, multiple of them forming around all of Noah’s body as they rapidly spun and caused the abundant Life Essence to enter every part of Noah’s body down to the cellular level, where some cells shone with a brilliant luster as they were strengthened while at the same time causing destruction to some cells as they quickly imploded!","A cycle of destruction and reformation, that was what the [Primeval Propitious Physique Forging] technique provided as all it would leave behind when cultivated sufficiently was a Physique of shocking proportions, a Physique that would allow a being to move unhindered in the Chaotic Void as if it was his home, as a being garnered a body filled with such strong vitality and strength that he could take on powerful experts purely on the strength of his body!","And Noah . . . could progress through at 500% speed while using this skill because of his skill points .","OOOM!","He felt the pleasurable feeling of old skin and muscle falling off as even stronger muscle reformed and even smoother skin returned, the process of destruction and reformation actually not giving a net painful effect as he rather enjoyed cultivating the Primeval Propitious Physique!","In his stat panel, a whole other section had appeared as it displayed wondrous details .","[Noah Osmont] . . .","... .","[Body Cultivation: Primeval Propitious Physique- . 0005%]","A long and arduous journey of cultivating and strengthening his body to insane degrees had begun, even though its length was bound to be 5 times less than everyone else as he traversed through it at shocking speeds .","He could choose to have his clones cultivate it in the Time Space of the Infinite Realm as he used means very few beings could utilize, with their results being something that would shock the forces in the coming future .","As he cultivated the Primeval Propitious Physique with both his bodies and watched the newly appearing percentage go up, ancient green runic circles swirled around his body as Noah officially considered his perception and review of everything he gained under the Inheritance of the Law of Life completed for now!","There was still much to experiment with and observe when it came to the effects of [Life Essence Endowment] over the days to come, as well as monitoring the strength of his body as he forged this new physique .","But he felt like he was heading in the right direction of strength as he had a wide smile everytime he saw the +3000% and +5000% percentage boosts in a particular skill!","He really itched for an enemy to come, he really itched to try [Yggdrasil]!"]},{"number":654,"title":"Chapter 654: Chapter 653","paragraphs":["Chapter 653: 653","At the center of the Imperial Citadel, a terrifying force of power that oversaw the entire Brightgold Monarchy Realm and the Nexus Galaxy itself lay .","To enter further in towards the center where the enormous archaic castles stood strong, one would have to be granted permission or have a sufficient rank which allowed them to do so, where if you wandered in without permission- you might have your life lost in the span of a few seconds!","Among the many archaic and grand castles in the Central region, in the largest one that shimmered with the colors of green and gold- one woman was walking across one of the many halls with vigor and strength not seen in many beings .","This largest castle was one of the many that a particularly powerful Household of the Imperial Citadel resided in- the Dannicus Household where the Imperial Adjudicator stemmed from!","This was the castle known as the Dannicus Fortress!","Above this archaic castle, one could observe a shimmering illusory flag being portrayed above it, the flag holding the symbol of a golden axe and a green sword crossing in a stellar fashion .","The woman walking within the halls of the Dannicus Fortress was naturally the Imperial Princess herself, Anna Lexalius Dannicus . Her two maids were sent away to prepare a few things as her veiled figure went towards the inner parts of the castle, passing through multiple doors as she took out an Emblem unique to her and shone it on a panel of a particularly large green-gold door, slowly walking through the opening pathway as she entered into a small room .","This room did not have much to boast, but it did have an exquisite table surrounded by six chairs, and the center of the table held a hexagonal dark crystal that shone with an enticing luster!","The moment that Anna entered this room, the dark crystal shone brightly as she pulled out one of the seats and watched as the light transformed into the shape of a strong figure of a man, a being that began to emanate a presence even though he was only being portrayed as an illusory image from this dark crystal!","\"My Little Anna...\" A strong voice that would have caused the legs of the strongest Generals to tremble rang out with extreme love and affection, looking towards the Imperial Princess with the eyes of a father that were filled with immense love and guilt .","\" . . . Hey Daddy . Where are you now?\" A small voice that seemed like it was coming from a being who could not harm even a fly came out of Anna, her veiled head looking towards the figure of her Father, the Imperial Adjudicator!","\"I’m in the Sanguine Galaxy right now, just about to finish establishing order across their realms as we get everything operational . Say, which gift do you want when I come back? They have resources that can promote a faster growth rate for both Laws and Traits here, oh and their food is...\" The Imperial Adjudicator was looking doting towards his daughter as he spoke, but he was interrupted when she shook her head lightly .","\"Daddy, my Trait is already powerful enough as it is and you know I get bored when I comprehend laws . But I did want to work on my Realm...\" Anna spoke as she seemed to have slight hesitation .","\"Oh, you want to enter the Realm of Black Hole?\" An expectant reply came from the illusory image of the Adjudicator as he said these words as if it was the simplest thing in the world!","\"Yeah, I wanted to quickly finish forging the required stars and then breakthrough, and I know we took over the Stellar Sky Galaxy that has treasures which easily allow one to forge stars . . . and I wanted to take a trip there...\"","RUMBLE!","\" . . . \"","Vibrant waves of power released from just the illusory figure at this moment as complete silence overcame the room!","\" . . . You want to step outside the Galaxy? Anna, just wait a few weeks for me . I’ll be back and I can personally take you wherever you want to go-\"","\"No daddy, I just wanna make a quick trip to grab the resources and I’ll be back . You can even send a few experts to accompany me if you’re worried . \"","\" . . . \" A stern silence was from the other end as the Adjudicator seemed to be thinking heavily, this simple question making him more thoughtful than when he discussed with Imperial Rulers on their management of Galaxies!","\"Please daddy, I’ve been cooped up in this castle since I was born and only just went out to see our Imperial Citadel . Nothing bad happened here, and now I just wanna explore another Galaxy while upgrading my realm to another stage...\" Anna spoke lightly with an imploring gaze as she thought about the incident her father might not have heard yet, her eyes glimmering behind the veil as a sigh could be heard from the illusory figure of the Imperial Adjudicator .","Anna looked expectantly towards it as she waited for an answer, and spoke one last time to erase any more reservations there could be!","\"You also know about my Trait, even Black Hole experts have a hard time dealing with me . . . you know I’ll be safe . \"","Sound words that shockingly could not be denied rang out, the illusory image putting on a thoughtful expression as a strong voice reverberated from it .","\"Alright, but only for a few days! You need to be in and out, and multiple Blessed and Law Masters will be escorting you!\"","\"Yay!\" Anna rose triumphantly in her seat as she jumped across the table and made a cute motion to hug the illusory image, hearing a sigh from it as she laughed happily .","\"You’re the best! I’ll let Maya and Raya know and start preparing now! Be safe in the Sanguine Galaxy!\"","Her figure bounced out of the room as she seemed to be filled with excitement, leaving behind a sighing father who felt like he was played .","\"Hmm . \" His expression straightened up as he stared around the simple room, sending out essence as it alerted numerous powerful experts in the Dannicus Fortress, numerous commands starting to be sent out .","In another location, the veiled Imperial Princess was walking across the halls of the castle with even more vigor, many thoughts coursing through her as she actually got permission to go out exploring outside of her Galaxy for the first time!","As she planned and prepared, the image of one particularly interesting and confident genius entered her mind as a devilishly cute smile crossed her lips, knowing who she would be taking towards this Stellar Sky Galaxy that held powerful resources to promote the forging of Stars in a Nebula as it created many Black Hole experts!"]},{"number":655,"title":"Chapter 655: Chapter 654","paragraphs":["Chapter 654: 654","Across the vast Dark Universe, there existed an unknown number of Galaxies, each with their own uniqueness and qualities .","Over the eons of time, some Galaxies developed in different directions as they obtained unique realms or resources, these differing resources and treasures being one of the major reasons why you had some powerful forces spreading their power to multiple Galaxies in the Dark Universe .","Some Galaxies had unique systems of power, others were blessed with realms that made traversing universal laws much easier, and you even had some with resplendent treasures that would cause the greed of any powerful force .","The treasures that caused greed were mostly ones that increased the realms of beings rapidly or increased law comprehension, and there was even an ancient myth that there existed Ultimate Treasures in some unique galaxies that granted Traits!","This caused some galaxies in the Dark Universe to be given more attention than most .","One particular Galaxy of interest was the Steller Sky Galaxy, a prominent and powerful Galaxy that was fought over by multiple forces intertwined with the Nexus Galaxy, the Fiends from the Burning Domains Galaxy being one of the bigger losers as the eventual winner was the dominant Imperial Adjudicator of the Nexus Galaxy!","The reason that many forces sought over the Stellar Sky Galaxy was for a rare treasure that was only fostered amongst unique stars present only in this Galaxy, the treasure known as the Effulgent Star Pearl!","The Effulgent Star Pearl was a unique treasure that allowed beings to easily forge stars in their Nebula, these treasures being birthed in planets known as Stellar Stars- and it was these treasures that allowed the power of the Nexus Galaxy to spread even further as they produced multiple Black Hole Realm experts over the past years since bringing the Stellar Sky Galaxy under their control .","This was the same the Galaxy that the Imperial Princess had just gotten permission to go to, and she sent word to one of the beings she would be taking right away as far from the Imperial Citadel in a mountainous region surrounded by trees, Alexander felt the crystal he received from her shine as her voice resounded out .","\"Boastful genius! The time has come for you to pay back that favor . Follow the signal of the Imperial Medallion I gave you and come over to my place . We’re going exploring!\" The commanding voice of the Imperial Princess filled with excitement rang out from the other end as Noah lifted up the medallion while numerous thoughts crossed his mind .","\"Exploring what, Princess?\" His words were light as he stretched his body and stood up, having just finished forging his body through using the [Primeval Propitious Physique Forging] ability .","His body felt like it was brimming with overwhelming strength as the density of his bones and muscles felt extremely heavy, yet at the same time, he knew he could move multiple times faster than before!","And this was just the initial stages of the Primeval Propitious Physique that he was now forging, the percentage in the stat panel not even having reached 1% yet .","\"The Stellar Sky Galaxy where they have treasures to quickly turn those in the Nebula Realm into the Realm of Black Hole . Hurry up or I’ll change my mind and leave you behind!\" The voice of Anna rang out again as Noah stood up abruptly and replied .","\"Coming!\"","BOOM!","A sonic boom could be heard as he disappeared into a streak of light, the words of the Princess being extremely enticing .","He thanked [Blind Luck] and [Memorable Visage] of the Protagonist Trait as this wondrous opportunity seemed to have fallen out of nowhere, even though he knew the princess said she would call for him just yesterday .","But the opportunity of using the Universal Rift of the Nexus Galaxy to explore another galaxy that held treasures that would quickly push beings in the realm of Black Hole? That was something he couldn’t say no to!","He looked at the direction of the signal that the Imperial Medallion given to him by the Princess released as he teleported multiple times while moving at great speeds, soon passing by the Imperial Library as he went further in land into the Imperial Citadel .","Everything around him was becoming richer and more exquisite as grand archaic castles of nobility populated his sight, slowing his advance as he went along the central golden-green road without making too much noise . The further in he went, the quieter the streets became as an aura of elegance and power permeated!","The Imperial Medallion that he was carrying seemed to be releasing some sort of signal that allowed none of the powerful auras of beings protecting these inner lands of the Imperial Citadel to stop him, his path continuing as passed numerous beings brimming with power along the path and he soon came upon the central archaic castle that the signal was leading to .","Numerous guards were lined up and down on the fortress-like wall of the Dannicus Household as Noah came to a stop, looking over each of the guards that were adorned with a spectacular set of armor as he stopped in front of an enormous fortress gate .","Each of the guards released powerful auras at the Nebula Realm, and he could see that just the two lead guards that had locked their eyes towards him were at the rank of Black Hole!","He saw these powerful pressures delve onto him as he was about to send a message in the medallion once more, but this was exactly when he felt movement as the enormous fortress gate in front of him opened .","OOONG!","With a grand air filled with majesty, what appeared after the opening on the gate of the Dannicus Castle was an exquisite Imperial Vessel clad in white and gold, numerous aurora-colored gems covering the outside!","This Imperial Carriage was being pulled by creatures Noah had seen in the Central Realm of his own Galaxy- Pegasi with grand white wings and luscious mane who released an aura of serenity and strength .","[Void Beast- Light Pegasus] :: A rare creature of the void that is proficient in the law of light . Currently tamed by the...","Details of the Nebula Rank Void Beasts pulling the Imperial Vessel flowed in front of Noah’s eyes as he kept Eyes of Truth active at all times, his gaze only being pulled away from the majestic beasts when the Imperial Vessel stopped not too far from him and opened along with a sonorous voice ringing out .","\"Come on now, we don’t have all day . \"","The voice of the Imperial Princess pulled Noah forward as he stepped into the Imperial Vessel to a grand sight inside of it, the Pegasi pulled it flapping their wings as it rose to the skies and shot off at rapid speeds!","At the area it just left, the gates of the Dannicus Household closed as the two guards at the Realm of Black Hole looked at each other .","\"Does His Highness know the Princess is inviting a guy to her ventures?\" One of the experts spoke in a low whisper as if he did want to be heard saying this .","\"Hmph, you want to be the one to tell him? Go ahead and sign your own death wish . \" The other guard replied with a rough voice as these two experts of high ranking continued sitting guard for the most powerful Household of the Brightgold Monarchy, and of the Nexus Galaxy by extension .","The Imperial Princess of this household had just embarked on an Imperial Vessel with a being holding two shocking Traits, this Vessel heading towards the Sanctuary of the Watchers where the Universal Rift lay, a grand and shocking adventure waiting for them!"]},{"number":656,"title":"Chapter 656: Chapter 655","paragraphs":["Chapter 655: 655","In the Imperial Vessel that was closely resembling a regal carriage, shockingly powerful personage were traveling with a being that was relatively not well known in the minds of the beings of the Nexus Galaxy as of right now .","This being currently held the name of Alexander, and he was looking at the Imperial Princess that many beings never even got the chance to be in the presence of all their lives while sitting opposite to her on the vessel being carried to the skies by Void Pegasi!","Anna was still veiled as always, but the colors of her clothes had changed as she adorned a red tight-fitting battle suit that was covered by a shimmering red and black cape which covered all the goods she was blessed with .","The Maids Maya and Raya were sitting beside the Princess as they tried not to stare at Alexander, occasionally sending telepathic messages to the Princess as they tried to dissuade her from taking an entire trip with this new being she considered a friend .","These two had only met a few days ago, yet they were now on a vessel that was heading towards the Sanctuary of the Watchers with the goal of exploring another Galaxy!","Yet every time the two maids raised their points, they were quickly shut down as Anna simply told them not to worry about it . The gaze of this Princess was as always on Alexander as she spoke with piercing eyes .","\"How come your life force is nearly five times what it was when we left you? You couldn’t have made even faster progress in the Law of Life right?\" Anna asked a question that puzzled her as she sensed the boundless aura of Life rampaging from Noah","On the Vessel, Noah was spreading his aura as he looked around him, noticing the great speeds the Void Pegasi were traversing as the enormous Imperial Citadel was just a far dot as they soon left the boundaries of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm .","\"Naturally, Princess . I was just cultivating the Primeval Propitious Physique that comes with the techniques of the Law of Life, it seems I’m also suited for body cultivation and have some skill extending to this as well . \" Noah spoke naturally as the veiled princess gave a light laugh, the two Maids Maya and Raya simply shaking their heads as they were now getting used to his boasting .","\"Very well, keep your secrets . We’re now stepping out of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm as we take a straight path to the Sanctuary of the Watchers, that being the last place we need to pass before we can take the Universal Rift towards the Stellar Sky Galaxy . \" Anna spoke languidly as she sent out her senses to their surroundings, their vessel finally passing through the boundary of the realm they were in as they appeared in the starry space of the Nexus Galaxy!","This would be the first time that Noah with his identity as Alexander stepped out of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm, his gaze bright as he looked all around him . The Princess noted his fascination with a sharp light as she continued .","\"What do you know about the Stellar Sky Galaxy?\"","Noah pondered this question thoughtfully before he replied, \"Not too much . Enlighten me, Princess . \"","\"Well...\"","A conversation continued in the exquisite Imperial Vessel that streaked towards the Sanctuary of the Watchers as Noah was given more information on the uniqueness of the Stellar Sky Galaxy and the Effulgent Star Pearls that were sought after, the Maids chipping in their knowledge every now and then as a fun atmosphere overtook the vessel, the beings within expectant for an adventure!","They traversed through the Nexus Galaxy as they passed countless worlds and Realms, the Void Pegasi pulling the Vessel shooting forth at Light Speed as great distances were covered in a short amount of time .","Occasionally, their Imperial Vessel even entered Teleportation Rifts that were set up all over the Nexus Galaxy to allow for faster transportation across vast distances, their party soon nearing the Sanctuary of the Watchers that surrounded an enormous aurora colored Universal Rift .","The Sanctuary of the Watchers was a mystical sight to come across, and extremely busy at that as numerous Vessels could be seen entering and leaving constantly . It was unique as it wasn’t a planet or realm, but an enormous structure the size of a world that surrounded the hundreds of miles long Universal Rift at the very center .","It was designed in a circular manner as ten enormous large humanoid statues were built on top of an obsidian disc facing towards the Rift, these statues having wide halls and rooms as they acted like the base which beings moved in!","A large black obsidian disc the size of a small world enclosing a Universal Rift in the center, 10 enormous Statues built upon this obsidian as they focused their gold-green eyes and faces towards it . This was the Sanctuary of the Watchers!","This was the location that numerous Vessels visited daily as they were assigned to specific Watchers before being granted permission to use the Universal Rift to explore the Dark Universe .","Today, it was particularly busy as in the central area of the exquisite structure that was the Sanctuary of the Watchers- ten Watchers were assigned to a single departing party, with a group of Guards being prepared to escort this party on their exploration outside of the Nexus Galaxy .","Those considered Guards for this mission were shocking to say the least, where among those included- 10 were in the Black Hole Realm, with double the amount being at the Nebula Realm!","A collection of Blessed and Law Masters were prepared for the journey that a single being wanted to take, and such a powerful defensive escort force was created because of the identity of the being stepping out of the Nexus Galaxy for the first time .","As the unique Imperial Vessel containing this party arrived at the Sanctuary of the Watchers, many beings finally understood the reason for the seriousness and the commotion around this grand place for the last few hours!","Powerful Blessed, Law Masters, and even other Watchers looked on at the unexpected sight of the Imperial Vessel with the design of the golden axe and green sword that represented the House of Dannicus land on the Sanctuary, simply waiting to be received and granted the permission before setting off into the Universal Rift . . ."]},{"number":657,"title":"Chapter 657: Chapter 656","paragraphs":["Chapter 656: 656","General Zadan had been notified the moment the Watchers received word that the Imperial Princess would be setting off for another Galaxy, his presence being the reason why so many powerful beings were assigned to protect the Imperial Vessel that would soon be setting off .","He had a somber expression as he stared at the doors of the Imperial Vessel opening and watching the veiled Anna descend down, and this expression became one of annoyance when General Zadan also observed the genius proficient in the Law of Life that he had met just prior!","\"Little Anna, I don’t think I or your father knew would be taking company with you . \" His gaze was locked on to Alexander as the Imperial Princes bowed her head towards him .","\"Don’t worry about him, Uncle . He’s also here for my protection! Even though I see you may have already gone overboard with that...\" The Imperial Princess spoke with a sweet tone as she saw the 10 Black Hole experts with 20 more in the Nebula Realm stationed near them ready to board two other Vessels .","\"These Imperials have sworn their lives on keeping you safe, and it is more of a precaution from the Imperial Adjudicator . Even though we have conquered the Stellar Sky Galaxy, it doesn’t hurt to be safe . \" General Zadan pointed to the protectors standing by their side as they bowed in acknowledgment .","As General Zadan introduced the party to protect them, the Princess nodded as she expressed her gratitude, the Watchers assigned to them giving them coordinates that could be used on a unique map that outlined the numerous zones around the Nexus Galaxy that had been explored!","While all of this was occurring, Noah glanced around the Sanctuary of the Watchers as Eyes of Truth granted him boundless information, but his gaze was overtaken when he turned towards the mystery that was the Universal Rift itself .","[Chaotic Void Rift] :: A Lesser Universal Rift that is currently being used to grant a Void Aura over those passing through it, giving them safe passage in the Chaotic Void for 30 days . Forming randomly throughout the Dark Universe, these Void Rifts can be utilized for a variety of means when powered by the essence of the Tools of Ruination . When properly used with the aid of the Tools of Ruination, one can [email protected]$^#%#$ . . .","...!","Alarm rose in his eyes as he read over the information numerous times, not having expected the Rift that the powerhouses of the Nexus Galaxy termed a Universal Rift was actually a Chaotic Void Rift that was a lesser type of a Universal Rift, and the shocking thing was the terrifying name of Tools of Ruination popping up again!","Whenever this term popped up while Noah used the [Eyes of Truth] under the Protagonist Trait, it was the only thing that would always be followed by incomprehensible words that could not be read . He would have to elevate his Protagonist Trait to the next level if he wanted the chance to pierce through the veils of secrecy that came with the terrifying Tools of Ruination that made both of his two Traits possible!","As Noah became lost in the glimmer of the Lesser Universal Rift, much of the process behind him finished as they were soon ready to head out .","\"We have been mining the Effulgent Star Pearls for a while now as we still face limited supply, so I’ll be sure to send a message ahead to have the recently mined ones saved for your arrival . \" Many things were outlined for them for the sake of safety, going through numerous words of advice and regulations before they could reboard their Imperial Vessel and get ready to enter the rainbow-colored Universal Rift .","\"I’ll be back soon, Uncle Zadan!\" Anna voiced out joyfully as they boarded the Imperial Vessel once more, the exquisite carriage being pulled by two Void Pegasi rising to the skies as two more Imperial Vessels floated behind it .","General Zadan watched this scene with cold eyes as he wished them a safe and boring journey, as someone like him much preferred when things were boring and nothing drastic occurred!","RUMBLE!","The three Vessels shot forth towards the Lesser Universal Rift as they set off towards the Stellar Sky Galaxy, nobody among those watching realizing that this event marked the beginning of a drastically changing future...","---","Light years away from the Nexus Galaxy, in the Burning Domains Galaxy that had the Fiends which Noah met during his Blessed Imperial Selection .","This unique Galaxy was among the many that the Imperials of the Nexus Galaxy had made enemies of, with many casualties occurring on both sides as even now, multiple Fiends were locked in places like the Devouring Hells Realms in the Nexus Galaxy, and Imperials taken prisoners were also locked in hellish realms within the Burning Domains Galaxy!","Most of the conflict occurred when it came to these two Galaxies trying to impose their influence onto nearby regions, the numerous clashes over the years being a result of territorial battles!","Deep within this Galaxy that had a calm exterior, shocking movements were happening within as the Fiends born with immense talent to traverse ranks with the handicap of not being proficient in Laws were being grown in large numbers .","In a Realm near the Center of this Galaxy, a Fiend Emperor that normally ruled over multiple Realms of the Burning Domains Galaxy was kneeling down while bowing to a mountainous figure that seemed to be focusing on a page floating in front of its eyes .","\"Master, we have gotten word of new developments on the side of the Imperials . It seems that a Royal of the Dannicus Household is setting off a mission of conquest with more than three Vessels seen leaving the Nexus Galaxy, granting us a perfect chance to carry out our plans . \"","The Fiend Emperor had a unique body that thrummed with tremendous physical strength, where those knowledgeable would know that it surpassed the Realm of Nebula and Black Hole purely on strength alone, with his rank even being above that!","Yet this Fiend Emperor was bowing towards another creature, the Entity who had been focusing on the dark floating page with immense concentration as the words recently released grabbed its attention .","\"Mmm . . . It might still be too early...\" The voice coming out of the Entity surrounded like searing metal clanging against each other, its voice extremely unnatural and grating, but one could make out it was slightly feminine .","The Fiend Emperor bowed even lower while continuing to speak . \"Master, the Vessels are heading towards a galaxy you wanted us to conquer before . . . the Stellar Sky Galaxy...\"","RUMBLE!","A fearsome pressure appeared with the mention of this, the Entity glancing at the Fiend Emperor as it replied after thoughtful consideration .","\"The only Royal in the Dannicus Household aside from the Imperial Adjudicator is his daughter, yes? Mmm . . . this could be sufficient enough to keep his attention while we finally act . He is the only one among the few Galactic Rulers who shows any capability, and one that has hindered my plans the most . . . \"","...!","With these words, the Fiend Emperor nodded with vigor, the voice of the Entity continuing to ring out!","\"These fools prancing around as Rulers of Galaxies do not know a thing about the Truth, believing Supreme and Ultimate Laws are the peaks of strength and that Blessings from Galaxies are sufficient to traverse the wide Dark Universe . They do not even have knowledge of the @#$, nor could they even imagine the shocking truth of this Universe! . . . Yet the things they covet are also those I want, and there should be another Page from the Book of Ruination in the Stellar Sky Galaxy...\"","The Entity said these words as she waved her hands and caused the movement of the floating page in front of her, her gaze locking with the excited Fiend Emperor as she relayed her command .","\"Gather your brothers and sisters and all the Fiends we have managed to produce over the last thousands of years, and let your Elders know . I still cannot move with my injuries yet . . . but I should have raised more than enough of you all to cause some commotion and stand against these puny Galactic Rulers, even the Imperials . \"","RUMBLE!","\"You shall go forth and conquer all the Galaxies we have our eyes on at once, not giving the Imperials time to even know what is happening . Use the daughter that the slightly able Imperial Adjudicator raised as a bargaining piece, or even kill her if you must as you occupy the Stellar Sky Galaxy . Your mission there will be to specifically locate a page like this . \"","The glimmering dark page that represented another page from the Book of Ruination floated and imprinted itself in the eyes of the Fiend Emperor, his heart thumping as he seemed completely enamored by the figure of the powerful Entity as he replied with conviction!","\"Whatever you want shall be yours, Master!\"","OOOM!","This was the conviction of a Fiend Emperor, a being not in the Nebula or the Realm of Black Hole, but a being in the QUASAR Realm! Such a being gave strong words of conviction as he chose to lead the force that would occupy a particular Stellar Sky Galaxy that a party was adventuring towards .","After the Nebula Realm and the creation of a Black Hole, the next Realm thereafter was something of shocking stature and strength . . . the realm known as QUASAR .","Also, one must recall that the Entity told this Fiend Emperor to gather his brothers and sisters, and even let his Elders know!","This meant that there were multiple beings with power at the QUASAR Realm like this Fiend Emperor, and there were even unknown Elders standing above beings such as this .","To top it all off, there was an Entity that was also trying to collect more information on the Tools of Ruination as they looked for the pages of the Book of Ruination! Even though one would not know the power of this Entity as she was injured, what did her ability to raise multiple Fiend Emperors at the QUASAR realm such as the one bowing before her say?","The race of Fiends that had no advancements in the Universal Laws but could rapidly advance through the Realms of Power . . . these beings began showing movement after remaining hidden for thousands of years, choosing to move in the most explosive fashion in response to a single action that caused their plans to align .","The daughter of the most powerful Galactic Ruler standing in their way had left her home for the first time ever, her actions providing unique opportunities as a powerful Entity saw uses of this Royal against one of their most powerful enemies!","The Imperial Adjudicator would have never expected a possibility of a terrifying injured Entity lying behind the Fiends, one of the many forces he fought over the thousands of years . Nor would he have known that these fiends only ever sent out their surface-level pawns on their many battles . Nor could he predict allowing his daughter to simply go to another Galaxy already under their control . . . would be the spark for such a shocking sequence of events, the spark that made a deeply hidden force choose to move at this moment!"]},{"number":658,"title":"Chapter 658: Chapter 657","paragraphs":["Chapter 657: 657","The Imperial Vessel Noah was on passed through the Lesser Universal Rift with ease as in the next moment, it appeared outside the Nexus Galaxy .","A unique essence covered the vessel as it protected them from the Chaotic Void outside, even though the essence of a Grand Controller or even something like having a powerful physique similar to Noah would be more than enough to withstand the terrifying pressure and terror of the Chaotic Void outside of Galaxies .","The Vessel left behind the Nexus Galaxy that Noah had only been on a few days as it began heading towards one of the locations that were under the control of the Nexus Galaxy- the Stellar Sky Galaxy!","The veiled Imperial Princess within the Vessel was spreading her aura out as she stared at everything around them with wonder, even the darkness of the Chaotic Void seemingly interesting to her . Being given permission to travel out of her native Galaxy for the first time was naturally something that made Anna very happy!","Even the maids Maya and Raya stared at the glimmering lights the Void Pegasi pulling the carriage were releasing as they streaked across with the speed of light, following a predetermined path towards the Stellar Sky Galaxy as they would pass various relay stations holding portals that were set up for smoother and faster journeys across the Void to the places under the influence of the Imperials .","\"You’ve heard the rumors of powerful Entities roaming the Chaotic Void? Of beings so powerful that they could destroy entire Galaxies with a wave of their hands?\"","The Princess continued making conversation as the minutes passed during their journey, many things being discussed with this girl that seemed to never have had the chance to talk freely to someone else like Noah before!","Noah replied with interest as he amassed more information about the Nexus Galaxy and their surroundings, even more so what forces they had under their control .","\"Apparently some of these Entities do not even bother with Universal Laws, and they are proficient in something even more terrifying-\"","RUMBLE!","Anna was talking with enthusiasm while Maya and Raya looked towards her with adoring expressions, when her words suddenly came to a stop as powerful waves of Life Essence erupted from Noah out of nowhere, his body suddenly being covered by numerous ancient runic circles!","\"You...\"","They looked on with gawking expression as Noah replied with an apologetic expression, since the reason was because his counterpart that held half of his Origin in the Novus Galaxy had been cultivating the [Primeval Propitious Physique], and had actually reached the 1% mark at this time as the Primeval Tree within the body of Alexander released a burst out with Life Essence and caused the appearance of the ancient runic sigils that naturally strengthened this body to the 1% mark as well!","\"Sorry for interrupting, I didn’t think my body cultivation in the Law of Life would upgrade just from time passing . You were mentioning the Entities...\"","His apologetic words seemed extremely condescending to the three girls as they looked at him while shaking their heads at his continued ridiculousness, knowing that no normal being would make advancements while just sitting down talking!","An even more curious light passed through the hidden eyes of the Imperial Princess as she found her intuition of this Alexander to be more and more correct .","Traversing the Chaotic Void with two gorgeous Maids and a veiled Imperial Princess, Alexander made advancements as he merely sat down in a Vessel heading to another Galaxy!","---","Meanwhile in the Novus Galaxy, Noah’s body felt the burst of strength from the Primeval Propitious Physique as the ancient runic circles died down around his body, putting on a silk golden robe to cover his steel forged muscles that seemed tout and trembling with power!","He then conversed with the Novus Galaxy as he checked up on the continued changes throughout the Galaxy from having its Atmospheric Essence, Law Essence and Comprehension, and even the Life Force of its beings strengthened to such a large extent .","The progression of beings ascending through the Realms was the greatest change that the overabundance of essence caused, especially in a place like his Infinite Realm causing for his subordinates and Infinite Realm Beasts to elevate themselves greatly in a short amount of time .","This effect was increased even more for those training in the numerous Time Spaces spread throughout the Infinite Realm, where only a day would have passed in the outside world as they spent more than two months in the Time Space!","Such a unique convergence of factors allowed for most of the Harbingers to step into the ranks of Star Forgers, and their eyes were already set on achieving the Nebula Realm as they continued to train incessantly .","The even larger change was the formation and advancement of more and more Infinite Realm Beasts who had the Medicinal Herbs and Fruits directly from the Realm being extremely conducive to elevating their ranks, creating for a fearsome situation where hundreds of thousands of ridiculously powerful Beasts were rising through the ranks every day .","One would be shocked to know that when it came to sheer numbers of beings in higher realms, the Infinite Realm Beasts alone had a huge lead when they were compared to any of the other Races living in the Infinite Realm!","But this wasn’t the only change worthy of note- the biggest one was the continued granting of Traits that occurred with even more frequency, where another Harbinger of Sin had gotten a powerful Trait .","It wasn’t just any common Trait, but the first EPSILON ranked Trait to appear in the Novus Galaxy!","Claiming the unique title of being the only person currently holding an EPSILON rank trait was . . . Kazuhiko!","OOOOOM!","The gaze of this being who could be the main character of his own book was sharp as his dark hair waved from the winds of a high mountain he stood on in the Infinite Realm .","Atop this mountain, Kazuhiko was staring at the vast army of Barbatos filled with Undead that were brimming with the Essence of Life, the Star Forging Barbatos herself accompanied by the Emperor Penguin, Steel Mikhail, Imperial Phoenix, and many more of Noah’s powerful subordinates as they all came together to test out the power of the first EPSILON ranked Trait of the Novus Galaxy .","Being faced with so many powerful beings at the same rank as him, Kazuhiko was actually not afraid as he couldn’t help but have a wide smile appearing on his face, his eyes nearly tearing out of happiness as he bellowed out a roar of power while activating his Trait- [Dark Emperor]!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":659,"title":"Chapter 659: Chapter 658","paragraphs":["Chapter 658: 658","Faced against all of his allies, Kazuhiko fearlessly roared out without any shame - [Dark Emperor]!","[Dark Emperor](EPSILON) :: A Trait that allows the user to turn their body and origin into a unique essence of Darkness, becoming a conflagration of dark smoke as they gain a 100% reduction in Physical Damage, 50% reduction in soul damage, and the ability to utilize their new forms in many unimaginable ways as they only become more proficient in time .","Worthy of EPSILON rank! A Trait that gave the user complete reduction to Physical Damage, and went even further to reduce Soul Damage by half, while also changing their form into a conflagration of darkness . Worthy of a Trait!","RUMBLE!","Kazuhiko’s body erupted into tendrils of palpating darkness as it barreled towards the Harbingers menacingly, and one could distinctly begin to see the formation of katanas and serrated blades from this extremely dark smog as they thundered towards the Harbingers and threatened to overwhelm them .","The Undead under Barbatos slashed their weapons as others cast skills filled with the aura of death, but all of them seamlessly passed through the dark smoke that was Kazuhiko as this darkness went on to enter the orifices of the undead, the creatures becoming immobilized!","\"RAA! RAA! RAA!\"","A piercing cry erupted out at this moment as a gargantuan Emperor Penguin landed among the dark smoke, his flippers filled with the dense essence of space and time as it clashed with the smoke .","The essence of laws was the only thing capable of dealing damage to the body of a being utilizing [Dark Emperor], but the range of Kazuhiko’s body was currently too enormous as he not only focused on the Emperor Penguin, but he was surrounding many of the other Harbingers while facing his utmost attention on a single being- a dark skinned woman with glistening hair, the Inquisitor that held a terrifying DELTA Trait called [Extinction Flames] which was wiping away his form of darkness rapidly every time Athena waved her hands!","OOOOH!","A bellow erupted from the dark smog that was Kazuhiko, barreling towards everything and everyone as he actually stood on par with multiple beings at the same rank as him without any issues .","As long as he withstood and avoided the attacks which could deal Soul Damage, his complete immunity to Physical Damage in this state would make him a terrifying combatant on any battlefield!","Of course, if someone like Noah who held terrifying abilities that purely dealt Soul Damage came, it would be a different case entirely .","Minutes passed as many looked towards the powerful darkness with envy, wondering if they would get such a Trait as this . It continued to surround them like a dark smoke as Kazuhiko separated them to stop them from working together, his attention placed on those proficient with laws that could deal even a hint of soul damage to him .","He continued to show a dominating presence in the sparring field, but it was also at this moment that this dark smoke came to a stop, a shocked voice of Kazuhiko ringing out as this smoke began to recede towards one location .","\"Stop stop stop!\" The shout was slightly hurried as Kazuhiko saw the others had many powerful skills ready to be thrown his way as they continued to test his invincibility and the extent of his Trait .","\"I . . . I’m running out of mana...haaa . \" He released a defeated sigh after standing against many powerful beings, realizing the high cost of keeping his Trait active as he sought to increase his Realm and have more essence to use!","As the dark smoke which had spread to hundreds of meters receded to become his single human body, one could see a determined expression on Kazuhiko as a dashing smile could be seen on his face, his heart set on getting stronger as he saw rapid progress with the addition of this Trait .","If one looked around at the scene of Harbingers in this sparring field, they would observe determined expressions on all of them as they pushed themselves to work even harder!","...","---","In the Chaotic Void, the three Imperial Vessels had passed through numerous teleportation stations as they neared the position of the Stellar Sky Galaxy, spending a bit over 7 hours on this journey!","Noah’s eyes shimmered as they reached the last relay station set up by the Imperials in the Chaotic Void, his senses observing the beginning of a boundary of a glimmering Galaxy .","\"An average Galaxy through and through, but its position was heavily elevated because of the Effulgent Star Pearls that could be found in it . \"","Maya had become more talkative over the trip as she spoke out with shining eyes, the four of them in the Imperial Vessel of the Dannicus Household observing the bounds of the Stellar Sky Galaxy with expectant eyes .","\"Let’s go!\" An excited command was released from the Imperial Princess as the Void Pegasi streaked forward, the station set up by Imperials outside the boundary of the galaxy not doing a thing to stop them as they very well knew their identity, only sending acknowledgment their way .","RUMBLE!","The Void Beasts seamlessly passed through the shimmering barrier without any issues, three Vessels successfully passing through from the Void and into a Galaxy! These three vessels came to a stop near the boundary as the beings within stepped out, looking into the new galaxy as a welcome party was there to greet them .","The figures acting as the welcoming party were numerous as a shockingly handsome man was at the forefront with a bright smile, the light of fate coursing through his eyes as they honed in on the veiled Imperial Princess while giving glances to the two Maids and Noah .","\"Imperial Princess, I welcome you to our everything . . . I welcome you to our Stellar Sky Galaxy . \"","OOOOOH!","Triumphant horns of celebration bellowed out as it seemed an entire show was brought to this welcome reception, Noah already using Eyes of Truth on anything he saw as he began gathering tons of information .","Among the welcome party, multiple beings carrying the emblems of Imperials could be seen as they also bowed their heads towards the Imperial Princess with a warm welcome . But the man in focus at the moment has shining blue hair somehow waving in the starry space, Anna glancing towards this being with a nod .","\"You must be...?\" Anna spoke with a calm tone as their party moved forward, the 10 Black Hole experts and 20 Nebula Rank guards standing not too far behind them releasing an oppressive pressure all around .","\"I am the only son of the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy that bends to the Imperial Adjudicator, Andreas Von Husen!\"","A grand announcement was made as the son of the ruler of this Galaxy that was under the rule of Imperials came to welcome the Imperial Princess . Light greetings were exchanged between them as they began moving across the starry space of this new Galaxy, leaving the Imperial Vessels behind as they took in the time to enjoy the new sights .","\"The word we received mentioned your purpose was the Effulgent Star Pearls?\" Andreas spoke with an inquisitive face as a smile remained on him at all times .","\"Yes, Our Lady wishes to use these treasures to quickly move through the Nebula Realm and approach the creation of a Black Hole . \" Maya replied to him passively as glimmering stars began to appear within their sights .","A sigh could be heard from Andreas at these words as he spoke out with melancholy . \"That may be a bit problematic at this time, Your Highness . We have been trying to locate and mine the Effulgent Star Pearls on any of the millions of Stars and thousands of Realms over the years, with the known locations running dry and the Pearls themselves being distributed for use the moment they are mined . I’m afraid there won’t be too many at this time . . . unless you are okay with spending a few weeks in our small Galaxy until a few hundred are collected . \"","The smile remained on Andreas as his dashing face seemed to exude the sadness he felt at not being able to provide for what the Imperial Princess wanted, and Noah only smiled as he looked at this character’s description with the Eyes of Truth as he understood his true nature!","A son of the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy! Someone who should have inherited and ruled something so vast and wide that very few could claim the title of it in the Dark Universe .","Yet all of this was taken away by the Imperials as he had to now even attend to a mere Princess with a smiling expression! The true emotions that Andreas felt as well as his true nature . . . all of it was visible under Noah’s eyes as they arrived in the Stellar Sky Galaxy and met some of its inhabitants, a new adventure underway as an interesting treasure was their goal- the Effulgent Star Pearl!"]},{"number":660,"title":"Chapter 660: Chapter 659","paragraphs":["Chapter 659: 659","The Stellar Sky Galaxy was a particularly gorgeous galaxy as it held many unique stars . Part of its name stemmed from the planets that were termed Stellar Stars, stellar bodies that could be found across the billions of stars in the wide galaxy, with some of them even being more unique as they became Stellar Realms .","The one thing that caused other Galaxies to fight for the Stellar Sky Galaxy was the unique treasure known as the Effulgent Star Pearls which could be found on the rare Stellar Stars, but these Pearls had unique attributes that caused them very hard to locate!","One could not sense them even if they spread out their aura or consciousness over an entire star, these Pearls being only visible to the naked eye as the only method of detection . It required beings to dig across an expansive star of thousands of miles!","To make it even worse, one had to be very careful while mining them, as the slightest disturbances could affect the treasures essence held within the Effulgent Star Pearls, making them quickly leak out this potent essence as it became lost in the atmosphere if one did not begin absorbing it right away . If enough shock was felt from a being rampantly using their strength to break through the layers of earth and search for them, the pearls would shatter right away as they watched the potent essence they contained quickly become assimilated in the atmosphere of the star once again .","So the treasures were rare, delicate, and hard to locate among the many Stellar Stars and Realms!","The entire task of Imperials stationed in the Stellar Sky Galaxy was to work with the Natives to locate and mine the Effulgent Star Pearls, coming to an agreement to provide a set amount to the Imperials and a set amount to the natives themselves .","Being as rare and as useful as they were, the Pearls were normally used up in a matter of days by the Imperials and Natives alike as a few were transported back to the Nexus Galaxy!","At this moment, the stock of the Pearls was nearly depleted as Andreas mentioned the locations they knew and had been mining so far were running dry .","\"So all we have to do is find Stellar Stars and Realms ourselves as we can mine the Effulgent Star Pearls and use them as we wish, yes?\"","Anna spoke to the dashing Andreas as they streaked across the starry space, their figures coming to a stop in front of a glimmering star that shone with a silver and white colored aurora .","\"Theoretically, yes . But even we as Natives who have even been born on Stellar Stars spend a long time just to locate the Pearls, and we have to be even more careful while mining them as even vibrations can cause them damage as they leak out their wondrous essence . Even this Stellar Star in front of us that had recently begun to be mined is nearly depleted, where we are spending most of our time just trying to locate the Pearls \" The son of the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy, Andreas, replied with a smile as all he got was a nod from Anna .","The veiled Princess and her maids looked with sparkling eyes towards the star that shone with a silver and white brilliance, but it was Alexander’s eyes that were shining with even more intense lights than them as they gazed upon the Stellar Star with Eyes of Truth!","\"What do you think, Boastful Genius? Can you show us something surprising on this matter as well?\" Anna turned towards Alexander as she spoke with a tone that surprised Andreas, as whenever her words were directed towards him they were completely cold and flat . But towards this being, they actually seemed lively?","\"Well, a Stellar Star that holds these Pearls is right in front of our eyes, so I don’t see a reason why we shouldn’t mine some ourselves . \" Alexander’s tone that seemed extremely calm and confident rang out, drawing the eyes of the many experts guarding their party and raising the brows of Andreas and the natives of the Stellar Sky Galaxy that came with him even more .","\"I don’t mean to dampen your spirits, but we have lived and mined these Star Pearls for centuries, with our methods being honed and becoming impeccable over the years . Even with my experience, I can at most mine out a Star Pearl of High Grade if I’m lucky . Newcomers to mining will either destroy the Pearl completely, or come out with a Low Grade one if they’re lucky!\" Words filled with disdain flowed from Andreas as his eyes focused on the man coming with the party of the Imperial Princess!","He had watched the demeanor of the Imperials that had been on this region of the Galaxy and even the 10 Black Hole and 20 Nebula Ran experts the Princess came with, and neither of them looked at this being in any special way, but the Princess was constantly conversing with him .","A feeling of competition seemed to rise from Andreas as he looked at Alexander, wanting to know what qualifications he even had to stand amongst the Princess and them!","He was the son of a Galactic Ruler, a being that held control over a Galaxy!","Even if his father was under the banner of the Imperial Adjudicator, Andreas still had a powerful status . So why should this man be receiving more attention and such a tone from the Imperial Princess and not him?","His words were meant to provoke, but only a light smile covered Alexander’s face as he spoke out while looking at the Stellar Star in front of them .","\"Why don’t we head down and see the process of locating and mining? I’m curious to try a little something myself . \"","His eyes were shining with intense luster because a text box with golden-red words floated in front of him, Eyes of Truth showing him an ecstatic set of information as always .","[Stellar Star] :: A unique planet that can be found in the Stellar Sky Galaxy . A notable thing about this type of star are the unique Effulgent Star Pearls that can be found from them, these pearls being capable of allowing beings to forge stars within their Nebulae with even more ease than using cores . On this particular Stellar Star, the Effulgent Star Pearls can be found at . . . The best way to mine them is through the use of Universal Law Essence, with a higher tiered Law being capable of granting one a Star Pearl of the highest quality...","Information upon information passed through his eyes as he hid his smile and laughed in his mind!","Spectacular treasures that were so hard to find that one could only blindly search through the star as they dug everywhere just to find their location . So delicate when they were mined that even the slightest vibrations damaged them! Yet his Trait...","It was being ridiculous as always!"]},{"number":661,"title":"Chapter 661: Chapter 660","paragraphs":["Chapter 660: 660","The collection of beings with shaking auras of power all descended onto one of the many Stellar Stars of the Stellar Sky Galaxy, the eyes of a particular group being much more carefree and expectant than others as the unique features of these stars displayed themselves in front of their eyes .","The silver aurora that covered the Stellar Star remained as its key feature as one landed on it, its very atmosphere being surrounded by this unique atmospheric essence as it seemed like a type of silver mist was covering the entire planet, where one could not visibly see with their naked eye if they looked to a place a mile away .","The mist was a sign of dense essence coagulation, Noah gazing at the earth of this star as he saw grand mountain ranges tinted with green and silver, the movements of numerous living creatures being felt all around as the one major thing remained on this planet- a sense of calm!","\"We have to work very efficiently and carefully while locating and mining the Effulgent Star Pearls, with a base being built on every Star we have begun to mine as mining parties are sent out every day to carefully dig through the planet and search . \"","Andreas continued to introduce everything around them as Anna and her maids looked around them with interest, their auras sensing the movements of many beings moving all around the continents of this Stellar Star .","Noah on the other hand seemed to be looking at specific locations as he shone with a mysterious smile on his face, their party landing at an enormous silver mountain that had the entrance of a huge cavern!","\"To allow everyone to see the hardship we go through every day to mine, I asked my forces to stop their mining of an Effulgent Pearl that appeared on any stars these past hours, and a lucky miner was able to find and preserve a pearl on this star we are on . Come, I will show you the process we have to go through every time!\"","Andreas looked ready to show off and impress others as he led them into the cavern, the inside of it being briefly dark before it was lit up by silver crystals visible all over the walls of this wide cave .","The glimmering colors grabbed the girls’ eyesight as they went further into the stellar mine, passing multiple bowing individuals in unique outfits that seemed to distinguish them for the jobs they were doing . They proceeded forward for a few minutes until they came to a point where the silver light was shining the brightest, the party of many powerful beings coming to rest their eyes on a cavern wall where a clear round crystal could be seen emitting all the silver light!","WAA!","A unique aura of majesty spread from it as it seemed precious, the miners looking over it nodding towards them as Andreas stepped forward while speaking, his arms being covered by the essence of water as he carefully went to ’pluck’ out this silver circular crystal that was the Effulgent Star Pearl .","\"Once we can locate one where our digging did not completely disrupt or destroy it, we carefully wrap it with law essence before digging it out, and we can then obtain . . . the Effulgent Star Pearl...\"","His blue essence of the law of water moved seamlessly as he pulled off the delicate Pearl from the cavern wall while keeping it intact, controlling it as it floated towards the veiled Imperial Princess!","With a dashing smile, Andreas offered her the Pearl as he spoke . \"For you, Princess . Be very careful with it as even a little pressure can cause it to burst, but it will be very easy to absorb its essence as you can forge three stars from a Medium Grade Star Pearl like this . \"","Noah looked at this sight while laughing inside, knowing full well that this terrifying Princess did not even put this Andreas character in her mind, yet he was trying so hard!","As if to prove a point, Anna grabbed the Effulgent Star Pearl in front of her as she looked at it curiously, and then turned in his direction as she threw the delicate treasure towards him .","Gasps could be heard throughout the cavern as Noah lightly caught it in the air by wrapping his essence in it, the sonorous voice of the Imperial Princess ringing out .","\"Alright Analyzer, what can you tell me about it?\"","A hidden smile could barely be perceived behind the veiled princess as she called Alexander with the name of this body’s old Trait, a bubble appearing in front of his eyes as he read the words detailed through it .","[Effulgent Star Pearl](Middle Grade) :: Poorly dug out with a horrible technique and sustaining vibrational damage before it was uncovered, this treasure allows the user absorbing it to forge 3 . 5 Stars within their Nebula .","\"About three and a half stars can be formed from this, and I might be able to locate some more of them on this star after taking a look at this . \" He said these words calmly as they drew the ire of the surrounding natives, but he shockingly did have knowledge of where these rare and delicate treasures that most of the time broke because of how deeply they were hidden underground and the process required to unveil them!","Eyes of Truth had shown him multiple coordinates on this Stellar Star that mentioned where he could locate the Star Pearls, and he would be able to mine with ease while maintaining the highest quality if he so wished!","\"Hmph, please do not insult our prowess and techniques we have developed over thousands of years . To even locate a Pearl required luck, and even more luck that you do not destroy it while digging through the earth . Nobody is able to just find one if they wish!\"","Cold words came from Andreas as he felt that he lost his face to this being every time, where he became the center of attention from the hands of the princess while someone like him continued to be ignored .","Now he was bragging about being able to find Star Pearls after just touching one?","Arrogant!","The maids gave ridiculing looks while looking at the demeanor of Andreas, even the Princess ignoring this being as her eyes focused on Noah while she spoke .","\"Surprise us . \"","Noah nodded with a smile at these words as his body erupted with the essence of Aether, the destructive essence wrapping him from head to toe as he walked towards the cavernous wall in front of him .","\"You . . . what are you doing?\"","Surprised gasps came from the respectfully bowing natives as they had a foreboding feeling, and their thoughts came true the next instant as they saw the debris flying out from the cavernous wall, the arrogant being in front of their eyes beginning to forcefully dig forward using the destructive essence of Aether as he created a man-sized 2 meter hole while recklessly moving forward beneath the silver mountain .","\"Stop! This is a mining spot that should still have multiple Star Pearls, if you use such destructive force you will destroy all of them!\" Andreas bellowed out commandingly as Noah’s words did not even reach him, his senses following the direction that Eyes of Truth told him as he used the essence of Aether to move across the heard earth like a drill, disintegrating much of the debris with only some dust flying out every now and then!","Andreas was bubbling with rage as he was about to move, but he felt the eyes of multiple experts meant to protect the Princess and her party land on him at this moment as he shivered, reigning in his rage as he glanced towards the Imperial Princess that had begun following the man sized hole being made with interested steps .","\"Princess . . . please...\" Andreas seemed to plead with them as he also followed, many of the natives having looks of horror as they expected this boorish man with his destructive essence to very quickly destroy any Star Pearls that might have been remaining on this mountain .","Such a loss!","They followed behind Andreas with aching hearts as they could hear the voice of this Young Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy continue to ring out with complaints, but it very quickly halted as those who squeezed in to the man sized hole spread out their awareness to clearly see what was happening saw his mouth agape with his eyes nearly popping out .","In front of them, the ’boorish’ man playing with the destructive essence of Aether had stopped right before glimmering silver light, a light that only represented one thing as they then observed the essence surrounding him to change from the destructive Aether into a green one filled with an overabundance of life!","They saw this essence go forward as it carefully dug out the last layer of earth, unveiling a shining bright Effulgent Star Pearl that was shining more resplendently than any that they had seen before .","No vibrational damage or any type of damage was dealt to it, the ’boorish’ being in front of them somehow being knowledgeable to come to a stop right before he even hit the adjacent wall that the Pearl was stuck in and pulverized it along with anything else, and they shockingly saw him use the essence of the Ultimate Law of Life as he carefully wrapped it around the pearl and plucked it out!","RUMBLE!","\"This...\"","\"Not possible...\"","\"Unbelievable!\"","The miners that had lived all of their lives looking for and trying to carefully mine Effulgent Star Pearls were trembling with shock as they saw the bright light that this Pearl released . A hazy cloud of silver seemed to continuously wrap around the pearl as the life essence wrapping around it reduced, and when they saw this hazy white essence . . . they trembled even more .","\"That is . . . a perfectly mined Star Pearl...\"","\"That luminescence! That silver cloud mist surrounding it! That is... . !\"","\"A Supreme Grade Effulgent Star Pearl!\"","...!","Alarm rose in the eyes of many as they turned toward the man curiously holding the Star Pearl while staring at it, their minds reeling with many questions .","How was he able to know where it was at? How did he so perfectly come to a stop right before he pulverized it? How could he excavate it with such effort that it turned out to be a Supreme Grade Star Pearl?","Most of all, just who was this being?!"]},{"number":662,"title":"Chapter 662: Chapter 661","paragraphs":["Chapter 661: 661","\"How could you...\"","Many beings were still in a stupor as they stared at Noah, their eyes seemingly portraying that they were staring at some type of monster as a light laugh could be heard from the Imperial Princess up ahead .","\"Seems I wasn’t wrong to bring you here . Alright! Let’s find more of these Star Pearls since they seem to be in such short supply, we will find and use them all ourselves while not dipping into any of their reserves!\"","The words of the Princess strongly reverberated out as they struck Andreas the most, mentioning how it was impossible for there not to be a few hundred Star Pearls if not more in collection, but they were stingy to not give them freely! Now the Imperial Princess had shown up with a shocking being that could somehow locate a Star Pearl and excavate it in a matter of minutes, and do it while maintaining its Supreme Grade at that .","They didn’t even put the thought in their minds that it was luck, as they saw the skill required to do what this being did!","\"How were you able to find it so fast and take it out safely, Boaster?\" Maya had sparkling eyes as she renewed Alexander’s image again, the cute maid pursing her lips as she couldn’t believe the actions of this being once more .","\"Oh, I just have a sense about these things . Come on, I’ll find some more!\"","He left behind the beings with gaping mouths as the Supreme Grade Pearl disappeared, his body being enveloped with the dangerous essence of Aether as he began digging through the underground cavern while just barreling through with his body .","The shocked beings behind him followed as this time, he didn’t even move far before he came to a stop again, leaving another thin film of earth where they could see the beginning illumination of an uncovered round Pearl . The scene repeated again where Aether was switched with the Essense of Life, another Effulgent Star Pearl being plucked out with ease!","\"Another Supreme Grade Pearl...!\"","Those following cried out in shock as they observed this, everything they knew being turned upside down as the confident Andreas himself was ashen .","One might have been luck, but twice in a row confirmed the skill even to the biggest unbelievers! A light laugh could be heard ringing out from the Imperial Princess as Noah did not even stop after getting the second Pearl, simply using the information Eyes of Truth gave him about this planet as he went forth to easily collect all the Effulgent Star Pearls just on this mountain .","After the 5th Supreme Grade Pearl was retrieved by him, those following behind with stupor felt their ears ringing .","After the 20th, they felt their ears buzzing!","After the 30th, they just watched on in horror as this being did the impossible!","But during the time when Noah was about to mine the 36 Pearl, the mountain they were on began to shake as they all realized they had made holes all over the mountain, its integrity being reduced as the surrounding walls were creaking and breaking down .","All of them sighed as they shook their heads at this, beginning to move out of the mountain themselves as they had more than enough power to not worry about being buried .","RUMBLE!","The shaking continued as this mining location on this Stellar Star shook, silver debris and dust erupting out as the party of the Imperial Princess and her Protectors could be seen in the sky, the natives of the Stellar Sky Galaxy and Andreas looking towards Noah with complex expression as he waved his hands while saying grand words with he crumbling mountain below them!","\"36 Supreme Grade Effulgent Star Pearls just from this one mountain, and I can sense even more spread throughout the this Stellar Star . \"","...!","His voice was low, but they all heard it clearly as their looks of shock remained, knowing how rare Supreme Grade Pearls were, much less finding every single one of them at the same grade as it was mined with utmost care!","\"Good! Good!\" The Princess repeated the words good twice as she saw Alexander wave his hands, the 36 Supreme Grade Effulgent Star Pearls floating towards her as she released a soft essence to wrap around them, putting them in her spatial item as the surprising being in front of her began to shimmer with the essence of Aether again . He could feel even more numbers of these Pearls within this star, and wasn’t bothered with repaying the favor of being brought to this Galaxy as he knew he would be collecting even more of them soon .","\"I’ll be right back, Princess . Give me a bit over a few hours to scour this entire Stellar Star for the Effulgent Pearls . \" The words had only registered in their ears briefly before they saw his figure go towards an adjacent mountain at fast speeds, many of them still standing in the air while not knowing what to do!","As for Noah, he had read the descriptions of the Supreme Grade pearls from the Eyes of Truth as they told him he could forge 10 Stars with a single one of these pearls, and he knew a few hundred lay within this single Stellar Star alone .","This meant that for him to reach the 1000 Stars mark that many beings met before they attempted to form their Black Hole, all he would need was less than a hundred of these treasures to forge that many stars! But he didn’t want to stop there as he wondered, just what was the upper limit of stars he could forge before he could form his Black Hole?","It was said that the more Stars one had in their Nebula, the better their chances were- so he wanted to form as many as he could before he even attempted to step into the Realm of Black Hole!","But as he whizzed through this Stellar Star and did things even the natives could not do, he knew that he would definitely be reaching the Realm of Black Hole in just a matter of days if not hours because of the treasures of this Stellar Sky Galaxy .","Truly worthy of making the trip!","Unbeknownst to Noah and many more beings though, a great number of beings were covertly beginning their movements from the Burning Domains Galaxy as they moved with grand goals of conquest under the orders of a powerful Entity . . ."]},{"number":663,"title":"Chapter 663: Chapter 662","paragraphs":["Chapter 662: 662","A bit over 3 hours passed since Noah’s proclamation to scour the Stellar Star in front of them for all the Pearls hidden within .","Above this particular Stellar Star, the natives and Andreas had their own group standing not too far from the Imperial Princess who was sweetly talking with her maids .","None of them seemed to hold any worry as they took the words of the being known as Alexander with complete confidence, the hours passing by in no time as they felt the aura of the same genius being come towards them at this moment .","WAA!","Noah appeared like a flash of light in the starry space above the Stellar Star, looking below it with a smile as it had truly granted him too much this time around!","The Princess and everyone else looked expectantly towards him as they wondered just what his boon would be, and he did not delay as he waved his hands and caused the appearance of numerous silver-sparkling Pearls .","The experts that began to count them trembled every time they finished, as they confirmed with their own eyes the sparkling and misty appearance of over 400 Supreme Grade Effulgent Star Pearls!","\"This . . . this is enough to potentially produce 4 Black Hole experts!\"","\"Incredible!\"","\"How is this possible?!\"","Disbelief spread out as many beings reeled from the situation around them, shocked to have the knowledge that over 400 Effulgent Star Pearls came out of this single Star . Normally, only a few tens of pearls would ever be mined from one star, with many of them destroyed during the mining process or if a count like 100 pearls was ever reached from any star- they would mostly be Middle Grade Pearls or Low Grade, never Supreme Grade!","Even if there were 400 Low Grade Effulgent Star Pearls, they would not have a big reaction to it as they knew a Low Grade one could only allow a being to forge 1 or 2 stars . But Supreme Grade Pearls had the ability to allow one to form as much as 10 stars .","Just 100 of them represented the 1000 Star requirement in a Nebula before one could try their luck to form a Black Hole!","Yet this being in front of them had managed to bring out over 400 Effulgent Star Pearls of the highest grade from unknown methods, and he floated them in the star space as many looked over with envy and greed in their eyes .","\"Well, I had thought it would take us quite some time to gather and then absorb the treasures of this Galaxy to increase our Realm, but it seems you’ve done everything for us . \"","The words of Anna Lexalius Dannicus stopped the thoughts of all the beings in their tracks as she floated next to the shimmering 400 Star Pearls . She turned her head towards the natives and Andreas as she released cold words .","\"We can take it from here and won’t be needing an escort . We’ll go through a few more Stellar Stars or Realms if need be or just to see the sights of this Galaxy itself . \"","The words were extremely emotionless as Andreas nodded, waving his hands as some of the miners behind him returned to the Stellar Star below them, with others simply flying away to other locations as they still turned towards Alexander every now and then with shock .","\"You all watch over us as we cultivate, I’m curious of these treasures!\" Anna’s voice rang out again as it commanded the 10 Black Hole experts and the 20 Nebula Realm beings acting as their guards, those in the Nebula Realm trying their best not to even look at the enticing Pearls that would allow them to forge over 1000 Stars if they could handle it .","\"You guys can partake!\" The cheerful voice of Anna rang out towards her two maids, not even needing to tell Alexander as he had already grabbed onto one of the shimmering Effulgent Star Pearls that he collected .","[Effulgent Star Pearl] (Supreme Grade) :: An expertly dug out Star Pearl that retained all of its essence entirely . Capable of allowing the user to forge 10 stars with it .","In his hands, the Pearl began to melt as its essence passed through his hands and went towards the illusory Origin near his heart . The Nebula that represented his Origin, as well as the Nebulae of the Laws of Fire and Water continued to spin beautifully, there being a bit over 300 Stars currently in Noah’s Nebula .","The cores of Fiends had been extremely helpful as they brought him to 300 forged stars, but this many treasured Effulgent Star Pearls in front of him could easily push him above 1000 stars as he wondered exactly what his limit would be!","RUMBLE!","As soon as the essence reached his origin, it shone with a silver luster that went to form the outlines of 10 stars, his Nebula spinning faster as it absorbed the law essence from the surroundings Law Origins as well as the atmosphere to finish condensing these 10 Stars .","DING!","All 10 Stars were swiftly forged as his Nebula continued to spin, Noah giving a light smile as he moved on to the next one and continued forging stars as easy as one could!","The three girls that thought Alexander had given them enough surprises for today had to look up with surprised eyes again when they noticed that even though they were still absorbing their first Pearl and carefully forging their Stars, he had moved on to his third .","He had such a rapid rate of absorption that they wondered if he was already a black hole that sucked in everything!","This rapid rate of absorption continued as Noah soon passed 400 forged stars, then 600, then 800!","He had absorbed over 50 Effulgent Star Pearls in the span of an hour forming nearly triple the number of stars he had in his Nebula during this time .","Even the Imperial Princess and her maids had only been able to fully absorb 10 Pearls at around this same time! But Noah paid no heed as he continued, absorbing another 20 Pearls as he reached 1000 Stars .","OOOOM!","He felt strong vibrations ringing out from his Origin the moment he completed the 1000th Star, unique black light that actually sparkled draping over his Nebula as it signified he could choose to make the move of trying to form a Black Hole by making his Nebula collapse in on itself, using the force of the numerous stars to easily establish a Black Hole .","But it was common knowledge that the more stars you forged, the higher chances to had of forming a Black Hole as well as increasing its strength! With the maximum number of stars forged in a being known to be 2000, Noah wanted to even bypass this number as he made a grand goal of creating the most powerful Black Hole from his Nebula .","This meant that after he reached 1000 Stars . . . he ignored the newly appearing essence of sparkling darkness as he continued to absorb more Star Pearls!","1100, 1200 . . . He continued as the stock of Effulgent Star Pearls quickly became reduced in front of him, a shocking cultivation session where he was making progress that would take others years to make in just a matter of minutes!","---","As many beings went about their business across the cluster of Galaxies near the Nexus Galaxy and the Stellar Sky Galaxy, forces had begun moving in the Chaotic Void .","Placed on enormous ancient vessels, a ridiculous number of Fiends with high realms of power spread out from the Burning Domains Galaxy silently as they spread towards many different locations .","The shocking thing about them wasn’t that their numbers were in the millions or even billions, but the fact that they had a few tens of thousands of beings stepping out that had achieved extremely high realms! They didn’t bother sending dredges below the Nebula Rank, so their force was not large in quantity, but freakishly horrendous in quality!","They were launching simultaneous attacks across multiple Galaxies to make sure there would be no reinforcements or even a chance for others to act, occupying everyone as they made them busy while achieving their goals!","One of their biggest goals lay in the Stellar Sky Galaxy, where Vessels carrying 2 thousand Fiends at the Nebula Rank and slightly over two hundred Fiends at the Realm of Black Hole were prepared!","This was a shocking force to be sent to one location, but this Galaxy was one that the Entity behind them wanted something from .","Even more shocking was the number of Fiends at the Nebula and Black Hole rank, where no dredges of lesser power were sent! These were creatures that could not traverse in laws, but could easily achieve high Realms instead . Their shocking numbers would cause the scalps of many to tingle as there was a Fiend Emperor leading them, and he wasn’t alone as a being with the same aura as him stood not too far away while they traversed the Chaotic Void .","This meant that 2 QUASAR Realm Fiends on top of over a 200 at the Realm of Black Hole Fiends and 2 Thousand Nebula Rank Fiends were all rushing towards a single Galaxy!","It was strong enough force to cause the collapse of any common Galaxy, and it was headed towards the Stellar Sky Galaxy that only had a single QUASAR expert on it- its Ruler!","It was bound to be a hectic and shocking oncoming days as Noah was still at the Nebula Realm absorbing Effulgent Star Pearls in the Stellar Sky Galaxy . . ."]},{"number":664,"title":"Chapter 664: Chapter 663","paragraphs":["Chapter 663: 663","In the starry space near a Stellar Star of the Stellar Sky Galaxy, a beautiful scene of multicolored silver Star Pearls floating seamlessly in the air could be seen .","For figures were floating around these Supreme Grade Star Pearls as they absorbed them serenely, with Noah coming to a stop at this moment as he saw a bit over 200 remained floating in the starry space .","He had already absorbed a majority of the Pearls by himself, currently having over 1200 stars swiftly rotating within his Nebula . He wouldn’t finish the rest of them as they should be enough for the Imperial Princess and her maids to continue absorbing over the next few hours, so he simply made the decision to move out and find some more Star Pearls for himself to absorb!","He did not feel any sort of limit as he forged more of them, so he would simply continue to do it until his very Nebula screamed that it couldn’t take anymore .","He transmitted his thoughts to the Imperial Princess as her veiled figure broke her concentration to look towards him, a fairly reigned tone ringing out from her .","\"Thank you for collecting so many of them for us . You’ve repaid my favor over and above as it seems I owe you even more right now . \" The thankful words of the Princess reached his ears as he didn’t bother the concentrating maids, his figure disappearing silently as even the Protectors floating not too far from them only watched on .","\"I’ll regroup with you guys soon after I collect and absorb more of these Star Pearls . \" He left behind these words as he disappeared, delving further into the Stellar Sky Galaxy as he sought more Stellar Stars and even possibly Realms!","His physical prowess was currently extremely monstrous, his speed being pushed to ridiculous degrees as multiple skills from the Terror of Aether Skill Tree continued to make him ridiculously proficient in the field of space . When adding on to him actually comprehending the law of space, it just compounded as he was like a fish swiftly swimming through native waters .","He was a streak of light as he traversed the region they were in, coming across numerous stars as those termed Stellar were in the minority, but with half an hour he was able to see the silver shine of another Stellar Star as he descended down while covering his aura .","There were natives mining on this star as well, and he didn’t want to waste any time introducing or explaining himself as essence wrapped around him as he caused his body to become smaller, miniaturizing himself to the size of a grain of sand as he then shot forth with great speed towards the earth of this Stellar Star!","His small size would allow him to drill through relatively unannounced as Eyes of Truth already told him the locations of all the Effulgent Star Pearls of this planet, and he would switch from the destructive Aether he used to dig through into the potent Life Essence to simply mine and place the Pearls in his Expansive Space .","But on his 5th Star Pearl on this Stellar Star where he was about to stow it away, he saw the inefficiency as even without plucking the pearl out, his tiny fingers landed on it as he began absorbing it right then and there, all the essence of this Pearl being sucked out in a matter of seconds!","He felt the formation of 10 extra stars as he nodded thoughtfully, continuing to go through the Star efficiently as he found the locations of these treasured Pearls and absorbed all of them without reservations .","After an hour, he had found and absorbed 150 more Pearls, easily amassing another 1500 Stars within his Nebula! The aura of sparkling darkness that descended after he reached the 1000 point continued to become ever denser and brighter, telling him that he could choose to try forming his Black Hole with relative ease at this moment if he wished as he had over 2700 stars within his Nebula!","This was an extra 1700 compared to the 1000 goal that many beings sought, even the most dreadful geniuses to be documented around the cluster of Galaxies near the Nexus Galaxy having the information of a powerful individual being able to forge as many as 2000 Stars before they embarked to form their Black Hole . It was a documented and researched fact that within Galaxies, actual Nebulae held around 700-1000 Stars, and that was where this magical number was contrived .","Going above it meant exceeding the known limits of a Nebula!","For Noah, as he saw the ridiculous usefulness of the Effulgent Star Pearls and the rate he forged his stars, his goals were extremely high as he asked himself- what stopped him from reaching 10,000 forged stars? Ten times what beings normally had before they broke through! But even further, what stopped him from going above and beyond?","Thus, his gaze remained steadfast as he emptied the hidden reserves of the Star Pearls of this planet as well, gaining over 500 Pearls instantly as the number of stars within his Nebula rose to 6200 .","6200!","He felt boundless power as this was the equivalent strength of 6 Peak Nebula Rank experts all contained within him, causing his body’s explosive speed to only increase as he moved from this Stellar Star and went on to find the next .","As he streaked across the starry space of the Stellar Sky Galaxy, he wished that this body also had the [Pocket Realm] that would have allowed him to use the abilities of his Infinite Realms that allowed him to find Treasures, but he could only rely on blind luck at this instance as he streaked across space .","When his thoughts came to this, he laughed as he recalled that he had an ability that was actually called Blind Luck, and as if wanted to announce itself at this very moment, his eyes picked up a silver luster at a far corner of space to his right, halting his direction as he went towards this light right away!","The light only became brighter and brighter as he neared, a bright smile blooming on his face as he found an enormous Silver Door seamlessly floating in space .","[Gateway- Stellar Realm] :: A gateway that leads to a Stellar Realm filled with abundant life forms...","His Protagonist Trait put in some work as the third thing he came upon wasn’t another Stellar Star, but a grand Stellar Realm that should have been multiple times larger than any star!","This meant an even more exorbitant amount of Effulgent Star Pearls that he could mine with the highest grade, and it meant an even more shocking number of stars could be forged within his Origin . His grain-sized miniaturized body went forward and touched the gateway as he quickly disappeared, entering his first Stellar Realm that was filled with an even more beautiful silver-colored luster!"]},{"number":665,"title":"Chapter 665: Chapter 664","paragraphs":["Chapter 664: 664","The Stellar Realm was simply like an even larger Stellar Star, the unique color of silver presence throughout as it seemed like an ancient land untouched by the ravages of time .","The number of natives in this Realm was even higher though, with each of them carrying out mining operations as they searched for the Effulgent Star Pearls themselves .","This was the main job for many beings in this Stellar Sky Galaxy! Noah ignored all of them as his militarized body sunk into the earth, continuing his own search as he repeated the same process of absorbing as soon as he located them .","The number of forged Stars within his Origin continued to explode upwards of 6000 as his body in the Novus Galaxy was experiencing great changes as well .","Both Noah and the body of Alexander shared the same Origin, and thus a majority of things were shared between the two bodies!","Law comprehensions and even something like progress in the Primal Propitious Physique were shared simultaneously, but the essence of his realm was the only thing that wasn’t simultaneously shared .","This was the reason why Alexander had remained in the Star Forging Realm after the process of Transmigration, but had abruptly risen into the Nebula rank the moment the cores of a single being of that Realm landed in his hands .","The process of Alexander forging stars was also even faster after he gained more cores from Fiends in the Devouring Hells Realm, catching up and beginning to exceed the number that the Original body of Noah had in the Novus Galaxy!","Now that the situation was switched with the body of Alexander leading the way with over 6 thousand forged Stars within his Nebula, the body of Noah in the Novus Galaxy was having a stellar time as all it was required was for him to use the abundant Enhanced Essence of the galaxy and Infinite Realm he was in- this essence being enough to reproduce the forged stars that a part of his Origin had already created!","In the past few hours as the absorption of the Effulgent Star Pearls continued, the body of Noah had already amassed over 2 thousand forged stars as a similar unique dark veil landed on his Nebulae, letting him know he could try breaking through and forming his Black Hole any time .","So he continued on fearlessly as the body of Alexander began to locate and absorb even more pearls in the Stellar Realm, excited to see if a universal restriction or anything like that existed that would prevent him from completely shattering everything that was known about the forged stars of the Nebula Realm!","---","As Noah continued actions that literally nobody else could take in the Stellar Sky Galaxy, a terrifying force approached not just this Galaxy, but 3 more that were in the cluster of Galaxies near the Nexus Galaxy .","The forces were distributed fairly evenly, with over 200 Fiends in the Realm of Black Hole, over 2000 in the Nebula Realm, along with two Fiend Emperors at the shocking Realm of Quasar!","A force such as this was heading towards the 3 Galaxies that were either Allies or under the Influence of the Nexus Galaxy, while the force heading towards the Nexus Galaxy itself was even more terrifying as it held double the experts at the Quasar Realm, and another being that the Fiend Emperors called an ’Elder’ .","This ’Elder’ . . . was a terrifying existence that could not even be talked about at this moment . . .","Among the 3 Galaxies targeted, the one that the Imperial Adjudicator was currently trying to stabilize, the Sanguine Galaxy- actually had no force going towards it, and this was purposeful! This, along with the huge force heading towards the Nexus Galaxy undetected were all just merely preparations .","This was all preparation for the terrifying Imperial Adjudicator and the forces under him that would run to protect the Nexus Galaxy, and it was also just one of the schemes hatched by the Entity behind the Fiends to mask their true goals for this venture .","Their main goal was a treasure in the Stellar Sky Galaxy, with the side goals of claiming influence over the Galaxies that had fallen under the reign of Imperials while diverting the attention of the Imperial Adjudicator to multiple attacks as they reduced his ability to make strategic decisions even further by taking control of the Stellar Sky Galaxy and holding his daughter hostage!","For this mission, the party of Fiends under the two Quasar Fiend Emperors moved with vigor, the terrifying expressions of the two powerful creatures being extremely cruel at this moment as they silently traversed the Chaotic Void and neared the position of the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","\"Brother Blazing Earth, how will we locate the Treasure that Master wants us to find? A Galaxy is much too vast for us to search all of it before the Imperial Adjudicator retaliates and hinders us . \"","One of the Fiend Emperors called out to the being that had reported to the Entity not too long ago and been directly given the mission of finding a Page of Ruination in the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","This Fiend Emperor had his body tower over 4 meters in size as the terrifying wings and animalistic horns growing out of his head were extremely terrifying, his eyes filled with intense light as he replied with a guttural voice .","\"Master showed me the unique energy signature of that treasure . As long as it is within the Galaxy, I will be able to quickly scour it as I find whatever Star or Realm it’s hidden within in no time!\"","RUMBLE!","His words were filled with belief and strengths as he continued .","\"There is only a single Quasar Expert within the Stellar Sky Galaxy, after we reap his life and take hold of the daughter of the Adjudicator, we can swiftly begin this mission as the experts of the other 4 Galaxies scramble to defend themselves without knowing our true goals . \"","A fearsome plan was revealed as cruel smiles came upon the faces of the QUASAR Fiend Emperors, the 200 Fiends in the Realm of Black Hole and the even more numerous Fiends at the rank of Nebula contained within their Ancient Vessels shone with a menacing power!","\"Such puny and weak existences that only have a single Quasar ranked expert defends a Galaxy . They are about to know that we have multiple of such experts among our Brothers and Sisters, and even more terrifying Elders at the rank of the same thing they protect- GALAXY!\"","RUMBLE!","The rank after Quasar was revealed from the monologue of a terrifying Fiend Emperor at this time, the luminous and heart-shaking realm that very few people understood and even fewer people knew about- The GALAXY Realm .","\"After we rip apart the Quasar Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy, we can bathe in the blood of their so-called experts as we search for the Treasure that even they do not know exist, nobody being able to stand in our way...\"","\"And after that pesky Adjudicator is taken care of by Elder Oswald, what can they do but despair? This cluster of Galaxies will fall to our control as we begin to finally let our name known to all the Ancient Powers of this Dark Universe . . . as we finally build a bastion to protect all Fiends and never be enslaved again!\"","Cruel lights passed through the eyes of the QUASAR ranked experts as they neared the Stellar Sky Galaxy that had a Protagonist still rapidly moving in the Realm of Nebula .","The power difference was vast and the gulf of strength was wide, and the shocking conflict was about to be even more glorious!!!"]},{"number":666,"title":"Chapter 666: Chapter 665","paragraphs":["Chapter 665: 665","There are such things known as limits .","Normally, people adhere to these limits as they reach an upper boundary of something, and they are satisfied with it as they then proceed forward in another direction!","Yet for Noah . . . he was currently looking at a limit, and then simply chose to bypass it!","As he traversed through the large Stellae Realm, he found and absorbed a few hundred Pearls as he neared the 10,000 boundary of forged Stars within his Nebula, where he was currently at 9,999","Yet when he neared this number that should have been a limit his eyes remained impassive as he didn’t seem that impressed!","10,000 would be ten times the normal amount of forged Stars that any recently known beings had undertaken, but to someone like Noah who had risen so quickly from just absorbing treasures of a specific galaxy, it made him hungry for more .","Other beings would have counted their lucky stars and embarked on the formation of a Black Hole right away, but Noah simply watched as the 10,000th Star completed forging, causing a huge change to occur once again within his Nebula .","RUMBLE!","It vibrated with the immensity of power one would even wonder if this could be considered a Nebula anymore, the vast amounts of stars being truly too much to wrap one’s head around!","With the 10,000 count reached, the sparkling layer of darkness that had descended down when he reached 1000 was replaced, his eyes watching as he saw the essence of the surrounding Law Origins somehow resonating with his Nebula at this instant, the rainbow-colored essence of the Universal Laws themselves beginning to descend onto his Nebula as they draped over them magnificently .","This caused for the ten thousand stars within his Nebula to shimmer with colorful splendor, the shone of his Nebula at this moment screaming magnificence!","He was constantly receiving an indication in his mind from his very own Nebula that if he chose to so at this moment, he could very easily form a Black Hole .","His Origin seemed to be nearly screaming to him as it said- ’You’ve worked hard, let me go on to the next stage now!’","Yet as he saw the active Nebula and the swirling of universal law essence around it, he remained impassive and unimpressed as he went towards the next location in the Stellar Realm that held another Effulgent Star Pearl .","This was because even as his Origin screamed for him to do something else, his own Intuition and ability as a Grand Controller of the Law of Fate told him he would find something much bigger if he continued going!","So he simply ignored the shocking number of the 10,000 milestone as he asked himself- ’Why stop there?!’","RUMBLE!","A wild and unruly thought, a thought that would bring about immense consequences! Instead of a measly 10,000 stars that were 10 times the normal amount, Noah’s only thought was what exactly stopped him from gaining 100x the normal amount?","The answer would only be given in time as he continued the rapid absorption of unique treasures, unknown movements continuing to occur unbeknownst to him...","---","In the Sanguin Galaxy, the ruling powers were being reorganized as this recently conquered Galaxy by the Imperials came into agreement with the Imperial Adjudicator to be placed under the influence and rule of the Nexus Galaxy .","The Imperial Adjudicator himself was present as he looked at the many regions of the Sanguin Galaxy and the unique treasures they held that promoted law comprehension and the increased growth of Traits, his insight being one of the things that continued to allow the reign of Imperials to remain steadfast over the last thousands of years!","He was also extremely careful of everything he did over the years as this attribute of his got him where he was today . Unbeknownst to even himself though, he had recently tripped up when it came to something close to him, and it would bring with it a painful lesson...","\"Hmm?\"","It felt like a buzzing intuition at first, but the same being that was talking to and had granted the Imperial Princess permission to traverse into another Galaxy- this same being rose from a wide room of an enormous fortress as he felt something!","The fortress he was in was located in what could be considered the ’Central Realm’ of the Sanguine Galaxy, and this was where he was releasing all his commands as he monitored the movements of beings and the unearthing of the treasured resources from now on .","Yet from the room he was in, he stood up as his deep and starry eyes looked above, piercing through the fortress and even the boundaries of the Central Realm, and then it went even further as it seemed to see past the entire Sanguine Galaxy!","This gaze was inquisitive at first as it seemed to have seen far too much, becoming grim in a matter of seconds as he erupted with shocking power that instantly shattered everything in the room to dust .","A shout could then be heard throughout the Sanguine Galaxy as it entered the ears of all experts at the Nebula Rank and above no matter if they were natives of Imperials!","\"Fiends are laying siege to the Nexus Galaxy! All able-bodied Imperials and those under our control- set off to defend at once!\"","RUMBLE!","Shockingly, the Imperial Adjudicator had noticed the moments of the Fiends right before they entered the Nexus Galaxy, calling for defenders to move out right away as he also began sending numerous messages for the Generals in the Nexus Galaxy to be ready .","RIIP!","His own figure tore through the surrounding space as he traversed to leave the Sanguine Galaxy right away, not even taking the Void Beasts that were pulling a grand Imperial Vessel larger than any other in the periphery of the Sanguine Galaxy .","This was because this being known as the Imperial Adjudicator could move even faster than the Void Beasts in the Chaotic Void, and he was truly in a hurry as he somehow noticed terrifying auras nearing around the Galaxy he controlled!","Thus, he rushed out at extreme speeds while commanding his forces to do the same, but what he had yet to find out was that it was not just a single Galaxy that being laid siege to today..."]},{"number":667,"title":"Chapter 667: Chapter 666","paragraphs":["Chapter 666: 666","At the same moment, the Imperial Princess was finishing absorbing her 119th Supreme Grade Effulgent Star Pearl, her Nebula brimming with stars over 1300 as one added those she already had before coming on this trip here .","She was having the most peaceful time cultivating as she made enough progress in a matter of hours that would normally need tens of years, if not hundreds!","Yet she wasn’t alone in this as the boon was extended to her two maids that were also brimming with power .","And all of this . . . was made possible by a single being that continued to defy all expectations .","Anna thought of the singular mystery known as Alexander King who still had not returned as she was about to grab another Pearl to absorb .","Even though she knew she could try and form her Black Hole right away, she wanted to continue absorbing more Pearls as she forged more stars, knowing the more she could forge the better her chances and talent .","She was reaching for this Pearl when she suddenly felt an intense aura of wild madness and power, her veiled face turning upwards from the starry space of the Stellar Sky Galaxy as they seemed to pierce through the layers of stars and see the Chaotic Void outside it!","RUMBLE!","It was also at this moment that the 10 Black Hole Rank experts assigned to protect her also felt something, those in the Nebula realm feeling it as all their gazes turned upwards in a shocked fashion .","This was because they could sense a tremendously powerful aura of wild and maddened power that some of them were familiar with, but this wasn’t the more shocking thing! The more shocking thing was that these auras . . . were just too many!","Those that were even more perceptive were able to notice that among these domineering auras, there were two that were particularly horror inducing as the faces of all the Nebula Rank experts turned ashen .","WAA!","The 10 Black Hole experts instantly surrounded the party of the Imperial Princess as they picked up their communication medallions that had begun to light up with information, but it wasn’t one that they wanted to hear as it told them of a shocking attack coming to the Nexus Galaxy .","They felt their words stuck to their throats as they had wanted to report that an attack had reached the Stellar Sky Galaxy, the same Galaxy where the daughter of the Imperial Adjudicator was at!","Anna rose from her positions as the two maids surrounded her even closer, her piercing gaze seeing shocking things as at this moment, powerful auras entered the Stellar Sky Galaxy wildly .","Filling ancient looking Vessels that could traverse the Chaotic Void, the race of Fiends they knew all too well made their entrance into the Stellar Sky Galaxy, and all that noticed them were shocked when they observed their sheer numbers .","It wasn’t something in the billions or trillions that would make someone shake their heads in wonder, but it was merely a small number of around 2,000 .","Then there was an even smaller number of around 200 .","And an even smaller number of 2!","They were actually small numbers, but they represented extremely shocking identities that made those looking at them treat them with more horror than even if it was a trillion enemies .","This was because the 2000 represented Fiends in the Nebula Realm, the 200 represented Fiends into the Realm of Black Hole, and the 2 represented Fiend Emperors standing stably in the QUASAR stage!","The faces of the 10 Black Hole experts protecting the Imperial Princess turned ashen as they saw the scene of these intruders, but yet another aura appeared thereafter that somewhat caused them to breathe easier .","RUMBLE!","From the center of the Stellar Sky Galaxy, a being shimmering with silver and white light as bright as a star made his way over, their eyes that saw from far away observing this being to actually appear not too far away from their position as he looked at the invading forces of Fiends that silently went towards a certain location in a straight line- towards the very spot that the Imperial Princess and her guards were at .","But the being that had appeared between them was someone extremely special, the being known as the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy!","The party of the Imperial Princess and others could see all this very closely because they had just entered the Stellar Sky Galaxy a few hours ago, and had stayed in the periphery of the first Stellar Star they found as they were very close to the boundary of the Galaxy .","So when the Fiends neared and entered, their auras picked them up . But this also meant . . . the powerful Fiends also picked up their signatures and knew who they were, actually making a bee line right towards them!","But it was at this moment that this Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy appeared, his gaze bubbling with fury as he glanced at the terrifying force of Fiends atop the ancient Vessels .","\"What do you want with my Galaxy that you Fiends would send your entire force here?! What have we done to wrong you?!\"","RUMBLE!","The voice of the Ruler rang out clearly for all to pick up as the ancient vessels carrying the Fiends forward did not stop, another voice merely coming out coldly as they moved unhindered towards their goals .","\"Our entire force? You think too highly of yourselves, humans . This is merely but one force from the many that finally embarked from our glorious Burning Domains...\"","...!","\" . . . As for our purpose, it is naturally your Galaxy . . . as well as the little spawn of a princess that was nice enough to be very close . \"","RUMBLE!","Many beings felt their hearts shaking as they heard and understood the meaning of these words, some beginning to feel fear seep deep into their bones as they really confirmed the enemies invading in front of them .","Even the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy that shone with the luster of a small sun shook as he himself was only at the QUASAR Realm, and he could see two beings of the same rank as himself standing to oppose him, the one who just spoke being particularly more powerful!","As he floated in the starry space of his Galaxy, his heart twisted as he knew they had stepped into a terrifying ordeal .","A truly terrifying and terrible ordeal of powerful enemies!","From the same direction that the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy had come from, thousands of lights that each signified powerful beings began to gather, those that were defenders of this Galaxy coming forward with shaking hearts .","Andreas could be seen amongst the many beings as they made their way forward . Within the group of thousands, only a bit over 30 Black Hole experts could be seen, slightly over 200 beings at the Nebula Realm, and the rest were Star Forgers!","Even though their hearts felt an incredibly cold chill, they still came forward to defend their Galaxy .","Near the mined Stellar Star, the party surrounding the Imperial Princess shook as they looked towards Anna in despair, never in their lives thinking this being would be targeted, and they would be the ones protecting her!","The Princess in question herself seemed extremely poised as her veiled gaze still looked up and observed the approaching ancient vessels with shocking auras, the two Maids nearest to her that were shaken themselves only hearing a sigh from her as she waved her hands and caused the appearance of a shimmering golden-green medallion .","A few million miles away from them, from the doorway of the Stellar Realm that a particular someone ahead entered not too long ago- he came out once again as his eyes also stared towards the periphery of the Stellar Sky Galaxy as he saw the shocking invading force assembled and making their way .","In the middle of forging thousands of stars within his Nebula, Noah came out to find a nauseating number of enemies multiple ranks above him make their entrance into the third Galaxy he had stepped into!"]},{"number":668,"title":"Chapter 668: Chapter 667","paragraphs":["Chapter 667: 667","In the Chaotic Void, a being that looked like an exploding sun shone brilliantly in the utter darkness as he tore through the void while making haste towards the Nexus Galaxy .","Numerous teleportation stations were used by him as he traveled even faster than Void Beasts, the trip that would have taken vessels hours being grounded down to mere minutes by him!","As he was soon about to reach the Nexus Galaxy, he took out his Command Medallion that could receive many messages and communications in times of emergencies to check the situation, and his blazing speed came to a halt instantly as he picked up more information from the Medallion .","WAA!","He came to a stop in the Chaotic Void as he was just a few minutes away from reaching the Nexus Galaxy, the thing that brought him to a stop being the news that it was not just the Nexus Galaxy that was being attacked, but the 3 other Galaxies under their control as well as . . . the Stellar Sky Galaxy!","His face turned extremely grim as more communications finally entered from the Black Hole experts sent to protect a special someone adventuring within this Galaxy, revealing shocking information about the purpose of the invaders who had stated clearly what they wanted .","His body shook as he heard many messages coming in that revealed horrendous information of powerful forces of Fiends led by QUASAR ranked experts on each of these Galaxies, with the Nexus Galaxy facing an even more terrifying force!","But none of this was the reason that made the face of this Imperial Adjudicator turn grim . It was the information that the Fiends attacking the Stellar Sky Galaxy had his daughter as one of their goals .","This was the reason he came to a stop in the middle of the Chaotic Void, not continuing to go towards the Nexus Galaxy that was just a few minutes away now! It was because he knew his precious daughter was in danger!","This fearsome commander that ruled an entire Galaxy, this being that held the title of a Ruler of a Galaxy . . . his heart was currently burning with wrath and pain as the Galaxy he swore to protect and had everything he had built was under attack, but his one and only daughter was also being targeted by the same enemies in a terrible plot .","He came to a stop as he could not make a decision on whether he should go save his daughter . . . or save his Galaxy!","Ah!","BUZZ","At this moment, the Command Medallion rang again as the Imperial Adjudicator received another communication, and this time it was from someone special as it drowned out all the other voices coming out of the Medallion, the body of the Adjudicator shaking as he heard a sweet voice that made his heart feel like it was being squeezed .","\"Daddy . \"","----","In the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","As the force of powerful Fiends was descending down, Anna took out a Medallion as she sent her voice into it quickly while hoping for a reply .","It was a Medallion only to be used for emergencies, and a pretty shocking emergency showed itself in front of her at this time as she called out, \"Daddy . \"","The voice of a daughter calling for her father was calm and composed, her heart only stirring when she heard the reply of the powerful voice she was always used to .","\"Anna, are you safe? The Fiends...\"","\"There’s a decent amount of them arriving at the Stellar Sky Galaxy . Hearing their words, it seems they probably sent another force just like it if not more powerful to our home . \" The voice of Anna was calm as she analyzed the words of the Fiend Emperor and quickly came to a conclusion, the voice on the other end going quiet as it heard these words!","\"Don’t worry about me, Daddy . You need to go protect our home . \"","RUMBLE!","A shocking truth was revealed as the Imperial Princess put many pieces of the puzzle together purely from the words of the Fiend Emperor that they were just one of the many forces of Fiends sent out, realizing that the Nexus Galaxy as well as other Galaxies could also be under simultaneous attacks .","But she went even further as she knew her father was in the Sanguine Galaxy, and he should have now known of these attacks as he would either be setting off to protect the Nexus Galaxy . . . or someone special that had just stepped outside of it!","She was very thoughtful as she knew at this point, her father would be placed in a huge dilemma as the lives of trillions hung in the balance along with the Galaxy he ruled over . . . while he contemplated all of this for his daughter who was in another targeted Galaxy light years away .","\"Anna...\" A voice filled with intense pain and wrath was the only thing that came out from the Medallion, the maids Maya and Raya besides the Princess who was surrounded by the 10 Black Hole experts also looking towards the Princess as they began to tear up .","When Anna heard her Father’s voice again, she smiled lightly as she knew he had already made the difficult decision!","\"Don’t worry about me, our home is much more important, you know? Mom is there, my annoying aunties, even the pompous nephews along with trillions of others...\"","Her voice was always calm and collected, but it had begun trembling near the end as she knew there were many uncertainties to come in the next few minutes!","She was about to continue as she wanted to tell her father she loved him, these words serving a shocking meaning that might have even made the Adjudicator change his mind .","But it was at this moment that she spatial fluctuations near them, her gaze noticing the reappearance of the being she knew as Alexander .","Towards this particular genius that she had invited and embroiled into this situation, she wanted to sigh as her eyes caught her face, and she had to do a double take!","Her perceptive eyes saw the expression of Alexander was the same as always, the same expression that had appeared multiple times before he threw ridiculous surprises their way .","As he now stared up towards the few hundreds of thousands of miles where ancient Vessels filled with Fiends were coming towards them, she saw that his expression was as calm as ever, and it didn’t have any ounce of fear!","Her heart settled as she saw this expression, pulling back the words of telling her father she loved him that would serve as a goodbye .","She instead spoke sweetly again just like when she was asking him for permission to leave the Nexus Galaxy .","\"Take care of them without a worry Daddy, I’ll see you in a bit . \"","WAA!","She finished these words as she put the Medallion away, glancing towards Maya and Raya, and then towards the powerful genius calmly watching the scene playing out in front of him .","She looked at the calmness of this being’s eyes as she wondered, in the face of all of this when even her Black Hole Protectors seemed to be quaking, what was giving this being the strength to be so calm?"]},{"number":669,"title":"Chapter 669: Chapter 668","paragraphs":["Chapter 668: 668","In the Chaotic Void where the Imperial Adjudicator had come to a stop, his body exploded with even more power the moment the words of his daughter finished, his heart filled with such intense wrath that even the Chaotic Void around him warped and shook!","A part of his brain noticed that his daughter had not said goodbye to him, only that she would see him in a bit .","It meant that even his daughter held some form of hope that even with the terrifying plots and enemies against them, she saw a possibility of coming out of it alive!","Just this small possibility made the Adjudicator blaze with even more power, continuing his path towards the Nexus Galaxy as the fate of his daughter was left up in the air .","But now, his power blazed even brighter as he saw a possibility for him to dave both his Galaxy and his daughter, but he would have to act as quickly as possible and crush all enemies before he could go on to save the thing dearest to him!","RUMBLE!","His shocking aura that seared the very Chaotic Void itself thundered towards the Nexus Galaxy, where it wasn’t just those at the Black Hole and Quasar Realm that was targeting this particular galaxy...","---","In the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","Anna’s eyes closed as she sensed the trembling protectors around her, the teary Maids nearest to her, as well as the calm Alexander further from her .","She felt all of this as she looked within her Nebula, seeing the over 1300 Stars that were forged and the dark light that signified she could try forging her Black Hole at this moment if she wished!","She had wanted to wait some more as she stabilized her Realm before proceeding forward, but her languid eyes that were glancing at everything around her became even calmer at this moment as while she looked towards her Nebulae, she gave a single command .","Break through!","RUMBLE!","The space around her shook as even the Maids were slightly pushed back at the pressure, looking towards Anna as they sensed a terrifying gravitational force enveloping her .","This caused their eyes to open wide as they knew what this gravitational force signified- it was what would be observed anytime a being tried to break through into the Realm of Black Hole! The Nebula at their very center would be used as a sacrifice to produce a terrifying Black Hole with a tremendous gravitational force that threatened to devour the being trying to break through if they were not strong enough .","The more stars one had in their Nebula when they broke through, the more stable their Black Hole would be as they had best hope their bodies were also strong enough to withstand the initial force of the Black Hole and successfully finish its formation .","One must know, a Black Hole normally forms because of the death of a massive star, when such a planetary body has depleted its thermonuclear fuel at its very core, it becomes unstable and then proceeds to gravitationally collapse inward upon itself!","What a being had to do when going into the Black Hole Realm . . . they had to utilize their Nebulae filled with over 1000 stars as they gave the command for it to collapse within itself for the formation of a grand and powerful Black Hole .","The result . . . was something ecstatic!","The protectors of the Princess looked towards her location with strained eyes as they saw what she chose to do, their bodies beginning to glow with power as they prepared to lay down their lives if they had to on this day .","The force of the Stellar Sky Galaxy that had also neared saw this breakthrough, their eyes then moving towards the incoming Ancient Vessels carrying Fiends as many of them simply shook their heads in despair .","What could a single new entrant into the Realm of Black Hole do? They had over 200 of such Fiends in the Black Hole Realm as they even held two QUASAR experts! So what if you broke through right now?","Their eyes were filled with despair but also a tinge of hate, as they heard the aims of the Fiends was their galaxy and this Imperial Princess, attributing the fault of them being targetted to her .","Anna paid no attention to this as her heart remained calm, the gravitational force threatening to absorb her body and extinguishing her life being wiped away instantly as she used her EPSILON ranked Trait- [Vector Controller] .","To a being with a Trait such as that, what gravitational force could they not repulse or nullify?!","OOOOH!","Her languid eyes opened wide beneath the veil as she instantly wiped away the terrifying obstacle that came with forming a Black Hole, the terrifying gravitational force disappeared as the Nebula within her that had imploded within itself came down to stabilize . . . coalescing together as vibrantly, a glimmering Black Hole was being born .","An extremely hard breakthrough that should have taken some time and effort to occur was easily cleared by the terrifying Imperial Princess, her veil widely flapping for a second as it threatened to fly off .","\"Haaa...\" A distinct sound of someone breathing out calmly could be heard as Anna reigned in the wild essence pulsing off of her, completely placing her black hole under control as a powerful aura began to rise from her .","Her maids and protectors looked towards her in a stupor as they seemed to want to ask . ’Was that it? You had already broken through?!’","But the stupor was ignored by her as she channeled her abundant energy of this new realm that was sucking in all the essence around her, fully utilizing her EPSILON ranked Trait of controlling vectors as she utilized a high level ability she had just begun to understand .","\"Plasma Generation . \" Sweet words escaped her lips as immensity thundered out .","WAA!","A gorgeous color of blue and purple erupted as the Vector Controller increased the vibration rate of the atoms around her so much until she began to coalesce . . . plasma!","If one was knowledgeable, they would know that plasma is a superheated electrically charged ionized gas that is so extremely hot, causing even electrons to be ripped away from the atoms to form this ionized gas .","This extremely dreadful Plasma had begun to coalesce around Anna, warping the nearby space from its searing heat as it even caused the Maids Maya and Raya to pull back from their sheer scorching temperature . Yet this blue-purple plasma erupted out from the back of Anna Lexalis Dannicus as it formed into a majestic shape of stellar wings, wings made of pure plasma would scorch anyone but the Vector Controller!","As these wings were in the process of forming, Anna’s hands magnificently opened to her sides as the baleful plasma formed there as well . . . in the form of a long cylindrical rope that seemed to turn into a whip as she grasped this destructive plasma with her bare hands .","RUMBLE!","Their formation wasn’t alone as scorching balls of plasma began to erupt all around her, a shocking image of a terrifying creature being created in the Stellar Sky Galaxy as the Imperial Princess became surrounded by plasma, her eyes cold as they stared fearlessly towards the far distance where powerful Fiends stood!","Not too far from her, Noah saw all of this happening as numerous thoughts crossed his mind while calculating the situation around them, his eyes hiding a lustrous shine as it seemed he was plotting something . . ."]},{"number":670,"title":"Chapter 670: Chapter 669","paragraphs":["Chapter 669: 669","The defenders of the Stellar Sky Galaxy gathered under the QUASAR ranked Ruler of this Galaxy as they watched the unhindered Ancient Vessels of the Fiends rush towards them .","Many of them were fearful as they did not even have the will to attack first, seeing how outnumbered they were by the many Fiends .","They had over 200 beings in the Realm of Black Hole while they had slightly over 50 when the defenders of the Imperial Princess were combined, and while the number of Nebula rank individuals they had were in the hundreds, the Fiends were above 2000!","To top it all off, they only had a single QUASAR ranked expert while the other side had two! Faced with such a line up, who would not despair?","The answer was very few special beings!","One was the transformed Imperial Princess that had a shocking look of a being clad in scorching plasma, even the nearby Nebula rank individuals feeling this searing heat as they pulled back in fear . The wings made of plasma erupting behind her seemed to make her unique charm and power even more lustrous as they did not harm her one bit, the control this woman had over the minute atomic particles being extremely frightening .","The other being that wasn’t shitting his pants amidst all of this was naturally Noah!","He had heard the shaking words of the Fiends reverberating through the nearby stars, coming out of the Stellar Realm where he had continued to absorb numerous Effulgent Star Pearls as he forged more stars within his Nebula .","Currently, he was sitting over 16,000 stars as his Nebula felt extremely robust and vibrant, and the intrusion of these beings made him look around in surprise as he complained within .","These were extremely powerful enemies, with two that were shockingly two Realms above him!","He wasn’t fearful as he knew he could run away whenever he wished, and none of these beings were even aiming or looking at someone like him as he seemed to be a small figure in this expansive galaxy .","But was running ever part of his skill set? The answer was no!","He also could not turn tail and teleport away since the person with a singular identity in the Nexus Galaxy had already connected herself to him, and he would be taking an easy path if he continued to stay near her as he went on to try and complete the Protagonist Trait that required him to play a central role in the Nexus Galaxy .","As he looked at all of these factors . . . he chose to stay and fight! He would fight, but of course, he would not throw his life away . So his mind had moved as a few plans formed, and he began adapting to the situation right away as he acted based on his thoughts .","The first thing he did was the moment after he left the Stellar Realm, two drops of blood dripped from him as they floated imperceptibly across the starry space, hiddenly beginning to form into the shape of a humanoid being not too long after as for the first time as Alexander- the Ancient Blood Clones were reproduced!","An ability stemming from the [Blood Lord] skill tree continued to be just as useful as ever, making Noah keen on continuing this Skill Tree and even the ignored Law of Chaos skill tree .","The clones that stemmed from the ability fully formed as they had a singular mission- to continue searching for and absorbing the Effulgent Star Pearls on any Stellar Realms and Stellar Stars lying in the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","His goal was to push his number of forged stars as high as possible, and the situation in front of him . . . was extremely helpful towards that goal if he played it well!","There were over 2000 Fiends in the rank of Nebula aboard the Ancient Vessels, and 200 more in the Realm of Black Hole on top of that .","He did not even begin to think that he could take down the QUASAR ranked beings as was right now, so he focused on the Fiends of lower rank as he knew if he could take many of them down and absorb their cores . . . coupled with his clones searching for and absorbing the Effulgent Star Pearls, he was bound to have an explosive growth unlike any other!","He was not sure how hard of a fight it would be against the Fiends in the Realm of Black Hole, nor what his absorbing of the cores of these beings would provide in terms of forged stars . At these high Realms of Power, one needed to accumulate a large amount of essence before they could proceed forward, and Noah had yet to even confirm the path forward after establishing his Black Hole .","But that would not prevent him from trying to take down experts of such a level as he tested exactly what they would give .","Cores! Skill Points! Whatever other loot they brought with them!","His eyes shone with a greedy light as he planned to use this terrifying ordeal that had many beings despairing and fearful into an opportunity!","The only reason he was somewhat confident besides the fact that he could easily teleport away . . . was when his thoughts went towards a certain skill that he had received from an Ultimate Law not too long ago . His eyes turned into slits as he stared into the stat panel to observe its shocking percentages once more .","[Yggdrasil](5/5) :: An ability that most beings cannot keep active for longer than a few minutes because of its immense mana requirements, but a worthy ability of a user of the Law of Life . Project your comprehension of the Law of Life outwards as you take on the form of an ancient tree lost in the vicissitudes of time . In this form, the user gains +3000% Physical and Soul Defense, +3000% to All Damage, +5000% Health and Mana Regeneration, +3000% Increased Area of Effect on all Abilities, +3000% Increased Attack Speed, +100% Universal Laws Resistance Penetration, +100% to all Universal Laws Resistance, +10% Vitality Returned Each Time an Enemy is hit by an Attack . All enemies struck by your branches gain the [Withered] status effect . All Allies struck by your branches gain the [Boosted Life Force] status effect . The user will also gain a Life Shield after every 10 minutes this ability is kept active . (The skill is currently being enhanced by the [Life] ability . )","With such boosts of this ability that many others could not even keep active for a few minutes, he felt like he should be able to withstand Black Hole Realm experts while being able to butcher those in the Nebula Realm freely!","He could already take care of Nebula Rank Fiends with ease as he saw in the Devouring Hells Realm of the Nexus Galaxy where some of them were imprisoned, and he was basing his plans on this .","The only thing he would have to watch out for and carefully navigate was the presence of the two QUASAR ranked Fiends . He did not have much information on the fearsome power of this Realm, nor did he know if the being known as the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy would be able to stand against one of the Fiends, much less two!","As he glanced at the image of the Imperial Princess clad in purple-blue wings of plasma, he could feel an unshaken gaze that let him know help might be coming because of the identity of this being, but the words of the QUASAR Fiend also let him know that the Nexus Galaxy was most likely under attack .","Help would not be coming anytime soon, and they were most likely on their own!","As the Ancient Vessels of the Fiends neared and he sensed the space shattering power of the two at the forefront, he breathed out calmly as his nerves settled and his mind turned clear .","He sensed the Imperial Princes and her maids not too far away, the protectors steeling their resolves to defend with their lives, and the defenders of the Stellar Sky Galaxy standing behind their Ruler as they prepared for a clash where their lives would most likely be lost .","His eyes then closed as he spread his arms out freely and called out .","[Yggdrasil] .","...","RUUUUUUUUMBLE!","At this moment, a Primeval Ancient Tree had taken root in the starry space of the Stellar Sky Galaxy ."]},{"number":671,"title":"Chapter 671: Chapter 670","paragraphs":["Chapter 670: 670","RUUUUUUUUMBLE!","A magisterial display of mana freely erupted out as it drew the attention of many, even the oncoming QUASAR ranked Fiend Emperors looking away from the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy to briefly glance at this display!","Not too far from the party of the Imperial Princess, a flash of green began spreading out wildly as they observed the appearance of a bud, and then watched as a trunk filled with branches came to be, incandescent green leaves erupting thereafter as the sight was breathtaking to say the least .","\"That is...\"","\"A skill from the Ultimate Law of Life!\"","Many beings went into a stupor as they observed the stupendous show, especially the Law Masters among the party of Black Hole and Nebula rank experts .","Some of them were Controllers, and a few had the titles of Grand Controllers as they fully comprehended the laws of Fate and Chaos . Some were even more proficient and had made great gains in their path as Assimilators, embarking on the path to make the universal laws a part of them!","Yet as they looked at the eruption of this singular skill, they had to take a step back and look multiple times because of the sheer grandness of it .","It was manageable when it first began, but they watched with widening eyes as the budding tree grew an incandescent green color and grew rapidly, numerous roots erupting our beneath it as they wriggled wildly across the starry space, its branches flailing with even more figure as they stretched out and grew luscious leaves!","200 meters!","500 meters!","2000 meters!","3 Miles!","The Primeval Tree continued to spread its roots and branches throughout the expansive space as the party of the Imperial Princess watched in wonder as numerous roots passed around them and covered everything in front of them .","The greenery blazing off of this primeval tree was extremely blinding as a hue of green spread out, even the Imperial Princess in a grand form surrounded by scorching plasma looking up with wonder .","WAA!","Sitting over 5 miles, Yggdrasil stopped growing as its branches shook with vigor, green starlight shooting off from them as the abundant aura of life spread out with ease!","The party of the Imperial Princess under the influence of the Primeval Tree felt their essence responding with vigor and crying out with wanting, drinking the essence of life that enhanced all other laws it came in contact with .","Many beings still looked forward in a stupor as their despair was taken down somewhat, with a few of them having come across Life Law Masters who could use such a skill before!","\"That is...the [Yggdrasil] ability, right?\"","One could not help but ask out loud as they tried to match what they knew about the skills under the law of Life and the phenomenon they were seeing today .","\"It’s too big...\"","\"The biggest I’ve seen was a hundred meters, and the exalted Life Law Master could only keep it up for a minute . This exalted Law Master having his over 5 miles . . . how can he...?!\"","Shock and disbelief spread throughout the minds of many as the eyes of the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy shone, feeling the pressure and despair he felt towards his Galaxy slightly lessen as he observed the power of this new ally .","But only lessen, the despair he felt was still huge as he saw no way of combating two QUASAR ranked individuals alone!","But at this point, some gasps began to occur as the many experts observed the branches of the Primeval Tree to begin moving with vigor, their targets being the allies around it as many became apprehensive .","The tree seemed to feel this as it directed three branches towards the Imperial Princess and her two Maids first . The guards were ready to act when they saw the hand of Anna rise up to stop them, the hand she raised going towards the branch that was coming towards her with a purpose .","PA!","A brilliant green light shined the moment her hand came in contact with the branch that Noah extended, the same scene repeated with Maya and Raya as these three beings felt an overabundance of Life Essence begin to flow through them!","The effect of [Boosted Life Force] was applied to the beings hit with the branches of the Primeval Tree, the dense essence making their bodies feel full of life as any injuries they sustained would be healed rapidly!","As the guards saw the vibrant Life Essence erupting out from the Princess and her maids the moment the branches struck them, they let down their reservation as they allowed the branches of the enormous tree to wriggle around and freely hit them .","PA! PA! PA!","Spectacular sounds rang out through the starry space as enormous widespread buffs were applied, the defenders of the Stellar Sky Galaxy seeing this as the Ruler gave out a command .","\"Join with the Imperial Princess of the Nexus Galaxy and her protector . We shall aid them while protecting our Galaxy!\"","The command spread out through the minds of the few thousand beings as they turned into streaks of light towards a shimmering green resplendent Primeval Tree .","They surrounded it as they waited for tremendous buffs that would make their fight much easier, hoping the exalted Law Master would be able to last a long enough time before he finished all his mana!","Far in the distance, the two Fiend Emperors at the QUASAR Realm saw this as they merely harrumphed, seeing that while the power of this Life Law Master seemed to be unique, they did not sense the aura of a being at the QUASAR Realm from it .","To them, that was enough to treat it as nothing!","Thus, they continued forward as the 2 thousand Nebula ranked Fiends began to weave out of the Ancient Vessels, the 200 in the Realm of Black Hole also releasing their shocking auras as they overpowered the fewer forces coming to gather around the enormous tree .","Most of all, an eruption of frightful power erupted out from the bodies of the 2 QUASAR ranked Fiends as the both of them had their gaze on the Ruler of the Starry Sky Galaxy!","Take out the most powerful one first, and the rest will follow .","This was the strategy the Fiend Emperors were going with as their bodies overflowed with power!","These were beings at the QUASAR Realm .","Did any of the beings in this area truly understand their power? Did any of them understand the gap between them and those in the Realm of Black Hole? Do any of the readers of this grand epic grasp the difference between the Realms of Power?","The answer was no . Not yet anyway!","Soon, it would be made blatantly clear just what those beings at the QUASAR Realm could do . As for the more shocking level of GALAXY that was above it? Ah!"]},{"number":672,"title":"Chapter 672: Chapter 671","paragraphs":["Chapter 671: 671","Across the Chaotic Void, the presence that was shining brighter than a sun neared the Nexus Galaxy as he could already sense powerful shock waves spreading out, a stench of blood and war he was used to beginning to permeate out!","This was the same stench he dwelled in whenever he conquered Galaxies, but never did he expect to find it in his own home .","As his rage only rose to the skies, he saw the shimmering Nexus Galaxy appear in front of his eyes as Ancient Vessels were near its entrance, terrifying auras of power present in these vessels as the scene in front of him was a gory one!","The scene was gory because the defenders of the Nexus Galaxy had appeared, where one could see many Watchers, Law Masters, and Blessed valiantly defending their home . But the valiant defense could not do much as the enemies before them simply had too much power .","The 4 QUASAR ranked Fiends sent here were actually matched with 4 Imperials of the same caliber, showing the power of the Nexus Galaxy to be able to produce for QUASAR Realm defenders! Below them, even more at the Realm of Black Hole like the General Zadan that Noah had previously come in contact with were standing their ground, but it was still a bloody scene as they were being pushed back, with a Black Hole expert drying every few seconds!","The reason for this . . . was naturally the Elder that accompanied the force of Fiends, a being that spectacularly stood at the realm above QUASAR .","OOOOOH!","Bellows of fury and shock could be heard throughout as the 4 QUASAR ranked experts trying to match with the Fiend Emperors were being pushed down by the sheer energy the Elder at the GALAXY Realm released .","At this moment, this Elder actually had a humanoid shape unlike other fiends, his arms scholarly behind his back as he floated in the starry void and observed the show . One could see his body was thrumming with power as he looked like he was about to make a move and wipe out all the enemy forces nearby, but this was the exact moment when the shocking aura of the Imperial Adjudicator appeared!","OOOM","With a grand entrance and a face full of wrath, many beings turned their eyes towards the new entrant as a variety of emotions covered their faces .","The Imperials breathed out sighs of relief as they felt a huge weight lifted off their shoulders, while the Fiends did not seem bothered as they knew the shocking power of their Elder, simply keeping to their relentless advance as the Ancient Vessels pierced into the starry space of the Nexus Galaxy .","The Elder letting out wild waves of power honed his eyes on the wrathful being appearing in front of him, his eyes that had experienced the vicissitudes of time not being bothered one bit as a cold voice released from him .","\"Adjudicator, huh? You’ve been bullying my youngins all this time thinking you were something big . I am here to clear that misunderstanding . \"","WAA!","An aura of majesty released from the Elder as space weaved and cried, even the nearby barrier of the Nexus Galaxy thrumming as if it felt a threat!","The Chaotic Void in the surroundings shook as it seemed to become more orderly, with this shocking phenomenon continuing until the void seemed to take characteristics of the starry space within a Galaxy, as if another Galaxy had actually come to reside in this location .","The shocking truth was . . . that a Galaxy had come to reside in this area, and it was the manifestation of the Realm that the Elder of the Fiends achieved!","GALAXY Realm! A Realm where in the simplest terms, the beings could influence the surrounding area as if it was their own personal Galaxy! Do you even fully understand what this phenomenon meant? The implications were shocking as the Imperial Adjudicator looked at this scene with the same wrathful eyes .","The Father of the fearsome Imperial Princess seemed like a man in his forties, his face sculpted with devilish handsome features and a sharp jawline as his eye brows alone released unkempt regality . Dark hair flowy wildly above his head as eyes that shone with a blue luster glanced at the fearsome GALAXY ranked combatant without any fear .","As he saw the war currently making its way into the Nexus Galaxy, he thought of his daughter that was facing a deadly threat far away, as well as his wife in the Nexus Galaxy! As the images of these beings crossed his mind, his rage overflowed as essence erupted from him .","VOOOM!","Like a vacuum coming to fruition, the aura he released pushed back the horrifying influence of the GALAXY Realm Fiend Elder, glimmers of stars beginning to appear around him as one could see his aura was not at the QUASAR Realm, but it also had not stepped into the GALAXY Realm!","\"Hmph, just a half a step into the Galaxy Realm, and you thought you could raise yourself into a power in this unknown corner of the Universe? Too bold!\"","The voice of the Elder Fiend was as cold and domineering as ever, his aura only spiking up more as it threatened to devour the barely formed manifestation of a starry Galaxy that the Adjudicator released .","\"If this is all you have, it seems like the rest of our targets today, this Galaxy will be falling to the hands of our Great Master . \"","RUMBLE!","Horrid words that would have made any man falter released from the Elder Fiend, the mentioning a Master behind him only making the situation more pressing as the face of the Imperial Adjudicator remained as quiet and wrathful as ever .","As he sensed the fearsome power of his opponent and saw the chaos falling upon the Nexus Galaxy, he held slight hesitation on his face as he recalled the words that a being extremely special to him had said before!","’Only use it as a last resort . . . it is powerful, but it might invite them here! If they find me, I will forever disappear from you and Anna...’","The voice of the being he loved the most repeated in his mind over and over again as he glanced at the fearsome force threatening the same Galaxy she was hiding in, steeling his resolve as he chose to face what may come whenever it came!","As he resolved himself, the eyes of the domineering Elder Fiend abruptly opened wider as he began to sense a fearsome aura emanate from the ’weak’ Imperial Adjudicator .","This aura . . . even made his manifested Galaxy tremble!"]},{"number":673,"title":"Chapter 673: Chapter 672","paragraphs":["Chapter 672: 672","Across the vicissitudes of time, the types of powers and strength were numerous .","The masses would only ever come to touch the cusp of such powers, while a select few enjoyed shockings means of strength that could only be imagined in the wildest dreams!","Such a thing was happening right now as the Imperial Adjudicator that was half a step into the GALAXY Realm saw that to save the Nexus Galaxy, he had to use something that he had been warned not to utilize unless it was in the direst situations .","...","...","...","CRACK!","An eerie silence had pervaded briefly as it seemed the void itself was fearfully waiting, and in the next instant the horrid sound of space breaking occurred as one would be shocked to find the source of the horrid sound was from the Adjudicator’s chest!","RUMBLE!","Essence roiled and tumbled wildly as from the chest of this Galaxy Ruler, the appalling appearance of what could only be described as a rift appeared .","This rift seemed to split his chest apart as he winced in pain, but his blue eyes remained steadfast as he continued to supply his mana towards the stupendous ability he had cast, and the Elder Fiend felt the aura of something unbelievable as from the rift on the chest of the Adjudicator, something was emerging outwards with the luminescence of stars!","Whatever was coming out seemed to have been miniaturized when it was inside the rift apparent on the Adjudicator’s chest, and it continued to enlarge as it got bigger in front of him, overshadowing everything around it as the Imperial Adjudicator announced its name with great reservations .","\" . . . Aurora Galaxy Dragon . \"","WAA!","A magisterial awe inspiring aura erupted in the void at this moment as the image of the beast that leaped out of the rift situated on the Adjudicator’s chest became clear .","The image of a majestic dragon towering over 500 meters appeared with crystal clarity, its scales shining a formidable assortment of colors as the most shocking thing was that when one looked at the body of this Aurora Galaxy Dragon . . . they could see the appearance of a rotating galaxy!","An illusory image of a rotating galaxy was very clearly reflected on the body of this majestic creature, causing the luminescence of millions of Nebulae and Stars to light up the faces of the somber Imperial Adjudicator and the surprised Elder Fiend .","At the same time with the appearance of this Aurora Galaxy Dragon, an imperceptible wave of essence erupted from it as it spread outwards, none of the two beings in the surroundings being able to pick it up .","ROAAAR!","With glistening deadly jaws that were filled with dignity, a space rending Dragon’s Roar erupted out as the manifested galaxy that the Elder Fiend had laid out was entirely wiped away, a domain of unknown wonders being laid down as the fearsome Aurora Galaxy Dragon then turned its gaze towards the Elder Fiend .","Its eyes were colored gold, its face arrogant as it seemed to disdain merely being in the presence of the creatures around it, even the being that summoned it getting the same treatment . The domineering pressure of the Elder Fiend was wiped away instantly in front of the appearance of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon, as one could not compare the skill of a child to an adult!","One could not compare to the arrogance and domineering pressure of a Dragon! And this was a genuine Dragon, a creature brought forth by the !","The Elder Fiend looked on as his demeanor instantly changed, his own body screaming danger as his mouth unconsciously moved in a stupor .","\"That . . . is not possible! Such an ability is only available to those affiliated with THAT Ancient Power, those with knowledge of the power above Ultimate Laws . . . you . . . you cannot have it!\"","RUMBLE!","His arrogance had faded as his eyes turned extremely grim and hysterical, staring at the phenomenon before him in disbelief as he told himself it simply could not be so .","The Elder Fiend had lived long and was somewhat knowledgeable, having listened to the stories of the Entity it called Master as he knew quite a bit about the Dark Universe!","As the Elder Fiend heard the words uttered to bring forth the Aurora Galaxy Dragon that had a shocking aura at the GALAXY Realm, he recalled some of the stories heard before as the identity of this ability became clear to him .","!","An ability that only beings of a fearsome power nowhere near this nondescript location of the Universe should be, an ability that allowed these beings with the profession know as Animus Summoners to call forth fearsome creatures to fight on their behalf!","Some called these creatures Animus Summons, some called them Animus Pets- but the only thing that remained as the truth was the fearsome power of these creatures that could be raised to horrendous levels as it allowed for an Ancient Power to stand strong in the Dark Universe . It was an ability that utilized something even more horrific than the concept of Ultimate Laws .","The problem was . . . it should not be appearing here!","The Elder Fiend gritted his teeth as his overwhelming power at the GALAXY Realm erupted out with even more vigor, its gaze looking up to match with the cold and arrogant eyes of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon that was merely looking at him as if he were an ant, as if he was a being already destined for death .","Meanwhile, unbeknownst to the disbelieving Elder Fiend, a conversation was occurring between the fearsome Aurora Galaxy Dragon and the Imperial Adjudicator .","\"You know what your actions of summoning me can do . Are you so eager to get rid of my Master even after all the favor she has bestowed upon you?!\"","The voice of the Animus Summon was filled with even more rage than the wrath present in the heart of the Imperial Adjudicator, but the Father that was about to lose his daughter replied with a straightforward manner .","\"I had to! Not just the home she is in, but even her daughter is in trouble!\"","...!","The eyes of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon squinted as its oppressive power grew by a whole other level, silence reigning in their telepathic communication as the dragon only left behind a sigh .","OOOOH!","A bellow erupted out from the Elder Fiend at this time as his essence climbed up madly, a luminous red sword appearing on his hands as he screamed out while streaking forward .","\"It cannot be! It cannot be!\"","RUMBLE!","His words said it could not be, his actions wanted to ascertain it! The domineering dragon glanced at this Elder Fiend as the illusory galaxy reflecting on its body shone with a dangerous luster!","Space shattering power of the GALAXY Realm roiled out as even the chaotic void was displaced, a shocking battle beginning just outside the boundary of the Nexus Galaxy"]},{"number":674,"title":"Chapter 674: Chapter 673","paragraphs":["Chapter 673: 673","RUMBLE!","In the Stellar Sky Galaxy, the two sides had began clashing as the Fiends poured out of their Ancient Vessels .","The two QUASAR Fiend Rulers made a straight line towards the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy, a being that was known as the Stellar Ruler!","Hos body shone with the light of stars as his expression seemed to age a great deal in a matter of seconds as he saw the incoming Fiend Rulers, his closest subordinates at the peak of the Black Hole Realm staying behind him to reinforce against the kicking enemies .","Even though they were in the realm of Black Hole, they knew that those in the QUASAR Realm could trash them with ease!","The levels could be explained as such- those in the Realm of Black Hole compared to the Nebula Realm was akin to comparing a professional fighter to a fatty that enjoyed a hedonistic lifestyle all his life .","Meanwhile, comparing the QUASAR Realm to Black Hole was akin to comparing a grown man to a kid! All the grown man had to do was exert some pressure and he could easily trash that kid .","Of course like everything in life, there were exceptions .","Sometimes you had a powerfully trained kid that would be able to take down a grown man . But this was also why it was called an exception- it was rare!","At this moment 2 grown men- 2 QUASAR ranked Fiend Rulers, were ganging up against the Stellar Ruler as he was aided by his forces .","PA! PA! PA!","At this time, the branches of Yggdrasil reached them as they received a light smack on their back, the eyes of the aging Stellar Ruler regaining a semblance of light as Life Essence permeated through him and he felt increased vigor!","His heart thumped with power as it made him fully pull out his emotions of unwillingness, the emotions of not wanting to lose his galaxy! He roared out with power as with the buff of [Boosted Life Force], he clashed with the 2 Fiend Rulers .","OOOOOH!","Off in the distance where the branches of Yggdrasil were many, the Fiends at the Ranks of Nebula and Black Hole were swarming towards the heavily outnumber defenders fearlessly .","The grim looks on the faces of their enemies only served to increase their bloodthirsty as the first of the 2000 Nebula rank Fiends came in the range of Noah’s numerous branches .","As if a snake was lying in wait, the branches filled with shimmering green leaves suddenly stretched and extended out, shooting towards the heads of the unsuspecting fiends as their speed neared that of light!","SHA! SHA! SHA!","A flash of light, a smack of a branch . . . and to those caught off guard . . . death!","\"Hold!\"","The Fiends pulled back for a moment they saw with surprise how 25 Fiends were unlucky enough to have the branches pierce their heads, and that these branches were somehow enough to reap their lives as they watched their lifeless bodies pulled towards the enormous Primeval Tree and be absorbed into its thick trunk .","...!","Seriousness rose in the eyes of the Fiends as the 200 in the realm of Black Hole moved forward at this moment, their gaze towards the branches of Yggdrasil serious as they marked this tree dangerous!","The same scene reappeared when the Black Hole Rank Fiends entered the range of the branches, but they merely slapped them away as they could not be pierced through by them, the gravitational force they gave out being too terrifying .","Yet . . . they were still struck by the branches regardless as without their knowledge, the [Withered] status effect began to be applied to them!","One must note that this was also another difference in Realms . Because of the power of their Black Hole, beings in this stage could still defend themselves against the branches of Yggdrasil that had enhancements in the thousands of percentages .","The high percentage boosts were only enough to keep up with them in speed and slightly lesser in power, and this was shocking enough as it is since Noah was able to target any nearby Black Hole experts and the Fiends at the Nebula Rank alone!","But it wasn’t enough! And he saw this clearly as he saw some of his branches being grasped by the Fiends above him in Realm as they used their strong hands to rip them apart .","RIIIP!","A tingling sensation came everytime his branches were destroyed, only pulling back slightly before they regenerated to rush out with even more vigor!","This was the +5000% Regeneration at work, where as long as he provided mana and wasn’t killed by a terrifying skill, his branches could heal nearly instantly .","One must also recall during all this that he wasn’t alone!","As the enormous Primeval Tree Began to be besieged by Fiends and ripped apart, those who had received its blessing rushed out with vigor as their bodies shone with a hint of green from the Boosted Life Force ability .","Another particularly luminous figure was the Imperial Princess herself, the scorching wings of plasma behind her letting out a resonant cry as she thundered forward not to meet the Fiends at the Nebula rank, but the ones in the Realm of Black Hole!","WAAA!","The scorching temperatures of the plasma caused a line of blue purple lasers to be the only trail that the enhanced Anna left behind, smashing into an advancing Black Hole Fiend as a rupture in space occured .","When one looked at the scene again, they would find half of the body of the Black Hole Fiend to be missing, disintegrated entirely from the scorching beams of plasma!","...!","Alarm rose in the eyes of the Fiends as they moved with more care, seeing that this tree and this Imperial Princess would be a great hindrance to them as they had to be taken care of fast .","But it wasn’t just them as the two Maids living to only protect and service the Imperial Princess looked towards them with eyes pulsing with killing intent, their DELTA ranked Trait erupting out as they went to match the groups of Nebula Ranked Fiends .","The protectors from the Nexus Galaxy joined in, as well as the defenders of the Stellar Sky Galaxy jumping in the fray as the conflict fully began!","As all of this was happening, the numerous branches of Yggdrasil continued to whip as many beings as possible as allies were strengthened and enemies were debuffed, while also strangling any Nebula Ranked Fiends that came anywhere near them .","But everytime a Black Hole Expert came near, they used their powerful realm to not allow any of the branches to pierce through them as they release horrendous attacks that ripped apart the branches .","As Noah observed this situation, the enormous tree he was taking the form of seemed to nod as he then moved on to the next stage of his planning .","One must recall that with Infinite Mana, Noah truly had a great deal of options at his disposal!","One of those options . . . was layering a large amount of immense mana requiring skills that each have ridiculous boosts in order to be able to skip the advantage of the realms of his enemies .","As he looked at the Nebula and Black Hole ranked Fiends that did not dwell in any laws and only had immensely powerful physical bodies, he recalled how he had easily taken care of them before in the Devouring Hells Realm with an attack that dealt Soul Damage!","These thoughts only arrived for a second before he acted .","[Aura of Redemption] .","[Incandescent Emperor] .","[Sword of Judgment] . [Sword of Judgment] . [Sword of Judgment] . [Sword of Judgment] . . .","...!!!","A constant and repetitive spam!","The horrendous abilities under the Law of Fate were cast seamlessly to back up the already ridiculous Law of Life!"]},{"number":675,"title":"Chapter 675: Chapter 674","paragraphs":["Chapter 674: 674","A starry display of luminous essence of gold erupted out the moment Noah cast the skills under the Law of Fate, the golden glow beginning to permeate over the green as golden lines began to spread out from the trunk of the tree and go towards all of its branches!","To understand exactly what was happening, one must recall what the abilities Incandescent Emperor, Aura of Redemption, and Sword of Judgment that Noah had just cast provided to be able to comprehend what was about to happen in the next few minutes .","One had to recall the descriptions of these skills gained less than two weeks ago!","[Incandescent Emperor](5/5) :: The stature of the Incandescent Ruler is adorned as the user adopts a regal armament . While active, Incandescent Emperor grants +1000% to Damage, Attack Speed, Cast Speed, Law Resistances, Defence, as well as +50% Decreased Damage Taken from all sources .","[Aura of Redemption](5/5) :: A circular aura that surrounds the user and grants them constant health regeneration where any damage dealt can be healed instantly for as long as the ability is kept active .","[Sword of Judgment](5/5) :: A unique sword capable of tearing apart space itself is called upon to be wielded only by the user . The Sword of Judgment deals 0 Physical Damage in exchange for dealing a tremendous amount of Soul Damage .","A golden Aura that granted him constant health regeneration for as long as mana was provided!","A skill termed Incandescent Emperor that granted him another +1000% to a great deal of things!","And a skill that gave him a righteous Sword of Judgment that purely granted tremendous Soul Damage!","Just these 3 abilities reinforcing Yggdrasil meant . . . well we would just have to observe to see the results .","The Swords of Judgment continued to appear en masse around the branches of the Primeval Tree as Noah cast the skill over and over again, hundreds of these shocking golden swords being grasped by the tout branches of Yggdrasil as the golden runic lines from Incandescent Emperor continued to spread throughout!","The Fiends and defenders of the Stellar Sky Galaxy alike turned towards this phenomenon with shock as they observed a golden illusory crown appear above the 5000 mile Primeval Tree . Its branches shimmering with gold as it released an extremely dangerous .","And before anyone could absorb and react to this stupendous powerup, a great deal of branches instantly moved out under Noah’s command as they targeted multiple Nebula and Black Hole Realm Fiends! Each of the branches of the ancient tree carried with them a Sword of Judgement, the swords shining with a dangerous glare as they struck out with immense speed multiple times faster than before!","The speed came as a shock to the fiends who watched in disbelief as multiple branches of the ancient tree struck over one hundred nearby Nebula rank experts while an even larger number of branches seemed to target over ten nearest Black Hole Fiends! The instant the branches struck out, the unsuspecting fiends only felt an illusory sword of light pass through them and all of those in the Nebula rank instantly lost their lives .","Instantly!","This was because the soul damage from these swords was extremely high, and such high damage could not be withstood from the surprise attack . This was a shocking sight to see as over one hundred Nebula rank experts fell in less than a second . On the other hand, the fiends at the rank of Black hole fared much better, a few of them being able to react on time as they weaved out of the path of the Swords of Judgment .","But still, six had been unlucky enough to have multiple branches carrying the illusory swords pass through their bodies like a hot knife cutting through butter! Strong in physical offense and defense, but no protection against the damage dealt directly to the soul!","This meant that instantly, six Fiends at the rank of Black Hole also met their death . . .","A lull seemed to permeate throughout the battlefield as everyone looked towards the abrupt attack that had come from the glimmering ancient tree floating in the starry space .","They saw that golden runic sigils were permeating throughout the trunk and branches of the ancient tree, its luminous green leaves shimmering with a hint of gold . But the most striking thing were the dangerously shining golden swords that had been used to deal a shocking sneak attack that took away the lives of too many experts .","The imperial princess floated to the side as her wings made her stand out in the starry space . She still held a veil covering her face, but if one could see her resplendent expression they would see someone looking over in complete disbelief at what had just occurred .","Over a hundred in the Nebula rank dead and six in the rank of Black hole dead instantly!","Off in the distance, the two Quasar ranked experts that were besieging the ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy looked over with grim expressions as they saw the branches pull in the bodies of the defeated Fiends into its thick trunk .","They looked towards each other as an unknown communication seemed to pass through their minds, and then one of them instantly shot towards the ancient tree while the other took the attention of the shocked Stellar Ruler!","OOOH!","The Stellar Ruler burned with essence as this being was actually an Assimilator of the Law of Space, and he was an extremely proficient Assimilator as over half of this Law was already one with him .","His body seemed to become one with space as he instantly appeared in front of the Fiend that was making way towards Yggdrasil, throwing a punch that had the force of numerous stars as the Fiend Ruler came to a stop!","\"Your enemy is me!\"","The Stellar Ruler shouted this while his heart shook at the power the Life Law Master displayed! Aside from the Boosted Life Force given by this being that allowed him to sustain heavy injuries that healed instantly against the two QUASAR ranked beings, it turned out he was also proficient in the Law of Fate as he somehow dealt deadly damage to the Fiends and took down many of them rapidly .","He could not let this being be besieged by these two powerful enemies!","But as if the Fiend Rulers were in sync, the moment the Stellar Ruler appeared to block the one going towards Noah, the other one he left behind instantly disappeared from his location as he neared the wriggling branches of Yggdrasil .","This meant that at this moment, a QUASAR ranked fiend expert was making his way towards Noah as he was marked dangerous, since his actions were simply too eye-catching!"]},{"number":676,"title":"Chapter 676: Chapter 675","paragraphs":["Chapter 675: 675","Meanwhile, Noah himself was reaping the benefits of the surprise attack as he pulled in the bodies of over one hundred Nebula rank and six Black Hole fiends .","The Fiends at the stage of Nebula alone granted him cores that went on to help him forge a range of ten to one hundred stars . Meanwhile, the experts in the Black Hole realm that he had never taken down before and yet somehow there were six dead at this moment-these beings were giving him a range of around one thousand stars each! This meant that from the six black hole experts, he had gained over six thousand forged stars as their entire Origins were brought into the body of Yggdrasil for him to quickly absorb the cores .","One must also not forget the Skill Points that had increased by a few thousand just from the death of these beings!","Yet the cores took the spot light at this moment as there were simply too many being forged all at once, especially from the unexpected source of Fiends .","This was not even accounting for the stars he was currently forging through the help of his Ancient Blood Clones that had been scouring the Stellar Sky Galaxy for more effulgent star pearls . One clone had found a Stellar Star while another was sifting through a Stellar Realm!","With the help of the clone and the over abundance from the fiends that he had just taken down, the number of forged stars was shockingly nearing 40,000 .","This number only served to grant him more excitement as he neared the ridiculous 100,000 stars goal! So his eyes were once again set on the remaining Nebula and Black Hole rank Fiends as he wanted to scream towards them- ’Feed me more!’","His excitement was only dampened when he saw the QUASAR Fiend Ruler making way towards him .","This enemy that was two ranks above him would prove to be a terrible match as he began easily destroying the vibrant and luscious branches of Yggdrasil . His strength was extremely hard to describe, but the one thing one could see was extreme proficiency in the gravitational force around this Fiend Ruler .","Any branches nearby were inadvertently pulled towards the Fiend Ruler as they were then ripped apart right away, the force traveling towards the trunk these branches came from as the damage passed through! This was also when the strong Life Force of Yggdrasil shone though, as this damage was nearly repaired in an instant, the branches just destroyed coming back to life once more!","OOOOH!","While the Stellar Ruler was being stopped by the other QUASAR ranked Fiend Ruler, the one targeting Noah bellowed out as he essence rose by another notch, beginning to tear apart every branch of Yggdrasil faster than they could heal as he went to destroy the enormous trunks releasing its roots across the starry space!","But at this exact moment, a resounding sound rang throughout the region of the battlefield as a green glow bloomed from Noah’s huge form .","DING","With a vibrant eruption of essence, the feature of another ability of Yggdrasil came to be . Life Shield had finally been activated after ten minutes had passed since Noah transformed into the Primeval ancient tree!","RUMBLE","The Life Shield seemed like something that could not be violated, expanding out rapidly as it pushed out any nearby Fiends with an unknown force, including the powerful Fiend Ruler as all of them soon found themselves at the edge of a shimmering green circle .","In the starry space, one could see this resplendent green circular field fully cover Yggdrasil as this ancient tree shone with an even more vibrant luster!","\"Outrageous!\"","The Fiend Ruler was maddened at this being of obvious lower power that could only defend and regenerate at this moment, but he was still not able to wipe him away quickly .","DING!","His fists crashed against the verdant Life Shield as all other Fiends went to do the same, the defenders of the Stellar Sky Galaxy contained in the range of Yggdrasil for the healing abilities of being smacked by a branch looking around with palpating hearts .","The Imperial Princess was the same as her cold gaze shimmering with the power of plasma glanced towards Noah . Her thoughts could not be described at this moment as when she expected another surprise from him, it was nothing like what she was receiving now!","The Maids Maya and Raya were finally out of words as they stared with utter stupor, not expecting a despairing battle to be going this way at all .","But even in this moment of brief respite, Noah was still scheming as he saw the attacks of the many Fiends repetitively rain down on the Life Shield, sensing that this ridiculous shield could actually withstand the attack of these beings for about another 30 seconds at the rate they were going .","Numerous possibilities crossed his mind as one was picked, his attention going over towards the Imperial Princess as he enacted a plan!","\"Princess, can you use your Trait to pull at least 60 of the Fiends at the Realm of Black Hole towards me the moment the shield is broken? Just bring them as far in towards me as possible!\"","His words startled Anna who looked towards him as if he was insane, only affirming with serious eyes when she saw he was serious!","DING!","The Life Shield began experiencing cracks as it would soon be broken, but the Imperial Princess prepared herself as the scorching plasma wings and rays of plasma around her receded .","She thought of the words of Alexander as she sensed her Trait of Vector Controller, committing herself to affect over 60 Fiends at the Realm of Black Hole one way or another . She was also at this same rank, and she would have to control the vectors of 60 creatures to go towards a certain location!","Even with the odds of doing this, Anna still went forward as she began to trust the being known as Alexander more and more . She knew the task in front of her would be extremely arduous, where she might utilize all her mana at once and be immobilized! Yet she still went forward .","CRACK!","The Life Shield shattered at this instant as the embroiled Fiends were about to rush over, others still staying away from the range of Yggdrasil as they threw attacks from a distance! But at this moment, a group of many Fiends in the Realm of Black Hole felt a strong gravitational pull that had a single purpose- to get them to move towards one location with certainty!","It wasn’t a constricting gravitational force, just a simple pulling force that took over 70 powerful Fiends at the rank of Black Hole and brought them towards the very center of Yggdrasil where hundreds of branches carrying Swords of Judgement waited . . ."]},{"number":677,"title":"Chapter 677: Chapter 676","paragraphs":["Chapter 676: 676","Sometimes, only a single skill was required to change the landscape of a battle field entirely .","Such skills required extremely great timing and effort, and most of all had to have a huge aspect of luck to be carried out successfully .","With Noah’s actively flashing mind, he saw an extremely clear path that if taken . . . could cause for an explosive method of growth in a short amount of time . He saw his number of forged stars had increased by a thousand from each of the Black Hole experts as this count was brought over 40,000 stars, and he realized the remaining 60,000 could very easily be gained as long as he took down 60 more Fiends at the Realm of Black Hole!","It was mentioned he could ’very easily’ gain such a large number of stars, but it was an extremely hard thing to accomplish as he effectively wanted to take down 10 times the number of Black Hole Fiends that he did with his first surprise attack .","So he sent his thoughts to the Imperial Princess holding an EPSILON ranked Trait as he read over her Trait with the Eyes of Truth and saw that it could be possible for her to make him achieve this nearly impossible reality!","The result . . . was a star staggering wonder of a brilliant hazy light shining from Anna as she spread her arms out wide, her veil roughly waving in the starry space as she pulled a force of over 70 Fiends at the Realm of Black Hole straight towards the enormous trunk of Yggdrasil .","The moment this phenomenon occurred, not even the QUASAR ranked Fiend Rulers could react in time as a shower of branches folded in on the Ancient Tree, each one carrying a pulsating Sword of Judgment as they tore towards the Fiends!","As if this stupendous ability of Sword of Judgment might not be enough, Noah cast area of attack abilities that affected a wide region, spamming many skills that brought by a spectacular effect since they were cast in the form of Yggdrasil .","[Madness Hegemony] . [Holy Fire] . [Fireball] . [Madness Hegemony] . [Holy Fire] . [Fireball] . . .","Palpating Aether, blazing suns, and golden scorching flames overshadowed the starry space, the shimmering horror of the [Sword of Judgment] in the hundreds slashing towards the shocked Fiends playing out .","One must recall the [+3000% Increased Area of Effect on all Abilities] that was attached to Yggdrasil, and then you had the further enhancement under the [Incandescent Emperor] that made something which should have been nearly impossible into a reality .","To put it in simple terms, the Fiends that had no protection from laws and had very little resistance to the terrifying Soul Damage that was coming out from Noah on top his horrific abilities enhanced by many skills . . . the power of Realms was breached with ease as he was able to reap the lives of 70 beings a Realm above him in a few seconds! All of these factors made it possible for him to leap over the power of Realms and ignore it, reaping the lives of those that should have been above him with relative ease . . .","RUMBLE!","Off to the side, Anna and the other protectors were watching with bulging eyes as the starry space changes color to a tinge of gold and purple for a second, the essence of destructive Aether and domineering Fate present throughout as when the numerous branches could be seen again, the bodies of over 60 Fiends in the Realm of Black Hole were skewered on them as they were pulled towards the trunk of tree at once...","\"You...!\"","OOOOM!","World shaking essence filled with anger erupted out from the QUASAR ranked Fiend Rulers at this scene, the one besieging the Life Shield before pulsing with stupendous strength as he turned into a streak of light towards Noah .","\"Pull back first!\"","His command could be heard as it was directed to the Nebula and remaining Black Hole rank Fiends that could feel their hearts trembling with unease at the butchering of their brethren with such ease . The Fiend Ruler set off alone to rectify this great injustice but . . . he would find that he and his people had just played a part in a shocking play as they acted as the fuel to make a raging fire glow ever brighter!","At this moment, time seemed to come to a slow motion as many important events occurred in the span of a few seconds .","A Fiend Ruler erupted out towards Noah . Yggdrasil then began to shine with a vibrant light as at its hidden center where an illusory Nebula could only be seen by Noah- a great number of stars began to be forged at a rapid pace unlike anything experienced before .","50,000!","70,000!","95,000!","It seemed like his fuel was endless, and it actually was as the loot of 70 Black Hole rank experts went towards helping him put together a shocking Nebula of 100,000 stars . . . was actually completed .","DIING!","An archaic wave of mana erupted outwards from Noah’s huge form the moment that this phenomenon was completed, his entire body coming to a halt as even his clones that were searching for more Effulgent Star Pearls were brought to halt momentarily .","Even his other body and clones in the Novus Galaxy were also brought to a halt for a second, time seemingly being slowed down the instant the 100,000 star mark was achieved, a shocking phenomenon occurring within the Origin of Alexander as the Nebula came to a complete halt!","An essence of appalling age and profound ancientness seemed to emulate from the center of the Nebula and climb outwards, Noah’s mind coming back to life as his eyes shone while looking at his own Origin, a set of words appearing in front of him as he stared at the ecstatic Nebula with Eyes of Truth .","[Complete Nebula] :: An origin in the Realm of Nebula that has achieved Grand Completion, achieving a stage that very few have entered since time antiquity . As with all stages achieving Grand Completion, the illusory Nebula will become more real as it already manifests on the body of the being with this Origin...","A set of words showed something unique that very few had achieved as in the battlefield where time seemed to be moving in slow motion, many beings nearly had their eyes fall out of their sockets as from the body of Yggdrasil, they began to see an image of an expansive Nebula come to life .","This Nebula seemed wondrous and magical, with starry skies filling it to the brim!","A glimmer of profoundness could be felt from as it lit up the entire surrounding space .","Yet before this Nebula could even be enjoyed with all of its beauty, they saw a starry light cover it as the beautiful stars within it shattered, an implosion of tremendous proportions erupting out as it even shook the space outside, those watching with perched eyes beginning to see the formation of a dreadful Black Hole!","At this moment, a variety of factors came to be as Noah imploded his [Complete Nebula] to advance from this Realm he had been in for a few weeks into a brand new stage!"]},{"number":678,"title":"Chapter 678: Chapter 677","paragraphs":["Chapter 677: 677","In the chaotic void of the Nexus Galaxy, tears could be seen in space as flashes of light were the only thing visible every now and then .","This was because an appalling battle was taking place between experts at the GALAXY Realm!","The Elder Fiend was particularly active as he moved with a sullen face, parrying the claws of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon with the blade he carried or even his own body at times .","This was the body of an Elder Fiend that had trained to the peak, gaining a thrumming physical body that could actually match a creature such as the Aurora Galaxy Dragon in battle!","Others could traverse in laws and gain a special understanding, while Fiends focused on their Realms and bodies as they grew to the numbers and levels they were at today . Yet . . . they were still being hindered, and by a power that should not be able to do so at this moment .","The Elder Fiend had a somber expression as his denial about the creature before him could not be continued anymore, the knowledge it had about such a creature spilling out as his heart only became heavier!","The creature he was fighting was truly an Animus Summon or an Animus Pet, where beings proficient in a particular #%$^$ were capable of utilizing profound abilities to bring these creatures to life .","Among the many secrets of the Animus Summons, the one that made them as powerful as they were was the fact that when it came to the Realm of power, they followed archaic methods that granted them a nearly perfect cultivation base! Such a thing could also be understood with ease when one knew what to look for, and the Fiend was convinced when he continued to see the image of an expansive Galaxy swirling within the body of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon .","At any stage, if one could see a Manifested image of the Origin of a being when they utilized their essence, it meant that this being had a nearly perfected realm of power that would overshadow all of those in the same realm!","It was extremely hard to reach such a Realm as the methods to do so had long been lost in the eons of time, but the !&#^^# capable of utilizing made it so that these Animus Pets could actually be raised proficient enough to naturally attain the nearly perfected realm of a long past era .","So even though the Elder Fiend was extremely strong in physique and defense, he could currently only defend against the terrible attacks of this creature that was in the same Realm as him, and yet on a completely different plane!","What was most vexing was the fact that as he stood against this Aurora Galaxy Dragon, the Summoner himself had gone down into the Nexus Galaxy to reinforce the forces there .","Being half a step into the GALAXY Realm, the Elder Fiend felt pain at the thought of the Fiends fighting down there facing the Imperial Adjudicator alone! He knew at this moment that this campaign at the Nexus Galaxy . . . would not be successful!","ROOAR!","A dragon’s roar was all that met his thoughts as a starry claw carrying the force of a luminous Galaxy thundered down...","---","In the Stellar Sky Galaxy, an isolated gravitational force had come to be as a wonder of a Nebula was broken down, those watching seeing the formation of a shocking Black Hole that wasn’t just black in color, but it seemed to hold an assortment of gold, black, red, green, blue...!","It was a Black Hole forming that had the splendor of multiple colors as those watching had to rub their eyes to be sure they were looking at the correct phenomenon .","The implosion of the Nebula and the formation of the Black Hole was extremely fast, nearly instant for those paying attention as one of the benefits for forging the ultimate peak of stars before breaking through was revealed .","Those attaining the 100,000 number of forged stars in their Nebulae before breaking through would have the easiest time doing so, the next stage coming naturally as they would not experience any dangers!","Such was what occurred with Noah, where his spectacular Black Hole formed with ease as he began to feel the surrounding space with much more clarity, the gravitational forces in his immediate surroundings being something that he seemed to be able to easily control .","Many beings watched the formation of the Black Hole with amazed eyes, especially the Imperial Princess that had contributed majorly to making it possible .","Anna was currently breathing heavily after utilizing all her power, drawing nearly every mana she had to pull the over 70 Fiends to the position where they were wiped away . She was surrounded all around by her protectors as she recovered, all of their gazes remaining on Yggdrasil as on this huge tree, they could see the most beautiful multicolored Black Hole that thrummed with unknown power!","If one recalled the clear image of a Manifested rotating Galaxy on the body of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon, they would know this phenomenon was the same one, where Noah had actually achieved a path of a realm very few even knew how to embark on .","Yet he had used brute force of purely absorbing Effulgent Star Pearls and Cores of being a stage above him, finally breaking through and forging something that gave him unrivaled strength on beings of the same Realm!","RUUMBLE!","The leaves of Yggdrasil shone with even more splendor as the slowed down time seemed to move normal, a fearsome pressure erupting out from the ancient tree as it faced the coming onslaught of a maddened Fiend Ruler .","This QUASAR Realm expert locked his eyes with the gorgeous multicolored Black Hole that seemed to release an unknown sense of pressure that made even him uncomfortable, especially the fact that its image was rotating domineeringly in the body of this ancient tree, as if nobody could stand against it!","\"Perish!\"","The aura of the Fiend Ruler climbed as he ignored the danger signals and thundered forward .","A newly advanced being at the Realm of Black Hole versus a being at the Realm of QUASAR!","The former was reinforced with a great deal of skills that granted shocking percentage boosts, and now as he walked on the path of strength that had been lost over the eons of time, his level of strength amidst all of this not being fully calculated yet .","A battle with someone of a higher rank . . . was just what he needed!"]},{"number":679,"title":"Chapter 679: Chapter 678","paragraphs":["Chapter 678: 678","The battlefield had turned chaotic as the QUASAR ranked Fiend Ruler went toward Yggdrasil with an ever rising aura .","The Stellar Ruler observed this scene with unwilling panic as the other Fiend Ruler accelerated his attacks and besieged him on all sides so he could not lend help!","\"Protect the Life Law Master, even if you have to sacrifice yourself!\"","The cry of the Stellar Ruler rang out across the starry sky as many beings shook their heads with strong emotions while listening to the command . Even they knew that if this wondrous being in the form of a tree fell, they would fall even faster as they lost one of their strongest contenders who could also heal all of them in seconds .","The two Maids Maya and Raya did not want to leave the side of the tired Imperial Princess, looking towards Anna with hesitation as they wondered what to do .","All of the beings currently on the scene of battle were on the same mindset as they watched the Fiend Ruler aim at Noah’s life, they knew that it would be extremely hard to win such a battle even with the prowess he had shown in the form of Yggdrasil!","To understand this, one would have to know the distinction between those in the Realm of Black Hole and those who had stepped into QUASAR .","A Quasar is an exceedingly luminous active galactic nucleus that has a supermassive black hole with mass ranging millions of times greater than any common star! In the wide universe, it was known that Quasars were linked to how Galaxies formed, as they had within them the active galactic nucleus that would later make way into something even grander!","The supermassive black hole in the middle of a Quasar continuously collects gaseous mixtures from the surrounding space as it creates a bright whirling disc of light propelled by strong magnetic fields . If one ever had the chance to lay their eyes on a sight of a Quasar, they definitely should!","But at this moment, a being of such a level was thundering towards Noah as around his body, one could distinctly notice a natural swirling mass of star particles that created a natural barrier between the Fiend Ruler and the outside space .","A naturally protective barrier granted whenever one reached the QUASAR Realm, a barrier that heavily reduced all incoming damage while even nullifying lesser types of damage .","Before, when the branches of Yggdrasil even neared the Fiend Ruler, they were ripped apart into nothingness as the Swords Judgment carried on them were easily evaded . Now as Noah stepped into the Realm of Black Hole and stepped on a path of power lost in the eons of time . . . he sent forth his branches once more as other protectors of the Stellar Sky Galaxy swarmed towards his position to also lend a hand!","They watched with bated breaths as the singular branches of Yggdrasil rushed forward while climbing together, gradually forming into a huge cylindrical trunk that was 1000 meters in diameter .","This tree stump went towards the Fiend Ruler making his way over like a raging bull, this QUASAR expert throwing out a fist that carried with it the glimmer of stars, smashing against the cluster of branches head on!","BOOOOOM!","Titillating light waves and vibrations erupted out at the point of contact, the scene becoming clear once more as many beings watched in pure astonishment as they saw a fist still in contact with a thick tree trunk .","BZZZ!","Horrid gravitational forces were continuing to erupt at the point of contact as shockingly, Yggdrasil was not pushed back by the punch from a being a rank above him in the slightest!","\"What!\"","\"That is...!\"","The illusory multicolored Black Hole that was visibly swirling within the body of Yggdrasil could be seen shining ever brighter as it released a stupendous gravitational force, their eyes really registering the fact that someone at the Realm of Black Hole withstood an attack from an expert of the Quasar Realm .","They seemed to have forgotten the feat just a few minutes prior when multiple Black Hole experts were taken down instantly when Noah was still at the Nebula Realm, because they simply weren’t looking at him like he could be in such a realm with the power that he portrayed!","Yet now they visibly saw a shimmering Black Hole that did not appear on anyone else like so, the path of strength only common in ancient times being recreated in Noah’s hands as after seeing he could withstand the horrendous damage of the Fiend Ruler, even more branches weaved together into huge tree trunks .","The vibrant golden green leaves seemed to have an even sharpened edge that could cut apart steel as on the converging branches, hundreds of Swords of Judgment appeared as miniaturized stars also came to be, along with fearsome Portals of Terror filled with pulsating rays of Aether and golden scorching suns as Noah cast [Star Caller], [Madness Hegemony], [Fireball] and more skills!","Since he saw the gap could be breached, he wanted to break it even further by doing what he was best at- spamming!","---","Meanwhile, as the battle between the body of Alexander in the Yggdrasil form and the Fiend Ruler took place, something worth noting was happening with one of the Ancient Blood Clones that was just finishing scouring a Stellar Realm for more Effulgent Star Pearls .","The way of forging stars was much faster when cutting down Nebula and Black Hole rank experts, but where would one free find such beings to do in the future? These Star Pearls could grant someone multiple stars as they would still have their uses, so Noah had the two clones continue to scour the Stellar Stars and Realms of this Galaxy!","One of his clones was passing through the earth of a Stellar Realm while heading towards another location of a pearl, when his body suddenly came to a halt as not too far away from him- he felt the waves of unique essence that he shockingly recognized .","It was the same type of essence that he sensed when the overwhelming Ruination Core was brought out by the Novus Galaxy, an essence that seemed to indicate a Tool of Ruination!","He changed his direction instantly as he followed the waves of this unique essence, piercing through the earth as he broke into a small cavernous space beneath whatever mountainous earth he was on . This space was unique in nature as it seemed to only be holding a single thing within .","Floating in the very middle of this hidden space . . . was a page!","A Page!!!"]},{"number":680,"title":"Chapter 680: Chapter 679","paragraphs":["Chapter 679: 679","When Noah saw the clone break through the layers of earth and see the page floating silently in the small hidden cavernous, he couldn’t believe his own eyes as he had to make sure what the Eyes of Truth were showing him was truly a real thing!","[Book of Ruination- Page XI] :: A page from the Book of Ruination . Knowledge of the assimilation and integration of Laws is contained within .","...!","It truly was! His clone floated towards it as his hands reached out, managing to grasp onto the page carefully as he came across something with a unique texture .","It felt extremely cold to the touch, and even though it seemed to have the properties of a page, he could not bend it even slightly!","As he looked at this page, he was filled with disbelief as even he had to ask himself, what were the odds of him coming across such a thing as his clones scoured the Stellar Sky Galaxy for Effulgent Star Pearls?","He had only searched across a few stars and realms and yet a page from the Book of Ruination was now in front of him!","Granted, he only found it because it released a unique signature that he had felt before because he was around a Ruination Core, but it was still something that caused one to pause .","He would attribute it to Blind Luck at this moment, but his attention was already carried away from the ’Why’ as he stared into the page and wanted to see exactly what was on it .","He stared at the words present on the page as they seemed to come alive, each of them seemingly trying to jump out of the pages! His eyes could not help but read the first paragraph .","{Excerpt XI- Integration}(Book of Ruination) :: The Laws are as vast as the oceans and as solid as the mountains . One can embark on a single law and never complete it in their lifetimes, while others can begin a law and master it in a single day . This time among many things, we discuss the steps after one comprehends a law- we discuss the steps of the integration and assimilation of laws...Among the multitude of creatures in the Universe, the one who embarks on the path where their Origin is loved by the Universal laws will be the one to succeed . . . To those seeking to Assimilate laws in the most optimum way, one must first comprehend all the basic, Supreme, and Ultimate Laws . Initiating a method of Assimilation written later on in this page will allow one to embark on a path that breaks through the chains of Universal Laws as their assimilation of all of such laws will set them on the path of a Grand ***, a path that is needed if one ever hopes to fully utilize the Tools of Ruination, a path of those who stand above many in contempt...","...!","Archaic words filled with power littered the page, those displayed above being but a mere paragraph as what was written on this page could fill half a book! Yet this was only a single page from the book of ruination, a page that was titled {Excerpt XI- Integration)!","His eyes seemed thirsty as he continued to read even more, knowledge he never thought to be possible freely displayed on this page as he soaked all of it in .","---","While his clone obtained something out of his wildest dreams, Noah himself was fighting a being of higher rank than him while actually managing to stand his ground!","The high percentages of boosts given by the many skills he had active were the only reason he was doing what he did, with the other being the abnormally powerful multicolored Black Hole that seemed to release near the same pressure as the Fiend Ruler at the QUASAR Realm .","This was because it was a Black Hole formed from 100,000 forged stars, something 100x times greater than what most beings broke through with!","One must also understand the percentage boosts and exactly how they came to provide Noah the power that he held .","If we were to assign an ’Attack Value’ of 10 to Noah as the base damage he could deal and then apply the +3000% damage, it would be 10x3000%, or 10x30! This would bring the base attack of 10 to 300, an increase of 30 times...","This was why he could match the being at the QUASAR Realm- because nearly all of his attributes and damage of skills were being boosted by 30 or 50 times .","Such was the reason why he could stand against the Fiend Ruler!","BOOM!","Another impact resounded out as Noah observed the starry field around the Fiend Ruler expand outwards, its body trying to weave in and out of the spammed skills or simply tank those that were too large .","Noah was making sure the impact of the skills could be felt as he threw down stars and fireballs 10 or 50 times larger than the 3 meter tall Fiend Ruler himself, making it so that these attacks had to be dealt with by him as he withstood their damage alone!","One could distinctly see that even though the starry field portrayed by this Quasar expert was roiling out strongly, it continued to get dimmer and dimmer over time .","This was because even as he tried to make his way to the huge trunk of Yggdrasil, the numerous branches wielding Swords of Judgment always got in his way if not for the terribly changed Aether filled area of space through the hands of Madness Hegemony or the terrifying spammed skills .","At this moment, the Realms of Power were being violated by Noah as he actually made it so that a being of a higher Realm could not advance or pull back in front of his attacks, only being able to sit there and take it as with time, the one with essence remaining will be the eventual winner!","Many beings saw this situation as well, which was the reason why even more of them continued to be amazed with the being they only knew as a Life Law Master .","Having been fighting for so long and keeping such a powerful skill active, was this being still not running out of energy?!","The Fiend Ruler felt irreconcilable as he tanked more and more attacks while trying to squeeze in towards Yggdrasil to no avail, while the other Fiend Ruler versed the Ruler of the Stellar Sky Galaxy who had begun laughing wildly at the situation .","He and the many other protectors that were still facing the remaining Fiends with the help of the Branches of Yggdrasil that provided immense support actually felt the air of despair lift from their hearts, seeing a possibility of coming out of this terrible ordeal alive!","Such a thing was only brought forward by a single person, a being of unfathomable strength who had an image of a multicolored Black Hole slowly spinning with vigor on his enormous body!"]},{"number":681,"title":"Chapter 681: Chapter 680","paragraphs":["Chapter 680: 680","In the Nexus Galaxy, the Conquest of the Fiends was rapidly unfolding as the enemy they thought to have understood enough turned out to be even more mysterious!","The Imperial Adjudicator reinstated his power and might as he came down to reinforce his forces in the ongoing battle in the Nexus Galaxy, slaying the 4 QUASAR Fiend Rulers and all the forces they brought with them!","The Adjudicator had used an ancient power to summon the Animus Summon that was at the GALAXY Realm, this Summon alone keeping the Elder Fiend at the same rank busy as he went down to back up his forces and wipe out all the Fiends in the Nexus Galaxy .","But the Adjudicator knew the day was not done, and his heart was still not settled as he thought of his daughter that was in a galaxy far away . Also, aside from the Stellar Sky Galaxy, there were still other Galaxies under the simultaneous siege of the Fiends .","He glanced at the bloody scene of war as dismembered bodies of fiends littered the starry space, the Imperials breathing hard around him looking towards his direction with shock and reverence .","This was because aside from the power he had used to keep a GALAXY Realm combatant at bay, the Imperial Adjudicator still had his own EPSILON ranked Trait that he used to appalling proportions to wipe out the 4 QUASAR Fiend Rulers in an unmatched fashion .","\"Head to the Snow Realms and Silver Mountains Galaxies to reinforce them against the Fiends . I will make haste towards the Stellar Sky Galaxy . \"","RUMBLE!","He gave out a command to the QUASAR ranked Imperial Lords, the Imperials who were standing above Imperial Rulers that were most commonly at the realm of Black Hole . These Imperial Lords nodded with heavy expressions as forces were divided and soon prepared to set off, the Adjudicator turning into a streak of light as he left the boundary of the Nexus Galaxy!","Outside in the chaotic void, the Elder Fiend was maddened as his body was gradually ground down by the Aurora Galaxy Dragon, a being such as him not being able to handle a majestic creature holding the bloodline of dragons while also being on an ancient path of power that allowed for a glimmering galaxy to be manifested on their bodies .","The Imperial Adjudicator watched this unique creature with shining eyes as he came out of the boundary of the Nexus Galaxy, communicating with it telepathically as he received the reply that the battle with the Elder Fiend should end within the next hour!","Even with the extreme might of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon, beings at the rank of GALAXY were extremely hard to kill as their Life Force could even rival those cultivating the Propitious Primeval Physique .","This Elder Fiend who was on the ropes while fighting with the Aurora Galaxy Dragon would not be going down anytime soon, and the Adjudicator knew he would not be of help in this fight between experts of a Realm he had only taken half a step into, even if he brought his EPSILON ranked trait into account!","\"Then I shall go confirm Anna’s safety!\"","ROAAR!","His message reached the Aurora Galaxy Dragon as he simply received a piercing roar, his eyes barely managing to catch a glimpse of the starry claw rushing down towards an irreconcilable Elder Fiend .","His body thrummed with power as he made way towards the Stellar Sky Galaxy, hoping that the protectors there could just hold on for a little bit longer, and that even if all of them died- they had better protect his daughter with their last breath!","---","As the Adjudicator left a battlefield with experts of higher Realms and respected the absolute difference in power, Noah was utterly ignoring such a thing as he continued to thrash a QUASAR Ranked Fiend left and right .","The numerous and luminous branches of Yggdrasil focused entirely on the Fiend Ruler as this being was besieged on all sides with branches wielding Sword of Judgment, any time that these swords weren’t near an imploding star or a blazing sun would take its spot!","Over time, the Swords of Judgment found their marks as this fiend that even had a natural barrier of essence around his body began to get hurt, the problem of not having strong Soul Protection becoming the bane of this creature!","The protectors of the Stellar Sky Galaxy watched this fight with ever rising hope as they fought back even harder, the [Boosted Life Force] effect that they actively sought by going near lone branches of Yggdrasil just to be hit continuing to provide stupendous results .","The Fiends themselves could not believe the sight in front of them, and this was especially so for the Fiend Ruler that was matching the Stellar Ruler . This QUASAR ranked Fiend had turned drastic as he tried to get past the Stellar Ruler and lend aid to his compatriot who was being besieged by attacks on all sides, but the Stellar Ruler would not relent!","As he glanced at the miles long Ancient Tree that had a visible multicolored Black Hole rotate through its body as if it was a painting, the Fiend Ruler questioned what exactly they had come across .","They still had the mission of looking for the mysterious Page, and the Fiend Ruler was terrified to return to his Master without any results . Yet he could only watch as their forces were reduced to a level where the protectors of the Stellar Sky Galaxy could fight back, and the situation was turning drastic for the QUASAR Fiend Ruler facing Yggdrasil!","OOOOH!","The Fiend Ruler released a bellow as his body lit up with a torrent of essence, reinforcing it as he withstood a barrage of [Fireball]s in the form of genuine suns . Terrible eruptions of Aether and destructive elements from oversized Portals of Terror also erupted around him as the +3000% increased area of effect on all abilities boost continued to show extreme effectiveness .","In between this spam of suns, stars, and Aether rays were the hidden and the even more deadly Swords of Judgment, and the moment that a Portal of Terror exploded and caused a destabilization in the surrounding space, Noah used this chance to lay out a finishing strike!","Hidden amongst the destabilized space and baleful Aether, over 10 Swords of Judgment suddenly bloomed from a hidden branch as their tips reached the Fiend Ruler in an instant .","SHIING!","A grating sound of multiple illusory swords meant to only hurt the soul did just that . . . and they did so in an utterly stellar fashion as the Fiend let out a bellowing last cry, his head pointing up as his eyes blazed a golden light before they died down, the immense QUASAR within his origin coming to rest!","\" . . . \"","Dead! Dead! He was actually dead!","Silence permeated the battle field as even those in close combat came to a stop .","They looked at the scene of the Fiend Ruler floating listlessly in the starry space with disbelief as they did not even know how to react .","From the hands of someone that had just entered the Realm of Black Hole, a QUASAR ranked expert had fallen!","Many looked at this scene as they wanted to scream impossible, as they wanted to say it was improbable .","Not even the Stellar Ruler who was fighting another QUASAR Realm expert had been able to take him down . Nobody else on the battlefield had as many kills as him .","Yet he...","Did he have to be so outrageous?!"]},{"number":682,"title":"Chapter 682: Chapter 681","paragraphs":["Chapter 681: 681","How could it be so!","This was the thought crossing the minds of many, but it was the singular thought in the mind of the Fiend Ruler as he watched with disbelief as someone with the same rank as him had been killed .","OOOOH!","He bellowed out with rage and unwillingness as a command left his mouth soon after .","\"Fight! Fight with all your strength! For the Great Master!\"","He bellowed out the words as his command shook the hearts of the remaining Fiends, but they steeled them and followed as they rushed towards Yggdrasil that was still surrounded by many protectors like moths to a flame .","The Fiend Ruler knew that their Master would not accept such a failure, especially since their mission was much more important since it involved finding the treasure that their Master wanted .","If they could not get it, it was better to die here than to face the wrath and disappointment of their Master!","RUMBLE!","Fiends dashed down even though the state of the battle had become unfavorable to them, the Fiend Ruler raining down attacks towards the Stellar Ruler with even more vigor .","Meanwhile, near the Ancient Primeval Tree, Noah had just taken in the body of the dead Fiend Ruler as he saved the cores, a glistening QUASAR Ranked Skill Book, and then he watched the Skill Points shoot up by another few thousands while a red glow passing over the dead body of the fiend as he read through its memories!","Eyes of Truth told him a lot about the beings he came across, but nothing could compare to living the memories of the being themselves .","As he began to quickly process thousands of years worth of memories, his roots wriggled in the starry sky as his enormous body rumbled, the Manifested multicolored Black Hole rotating with immense power as he moved rapidly towards the other Fiend Ruler!","The movement of this mountainous form took many by surprise as the fiends on the way had a multitude of branches wrap around them, deadly swords piercing through them as the remaining QUASAR rank Fiend felt the presence nearing .","The look of the face of this Fiend Ruler was that of someone who had accepted death, and he did so in a stellar fashion as when he saw Yggdrasil nearing, he stopped attacking the Stellar Ruler and brought his arms to the side!","The Stellar Ruler looked at this as he used the opportunity to quickly land a deadly strike, but before he could even reach the Fiend, his fist stopped an inch away from him as an enormous force was beginning to erupt out .","When he felt this force, the Stellar Ruler turned ashen as he instantly turned around and ran in the other direction while screaming!","\"Spread out! As far away from here as possible! He is imploding his Quasar!\"","Shocking words left his mouth as many beings scrambled away, the Fiend Ruler that had accepted death for its failure actually choosing to go out with a bang, and it was in a stellar fashion at that .","At high stages like Black Hole and Quasar, experts could give out their most powerful attacks when they destroyed their own core, the destructive energies released from an imploding Black Hole or Quasar being something that could heavily injured or kill the enemy of the same rank .","This was especially so for Quasar, as it was nearly 100x more deadly than an implosion of a Black Hole!","This was because a Quasar had an active galactic nucleus, a level right before the formation of a Galaxy! Such a thing imploding would release a tremendous gravitational force that would rip apart space and everything in its surroundings to oblivion .","So the Stellar Ruler ran at this scene, while Anna and her protectors moved even further back to be safe . But many had widened eyes when they realized a single being was not running away as they even continued to rush towards the imploding Quasar faster!","Yggdrasil neared the terrifying force of an imploding Quasar as the body of the Fiend Ruler had begun to crack and melt, the space around him already ripping apart as a horrid gravitational force threatened to erupt out any second .","But Noah still went towards this exploding Quasar not because he was selfless or a Saint, but because of the loot!","He really could not let the loot of a Quasar ranked being go to waste!","So he went forward as he was also filled with a level of confidence . One of it was the fact that his Life Shield would erupt out at any moment, and the other was that he actually did not feel too much of a threat from the horrendous gravitational force spreading out from the Fiend- and the reason was his own archaic Manifested multicolored Black Hole .","At this moment, it seemed to be domineeringly screaming to him that the gravitational force being released by this imploding Quasar could not compare to the abilities of the Manifested Black Hole, and it threatened to prove this as the colorful Black Hole within Noah shone with a scintillating light!","The light seemed dominant and wild, converging to form an appalling gravitational force that went to restrict the imploding Fiend in front of Noah .","His branches flew out in a circular motion as they went to wrap all sides of the Fiend, the suppressive force being released by his own multicolored Galaxy actually stopping the advancing implosion of the Fiend as the terrifying gravitational force around it remaining restricted to him .","This was suppression! Utter and genuine suppression of a lower Realm with a higher one, and it was simply because the lower realm was made too resplendently with abilities that were lost over the eons of time!","The horrid gravitational force from the imploding Quasar never appeared, with Noah’s branches carrying golden sword reaching and piercing this being from all around as a golden light burned in the closed eyes of the Fiend Ruler, his soul being cleansed with the judgment of fate as he perished .","\" . . . \"","A pervasive sight!","A heart rending battle!","Two QUASAR experts dead, and to someone that had recently broken through to Black Hole at that!"]},{"number":683,"title":"Chapter 683: Chapter 682","paragraphs":["Chapter 682: 682","In the chaotic void, a particularly restless Imperial Adjudicator was rushing out with an aura of a blazing sun as he made way towards the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","He used any teleportation rifts that he could to make the trip smaller, but as it normally took hours to make it from the Nexus Galaxy to Stellar Sky, it would take him at least half an hour if not slightly more as his shocking speed powered forward!","As he streaked across the chaotic void, he just hoped for the safety of his daughter .","He held the Medallion she had used to contact him prior, only listening to see if any message would come out of it as he never sent one himself!","This was because he knew that his daughter could be in a deadly battle right now, and he would not do a single action that could break her concentration .","And he knew that whenever she was safe, she would immediately let him know! So he kept the Medallion as he thundered forth, wishing he could grow wings to move even faster .","What the Imperial Adjudicator did not know though, was that his daughter had passed over the terrible ordeal and was safe at this moment .","She just had not even thought about picking up the Medallion and letting her father know as her eyes, like the eyes of many, were still glued to the figure of an enormous green-gold tree butchering experts at the realms of Nebula, Black Hole, and Quasar as if he was simply snapping the necks of chickens!","---","With the fall of the last Fiend Ruler, the ranks of Fiend broke down as others tried to run, with even more choosing a similar action of self-implosion as the protectors had already run far away from them .","Meanwhile, Noah actively sought them out after he put the body of the Fiend Ruler away, his Manifested Black Hole releasing a suppressive force on any being that wanted to implode themselves and cause a horrendous gravitational storm, his branches reaping their lives thereafter!","The others saw this phenomenon as they shook their heads in amazement, thinking this righteous Life Law Master could not stand to leave even a single of these invading Fiends alive as he took care of them before they could deal any more damage .","But the truth was that Noah simply wanted all the loot that came with Nebula and Black Hole rank experts!","The skill books were many, the cores they granted were numerous, and he could find a way to transport them to the Novus Galaxy as he very easily increased the strength of the combatants there to Nebula Rank, and even make some of them experts at the Realm of Black Hole .","His subordinates would rise in strength even faster than him if they were power leveled with these cores, and Noah wanted them to achieve even higher realms of strength!","This was because he knew that deep inside their hearts, they felt a feeling of uselessness as they could not contribute to any of their goals because Noah’s power outpaced them by so much .","If he could raise their strength to a sufficient enough level, the Harbingers of Sin and others could finally be put to use as they explored this vast Dark Universe!","This was also why even after locating the shocking Page of Ruination, the clone had put it away for further reading later as he continued to search for and collect Effulgent Star Pearls- all that would be loot he could use to power level his subordinates .","He was collecting the loot from Fiends and the loot from this Galaxy as he left nothing behind . One could never have too much loot!","His thoughts were abundant as he carried out his actions, the memories of the Fiend Rulers showing the shocking truth of even their mission that he had stumbled upon . He also got to know the identity of a fearsome backer of these Fiends, a being that had earned the title of an Entity!","He still did not know what this title truly meant as he pushed it in the back of his mind for now, dealing with the things immediate to him at this moment .","The battlefield had gradually become calm as he finished off the last of the Fiends, his form as an enormous tree taking the eyes and attention of all the beings in the surroundings as they gave him a variety of looks!","The Imperial Princess that had recovered some of her mana floated with the two Maids who could not hide their amazement, their eyes opening even wider as they saw the ancient tree shimmer with a green light as it began to reduce in size .","Soon enough, the image of a young man with dark hair appeared, his eyes still carrying a hint of blue and green as the abundant essence of life vibrantly pulsed from him .","As Anna stared at Alexander, she could not help but shake her head in wonder as on the body of this being, she and many others could still see the image of a manifested Black Hole!","He looked like a being glowing with multicolored lights as the illusory image of his profound Black Hole took over 80% of his body and glowed with power, his eyes noticing the gazes of the beings around him as Alexander turned to look at himself and see the situation first hand .","He seemed to smile as he gave a command, the illusory Manifested Black Hole on his body becoming dimmer and dimmer until it could barely be discerned! This was a mark to identify the beings on a spectacular path of power, and would light up brilliantly whenever he used his essence in the future!","As he finished all of this, his gaze was calm as he went towards the direction of the Imperial Princess . Many of the people around did not even know how to approach and act towards him as only the Stellar Ruler was laughing boldly while going towards him .","\"Princess,\" Noah called out with a slight smile as the veiled Anna turned her face to the side curiously, speaking out words filled with interest and a hint of inquisitiveness!","\"Who are you?\" This was a question that many beings had, among the thoughts of thankfulness for saving them!","Noah already prepared multiple ways of answering but at this moment, all the beings here felt the nearing of a ridiculously powerful aura, an aura of power that was even greater than the QUASAR ranked Fiends that were just defeated .","The eyes of many nearly lost their light as they saw a blazing sun pierce the boundary of the Stellar Sky Galaxy and rush towards them, a bellow coming out from it that shook the starry space itself!","\"Vile Fiends!\"","RUMBLE!","Some were scared, while some that recognized the aura and the voice like Anna smiled brightly as the man himself, The Imperial Adjudicator, finally arrived to give aid to the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","His immense aura spread out as he noticed the scene of battle and prepared to release deadly attacks, but was shocked to find bodies of a few Fiends littering the space, those present only being the protectors of the Stellar Sky Galaxy as well as some Imperials and . . . his daughter!","The Imperial Adjudicator glanced towards the direction of his daughter as he arrived to save her, finding a mysterious man standing beside her and looking towards him with eyes of curiosity .","He had arrived to save them, and yet it seemed nobody needed saving!","Was this not the Galaxy that needed saving? Did it not have numerous Fiends of high Realms that completely outnumbered them? 2 in the QUASAR Realm? 200 at the Realm of Black Hole? What exactly had happened?!"]},{"number":684,"title":"Chapter 684: Chapter 683","paragraphs":["Chapter 683: 683","The scene of the battlefield in the Stellar Sky Galaxy was one of cheering and happiness, this state being increased even more as the identity of the recently appearing Adjudicator was confirmed .","Many were happy to escape death as they threw away their feelings of despair, looking toward Noah’s direction as he was the only one they had to thank for this .","The Imperial Adjudicator went towards his daughter as his perceptive eyes caught this scene, nearing her in an instant as he questioned for her well being and exactly what had occurred .","Anna changed to her sweet tone as she talked to her father, Noah standing by the side as he was too busy reading the information about this being from Eyes of Truth!","If he could put it in one word, the information from this being was- vast!","There were many things worthy of note and some shocking secrets, but those on the surface was the fact that this being was half a step into the GALAXY Realm, and he also had an EPSILON ranked Trait similar to his daughter while also being an Assimilator of the Law of Chaos and Space, and a Law Master of the Law of Death .","Many titles with a lot of hard work required to bring them to life, but Noah’s shone as he saw that the identity of this being as a Father was the most important!","Eyes of Truth were showing him shocking information about the being that this Adjudicator was connected to, the one who would be the Imperial Princess’s mother! Noah’s thoughts moved rapidly as he learned more about the Imperial Adjudicator more than anyone, this being turning towards him after he heard the story from his daughter .","\"You have my genuine thanks for going out of your way to save my daughter and the people of the Stellar Sky Galaxy!\"","OOM!","The voice of the Adjudicator was filled with power as he said this, his eyes looking towards Noah with thankfulness as they also held a hint of questioning and coldness, as Noah was too mysterious .","When listening to her daughter’s story, his instincts as a father were glaring whenever Anna mentioned Noah as a friend she made when she went out to the Blessed Imperial Selection not too long ago .","When she told how he had killed the QUASAR raked Fiend Rulers, the Imperial Adjudicator had nearly disputed her words with disbelief!","\"As a citizen of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm, I was only doing my job to protect the Princess . \" He replied while bowing, his actions receiving eye rolls from the two maids as the Imperial Princess felt the same, her voice ringing out thereafter .","\"I can’t stomach this . Dad, don’t we have to go? There should be many things we need to get done!\"","The words of the Imperial Princess returned many to the present as the Adjudicator nodded, turning his attention to the Stellar Ruler as he spoke to him briefly .","The knowledge that multiple Galaxies were under attack was now widely known as they knew much work was still needed!","They moved to fortify the defenses of the Stellar Sky Galaxy as the Adjudicator even gave the commands to leave the Imperial Protectors that came with Anna to remain, with him choosing to take his daughter and her party back towards the Nexus Galaxy where an Elder Fiend was being over powered .","After he knew his daughter was safe, he planned to reinforce the rest of his forces that had moved out to help the other besieged Galaxies as they put this matter to rest for good!","RUMBLE!","A wave of essence erupted out as it wrapped around Anna and her two maids, the princess nodding her head towards her father as she looked towards Noah, this essence wrapping around him also as all four of them shot out from the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","They left behind a powerful force reinforcing this location, and Noah left behind two clones to continue mining the treasured Effulgent Star Pearls","---","Light years away in another location .","In the Burning Domains Galaxy, an Entity was releasing baleful breaths of essence as she healed herself, grave injuries apparent on her body from an unknown source!","Her eyes were calm and collected as she cultivated silently, but they soon opened with a sharp light that contained maddened ruthlessness .","\"Failed...?\"","The word seemed to have a sense of disbelief as even this Entity was surprised at the result, her powers ending that the lives of many of the beings she had sent out were snuffed!","The most important force she sent to silently scour the Stellar Sky Galaxy for a page from the Book of Ruination- utterly destroyed .","And the being she had sent to spearhead the mission of conquest to the main Galaxy, the powerful Elder Fiend that had a realm same as the Entity, except of the Low Tier- even this being had just now lost his life as it was the signal that woke the Entity up!","Disbelief filled her, as well as a sense of profound carefulness!","From her knowledge, there should not have been a force capable of destroying a Low Tier GALAXY Realm expert in the cluster of Galaxies he targeted, thus she was filled with concern as her eyes shone with coldness .","A moment seemed to pass as the Entity wished her options, sensing her injured body as she thought of the unique treasure that was the Book of Ruination and multiple other factors .","The wrath and coldness won in the end as she spoke out appalling words .","\"Fine . I’ll do it myself!\"","RUMBLE!","Waves of fate erupted out as the essence of this Entity erupted, the injuries she had being healed at a faster rate as she used even more expensive means to recuperate!","Meanwhile, the Imperial Adjudicator and party of four streaked towards the Nexus Galaxy, arriving there in less than an hour as the image of a domineering Aurora Galaxy Dragon soon became clear in their eyes .","The Aurora Galaxy Dragon floated in the chaotic void outside of Nexus Galaxy with blazing eyes, the Manifested Galaxy rotating calmly on its body as floating in front of it was a body .","It was a body of the Elder Fiend in the Realm of GALAXY, and it was dead!"]},{"number":685,"title":"Chapter 685: Chapter 684","paragraphs":["Chapter 684: 684","Noah enjoyed the feeling of being taken through the chaotic void at speeds faster than anything he could muster right now, the Imperial Adjudicator that he had only recently come across truly being a powerful individual!","Only half a step into the GALAXY Realm, yet the things he delved in and mastered were many, with his power extremely robust .","They crossed the distance that took them a few hours with the aid of the Void Pegasi in just 30 minutes as they appeared back at the boundary of the Nexus Galaxy, noticing an extremely suffocating aura permeating in the surroundings!","Noah and the three girls spread out their senses as they glanced at this figure with awe, the image of an Aurora Galaxy Dragon being something that they had never seen in their life times .","Even the daughter of the being that summoned this creature had never seen it before, her veiled figure hiding the shocked expression on her face as she looked up in wonder!","They saw the shimmering galaxy manifested on the body of this Aurora Galaxy Dragon as it reminded them of something extremely similar, turning their faces towards Noah briefly as they recalled the manifested Black Hole that could barely be discerned at this moment .","Their eyes then went towards the thing floating in front of the Dragon, their hearts tightening as they saw the body of what should have been a Fiend! Based on its aura, this Fiend was at the genuine Galaxy Realm, and yet it lay dead before this Aurora Galaxy Dragon!","They could see the body of the Elder Fiend had been brutally split apart, its chest caved in as the blood floating in the chaotic void was a mixture of colors, the torn muscles and bones revealing a unique structure that shimmered with the light of stars, making it seem like a shattered Galaxy was still present in this small body .","Amazingly, the bodies of beings at the GALAXY Realm were forever changed as their muscles and bones shone with the light of starry stars, their power still being something that they did not understand!","\"You were successful . \"","OOOM!","The strong voice of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon reverberated around them as the Imperial Adjudicator nodded with a heavy face . The Dragon glanced towards Anna with a warm light as it nodded, surprising the Imperial Princess as next up, the face of this fearsome creature landed on Noah .","\"Hmm?\" An inquisitive light passed through its eyes that shone briefly, shooting out a light that instantly reflected on Noah before he could do anything else!","Surprise came upon the Imperial Adjudicator and Anna as they did not expect this, turning towards Noah to see the vibrant multicolored Black Hole manifest itself fully again after what the Aurora Galaxy Dragon just did .","\"Rare to find a being like you in these parts . . . only the Scions of Ancient Powers have been able to reproduce this path on their own bodies, and never at the level that would match Animus Summons like you...\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking words hiding many different clues and meanings erupted from the Aurora Galaxy Dragon as it gazed over Noah up and down, while Noah did the same to the creature as Eyes of Truth showed this majestic being’s information!","[Aurora Galaxy Dragon] :: An Animus Summon that is temporarily contracted with Alexei Lexalius Dannicus . This Animus Summon has been trained to Grand Completion as it exhibits the Manifested Galaxy Realm, even though it is only at the Low Tier Galaxy Realm . [Life History][Strengths][Weakness][Ability(s)][Trait(s)][Habits] . . .","From the Life History of this being, a stupid amount of information he had no reason seeing at this moment was reflected in front of his eyes! Knowledge of the beings known as Animus Summons or Animus Pets, and some knowledge of powerful ancient organizations that ruled the many regions of the Dark Universe that utilized creatures such as these!","Truly too much and too early for Noah’s imaginative mind as his eyes nearly showed the intense thirst he felt .","\"He was the one to save Anna, a genius Law Master with essence reserves unlike anything we’ve seen . \"","The Imperial Adjudicator replied to the Aurora Galaxy Dragon as he saw Noah was absentmindedly looking towards the majestic Dragon, a nod coming from the creature as it pulled its eyes away and spoke with a strong tone .","\"You must go see her after this . \"","Words that caused the Adjudicator to adopt a somber expression and for Anna to light up rang out, with the Adjudicator nodding his affirmation! His palm then pointed towards the Aurora Galaxy Dragon as he shouted out a single word .","\"Return . \"","CRACK!","His chest seemed to split open as a swirl of a rift formed within it, a sucking force wrapping around the Aurora Galaxy Dragon as it became smaller and smaller . . . until it fully disappeared into the chest of the Imperial Adjudicator!","Shocking sight after shocking sight was being revealed in front of Noah as he breathed out calmly . Just the single glance at the Aurora Galaxy Dragon had given him so many things to look forward to that he did not even know if he could contain himself . He breathed out as he kept his heart calm, the essence of the Imperial Adjudicator wrapping around them again as his voice came out .","\"We shall go see your Mother as soon as we ascertain the status of all the Galaxies that fell under attack today . \"","The words of the Adjudicator were sound as they entered the Nexus Galaxy once more, many things happening all around as they returned to Brightgold Monarchy Realm!","The Imperial Adjudicator did not have to leave to lend help to the other Galaxies himself as only QUASAR ranked Fiends were there similar to the Stellar Sky Galaxy, and the Imperial Rulers that he sent to aid them quickly got things under control .","This meant that the sudden and terrible conquest the Fiends had shown quickly came to an end, and there were a few things to come out of it as the most immediate effect .","The first one was the knowledge that the Fiends were deeply hiding their power, where even now they weren’t fully confident of the forces they had hidden in reserve .","Another effect was the knowledge that while under siege, the Imperial Princess had undergone forging in the battlefield as she broke through into the Realm of Black Hole, showing tremendous power that could instantly kill a Fiend of the same level in the Stellar Sky Galaxy .","But she wasn’t even the brightest star that shone from this ordeal, as the being that had protected her life and the lives of many in the same Stellar Sky Galaxy was the one whose name had begun to spread as soon as the party with the Imperial Adjudicator returned to the Nexus Galaxy .","The name of the being who was a shockingly powerful Life Law Master among many other titles, the one who could reap the lives of Black Hole Fiends at the Nebula Realm and then reap the lives of QUASAR Fiends at the Realm of Black Hole!","The one known as Alexander King . . . his name was spreading among the upper echelons of the Nexus Galaxy!"]},{"number":686,"title":"Chapter 686: Chapter 685","paragraphs":["Chapter 685: 685","In the Nexus Galaxy, many beings were moving about as they established normalcy to this Galaxy and all those affected by the recent attack by the Fiends from the Burning Domains Galaxy .","The Imperial Adjudicator had spent an entire day giving out commands to his forces as he communicated with those sent to reinforce other Galaxies, and he found that the battle was not without its losses!","The two Galaxies that had only received reinforcements some time after the attack started lost more than half of their experts, a heavy toll being taken as many were bubbling with fury towards the Fiends .","But even while feeling immense wrath, nearly all of them were hesitant to make a move as they didn’t know the depth of the Fiend’s strength!","So the Imperial Adjudicator focused on reestablishing order, and as soon as this was done he moved on to the next important task .","In the Dannicus Household that was bustling with activity, Imperials of all types filled the halls as discussions of the recent war spread out .","One would be able to notice that among many of the names, ’Alexander’ would be popping out with frequency as he was discussed with much fervor!","\"A High Imperial at the Realm of Black Hole who can match Quasar?\"","\"Don’t forget that he’s a Life Law Master as well, and apparently also dabbling in Fate and Aether...\"","Royals and Imperials were discussing in murmured breaths around the Dannicus Fortress, and one question was in the minds of many that still had not been answered!","\"I heard he is always with the Princess, is there...?\"","\"Don’t even finish that sentence if you want to keep your life! Do you know who she is?!\"","Words and rumors spread around as the situation gradually settled . In a corner of the Dannicus Fortress, the Imperial Princess was being attended to by her maids as she heard the voices of the many Imperials rooms away as she smiled with a cold light, this light dimming down as she felt the aura of her father materializing outside of her room .","\"Little Anna, we need to go now . \"","The Imperial Adjudicator came to pick up his daughter for a trip they had to make to a special someone, making Anna quickly step out as even her maids remained behind!","Father and daughter were heading out of the Dannicus Fortress silently, heading towards an unknown location .","But before they could even get too far, the Imperial Adjudicator came to a halt as if lightning struck him, a surprise expression appearing on his face as he received a telepathic message from the same being they were going to meet!","\"Bring the one that saved my daughter as well . \"","The voice was calm and sonorous, with a tone that seemed so enticing that any man would turn cartoonishly heated .","The Imperial Adjudicator blankly nodded with surprise as he turned towards Anna and asked where Alexander was .","\"Oh, since he saved my life, I wanted to return the favor once more . The only thing he wanted was to learn the techniques of the Ultimate Law of Death . . . so I granted him access to the library again . \"","Anna’s voice was low as she talked, seemingly not wanting to be disciplined by her actions as her father shook her head with a smile .","\"Tell him to come here, quickly . \"","Anna hid her surprise in her veiled face as she quickly sent a message to Noah, who had just finished obtaining the techniques for the Law of Death in the Imperial Library!","When they returned to the Nexus Galaxy and received the hero’s welcome with his name spreading among the upper forces of the Galaxy, Anna had asked him if he wanted anything to repay his actions of saving her and an entire Galaxy .","His answer was of course- the techniques of the Ultimate Law of Death in the Imperial Library!","This was because he was extremely excited to get the counterpart of the Law of Life, and he wanted even more to see the opposing ability of \"Ashes to Ashes\", the one termed as \"Dust to Dust . \"!","He wanted to check the abundant amount of loot he received from the Fiends also, but he pushed this back as aside from the stupendous Cores and Skill Points, the skill books he got from them would most likely just be used as sacrificial skill books when he upgraded his skills or given to his subordinates .","So he simply asked for the reward of the Law of Death!","Anna had shaken her head wyrily as she granted this request, using her authority to grant him access once more into the floor of the Imperial Library where only the highest of Imperials could enter, all the while the Adjudicator dealt with clearing up chaos sown by the Fiends .","At this moment, Noah received word from the Imperial Princess as he stopped reading the description of the new techniques, his senses for unique opportunities tingling as his proficiency in the Law of Fate told him only benefits awaited him!","He disappeared from the Imperial Library as he appeared in the skies of the Brightgold Monarchy Realm, following the coordinates given by the Princess until he found two figures in the skies not too far from the Dannicus Household .","He bowed his head slightly towards the floating Imperial Adjudicator as he nodded to the Princess, the strong voice of the Father ringing out as he isolated the space around them!","\"We will be visiting someone with an extremely special identity, and they have asked for the one who saved Anna to come along as well . I expect your discretion!\"","His voice was strong but filled with a sense of hesitation, as even the Imperial Adjudicator wasn’t sure why that person wanted this Alexander there! A serious look was the only thing present on the genius’s faces as he nodded, the party of three moving away from the Imperial Citadel as they flew towards an unknown location in the Brightgold Monarchy Realm .","\"The location we are going to is a hidden Realm that very few know about!\"","They were going to a hidden Realm that contained a being with a powerful identity .","It was the person who had ’given’ the Imperial Adjudicator the Animus Summon at the Realm of GALAXY, the true Master of the Aurora Galaxy Dragon!"]},{"number":687,"title":"Chapter 687: Chapter 686","paragraphs":["Chapter 686: 686","In the Brightgold Monarchy of the Nexus Galaxy, there existed multiple Rifts that led to different Realms!","An example was the Rift leading to the Aether Carnage Realm where Noah had begun the first stage of the Blessed Imperia Selection, and the Rift that led to the Devouring Hells Realms where Fiends were held prisoners .","Currently, the party being led by the powerful Imperial Adjudicator was heading towards one such hidden Rift, a rift where a special personage was hidden at!","They arrived in the thick foliage of mountains as the Imperial Adjudicator descended down, Noah noticing the aura of multiple beings at the ranks of Nebula and Black Hole spread all over the mountain they were descending down in .","His eyes also noticed the appearance of multiple thin barriers of light that covered the entire area, their bodies passing through them at this moment with ease as their feet touched the grasslands of the mountain .","Covered by resplendent trees and stationed silently in front of them, a clear blue Rift could be seen near the area they had touched down in, the Imperial Adjudicator leading the way as the two of them followed!","Noah’s eyes shone as the identity of the rift was revealed in front of him .","[Blue Plains Rift] :: A rift leading to a small mobile realm currently located in the Brightgold Monarchy .","A simple description that gave away the identity of the location they were going to! His eyes went to the surroundings as he saw Imperials at the Realm of Black Hole guarding the blue rift on each side, standing still as the party of three approached and entered through the rift silently .","WAA!","A spatial movement later, they found themselves in what seemed to be a paradisiacal circular world, where with the simple spread of their aura they could actually see all the boundaries of this small Realm! It actually did not seem to be any larger than 100 miles in diameter, but it had a unique atmosphere that made it more pronounced than many of the Realms Noah had visited .","The Blue Plains Realm that they had entered has wide grasslands and expansive blue skies, the dome shape of this realm being covered by mystical blue clouds as it shimmered with colors and essence! In the middle of this Realm, a single small castle existed as Noah could feel the aura of only one being- a being that was currently walking through a garden in front of the castle!","Noah was looking around this realm in wonder as the two beings beside him seemed emotional, neither of them being able to take a single step towards the castle . This remained so until a sonorous voice rang out beside their ears .","\"Why are you two standing there like fools? It’s only been a few years, come on . \"","The voice seemed melodious and enticing, each word dripping with honey as the three found themselves going forward unconsciously! They reached the perimeter of the castle in a matter of seconds as the woman walking in the garden became clear, her face turning towards them with a bright smile that seemed to shine away all darkness .","Yet at the same time, Noah’s eyes constricted as he looked at this being, his heart shaking as her eyes alone told him of the extreme coldness and strength of this woman, and his Eyes of Truth told him of even more shocking information!","\"Mom...\" Anna was reaching her arms out like a child as she threw herself into the arms of the woman, none of the demeanor of a cold blooded Black Hole expert existing as she hugged the woman tightly .","\"Silly girl, still wearing that veil I gave you? Take it off so your mom can see you . \" Words full of love were released from the woman as Anna quickly nodded, the veil she always wore on her head disappearing as ridiculous gorgeousness was revealed underneath!","’Holy...’","Even Noah had to hide his thoughts in amazement as he looked at the two women, having to admit that they were factually the most drop-dead gorgeous women he had seen in his life time .","His attention was shaken by the Mom’s power and status at first, but as he looked at their identical faces- it seemed like he happened to walk by two fairies beautifully standing in a garden!","The Imperial Princess he had never seen had vibrant red hair with light blue eyes, her fair face only being beaten by the mature demeanor her mother exuded that could cause the downfall of countries . The mother was an exact replica, but somehow even more vibrant to look at!","\"Anastasia...\"","The Imperial Adjudicator, Alexei, called out with hazy eyes as he went forward, but he could not bring himself to get near her as he sighed and instead continued speaking!","\"I could not help but release the Animus Summon you temporarily put under my control . We were being besieged on all sides and Anna was in danger as well...\"","His voice was low as he seemed ashamed, but the woman raised her hand lovingly as she turned her attention towards Noah and spoke .","\"I know . Saved by a being that many can only call a genius, an Imperial that nobody had heard of before a week ago but having unexplainable strength and being extremely proficient in the Law of Life that the abilities he released caused him to easily massacre beings a Realm above his own . \" Her eyes shone with a golden glint as she focused on Noah, the faces of the three beings on the garden of the castle landing on him with extreme focus!","Noah only reciprocated with a calm smile, seeing the clues to the reason for him being there as he continued to read the description of this being under the Eyes of Truth .","[Anastasia Frederick Windsor] :: An Entity residing in the Blue Plains Realm hidden in the Brightgold Monarchy . She comes from the Expansive Dragon Cluster located near the periphery of the center of the Dark Universe . . . [Life History][Strengths][Weakness][Ability(s)][Trait(s)][Habits] . . .","\"His Realm is even a perfected one, something that even I could only grant to my Pets after years of efforts and treasures . A genius through and through, the question is . . . how much of a genius?\" Anastasia, the being with a shocking status that should definitely not be in the small Nexus Galaxy, began walking towards Noah with steady steps .","\"After the recent actions, I do not know how much time I have, and your enemies still have someone behind them that will make a move soon . You have many warriors here, but many of them have no talent . \"","She spoke amply as she came to stand in front of Noah, her eyes shining with an unknown light as she smiled even more!","\"Yet you . . . have Comprehended multiple laws!\"","...!","Even Anna and her Father were surprised as they focused on him, this being knowledge they did not know! They knew he dabbled in a few laws, but not that he had comprehended many of them fully .","Noah remained calm as he saw this being was not directing any killing intent towards him, continuing to wait to see what her aim was!","\"I want to protect the small home I’ve been on in the past years . I will test your talent and see if you are worthy . . . worthy of coming in contact with that which lies above even Ultimate Laws . I will do this with the promise that you continue protecting Anna and the Nexus Galaxy\"","...!","Disbelief rose in the eyes of all beings there but the shocking personage herself, none of them being able to wrap their minds around what was happening!"]},{"number":688,"title":"Chapter 688: Chapter 687 - The Doctrine of Death!","paragraphs":["Noah breathed calmly as he tried to keep his breath under control, his shining eyes being the only thing revealing his true thoughts as he slowly nodded.","\"Protecting the Imperial Princess is something that I will always do, and the Nexus Galaxy is my home!\"","These words were said with conviction as they reached Anastasia, her gorgeous face shining brighter as she replied.","\"Good. The only problem is that learning such a thing required talent, and many beings on the fringes of the Dark Universe do not have it. Nor do they have the resources of Ancient Organizations to help them, so they forever remain weak!\"","She moved away from Noah as she went back to the surprised Anna, strong her hair tenderly as she continued.","\"Alexei summoning my Aurora Galaxy Dragon might have already alerted those searching for me of my location, so we might either have a few weeks or a few months, maybe even years if the signal wasn’t picked up. But during that time, I want to see if I can create some protectors for you all.\"","The words were filled with love and sadness, causing the Imperial Princess to bite her lip as she spoke to her mother!","\"Can we not just come with you?! I...I...\" Tears actually welled up in the girl’s eyes as she spoke, the tender look on her mother becoming grave at these words.","\"No. They cannot even know you are my daughter, nor that I took a man in this small Galaxy. They will kill you all without batting an eye!\"","RUMBLE!","Appalling words were said as she turned serious, the Imperial Adjudicator and Anna turning ashen as it seemed they still did not understand her identity.","\"Why...why...?!\" Anna was irreconcilable as she persisted.","\"I ran away because someone I did not want, wanted me. The rage of that Ancient Power is not something you can even imagine, nor what mindset they stand on.\"","Her expression seemed to be recalling something disgusting as she talked!","\"They stand above all others as they look down in contempt, as they think themselves the true inheritors of everything in this Dark Universe. Only other Ancient Powers stand equal to them, everything else being mere ants in their eyes.\"","\"To them, it would not be an issue to step on the ants that they would consider to have sullied something of theirs, they would not even blink before wiping everything here away!\"","RUMBLE!","Ashen expressions were the only thing that came with these words as they got a better idea, their heads buzzing as they repeated the word in their minds.","Ants!","They would be seen as mere ants before Ancient Powers, even with the Realms they had achieved! Even with all the hard work and progress they had made in laws or Traits, it was still considered nothing in their eyes!","\"But while I may not be able to stay with you all, I could at least ensure your safety. I did that first by giving Alexei my weakest Animus Pet and imparting some techniques, forming a contract with his soul momentarily for it to aid him in the most dire situations.\"","...!","Yes! She had given the Imperial Adjudicator the Aurora Galaxy Dragon that she even said was her weakest Animus Summon.","She did this because the weakest one should have released the weakest signal if ever it was used, and it was also the reason why she had not given any more of her Animus Pets nor summoned them over the years.","\"If I could enlighten some geniuses though, there might be a chance. So, Alexander, I’ve heard of your amazing feats and power, but I haven’t seen it first hand. Can you show me your genius? Just as a formality, but I would like to be sure of your talent before handing down something so immense!\"","Anastasia turned her face away from Alexei and Anna as she focused on Noah again.","During all this time that shocking information was easily released, Noah was the only one not scared or feeling immense pressure.","All he felt was excitement and wonder as the many new things were brought into the picture, and he wanted to jump towards them headfirst as he absorbed everything he could like a sponge.","He thought of the words of this woman with a fearsome identity as an idea popped in his mind right away.","\"I have just picked up the techniques of traversing the Ultimate Law of Death from the Imperial Library. I can cultivate the law for the first time in front of you as you see my comprehension!\"","\"Hoh?\" An interested light erupted from Anastasia as she nodded.","\"I cannot sense any concepts of death within you, good. Let’s see what you have.\"","Anastasia pointed for Anna and Alexei to sit in the paradisiacal garden as they stared at Noah, the eyes of these beings watching him as he felt not an ounce of fear!","His eyes looked at his stat panel that showed the recent techniques he received from the Imperial Library.","<strong>{The Doctrine of Death} :: Across the eons of time and space, there are few true wonders permeating throughout. The Doctrine of Death completes the Doctrine of Life, where the being that comprehends and assimilates both will have a possibility of finding an even greater path of strength.</strong>","The technique to cultivate the Ultimate Law of Death was given to him, and he sat down peacefully in the calm garden that was filled with important beings as he began to cultivate!","RUMBLE!","Anna had already seen scenting like this as she was there when he first cultivated the Law of Life, but her eyes still focused on him as she saw the color of immense darkness erupt out of him the moment he sat on the ground.","OOOM","The aura of an Ultimate Law permeated out, this one being particularly cold and merciless as it smelled of the potent aura of death!","Within Noah’s origin when an illusory Primeval tree that represented the Law of Life was blooming, a seed began to sprout below this grand tree.","The seed was black in color and shone with even greater darkness, essence pouring into it as it erupted!"]},{"number":689,"title":"Chapter 689: Chapter 688 - Above the Laws is...","paragraphs":["Unimaginable potent essence converged in the small garden in the Blue Plains Realm, all of it going towards the man currently cultivating the Doctrine of Death for the first time!","Similar to the Law of Life, the process for the Law of Death had begun with a budding of a seed that soon erupted into a sapling. This sapling was extremely dark in color as it seemed to absorb every other color around it, a stark contrast being created with the vibrant green tree of life that was growing above it.","The two trees were currently growing while facing different directions, where if one were to draw a line at the very center of the Origin, they would see a vibrant green hue permeate the origin above the line and a dark cold hue to permeate below!","As the sapling of the Tree of Death began to bud with more and more branches and leaves, thick roots erupted out as they spread serenely through the colorful Manifested Black Hole and began to intertwine with the roots of the Tree of Life.","This reaction should have been something opposable, but it happened as smoothly as it could as for the two Ultimate Laws of Life and Death, the two were one and the same! Two sides of the same coin!","But it created for a truly beautiful scene as even Anna who had seen Alexander shine with a vibrant green in the Imperial Library before could not help but watch with an agape expression.","The Imperial Adjudicator who had lived for many years and seen many things was also moved, his own Tree of Death within his Origin ringing in a reaction as it sensed another Death Law Master being born nearby!","The one with an esteemed identity, Anastasia, also looked on with shining eyes as she saw more things than the two beside her saw. She had seen many beings embark on Ultimate and Supreme Laws in the past, and none of them had caused a reaction such as this when they first began.","When she looked at the man in front of her, it seemed like the atmospheric universal essence was fighting to get into his origin to power up the cost of using Doctrine of Death, as if this essence was not a problem for him and would even acquiesce to his wishes!","She did not know how this result was brought about, but her eyes only gained more and more surprise as the time passed.","5 minutes passed as the phenomenon of converging essence and the illusory scene of a Tree of Death coldly growing ever larger below a Tree of Life continued, the roots of the two trees wrapping around each other so tightly that they created a mysterious groove at their point of contact.","25 minutes passed, and Anastasia was convinced of this being’s genius as she could see he had attained Small Success in this Ultimate Law in just half an hour since he began cultivating it, a result that would take even the Scions from her birthplace months to achieve!","Yet the phenomenon in front of them did not stop as the Tree of Death grew ever larger, its lifeless grey leaves shining splendorously as its branches shook angrily, seemingly not reconciled at the fact that the tree of life it was bound to was so much larger than it.","This caused for even more essence to converge towards it as it grew ever larger!","40 minutes!","60 minutes!","...!","Alarm rose in the eyes of Anastasia and the other 2 beings as they saw this process still continue, and their hearts only settled after they felt the essence begin to recede the moment the one hour mark was met.","The essence of universal laws began to die down around them as they could see two illusory Trees floating stably amidst the genius’s colorful Black Hole.","Anastasia sighed with surprise as her thoughts were proven true, committing it in her heart to see if genius would be able to traverse the even harder path that she walked on. She was about to speak her thoughts when her eyes caught the expression of Alexander scrunch up as he felt the waning universal essence, seemingly annoyed by this fact as his body soon shone with a verdant green light.","{The Doctrine of Life}!","RUMBLE","The technique for cultivating the Law of Life was cultivated simultaneously as {The Doctrine of Death}, the appearing green light stimulating the waning universal essence to re-energize as the black essence from the Law of Death also elevated to another level!","RIIING!","A resonance seemed to occur between the two Universal Laws being cultivated at the same time as universal law essence descended down once more with stellar colors, this time even more vibrant than when the genus had begun cultivating before.","The three watching in the garden only watched with agape expressions as they did not even know where to begin.","He’d passed whatever test was laid out in front of him, you know? He didn’t have to show off so much!","Yet the minutes passed as they could only watch in wonder, imprinting this memory into their brains for as long as they lived.","---","2 more hours passed.","Noah had taken his time as he felt the growth of the Tree of Death, this tree synchronizing with the Tree of Life as he brought the Law of Death to 12% from cultivating it in just a few hours, the Law of Life rising becoming to a full 30% at the same time!","It was only then that he stopped simultaneously activating the Doctrines of Life and Death as he opened his eyes, essence waning around him as even the skies seemed to breathe in relief at the phenomenon’s ending.","His eyes opened to lock on with the sharp eyes of Anastasia that was looking at him with focus, her voice ringing out right after.","\"Your talent should be at the level of the Core Scions of Ancient Organizations if not completely surpassing them. Good! We are low on time, so we shall get started right away. You two, pay attention as well and see if your talent can pick anything up.\"","WAA!","An aura of unique strength erupted from Anastasia as she rose in the air, her face becoming cold and devoid of emotions as she seemed like an untouchable Entity!","Her face was staring down towards Noah, her daughter, and the Imperial Adjudicator with eyes of authority, her voice ringing out all around them as it dripped of majesty.","\"In the vast Universe, there are many routes of power as beings continue to search for the unknown. The most natural route is to study Universal Laws, with others relying on unique cultivation methods or even Blessing passed down from their home Galaxies in the form of Traits.\"","\"All of these things can only support one of their path of strength, but there exists ’concepts’ above things such as Traits or Laws that grant immense power to their wielder, a power that sets them apart from all others!\"","RUMBLE!","Her words contained a unique charm as Noah listened with shining eyes, her cold expression continuing with no pause!","\"Above the laws, there exists Daos!\"","\"I come from the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter, an Ancient Power that relies on Archaic Animus Pets to control large regions of the Dark Universe, and we study...the Dao of Summoning!\"","...!!!","Daos!","Wide-ranging and extremely elusive, ranging from the Dao of Summoning to the Dao of Blood to the Dao of Destruction and many more...","The next area of study...was the Dao!"]},{"number":690,"title":"Chapter 690: Chapter 689 - Daos!","paragraphs":["Dao!","Above laws, there was the concept of Daos!","\"A multitude of Daos exist, yet few beings can ever grasp even one. Even those that have great guidance by others that embark on the path of Daos might not necessarily be able to comprehend even a single one.\"","They were abstruse and hard to grasp, things that one could search a thousand years for but never find one.","\"Even in the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter that boasts being followers of the Dao of Summoning only has a small percentage of the geniuses embarking and following this path!\"","Anastasia continued to float in the skies, her eyes releasing an unknown sense of pressure and regality as she continued.","\"Across the Dark Universe, the Ancient Powers are formed based on what Dao Path a group follows. So you can come across Ancient groups that focus on the Dao of Slaughter, or the Dao of Destruction, or the Dao of Creation...There are as many as there are grains of sand!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah felt his mind ringing as these words continued, a path he was only stumbling onto now opening itself up so widely that he wanted to scream out.","\"There are even Daos that integrate the Universal Laws into them and grant a being mastery at extreme speeds, with the Dao of Four Elements being one of them. We could sit here and talk for days just listing the many Daos there are, but we will focus on the Dao of Summoning.\"","Anastasia’s voice only became more and more enticing as time passed, her voice continuing to explain s grand concept as Noah, Anna, and the Imperial Adjudicator listened closely.","\"There are Lesser Daos, Grand Daos, and the most hidden, elusive, and majestic Cosmic Daos! The Dao of Summoning that we study...is merely a Lesser Dao. Yet it is this Dao that has granted the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter the capabilities to rule a region of the Dark Universe. You will come to find that even among the Ancient Powers out there, very few of them have even come close to touching Grand Daos, not to mention the elusive Cosmic Daos.\"","WAA!","Anastasia waved her hands in front of her as a luminous obsidian crystal appeared, this crystal releasing a fearful pressure as the surroundings around them quacked at the mere introduction of it!","\"To embark on the Dao of Summoning, all prospective talents in the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter are lent this Dao Crystal- an extremely rare material that is held by very few! This particular Dao Crystal has wisps of the Dao of Summoning, and you will have to grasp just a minuscule amount of understanding in this Dao before you can begin even activating the techniques of <<Archaic Animus Summoning>>.\"","She finished her words as the obsidian crystal known as a Dao Crystal floated down, its size being at 2 meters as it was around Noah’s height.","Anastasia then waved her hands again as three brilliant white lights shot from her and went towards the heads of Noah, Anna, and the Imperial Adjudicator!","\"That is the technique to sense and gain understanding in the Dao of Summoning, something that the Forefathers of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter have managed to create after eons of trials and errors. Learn it well and then try sensing the Lesser Dao within this Dao Crystal. If all goes well, you should be able to grasp something in a few days if you have a great talent, or a few months if you are merely talented!\"","RUMBLE!","The rumbling essence around them quarter down as the three of them closed their eyes and focused on the technique imparted, Noah watching the words of an Absolute Skill freely popping up in his mind.","<strong><<Expansive Dao Comprehension>> :: A technique created by Forefather Expansive of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter. It aims to comprehend Lesser Daos, but one would rarely find success unless a crystallized form of the Dao is nearby for them to sense. </strong>","A shocking technique that aimed to comprehend Lesser Daos, yet even the System showed how one could barely comprehend Daos with it! They would need something like the Dao Crystal that Anastasia laid in front of them if they wanted to make any headway with it.","Noah was about to give it a try with high expectations when he reread the part that said it was a ’technique created by Forefather Expansive’.","These words reminded him that the beings of the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter worked for eons to create a skill such as this, but he had to also remind himself that he...could also create skills!","RUMBLE!","His heart felt even more excitement as the thought took root in his mind, his eyes moving towards the Skill Points section of his stat panel as he could finally put the points he had been saving up to good use.","They had been raising by hundreds when he took down Fiends in the Devouring Hells Realm during the Blessed Imperial Selection, and they rose by thousands when he killed even more of them in the Stellar Sky Galaxy.","The QUASAR ranked Fiend Rulers alone granted him 10,000 skill points each as his total number came to....127,524!","Over a hundred thousand Skill Points!","The number only caused his eyes to shine with a maddened light as he pulled up the Skill Creation tab right away, beginning to input ideas of the skill he wanted as a calculation was soon made in a matter of seconds.","...","[Supreme Dao Traverser] :: The user utilizes their Origin as the lamp as they traverse on the dark path of the Dao, lighting up the way with ease as only time is needed to master Lesser and Grand Daos. All learned Daos will passively be comprehended even while the user isn’t actively comprehending with the skill. The speed of Dao Comprehension is increased the more mana that the user can provide. Cost to create the Skill- 100,000,000 Skill Points.","\"...\"","His mind went blank for a moment as the base skill he put in before he added any modification required simply ridiculous amounts of skill points, his face hardening as he went forward to edit the skill to acceptable levels!","He spent some time as he added more and more restrictions, watching as the 100 million required number of skill points went down to 50 million, then to 1 million, then to 150,000, until finally...it stopped at 120,000 skill points.","The new skill that he could create was displayed in front of him brilliantly!","<strong>[Dao of Summoning Traverser] :: The user utilizes their Origin as the lamp as they traverse on the dark path of the Dao of Summoning, lighting up the way with ease as only time is needed to master the Dao. The skill requires tremendous amounts of mana to activate and keep active.* The user can only comprehend the Dao of Summoning with the skill.* Cost to create the Skill- 120,000 Skill Points.</strong>","He took out the possibility of comprehending any other Daos from the skill as it purely focused on the Dao of Summoning, and also took away the possibility of passively comprehending the Dao freely as time passed. He then added restrictions as an acceptable skill appeared, and he gave the command to create it!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":691,"title":"Chapter 691: Chapter 690 - In Just F***ing Seconds!","paragraphs":["An eruption of essence silently occurred within Noah as 120,000 skill points were spent instantly, a new skill at the rank of Black Hole appearing!","His eyes shone whole looking at the skill, enhancing it with skill points as a (5/5) appeared in front of it.","All this did was enhance its effectiveness even more, and it was finally read for Noah to try as he came closer to the Dao Crystal that Anna and the Imperial Adjudicator had already begun to touch.","Anastasia looked at this scene interestingly as she saw this being move only a few minutes after he received the <<Expansive Dao Comprehension>> ability.","She watched closely as he went toward and placed his hands on the Dao Crystal, a unique air beginning to spread around him.","Her eyes constricted as she saw this appear the moment he sat down, and then her eyes began to tremble a second later as she observed a shocking sight!","The reason for this was because the moment that Noah touched the Dao Crystal containing wisps of the Dao of Summoning, he activated [Dao Of Summoning Traverser] right away.","The skill was nothing like the defective one that one could only embark on the Dao of Summoning if they had a Dao Crystal with a sense of this Dao already, and he could have begun activating the skill even without touching the Dao Crystal!","It might have taken him a few hours or a day before he gained his first understanding in the Dao of Summoning, but that was already multiple times faster than even the top geniuses that Anastasia talked about, and it was guaranteed with his self created skill.","Yet he was currently touching a Dao Crystal containing the Dao of Summoning, so the moment he activated the skill he did not even have to spend a second searching for the Dao of Summoning. It was already in front of him, so it simply came to him!","RUMBLE!","Immense mana poured into the skill because of the restrictions he created, but it meant that the second he sat down and activated the skill...the essence of the Dao of Summoning that he sensed from the Dao Crystal swarmed towards him, essence he did not even know existed flooding into his body on all directions.","An activation of a skill!","A second of passing!","A Dao was learned!","WAAA!","A magisterial pressure erupted out as the essence of a Lesser Dao washed over him, feeling more regal than even the Ultimate Laws as he felt a sense of closeness he could not explain.","BOOM!","His multicolored Black Hole seemed like it was on fire as it began to rotate and expand rapidly, merely the essence of this Grand Law pushing his strength upwards as it felt like...like a cap had been taken off an erupting volcano!","It felt like something within him was setting loose as abstruse waves of something he never came across before...waves of Dao were swimming around his body as they gave him an appallingly ancient aura!","Ah!","The Dao!","On this Day, he had stepped onto the path of the Dao of Summoning!","\"...\"","Anastasia was looking towards him with her drop-dead gorgeous face losing all of its majesty, her mouth agape as she sensed the essence of the Dao of Summoning beginning to swim around Noah.","’This...was impossible!’","No matter how much of a genius, no matter the talent...doing this in just a matter of seconds?! This was nigh impossible!","Not minutes! Not hours! Not days or even months, but merely seconds!","’What the f.u.c.k?!’","Even the most splendrous geniuses took days, with many taking months before they could even sense the Dao of Summoning.","Yet this being did not only sense it, he had also began embarking on it as the majestic aura of a Lesser Dao began to permeate around him!","Just what was this creature?!","Absent minded to the shock of Anastasia, Noah opened his eyes as his body felt something unique traveling through it, the Law Origins within him bubbling with excitement as they churned even faster.","A mere wisp of this Dao was able to excite his body and laws, all of them revolving even faster, especially the Ultimate Laws as the Trees of Life and Death began to brim with essence all around them.","The Dao was above the laws, so studying it would only make those below it proceed even faster!","But Noah put this behind him for now as while he embarked on the Dao of Summoning and felt like he could do something with it, he felt like he was missing a piece of something to do it.","So he looked towards Anastasia who was staring at him with shocked eyes, only coming back to herself when she saw his gaze!","She seemed to know what he was thinking as she waved her hands, another bright light shooting off of her as it entered into Noah’s mind.","Her voice seemed slightly shaken as she spoke, putting her surprise aside for now as she wanted to see just how far this genius could go.","\"Once one has stepped into the Dao of Summoning, they need unique skills to utilize its comprehensions to the fullest. We were able to create the techniques that allow us to summon and contract Animus Summons, unique creatures that can only be accessed from an unknown Universe that only those traversing in the Dao of Summoning can call upon!\"","RUMBLE","The techniques she talked about entered in Noah’s mind as he was nearly leaping out with excitement.","\"The ability of a being to call upon a powerful Animus Pets depends on luck and their comprehensions in the Dao of Summoning, with those just starting only being able to summon Common ranked pets as it becomes their jobs to use the skills I just imparted to you to raise them to greater levels.\"","Beginners would only be able to summon Common pets, with the ranks of pets going from Common to Uncommon, Rare, Ultra Rare, and ultimately Prismatic!","The skills that Anastasia imparted to him now were the <<Archaic Animus Summoning>> that could call forth a random Animus Pet for a being to first contract with, and this same skill was used to call forth contracted pets with just the intention of the master.","The other set of skills were in the form of a Skill Tree, one that contained four skills which went on to be termed...[Animus Summon Trainer]!"]},{"number":692,"title":"Chapter 692: Chapter 691 - The First Archaic Summon!","paragraphs":["Without wasting any time, Noah delved into the newly gained skill tree that was known as [Animus Summon Trainer]!","<strong>[Animus Summon Trainer] :: A skill tree geared towards raising the strongest Animus Pet. The skills contained within are capable of raising their ranks, refining their bloodlines, and much more. Abilities include [Archaic Contract](5/5), [Animus Growth Empowerment](5/5), [Bloodline Forging](5/5), [One Body, One Soul](5/5)</strong>","<strong>[Archaic Contract](5/5):: Every Animus Summoner needs to form a contract with the pet they summon. This ability inscribes an Archaic Contract into the souls of the Summoner and the Pet, forming a bond that makes them one. (Skill Point enhancement allows the user to contract a Pet a stage above their own).</strong>","<strong>[Animus Growth Empowerment](5/5):: The core skill of an Animus Trainer. This ability is cast on the Pet that the Summoner wants to train as their Realm can be raised. The Realm of the Summon can be taken as high as the Realm of the Summoner. Because of the uniqueness of Animus Summons, their Realms can be grown to Grand Completion over time as they are continuously trained with this ability. (Skill Point enhancement increases the effectiveness of this ability by 200%).</strong>","<strong>[Bloodline Forging](5/5) :: Even the weakest Animus Summons have bloodlines. This ability allows the Summoner to refine and activate the strongest bloodline that is hiding within their Summons. Can only be cast on a pet every 24 hours. (Skill Point enhancement allows for even bloodlines of Prismatic Summons to be brought forth, with the rate of refining bloodlines increased by 200%).</strong>","<strong>[One Body, One Soul](5/5) :: This ability allows the Animus Summoners to merge with their contracted Pet, their whole being forged into one as their power is enhanced. (Skill Point enhancement allows for perfect merging of Summoner and Pet, with the power increased by 200%)</strong>","...","Ah!","Noah stared at the skills as his mind seemed to be buzzing, his eyes nearly shaking from the excitement as he read over them multiple times.","A completely new path of strength that would make him even more overpowered had opened up, and it opened up in such a stellar fashion at that!","On top of dreadful Traits that were only made possible through the use of a mysterious Ruination Core and the use of Universal Laws that he would comprehend fully in a matter of time...he now also had a Dao to support his strength!","Just this single Dao of Summoning came with such appalling abilities that he couldn’t wait to explore all of it and see what it would give him.","He tried his very best to make sure that his mind wasn’t thinking about the fact that there were many other Daos that he didn’t even know about, the mere mention of Lesser Daos, Grand Daos, and Cosmic Dao making his heart tingle in anticipation.","But the Dao of Summoning was first, and even though it was a Lesser Dao, its majesty felt greater than even the Ultimate Laws of Life and Death!","\"Familiarize yourself with the abilities before you try summoning your first Animus Summon.\"","The voice of Anastasia shook him out of his stupor as he glanced around him, seeing that the Imperial Adjudicator had released his hand from the Dao Crystal while shaking his head disappointedly, while Anna still had her eyes closed as she tried to sense the Dao of Summoning.","Even while being temporarily contracted to an Archaic Animus Pet, the Imperial Adjudicator could still not sense even an ounce of the Dao, the temporary contract being something that Anastasia placed onto him herself with the willingness of her pet!","But even this did not allow someone as fearsome as the Imperial Adjudicator to grasp even a tendril of the Dao of Summoning.","Yet...","The eyes of the Imperial Adjudicator looked towards the direction where Noah sat in a Lotus position with difficult eyes as he saw the familiar oppressive aura of a Dao that Anastasia released also emanate from this genius!","He had shockingly grasped a wisp of this Dao the first time he tried! The Imperial Adjudicator had sunken shoulders at being near a genius such as this as Anastasia came next to him and stroked his shoulders affectionately.","\"It is not that you aren’t talented, just that he is a monster.\" Anastasia’s words that should have made the half a step into the Galaxy Realm expert feel good only made him feel worse, his gaze focusing on the direction of the genius again as they saw an ancient runic sigil forming in the skies.","\"You’re trying to summon right away?!\" Even Anastasia was surprised as her eyes focused on what was about to happen, not expecting this genius to be so confident that he would start right away.","Off to the side, Noah’s eyes were filled with concentration as he could not bring himself to wait any longer, his eyes shining luminously as he cast <<Archaic Animus Summoning>>!","RUMBLE!","In the skies, an archaic runic sigil appeared as it rotated while releasing a unique aura, a swirling Rift slowly being formed above them as it began to expand rapidly.","Anastasia looked at this scene with interested eyes as she knew that the larger the opening Rift was when one first summoned their pet, the more powerful and rare that pet was!","The Rift brought to life by the archaic runic sigil was already at 10 meters and still expanding, which let her know that an Animus Summon of at least a Rare rank was coming.","Below the Rift, Noah was looking with expectant eyes as he wondered of the first Animus Pet he would summon.","What rank would it be! What kind of a creature and with what bloodline!","Many thoughts and expectations were carried as the Rift became ever larger, reaching 50 meters as Anastasia’s mouth opened with an agape expression once more.","’An Ultra Rare pet with the first summon?!’","Her thoughts were tumultuous as she looked towards this genius with a disbelieving gaze, the Rift above them shining brilliantly as something descended down while being surrounded by the colors of blazing flames and an immense light of fate!","RUMBLE!","The light came all the way down as it touched the ground, the blinding luminescence dying down as the creature to come out of the rift began to be seen with clarity.","Being only a meter in size, the Archaic Animus Summon shimmered with wings that spat out flames, the golden light of fate pulsing off of its feathers as its head rose to the skies. One could see a golden piercing beak with dichromatic eyes of gold and red that dripped with arrogance and dominance, this Animus Summon looking towards Noah with an unkempt aura of regality!","Standing on three legs with wings wreathed in flames and the light of fate, the First Archaic Summon that Noah brought forth...was a chicken!","\"...\" The Imperial Adjudicator was speechless.","\"...\" Anastasia had no words!","\"...\" Noah himself was shocked as he stared at the Animus Summon in front of him, a summon of the Ultra Rare rank!"]},{"number":693,"title":"Chapter 693: Chapter 692 - Three-Legged Fate Crow!","paragraphs":["The singular thing that could be said when one looked at the fiery gold chicken was the fact that from its face, they could see an aura of extreme arrogance and dominance, its eyes gazing around everyone as if it stood above them!","Even while glancing at Noah, its golden beak was raised high as its flaming feathers flapped towards him, seemingly telling him to get a move on after it had been summoned.","Anastasia came out of her stupor as she sensed the profound aura around the chicken that told her it was of high rank, her years of experience telling her not to underestimate it as she quickly spoke.","\"Quickly contract it! An Animus Summon will not remain here for long unless it finds a master right away.\"","Noah’s eyes shone at Anastasia’s words as he didn’t need to even be told, the identity of the chicken in front of him making him wave his hands as he cast [Archaic Contract] right away!","RUMBLE!","Essence flooded out as the skill enhanced by skill points formed into a unique runic sigil in the skies, the sigil separating into two parts as one shot towards Noah’s head and the other shot towards the fiery gold chicken.","SHAA!","It felt like a brand was being placed on his very origin when the archaic rune entered, the process being fairly fast as in a matter of seconds he felt...a consciousness that he could understand!","His eyes sharply opened as he stared forward, locking with the fiery gold eyes of the chicken as its face still continued immense regality and arrogance. The consciousness within him conveyed an arrogant thought as he received the first ever thought from an Animus Summon.","\"Human! Count your lucky stars to have summoned someone as great as I- the Great and Archaic Animus that stands above all, the Golden Crow!\"","OOOM!","The voice dripped with confidence and strength as Noah smiled at the successful contract, looking over the details of the pet as its arrogant words stood true.","<strong>[Three-Legged Fate Crow](Ultra Rare) :: An Animus Pet currently at the Domain Rank. It holds within its origin a semblance of the bloodline of the Archaic Golden Crow, and is currently contracted to Noah Osmont. Its abilities include Fate Flames of the Void, Barrier of Brilliance...</strong>","The description of the first pet were displayed in front of his eyes as he drank them in, going towards this pet as its voice continued to resound in his mind.","\"Well? I’ve heard that the Trainers calling upon us will have skills capable of raising our realms and refining our blood, where are these skills at? It is the only reason I answered your call!\"","Noah smiled at the domineering voice inside him as he went to grab the juvenile Fate Crow, its fiery feathers flapping as it tried to get away, but its power at the Domain Rank was nothing to Noah!","He grasped onto it as it flailed around with complaints, this creature never being held by anyone before as it grumbled its complaints in his mind.","\"Let’s see, I’ll call you...Flamey?\" He sent his thoughts towards it as its head shook with horror, not accepting the name as Noah continued.","\"Sparky?\"","\"No!\"","\"Fruitloops?\"","\"No!!\"","....","\"How about Ruby?\"","\"...Hmph\"","An acceptable name was taken as the Fate Crow took to the skies, announcing its entrance to the Dark Universe with a piercing cry!","CAAA!","Flames of fate erupted out as Anastasia appeared behind Noah, nodding her head as her sonorous voice rang out.","\"After summoning a pet and contracting it, you must then work hard for years to increase its realm and refine its bloodline.\"","\"The [Bloodline Forging] ability can only be cast once a day to gradually refine your pet’s bloodline, with powerful trainers spending hundreds of years to even successfully awaken any ancient bloodline within their summon. But the [Animus Growth Empowerment] can be cast as many times as possible, and only depends on your mana reserves and the talent of your pet for how far it can grow!\"","Noah’s eyes shone as he heard these words, Anastasia continuing as she expounded more knowledge.","\"Some are able to quickly raise the Realms of their pets and even bring them to the Manifested stage for each realm, the only thing stopping the advancing of the pet thereafter being their Summoner’s Realm and the capability of the Summon to refine the essence of the Realm they enter before they can proceed forward.\"","Yes! Animus Summons were special in that their realms could be raised purely from their Masters casting the Animus Growth Empowerment on them, with the only thing they had to do is to refine the essence flooding into them and stabilizing their realm before they could advance!","Some had the talent to quickly stabilize their realms and break through multiple times, while others took years to stabilize their realms before proceeding forward.","\"When a pet achieves the latter realms of Nebula, Black Hole...the talented ones take years while the worst ones take hundreds of years before they can be caused to advance even with the Summoner casting [Animus Growth Empowerment] until they run dry. The only limit to how high a Summon’s Realm can be raised is the Realm of the Summoner himself.\"","Noah nodded as he sent a command to the Fate Crown, its three legs touching the ground again as he neared it and cast [Animus Growth Empowerment] right away!","RUMBLE!","Mana flooded out of him in waves as it created three illusory runic circles above the Fate Crow, these runic circles beginning to undulate up and down the summon as essence from the surroundings and from Noah flooded into it incessantly.","Anastasia said even with the use of [Animus Growth Empowerment], pets would still take months or years to move up! He wanted to test with his Infinite Mana and the talent of this Ultra Rare summon, just how fast could he raise its Realm?!","WAA!","He gave no pause as after casting [Animus Growth Empowerment] once, he cast it once more as three more runic circles appeared and began undulating around the Fate Crow, the conversion of essence only increasing.","CAAA!","\"Hey...\"","A piercing cry was released from the crow as Anastasia was about to caution, but everything she knew was once again flipped upside down as in the next second, a wave of essence released as she watched the realm of the summon go from Domain and into the World Realm right away!","At this moment, the first three runic circles undulating on the body of the crow had begun to fade away, but Noah waved his hands as yet another three appeared with ease.","[Animus Growth Empowerment], [Animus Growth Empowerment]...","\"You...\"","Anastasia was cautioning with alarm as she saw Noah casting the ability multiple times as if it didn’t take immense amounts of mana, numerous undulating runic circles appearing on the Three-Legged Fate Crow as the unique cultivation only for Animus Summons began with a stellar fashion in the Blue Plains Realm!","Anastasia could only watch on before finishing her caution as she saw from the body of the Fate Crow, an Illusory World was already beginning to be Manifested!","Trained from the Domain and into the World Rank in seconds, with its current Realm already beginning to reach Grand Completion as an illusory world was already manifesting on its body.","CAA! CAA! CAA!","An excited expression could be seen on the arrogant Three-Legged Fate Crow as it sat within the numerous undulations of runic circles, its eyes shaking in happiness as it sensed the profound essence continuing to flood into it as its Realm rose even higher!","Its body already began undergoing changes as it looked towards Noah with a shining light.","This was a Trainer! This was an Animus Summoner!"]},{"number":694,"title":"Chapter 694: Chapter 693 - Ascending Through Realms With Ease!","paragraphs":["For Animus Summons, their cultivation was extremely unique!","Their Summoners did all the work as they cast powerful Trainer skills that directly caused essence to flood into them and elevate them to a higher level, the job of the Summon only being to consolidate and stabilize their realm before they can move forward.","Common ranked beasts took a long time to refine their new realms before they could advance to the next rank even with the aid of [Animus Growth Empowerment], with rarer Summons taking a shorter amount of time.","The truly rare or Ultra Rare Summons with powerful Archaic Bloodlines would take even less time before they could refine and consolidate their new Realms, being some of the beasts that could be raised extremely fast!","The only limiter to how much a Summon could be raised was only based on the Summoner himself, and Noah wanted to see if his enhanced [Animus Summon Trainer] paired up with the hidden Bloodline of this Three-Legged Fate Crow would allow it to quickly catch up to his Realm of Black Hole.","BOOOM!","Potent reverberations of essence erupted out as one could observe the illusory world of the World Rank Manifest on the body of the Crow.","CAA!","Its eyes shone with l.u.s.ter as its wings gained archaic golden runes, the runic circles undulating around it continuing to swirl from all directions as in the next moment...the Manifested illusory world could be seen quickly condensing and becoming realm, forming into a genuine Star!","Star Forging Realm!","The Three-Legged Fate Crow had entered the Star Forging Realm as the forged star enlarged and became denser, essence continuing to be refined by its body rapidly as it tried to assimilate this new realm and use the potent essence from the undulating archaic circular runes cast by its master to go even higher.","The mesmerizing body of the Three-Legged Fate Crow had gotten even larger, reaching over 10 meters at this moment as the undulating runic circles brought forth by Animus Growth Empowerment expanded to match it.","Shining with a gold and red l.u.s.ter, the Crow continued to absorb a flood of essence as by the side, Anastasia seemed to be learning a completely different way of cultivating Animus Summons.","Her mind was buzzing as she affirmed what she was seeing was correct, trying to make sure that the genius she had just handed down skills to wasn’t an old monster who had already spent thousands of years studying the Dao of Summoning!","Because she knew the only way one could be an amazing Trainer such as this to be able to raise the rank of a Summon multiple times- they had to be extremely proficient in the Dao of Summoning.","Those with more comprehension could naturally bring more of the pets’ talents, yet this Alexander seemed to already be at the stage just within an hour of coming in contact with the Dao!","Her eyes watched with rapt attention as on the body of the Three-Legged Fate Crow, she noticed essence being burned as she finally saw something normal- the scene of the pet trying to refine its essence and blood after stepping into a new Realm.","This was something every pet had to do after breaking through, and it was what took time when it came to raising one’s pets over the years!","Even though this monstrous genius was casting the skills of an Animus Trainer over and over again as if the concept of mana wasn’t applicable to him, the pet still needed time to assimilate the fast progression of Realms.","Anastasia was waiting to see how long it would take for this pet to assimilate before trying to break through, planning on imparting some of the more common sense ideas into Alexander’s head in the mean time when her eyes contracted.","CAA!","She saw at this moment that the burning of essence on the body of the Three-Legged Fate Crow had finished as it let out a piercing cry, the forged Star within its Origin Manifesting very clearly as it seemed to be...at the peak of the Star Forging Realm!","BOOM!","Her thoughts were proved to be true in the next moment as the forged star imploded powerfully, becoming scorching heat and gaseous dust as the base for a Nebula was created.","My gosh!","From Domain to World to Star and Now Nebula, all in a matter of minutes!","Completely defying all known norms, this phenomenon was caused by the enhanced trainer skill that Noah used, along with the immense talent of the Three-Legged Fate Crow that had the Bloodline of the Archaic Golden Crow.","Numerous stars had already begun to be forged within the Nebula as Noah continued to cast Animus Growth Empowerment, increasing the undulating archaic runic circles that enhanced the realm of the Summon as a fiery fate essence continued to permeate out.","He already had a pet at the Nebula Realm, and it would not take too long to bring it to the Realm of Black Hole!","As he watched the stars forging in the Manifested Nebula, he was patiently waiting for them to reach 100,000 as this summon consolidated its realm before it broke through.","In the meantime, he also looked at the [Bloodline Forging] skill that further refined and brought the hidden bloodline of pets out, casting it right away as a golden bloody mist landed of the Three-Legged Fate Crow that caused it to tremble!","The descent of a fearsome aura could be felt as off to the side, Anastasia shook her head in wonder as one could barely hear her whisper.","\"A Top Tier Archaic Bloodline...Ah!\"","One could hear lament and disbelief in her voice as Noah kept his eyes on the cultivating Three-Legged Fate Crow, going towards Anastasia as he saw the situation proceeding smoothly.","At this moment, tens of stars were being forged by the Animus Summon as numerous archaic runes undulated around it, so all it needed was time! Noah went to talk to the shocked Anastasia and the Imperial Adjudicator that was looking towards him with shining eyes as he waited.","\"You mentioned how the Aurora Galaxy Dragon was just one of your pets, how many pets can one contract?\"","He asked this with a clear face as if he didn’t just overwhelm the two of them with a shocking show in the past few minutes.","Only Anastasia and the Imperial Adjudicator were watching the commotion, and Anna still had her eyes closed and engrossed on the Dao Crystal that contained wisps of the Dao of Summoning as she tried to sense this Dao and nothing else!","Anastasia heard his question as her drop-dead gorgeous face returned to its old self, her sonorous voice ringing out.","\"...At the Nebula Realm and below one can contract a single pet, with every Realm thereafter allowing them to contract an additional pet. Aside from the Aurora Galaxy Dragon, I have three other contracted pets!\"","These words were like honey to Noah’s ears as he nodded with shining eyes, his gaze staying on the image of the Three-Legged Fate Crow as many thoughts crossed his mind!"]},{"number":695,"title":"Chapter 695: Chapter 694 - Conditions Met!","paragraphs":["Noah truly had too many ideas and thoughts coursing through his mind as he ascertained the number of pets one could contract as they progressed through Realms.","At his current Realm of Black Hole, he could summon and contract two pets!","But one must recall that Noah was not normal.","Through the use of a Ruination Core, he had granted himself not just Infinite Mana and the Trait of Protagonist that should soon grow to the next stage, but he had also split his Origin as he obtained the identity of an entirely new being in another Galaxy.","His bodies as Alexander and Noah weren’t merely clones, and each of them carried their own cultivation as even now, Noah’s body in the Novus Galaxy was still only at 80,000 forged stars as he used abundant essence to recreate what the body in the Nexus Galaxy had already done!","But because of his two different bodies with differing Origins... it meant that he would be able to summon and contract twice the amount of pets as other beings...or at least he hoped so!","This would mean that when both of his bodies were at the Realm of Black Hole, he could actually contract 4 pets.","And when he reached the GALAXY Realm, instead of the usual 4 pets one could contract...he would be able to have 8!","The implications of this were truly horrifying to understand as if he trained all of these pets to the same Realm as him when he later reached GALAXY...it meant that aside from his two bodies, he would be walking around with 8 GALAXY Realm Animus Summons that would each have their Realms at Grand Completion!","Ah!","Just the idea of it was enough to cause his eyes to shine with excitement.","In the Blue Plains Realm, Noah continued to observe the situation as hours passed.","On the 3rd hour as he resupplied the undulating archaic runic circles that continued to help the animus forge stars in its Nebula, he received a question from a worn-out Imperial Adjudicator.","\"Are your mana reserves just as monstrous? Even a Galaxy Realm expert wouldn’t have this much...\"","\"I was always born with large mana reserves. I’m nearly depleted right now so I hope the Three-Legged Fate Crow can advance to the Realm of Black Hole soon!\"","Noah’s reply was calm as he didn’t worry about them finding out anything about his Infinite Mana. Nobody in their right mind would even believe that someone could have such a thing, so they could only attribute it to extremely large Mana Reserves!","Another hour passed in the Blue Plains Realm.","RUMBLE","Essence raged around the Three-Legged Fate Crow once more as one could see on its Manifested Nebula...100,000 stars shone with immense l.u.s.ter.","BOOM!","All of these stars within this Nebula then imploded as a core of a multicolored Black Hole was then formed with ease, as easy as anything could be!","CAA!","A fearsome cry of the Three-Legged Fate Crow then rang out as golden flames flared out of its beak, its eyes opening grandly as its evolved body came to view.","Standing above 20 meters with feathers that shimmered with golden flames, its body was filled with a beautiful mixture of red and gold feathers as above its golden beak and multicolored eyes, an illusory crown could be seen placed on this future Golden Crow!","Its three legs beneath shone with piercing sharpness as its eyes landed on Noah, and the eyes could not hide the happiness of this Summon.","\"A truly worthy Trainer! From this day forth, I shall follow you with all my heart. Let us show the puny beings of this Universe just what the future Archaic Golden Crow and Master Trainer can do!\"","Ruby, the newly summoned Three-Legged Fate Crow, said these words clearly as even Anastasia and the Imperial Adjudicator heard them. Its piercing golden beak shone with l.u.s.ter as its eyes shimmered with strong confidence that blinded those looking!","Alexei and Anastasia looked at each other with exhausted smiles at the sight of this genius, Anastasia sending a telepathic message to Alexei at this time.","\"You must grant this being the highest Title below yours as you prepare the warriors to defend against your coming enemies. Don’t lose the fealty of such a genius!\"","Alexei, the Imperial Adjudicator, nodded at these words as he took out a shimmering Medallion that represented his Authority as the highest ranked Imperial in the Nexus Galaxy.","His eyes were somber as he released a shocking announcement to the high ranking Imperial Lords and Imperial Rulers, with the announcement later on being spread to all Imperials!","It was a command that effective immediately, a new Imperial Ruler was born! The being that had foiled the plot of the Fiends and saved the Imperial Princess in the Stellar Sky Galaxy, the one known as Alexander King was given a title that only the few QUASAR ranked experts of the Nexus Galaxy enjoyed.","Young in age yet holding tremendous strength, his position had been rapidly elevated as another core defender of the Nexus Galaxy was born!","Aside from the shock and stupor of many, the one who was most affected by this was actually Noah himself who had yet to even hear of the command elevating him to a higher position.","His eyes were honing in on the brilliant figure of the Three-Legged Fate Crow as he sensed its vibrant power, his heart already set on trying to summon the next pet he could summon right away!","The body of Alexander could summon another pet, and his body as Noah in the Novus Galaxy could also summon 2 more pets as soon as he reached the Black Hole Realm. There were so many things to do that even with his many bodies and clones he felt short-staffed, and yet in the next moment a resonant sound rang in his mind.","DING!","[Conditions for the next stage of the Protagonist Trait have been met.]","Ah!","Noah’s heart shook at these words shining in a blue text panel appearing in front of him, the gains on this day after performing spectacularly in the Stellar Sky Galaxy not just ending at him receiving the techniques of the Law of Death and the even more shocking knowledge of the Dao and obtaining the powerful Archaic Summoning techniques...his Trait would also be taken to the next level as the gains and loot just continued coming!"]},{"number":696,"title":"Chapter 696: Chapter 695 - Unlocked Abilities of the Protagonist","paragraphs":["In the Novus Galaxy, a storm of essence was erupting around Noah as he recreated the 100,000 stars of a Nebula and shattered all of them, his surroundings thrown into chaos as essence raged to help him form his Manifested Black Hole.","One body entering the Realm one day, his other body slightly behind as he entered it a few hours later!","At this moment, both of his identities had the Manifested Black Hole Realm as on Noah’s body, a multicolored Black Hole could be seen rotating beautifully.","Currently, he was in a location in the Infinite Realm where multiple Law Spaces intersected, enjoying the benefits of each of them as the abundant essence multiplied multiple times over with the Enhancement he had cast over the entire Galaxy.","At this moment, he and the many beings of the Novus Galaxy were experiencing tremendous growth!","Every day, more and more of his subordinates unlocked their own Traits, each of them ranging from Alpha and going all the way to EPSILON in the case of Kazuhiko.","What should have taken them months and years to do, they were now achieving in a matter of weeks as the atmospheric essence and universal law essence was simply too abundant at this moment. Those traversing in laws found it easy, those upgrading through ranks had an even easier time!","And now as Noah stabilized his Manifested Black Hole and watched its multicolored appearance rotate on his body, his eyes rose up from the Infinite Realm as he seemed to pierce through the layers of space to see a far away location.","At this time, another body of his was tearing through the layers of space as he cast an extremely long distance teleportation, one that only someone with his Infinite Mana could cast!","RUMBLE!","Blinding essence erupted in front of him as he gazed at the clone of Alexander appearing all the way from the Stellar Sky Galaxy.","Devilish handsomeness that hadn’t quite reached his original body, but still holding a unique charm! The clone appeared as it teleported light years from one Galaxy to another, waving its hands as a large amount of shimmering Cores, Skill Books, and Effulgent Star Pearls poured out!","The Origins of Noah and Alexander in the different Galaxies shared a different storage space from the use of the [Expansive Space] ability, so the only way to transfer things across his two bodies was for one of them or the clones to go to the other Galaxy.","He couldn’t have the clones of Noah even enter the Nexus Galaxy as it would alert the Entity overseeing it, but it was no issue for the clones of Alexander to jump light years away and into the Novus Galaxy to bring back all the loot!","Contained in the enormous pile were all the treasures obtained from the Fiends, with the cores ranging from Nebula all the way to Black Hole as Noah knew he would produce many experts from his forces with these.","He would distribute them to the Harbingers of Sin and then the Beasts of the Infinite Realm as he prepared to do even more things himself. He waved his hands as the loot brought out entered his storage space, Alexander’s clone already disappearing as it went back to continue mining the treasured Effulgent Star Pearls.","Meanwhile, Noah himself returned to cultivating as he saw the appearance of the [Dao of Summoning Traverser] skill and the other newly gained skills to summon Animus Pets that Alexander had obtained, his eyes shining as he sat down to gain the essence of the Dao of Summoning with this body as well!","The moment this was completed, he would start summoning with this body as well as he wondered what Animus Pets would come out of it.","Intricate actions such as this continued to happen in the background as time passed, with Noah’s body in the Novus Galaxy doing a multitude of tasks as his people did the same. Everyone was moving and doing their own things, but they all came together to form a shocking story that very few could experience!","Back in the Nexus Galaxy, the body of Alexander was watching the notification that the Protagonist skill would be elevated to another level, still not knowing that it was due to him being appointed as one of the highest protectors of the Nexus Galaxy.","To unlock the next stage of this wondrous Trait, he had to play a central role in the Nexus Galaxy, and his actions in just two weeks did just that. Just less than two weeks!","A silent essence of the Nexus Galaxy raged around him as he felt something within him elevated. He sensed the changes as his eyes focused on the panel showing this ridiculous Trait.","<strong>[Protagonist] :: You are the protagonist. To live up to such a title, abilities worthy of creating a true Protagonist are granted. As it is a culminated Trait, it has different stages that each have their own abilities. Currently Unlocked Ability(s) : Eyes of Truth, Photographic Memory, Memorable Visage, Blind Luck, Plot Armor, Chosen Extras, Deus Ex Machina. Locked Abilities: Chosen One, Save Point, @#%#%@$. To increase the stage of the Trait and bring it to complete fruition, you must play the central and decisive role in the Nexus Galaxy.</strong>","From the original three abilities, three more had been listed in a stellar fashion as [Plot Armor], [Chosen Extras], and [Deus Ex Machina] were unlocked!","His eyes twinkled as while Anastasia and the Imperial Adjudicator stood behind him, he began reading the panel displaying the details of [Plot Armor] that only he could see.","<strong>[Plot Armor] :: As a true main character, one must have a tool that allows him to keep his life in any situation! Yet to achieve this in reality is extremely hard. This ability allows the holder of the Protagonist Trait to gain genuine the [Plot Armor Status Effect] for a period of 1 hour, with the skill having a cool down of 30 days purely because of its reality-altering effects. With the status effect active, the user will not lose their life as their body and soul gain the [Invulnerable] effect that prevents all sources of damage.</strong>","\"...\"","As he looked at the skill, all he could say was that it was a truly worthy skill for a protagonist!"]},{"number":697,"title":"Chapter 697: Chapter 696 - Utter Ridiculousness!","paragraphs":["His eyes shook with strong emotions as the powerful beings beside him noticed this, Anastasia coming towards him with care as she asked him whether he had used up too much mana.","\"Recover for now before trying to summon your next Pet. I would even have you rest an entire day until you’re in top shape before doing it.\"","Noah nodded his head at the gorgeous personage worrying about him, sitting down in the garden of the mystical castle they were at in the Blue Plains Realm as he really had to be seated for the things he was currently reading.","Off to the side, Anna was still entranced with the Dao Crystal as her hand remained attached to it, essence bubbling calmly around her as she tried her best to catch a wisp of the Dao of Summoning!","Noah put all of this beside him as he read the details of [Plot Armor] again.","Such an ability truly made him shake his head in wonder, as the things it detailed were simply too fantastical!","When he used it, he would be under the effect of Plot Armor as his body gained something called [Invulnerable]- an ability that allowed him to not take any damage whatsoever.","He had to reread such an ability multiple times just to make sure he wasn’t dreaming!","He hadn’t even gone through the skills of [Chosen Extras] and [Deus Ex Machina], [Plot Armor] alone taking the spot light as he gained a new idea while reading the descriptions of the ability.","His eyes were honing in on the skill termed [Invulnerable] as his eyes shone, putting the details of it in the Skill Creation tab as he wondered if he could bring this effect to fruition himself without being restricted to one hour and a 30 day cooldown!","If he could do such a thing, he would just close the pages of his story as he lived his life to the fullest! Yet what showed in front of his eyes when he tried it brought him back down to earth.","<strong>[Invulnerable] :: An ability that allows the user to enter a state that prevents any source of damage from reaching them. Cost of Skill Creation- 1,000,000,000,000,0...</strong>","Zeroes on top of zeroes filled his screen as his fantastical thoughts quickly came down, toning down his greed as he was already ecstatic with the effect of [Plot Armor].","With such a tool under his belt, many ideas were coursing through his mind as he thought of the enemy that the Nexus Galaxy currently faced and the many days he could deal with them.","He had the memories of the Fiend Rulers, and he knew of the fearsome Master they had! A being with the identity of an Entity!","He wasn’t even sure what stage of the GALAXY Realm this being was in, but he knew that it was a terrifying creature.","Yet...a skill like Plot Armor that granted him Invulnerability for a whole hour...many ideas swirled in his mind as he thought about it!","But he placed these ideas for later as he looked on to the other two unlocked abilities of the Protagonist Trait.","<strong>[Chosen Extras] :: As with any Protagonist, there must be side characters that add something to your journey. They cannot all be left behind and forgotten like weaklings that contribute nothing. This ability allows you to currently choose 5 Extras who will be granted the [Enhanced Growth Perk] that allows them to progress through Realms at a speed comparable to the Protagonist, +100% Increased Loot Effect when defeating enemies, +100% Increase to their Comprehension, and a Thrice increase to their Luck.</strong>","<strong>[Deus Ex Machina] :: At the most critical and important juncture as the life of the Protagonist is in peril, casting this ability will bring forth an unexpected power, being, or event that will save them from the seemingly hopeless situation. As with any skill capable of affecting universal rules, there is a 30 day cooldown after every use. </strong>","His head shook with incredulity as he stared at the description of skills, Deus Ex Machina being somewhat similar to Plot Armor, while Chosen Extras went on to help those that Noah deemed as his subordinates!","They were skills worthy of being under such a shocking title as Noah was already thinking about who he should choose among the 5 Chosen Extras, but even with such an ability he still wondered whether his subordinates would play truly important roles in the future.","They had to rise through the Realms and gain great strength, becoming a powerful force that could dominate their own region of the Dark Universe after tens or hundreds of years!","All of these were possibilities for the future as he waited for it expectantly. As for the ability of Deus Ex Machina, it was yet another life saving tool if he ever brought himself to a pinch, and he planned to always save this for use even after he utilized [Plot Armor].","\"Haaa...\"","He breathed out a contented sigh after looking at the newly gained abilities of Protagonist, many grand ideas swimming in his mind that he never thought of before.","One of such ideas was if he really used [Plot Armor] and gained Invulnerability for an hour, where even a terrifying Entity would not be able to kill him- what if he used the Fiend’s memories and went to raise hell in the Burning Domains Galaxy while obtaining a whole lot of loot?!","He had to plan thoroughly and be sure that it would be worth the use of Plot Armor with its 30 day cool down, with his prizes from it being to at least enter the QUASAR Realm.","His thoughts actively moved as it seemed like he was just meditating as an hour passed.","Beside him, the domineering Three-Legged Fate Crow was unfurling its fiery golden wings that were bathed with scorching flames as it refined its Realm of Black Hole, this mystical Ultra Rare Animus Pet giving an extremely striking look!","It seemed like a fantastical bird from ancient times appearing in the modern era, with its form constantly evolving towards the Archaic Golden Crow as its bloodline continued to awaken.","OOM","A wave of essence silently spread out from Noah at this time as he opened his eyes, staring at the 20 meter tall Three-Legged Fate Crow that was bathing in Fate Essence and Flames, a smile spreading on his lips as he got ready to summon his second Animus Pet!","Before he made any plans to raise his realm or siege an entire Galaxy, he had to be as strong as possible. And being surrounded by horrendously powerful Animus Pets that had a similar perfected Realm like him...it would truly be a feast for the eyes.","As he rose to try his luck at Summoning another pet, he knew that his identity as Noah in the Novus Galaxy would soon do the same as well. It was bound to be an eventful next few hours as he continued exploring the new path of power!","Meanwhile, the Imperial Adjudicator was coming towards him as he was about to hand down a position of responsibility and power..."]},{"number":698,"title":"Chapter 698: Chapter 697 - Imperial Ruler!","paragraphs":["In the garden on the lone Castle in the Blue Plains Realm, the Imperial Adjudicator had come in front of Noah the moment he observed the genius to have woken up.","With the heart of a Ruler and his authority, he relayed the news of Noah gaining the title of an Imperial Ruler- something that only those at the Realm of QUASAR could hold!","To him, it was only natural as the genius that even Anastasia was shocked by could already kill beings at the QUASAR Realm, so granting him a title such as this was extremely befitting.","Noah had taken the news calmly as he expressed his thanks to the Adjudicator, knowing his advancement of the Protagonist Trait was in part due to this as he could now play a larger role in the Nexus Galaxy.","The position came with many benefits, granting him his own castle under the name of Dannicus in the Imperial Citadel and even granting him the possible position of overseeing another Galaxy as the Imperial Adjudicator mentioned he could work with the Stellar Ruler to look over the Stellar Sky Galaxy!","Such a thing was wanted by many Imperials, but Noah brushed it off for now as he said he did not have talent with such a thing, and would focus on increasing his strength for now.","Anastasia agreed with this as she spoke towards the two men, her eyes shining as she saw Alexei hand Noah a Medallion that represented an authority of an Imperial Ruler.","\"Take some time to solidify your understanding in the Dao of Summoning as well as becoming familiar to your pet. I’ll keep watch over Anna for now, and we will discuss the enemy in the Burning Domains Galaxy in a few days when we collect more information.\"","Agreeing with this thought process and wanting time to himself to truly explore his many gains, Noah glanced at the domineering Three-Legged Fate Crow that blazed with the essence of fate and flames behind him as he felt the connection with this creature and uttered out.","\"Return.\"","RUMBLE","A unique light went on to cover the Crow as Noah mystically observed a rift opening up on his chest, the same thing he observed on the Imperial Adjudicator when he recalled the Aurora Galaxy Dragon!","This rift was something unique to Animus Pets, leading them to the Origin Space of their Master as they would reside in here until called out for battle.","When one grew powerful enough, they would have multiple powerful Animus Pets within their Origin that they could call forth instantly to obliterate their enemies!","The 20 meter tall glimmering Crow grew small as it turned into a streak of light and was pulled into his Origin.","\"Then I will see your Esteemed selves in a bit. Thank you again for your guidance!\"","He gave thanks to the two beings in front of him, Anastasia nodding towards him with good will as he nodded his head and teleported away!","He wasn’t worried about showing such a skill at this moment as it would seem something small compared to what he had shown them he could do in the past few hours.","He appeared back in the Brightgold Monarchy Realm among the glistening vegetation filled with essence in the periphery of mountains, his thoughts moving rapidly as in front of him, one of the clones he left in the Starry Sky Galaxy appeared, while the main body of Alexander disappeared!","He had made a quick switch as his main body made a huge leap from one Galaxy to another, wanting privacy in the Stellar Sky Galaxy as the clone that had just switched with him in the Brightgold Monarchy Realm would head towards the newly gained fortress for an Imperial Ruler in the Imperial Citadel.","---","In the Stellar Sky Galaxy, Noah scoured the space he teleported into as he looked for an uninhabited star, finding a planet filled with deadly elemental storms of the surface as he delved deep into it and hid himself while casting an enormous Blood World.","He finally found time to himself as he prepared to fully digest his gains, starting with the summoning of the last pet that the body of Alexander could summon at the Realm of Black Hole!","Before he did this, he called forth his Three-Legged Fate Crow as a swirl appeared on his chest, the majestic fiery gold creature coming out.","\"When I first summoned you, what made you answer my call?\"","His eyes shone as he asked the golden flaming Crow, trying to pry off some secrets before he tried once more.","\"I was lazily moving about when I saw a blinding Summoning Rift appear, its size being multiple times larger than many that I had seen before! We Animus strive to find a perfect pair to complete us, so we always look for the strongest summoner out there. We can measure this by the size of the Summoning Rift!\"","A shocking truth came to him as he nodded, the Three-Legged Fate Crow continuing.","\"Truly powerful Animus as the Ultra Rare and Prismatic Rank like me are kings on our own right in our home, so we don’t even bother answering the calls of Summoning Rifts when they randomly appear. Only those at lesser ranks try their luck. But when we see an enormous Summoning Rift, it normally means the Summoner is extremely proficient in the Dao of Summoning or they have a high Realm that allows them to use immense essence to call upon us, so some of us answer!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah could feel as if a grand path was opening itself up in front of him, his shining eyes catching on to a singular truth that would be of great help to any Summoner.","Aside from the random luck of where his Summoning Rift opened in the Animus Universe and which Animus Pet would answer the call, one could increase their chances if they were extremely proficient in the Dao of Summoning or had immense mana!","He didn’t have the former, but the latter...he had already the mana on the world.","\"Good!\" He nodded with appreciation towards the Three-Legged Fate Crow as this Animus Summon felt essence bubble forth from its Master, the skill of <<Archaic Animus Summoning>> being utilized yet again!","But this time, Noah did not just stop at the required amount of mana to activate the skill...he continued to senselessly pump in more and more mana into the ability as the runic circle and rift appearing in the skies of the hidden planet he was on got wider and wider.","In the first 10 seconds, its width already exceeded the width that was there when he called forth the Three-Legged Fate Crow, and it only continued to expand!","Pump! Pump! Pump!","\"Master, you...\"","The Three-Legged Fate Crow had Fate flames leaping out of its beak as it breathed hard, its origin trembling at the sight of the widening rift as it began sensing an Archaic aura on the other side.","For the Three-Legged Fate Crow to have its origin tremble from an Archaic aura even though it held the bloodline of the Archaic Golden Crow...it meant that something terrifying had picked up on the Summoning Rift, something with an even rare and more Archaic bloodline than itself!","Ah!"]},{"number":699,"title":"Chapter 699: Chapter 698 - PRISMATIC!","paragraphs":["A ridiculously large Summoning Rift!","An Archaic aura that even made the Animus holding the bloodline of the Archaic Golden Crow tremble!","What came out from the other side...was appalling, to say the least.","In the hidden world, fierce mana storms were raging as Noah’s dark hair waved widely, his eyes focused on the widening Rift above as it finally seemed large enough to allow through whatever wanted to come.","An aura of antiquity seemed to leak out as from the now over 100 meter rift, a head popped out.","That’s right, just a head!","This head alone was extremely shocking to look at, shimmering with colors of grey, purple, and blue as it looked like a dragon’s head at first glance, but Noah soon realized it was a serpent’s head!","The terrifying serpentine head shone with the essence of Death, Aether, and Chaos as its red eyes opened, locking on Noah before it even stepped out of the Summoning Rift.","It seemed to be gazing at him carefully as it discerned something, having made a decision a second later as an enormous body slithered out of the Summoning Rift with ease!","Its width alone nearly touched the edge of the Rift as it continued to pour out endlessly, its length not yet being ascertained.","The scales on this enormous serpent shone with a purple-blue l.u.s.ter, its draconic-serpentine head rising up threateningly as it stared at Noah, balefully colorful elements freely swimming atop the crystalline scales.","RUMBLE!","The mana that Noah supplied to the Rift was finally cut off as the tail of this enormous serpent finally came out of the rift, its enormous body writhing on the ground as its head rose to the skies and looked down towards Noah. Raising his head to meet the dominant aura of this being, Noah heard an ancient voice resound in his mind!","\"Human, I have answered your call. But I do not even know if you are able to keep me here.\"","The voice seemed to be reverberating in his mind and outside of it as Noah stared at this creature absentmindedly.","This was because the aura he sensed from it was nothing like what he felt from the Three-Legged Fate Crow, the same summon that was shaking frightfully behind him as it tried to keep its arrogant golden beak up against the pressure that the serpent released!","This was because as even Noah affirmed while looking at the description of this creature, it was actually at the Prismatic Rank.","Prismatic!","The second Animus Summon he had called forth had the most shocking rarity, and its identity was even more terrifying!","[Void Eclipsing Sea Serpent](PRISMATIC) :: An Archaic Animus currently in the QUASAR Realm. Still in its early growth phase, this Serpent holds within it one of the 9 Supreme Bloodlines of all Animus Creatures- the bloodline of the Galaxy Devouring Serpent, Jörmungandr. Having mastered the Laws of Death, Chaos, and Aether, this creature’s abilities are many. When it completes its growth phase and fully awakens its Bloodline, it will naturally awaken the comprehensions of the Dao of Slaughter contained within.","A creature that was actually an entire stage above his own, one that he would not even be able to contract if his [Archaic Contract] wasn’t enhanced by skill points!","The voice it released reverberated out as Noah came out of his stupor, wasting no time as he got serious and released the [Archaic Contract] skill.","\"I have the ability, and much more!\"","RUMBLE!","He voiced out strongly as archaic runes appeared and split in the air, one going to him and the other going into the head of the Void Eclipsing Sea Serpent who looked at the scene playing out calmly.","This creature was extremely wise and had lived for thousands of years, knowing a great deal of things. It was astounded by the amount of essence that created an enormous rift in its Realm as it entered into it, but seeing the Summoner who was only at the Black Hole Realm, it didn’t know how this phenomenon was brought about as its ancient heart stayed until the universal rules sent him back to his Realm.","Yet...its enormous red eyes gradually shone as it actually felt the contract this being released...bind into its very soul!","’Hmm?’","Something that should not have been possible for a Summoner to do, this being actually did it as the Void Serpent sensed the contract fully establishing, its soul becoming connected to him.","\"Interesting.\"","Its thick voice reverberated out again as Noah looked towards the creature seriously. He could sense its emotions, which were actually extremely cold and filled with a wild aura of destruction! Its thoughts conveyed to him that it had only answered the call of the Summoning Rift out of passing interest, and that even with the established contract right now- the only emotions it felt were to see how the rest of this interesting set of events play out!","As these thoughts reached him, Noah contained his excitement of obtaining one of the rarest Animus Summons one could have, planning on reigning it in first as it looked at him more than just an interesting being.","\"What shall I call you?\"","He treated the Summon with respect as it truly deserved that and more, the Void Serpent spreading its aura around the hidden star as it continued to expand for several hundreds of thousands of miles thereafter as it simply observed the area it was currently in.","\"Just Void Serpent is fine for now. I will not take any other name other than Jörmungandr, and I do not yet deserve the name at my current Realm.\"","RUMBLE!","Domineering! Powerful!","The voice of the Void Serpent dripped with ancient regality as Noah nodded, replying with a calm voice full of expectations.","\"I will help you to successfully reach the stage to obtain such a name, refining your Bloodline and Realm to the highest levels in a short period of time!\"","\"Will you now?\"","The voice of the Void Serpent seemed cold and curious, Noah only nodding as he returned the same demeanor of dominance and began by casting [Animus Growth Empowerment].","\"Yes. First, I shall grant you a Manifested Quasar Realm as I bring you to Grand Completion!\"","OOOOM!","Essence erupted out as the skills of an Animus Summoner were cast, a terrifying Archaic Animus that would cause the Expansive Dragon Cl.u.s.ter to go in an uproar purely because of its identity...such a creature was summoned and contracted to an unknown being in the corner of the Dark Universe!"]},{"number":700,"title":"Chapter 700: Chapter 699 - Entities and Extras","paragraphs":["The types of strength across the vast Universe were many.","One could embark on any path, and as long as they spent enough time on it, they would become extremely proficient as they eventually achieve a title of Supremacy!","A title that makes it known a being has an accomplishment in a certain area, and these beings are titled...Entities!","A prerequisite to even be given the title of an Entity was for one to be at the Upper Tier of the GALAXY Realm, and that was simply the prerequisite!","After they became distinguished in a certain area, then they could be given such a prestigious title. The weakest of Entities would be those in the Upper Tier of the GALAXY Realm, while the strongest had immense strength that was hard to even grasp.","To fully understand the intricacies of this, we must also mention the differences of the three Tiers of the GALAXY Realm, where each of them are like their own stages!","From Lower, Middle, to Upper, each Tier of the GALAXY realm corresponds to a vast gulf in strength that some consider them separate Realms by their own right.","A being at the Lower Tier of the GALAXY Realm could never defeat one at the Middle Tier, and the same applied for the peak!","Even the powerful Aurora Galaxy Dragon was only at the Lower Tier of the GALAXY Realm even with all its shocking strength.","But the target of discussion today is a being dwelling in the Burning Domains Galaxy, the one holding the title of an Entity!","Even though she was heavily injured, this being was at the Upper Tier of the Galaxy Realm as she held shocking strength that could decimate Realms and shatter Galaxies if she really put in the work at her peak.","Yet she had gone through a terrible ordeal as heavy injuries were dealt, injuries that took an extremely long time to heal as they were dealt by a being proficient in a Dao!","It was a particularly deadly Dao at that, being a rare one that focused on the extreme essence of weapons- the Dao of the Sword! When she faced the terrible Entity that was at the same Realm as her, she had found the essence of a Sword occupying her entire sight as she only saw the grand form of a sword and nothing else.","Phantom sword strikes containing Dao within them had bloomed all around her in shocking numbers as they struck forth, nearly ripping apart her body as her soul was gravely injured. The only reason she was able to survive...was because the Dao she studied was one that gave her a degree of survivability.","The Entity residing in the Burning Domains who enhanced the strength of Fiends was actually studying the Dao of Vitality! She had long since mastered and assimilated the Law of Life thousands of years ago, where she then touched upon the deeper concepts of Vitality as she stepped upon the path of this Dao. This was the only reason she had kept her life when faced against a being with strongly Offensive based Dao of the Sword.","She then came to reside in the Burning Domains Galaxy as she healed herself while elevating the strength of beings within, having kept her prize from the battle with another Entity while also sensing another one just like it on a Galaxy not too far away- it was the Pages from the Book of Ruination!","Yet after years of planning and releasing the Fiends on a plan that should have succeeded, none of it produced any results.","RUMBLE!","Deep underground on the Central Realm of the Burning Domains Galaxy, this Entity was walking at the deepest areas of where the core of this Galaxy resided, her body bubbling with essence as she drew in the potent universal and atmospheric essence around her, a unique energy even seeping out of the obsidian core of the Burning Domains Galaxy as well.","Shockingly, this being traversing in the Dao of Vitality could even drain the Vitality of Galaxies to heal herself!","If one listened closely, they would even be able to hear the distinct sound of the Galaxy Core crying out, but no aid came to it even its most powerful inhabitants were under the reign of this Entity.","\"Hmph, just you wait.\"","Her enormous body showed a face filled with power and wrath as her words were said to no one, a colorful green-grey light that represented the Dao of Vitality swirling around her in a stellar fashion!","Faced with such a being who used to be at the Upper Tier of the GALAXY Realm and was proficient in a Dao, what could her enemies do?!","---","As many beings moved with their lives and planned, Noah continued to move with his own aims.","While the body of Alexander trained the fearsome Void Serpent at the QUASAR Realm and refined its bloodline, the body of Noah in the Novus Galaxy had chosen the 5 Extras for the [Chosen Extras] ability.","The choices could be changed at any time, so he had currently placed the Emperor Penguin, Barbatos, Kazuhiko, Elena, and Athena!","The moment these beings obtained the title of an Extra, an imperceptible golden light shone over them as even they felt some changes, but didn’t exactly know what they were. It was also at this time that Noah distributed Nebula Rank Loot to them and other Harbingers that didn’t yet have the title of Extras, observing the differences as they progressed through the Realms while absorbing the Cores.","An hour since the beginning of absorption and with speed reminiscent of Noah, the 5 Chosen Extras all broke through into the Nebula Rank after the implosion of their forged star. The other Harbingers were progressing much slower, but their Realms would make a breakthrough at any moment!","Each of them took the loot Noah gave them with heavy hearts as they could not even bring themselves to ask where he had gotten such treasures.","They knew that even while they were living peaceful lives and simply training, he must have been putting his life at risk to be able to get the treasures he brought back to them, and in such large quantities at that.","Their hearts felt stifled as they were screaming inside, screaming of wanting to help and be of use as Noah stopped risking his life alone!","Whether their wishes would be granted as they achieved higher Realms was yet to be known, and even their misconceptions about Noah and what he was currently doing would soon change.","He planned to gradually let them know what happened with the Terrors and Outsiders, how he was already moving in another Galaxy, and simply impart to them much of the knowledge they would need before they set off to explore outside of the Novus Galaxy.","He was creating experts as easy as it could be, simply feeding them loot like steroids until they bulked up to powerful individuals. This was even more true as the 5 Chosen Extras that had stepped into the Nebula Rank had already been given the treasured Effulgent Star Pearls to absorb, depending on their own talent for how many stars they could forge before they broke through!","For these 5 Chosen Extras, the Realms of Star Forging to Nebula to Black Hole would all be broken through in a matter of days, something that would be impossible anywhere you went.","Who else but Noah could make something like this happen?!","Who else could even try?!"]}]);
